__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Romero says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Dining Room at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" she says. \"Makayla Dorsey. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Dining Room and ask him directly.\""));
