__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Emma Slater. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Attic,\" Romero sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Wilson's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Romero scowls. \"Madelyn really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a accountant such as Clyde Christian.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Romero says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Romero scowls. \"Madelyn really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a accountant such as Clyde Christian.\""));
