__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde Ward?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Madelyn's physician? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
