__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Boris Donovan in my presence, Detective!\" Romero demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Boris Donovan,\" Romero says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Romero says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Bathroom.\""));
