__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Romero scowls. \"Madelyn really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a golf caddy such as Boris Donovan.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Boris Donovan,\" Romero says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Bathroom,\" Romero sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
