__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Romero sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Romero sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Romero sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Without question, it was Madelyn's cousin,\" she replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Without question, it was Madelyn's cousin,\" she replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Romero sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Romero sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Madelyn's cousin -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Romero sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Madelyn's cousin -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Romero sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Madelyn Romero. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- she's not really my cup of tea. She's in the Lounge, though, if you wanna meet her yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Stephen muses. \"I think I know who you mean, Detective, but I dunno them real well. I think they're in the Servants' Quarters, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh, yeah, I know Madelyn Romero,\" Stephen says. \"She's in the Lounge. If she says anything about me, though, it's a total lie.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Stephen says. \"Try the Servants' Quarters, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
