__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy... Golf caddy...\" Stephen mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Nicky Gentry! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Madelyn's golf caddy!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madelyn's accountant,\" Stephen says. \"He's good people. Dependable, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy... Golf caddy...\" Stephen mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Nicky Gentry! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Madelyn's golf caddy!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Stephen says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Madelyn like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Stephen says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Madelyn like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Stephen says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Stephen says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Madelyn like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Stephen says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Stephen says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Stephen says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Madelyn like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Joey says. \"We get along quite well. She's Madelyn's neighbor, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Bathroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Madelyn Romero. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Joey says. \"We get along quite well. She's Madelyn's neighbor, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Joey says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Madelyn Romero. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's neighbor and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Joey says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's neighbor. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Joey says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Bathroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's neighbor and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Bathroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, the gardener,\" Joey muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Bathroom, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's neighbor. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Joey says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's neighbor. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Joey says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the gardener,\" Joey muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Bathroom, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Stephen Colon is my biggest fan!\" Joey says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Clyde Ward?\" Joey asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Stephen Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Joey says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Clyde Ward and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Joey says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Joey smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Dining Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Clyde Ward and I get along rather well,\" Joey says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Stephen Colon is my biggest fan!\" Joey says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Dining Room.\""));
