__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wilson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Clyde Ward?\" Joey asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Joey says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Attic, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Joey sniffs. \"His name is Clyde Ward, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Joey says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Attic, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wilson's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Joey snorts. \"You're referring to Clyde Ward. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Attic, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Joey sniffs. \"His name is Clyde Ward, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Clyde Ward? Bah,\" Joey says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Joey says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Attic, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
