__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Attic, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Clyde Ward? Bah,\" Joey says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Attic, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Boris Donovan?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Joey says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The neighbor. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Bathroom,\" Joey says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Boris Donovan?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's neighbor, and an absolute philistine,\" Joey scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wilson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Bathroom,\" Joey says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Boris Donovan?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Joey asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's neighbor. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Joey snorts. \"Their presence in the Bathroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Boris Donovan?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Joey asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's neighbor. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
