__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Bathroom,\" Joey says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Boris Donovan. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Joey asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's neighbor. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
