__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Makayla Dorsey?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's golf caddy. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Joey says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Stephen Colon?\" Joey asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Makayla Dorsey?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's golf caddy and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Makayla Dorsey?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Joey says. \"We get along quite well. She's Madelyn's golf caddy, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Stephen Colon?\" Joey asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Makayla Dorsey. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's golf caddy. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Joey says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wilson's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Stephen Colon and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Joey says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Clyde Ward. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Joey says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Guest Bedroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Joey sniffs. \"His name is Nicky Gentry, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Guest Bedroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Joey snorts. \"You're referring to Nicky Gentry. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Joey says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Guest Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Joey sniffs. \"His name is Nicky Gentry, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
