__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Nicky Gentry? Bah,\" Joey says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Joey snorts. \"You're referring to Nicky Gentry. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's gardener, and an absolute philistine,\" Joey scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Bathroom,\" Joey says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Joey asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's gardener. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Bathroom,\" Joey says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's gardener, and an absolute philistine,\" Joey scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Bathroom,\" Joey says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Joey says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The gardener. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Joey snorts. \"Their presence in the Bathroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
