__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Joey snorts. \"Their presence in the Bathroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Clyde Christian. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Clyde Christian is my biggest fan!\" Joey says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Joey says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Clyde Christian is my biggest fan!\" Joey says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Joey smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Bathroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Clyde Christian is my biggest fan!\" Joey says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Joey says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Clyde Christian. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Joey says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Joey smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Bathroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Joey smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Bathroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the golf caddy,\" Joey muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Attic, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Joey says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Joey says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Joey says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Joey says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Joey says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Joey says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Joey says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah I know her,\" she says. \"I mean, kinda. We don't, like, hang. Real unchill woman. I think she's Madelyn's physician or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Emma says. \"His name's Clyde Christian. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Madelyn Romero is a total downer,\" she replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Madelyn's physician? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Emma says, rolling her eyes. \"Him. Clyde Christian. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" she says. \"Yeah man. That's Madelyn's physician. I've run into her a couplea times. She's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Emma says. \"His name's Clyde Christian. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
