__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Madelyn's gardener, dude!\" she says. \"He's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
