__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about her.\"<p>\"At this point,\" you growl, \"I would be delighted to get any kind of information at all out of you.\"<p>\"She's in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>Boris grimaces and turns a page. \"Ugh.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything about them at all?\"<p>\"Name's Madelyn Romero.\"<p>\"...That's it, huh?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
