__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Madelyn Romero. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls himself 'Boris Donovan', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Boris Donovan' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn Romero is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Makayla says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Lounge, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Boris Donovan, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn Romero is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Makayla says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Lounge, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls himself 'Boris Donovan', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Boris Donovan' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn Romero is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Makayla says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Lounge, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Boris Donovan, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Makayla says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Boris Donovan, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Lounge is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Makayla says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Boris Donovan, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn Romero is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Makayla says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Lounge, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls himself 'Boris Donovan', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Boris Donovan' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
