__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Boris Donovan, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Madelyn's gardener?\" Makayla says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Makayla says as sternly as she can muster, \"Madelyn's butler is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Family Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Madelyn's gardener?\" Makayla says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Family Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Makayla declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Madelyn's gardener?\" Makayla says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Makayla says as sternly as she can muster, \"Madelyn's butler is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Family Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Makayla says. \"He's Madelyn's gardener, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Makayla says. \"He's Madelyn's gardener, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Family Room, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Makayla muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Madelyn's gardener? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Family Room, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
