__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Family Room, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Stephen Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Makayla muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Madelyn's gardener? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Family Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Makayla declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Family Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Makayla declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Living Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls himself 'Boris Donovan', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Boris Donovan' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Boris Donovan, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Living Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Makayla says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Boris Donovan, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Living Room, go see for yourself!\""));
