__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Boris Donovan, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
