__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Living Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"Joey Wyatt is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Makayla says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Living Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Makayla says. \"She's Madelyn's best friend, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Living Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Makayla declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Madelyn's best friend?\" Makayla says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Living Room, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
