__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Makayla says as sternly as she can muster, \"Madelyn's accountant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Living Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
