__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Guest Bedroom, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Basement? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Clyde Ward!\" Makayla says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Basement? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Clyde Ward,\" Makayla says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Guest Bedroom, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Makayla says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Basement and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Clyde Ward!\" Makayla says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Basement? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clyde Ward?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Clyde Ward!\" Makayla says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Makayla says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Basement, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
