__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Basement? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Makayla says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Madelyn's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bathroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Nicky Gentry's a positive delight!\" Makayla says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Nicky Gentry. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Makayla says. \"Did you know he's Madelyn's butler? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bathroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Makayla says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Madelyn's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Makayla says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bathroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Nicky Gentry's a positive delight!\" Makayla says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Nicky Gentry. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Makayla says. \"Did you know he's Madelyn's butler? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Makayla says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bathroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Nicky Gentry. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Makayla says. \"Did you know he's Madelyn's butler? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Makayla says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Bathroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Nicky Gentry's a positive delight!\" Makayla says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Makayla says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bathroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Nicky Gentry. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Makayla says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Madelyn's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bathroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls herself 'Madelyn Romero', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Madelyn Romero' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bathroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Madelyn Romero, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bathroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls herself 'Madelyn Romero', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Madelyn Romero' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Clyde Christian. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bathroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Calls herself 'Madelyn Romero', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Madelyn Romero' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde Christian is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Makayla says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Bathroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Madelyn Romero, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Bathroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Makayla says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Madelyn Romero, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clyde Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Makayla says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bathroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Madelyn Romero, Detective?\" Makayla asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Makayla says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Madelyn Romero, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Makayla says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Madelyn's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Makayla says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Madelyn's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Makayla says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Madelyn Wilson?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the best friend, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Madelyn's best friend, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Makayla says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Madelyn's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Makayla says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Madelyn Wilson?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the best friend, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Madelyn's best friend, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Clyde says. \"She's Madelyn's cousin. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Clyde says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Guest Bedroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Madelyn's cousin,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Living Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Clyde says. \"She's Madelyn's cousin. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Clyde says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Guest Bedroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Madelyn's cousin,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
