__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Clyde says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Guest Bedroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's cousin? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Living Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Stephen Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Guest Bedroom, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Clyde says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Lounge isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Stephen Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Clyde says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Dining Room!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Clyde says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Lounge isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Clyde declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Dining Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Clyde says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Lounge isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Stephen Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Clyde declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Dining Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Clyde exclaims. \"They'rein the Guest Bedroom, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Guest Bedroom, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Wilson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Madelyn never even had a butler! Go to the Lounge and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Clyde declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Dining Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Madelyn never even had a butler! Go to the Lounge and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Guest Bedroom, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Clyde declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Dining Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Clyde says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Lounge isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Clyde exclaims. \"They'rein the Guest Bedroom, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Joey Wyatt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's accountant? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Wilson's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Madelyn Romero is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Clyde says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Clyde says. \"He's Madelyn's accountant. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Madelyn Romero?\" Clyde says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
