__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Clyde says. \"Her name's Madelyn Romero. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
