__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Wilson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Clyde says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Guest Bedroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Clyde asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Clyde exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
