__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Madelyn Romero!\" Nicky says. \"She's the victim's gardener. She's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think she has it in her to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Madelyn Romero. She's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think she did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
