__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Madelyn Romero. She's pretty funny,\" Nicky says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
