__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Nicky says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Dining Room right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
