__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the accountant, Detective!\" Nicky says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Nicky says, excitedly pulling out his notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's accountant! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Nicky says, excitedly pulling out his notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's accountant! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the accountant, Detective!\" Nicky says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Nicky exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's accountant, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Nicky says, excitedly pulling out his notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's accountant! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Golly!\" Nicky exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's accountant, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Nicky exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's accountant, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Christian says. \"Presently, she is in the Lounge. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Christian says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Lounge,\" Christian says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Christian says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Christian says. \"Presently, she is in the Lounge. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Christian says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Lounge,\" Christian says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Christian says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Christian says. \"You will find her in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Christian says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Lounge,\" Christian says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Christian says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Christian says. \"You will find her in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Romero?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Christian says. \"You will find her in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilson's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Stephen Colon to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Stephen Colon, Detective,\" Christian says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Stephen Colon, Christian says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Stephen Colon, Detective,\" Christian says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Stephen Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Stephen Colon to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Stephen Colon, Detective,\" Christian says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Stephen Colon, Christian says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Stephen Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Madelyn Wilson's butler,\" Christian says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Stephen Colon, Christian says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room,\" Christian says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Living Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Joey Wyatt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Christian says. \"Presently, he is in the Living Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Christian says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Living Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Living Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Christian says. \"You will find him in the Living Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Living Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Christian says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Joey Wyatt?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room,\" Christian says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
