__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Christian says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic at the moment,\" Christian says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Christian says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Attic is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Emma Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Attic,\" Christian says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
