__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Family Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Family Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Christian says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Family Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Wilson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Christian says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Family Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Family Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Christian says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Nicky Gentry?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Madelyn Wilson's neighbor,\" Christian says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Madelyn Wilson has true relevance, Detective,\" Christian says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Christian says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Christian says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Christian says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Christian says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Christian says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Madelyn Wilson has true relevance, Detective,\" Christian says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Madelyn Wilson has true relevance, Detective,\" Christian says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Servants' Quarters and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Zoey Harrell, the victim's physician.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Isabella Crawford's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Boiler Room, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Gavin Chen, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" he says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and his eyes widen when you show him your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" he pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Billiard Room, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Victoria Rodriquez, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "In the Sunroom, you find a large and powerfully-muscled woman doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. According to the dossier, this is Lily Levine, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Lily grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Dining Room is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Moe Tran, the victim's ex-bodyguard.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Crawford may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Smoking Lounge you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. According to the dossier, this is Saul Miranda, the victim's lover.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You walk into the Bathroom, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Mackenzie Neal, the victim's butler.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Isabella Crawford, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Breakfast Nook, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Your dossier identifies him as Bill Howard, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Kitchen and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Faith Ferguson, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Gavin Chen. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Bill Howard? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"A perfectly charming man, despite his upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Bill Howard? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"A perfectly charming man, despite his upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"I know him, yes,\" she says. \"Bill Howard. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured man. He may even make something of himself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Bill Howard? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Crawford's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Bill Howard? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured man. He may even make something of himself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured man. He may even make something of himself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Harrell says. \"His name is Bill Howard. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Harrell says. \"His name is Bill Howard. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Isabella's cousin,\" Harrell says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured man. He may even make something of himself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Harrell says. \"His name is Bill Howard. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Victoria Rodriquez?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Isabella's golf caddy? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Gavin Chen,\" Harrell says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>Harrell snorts derisively. \"Isabella's golf caddy is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Gavin Chen in my presence, Detective!\" Harrell demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Harrell scowls. \"Isabella really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a sibling such as Gavin Chen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>Harrell snorts derisively. \"Isabella's golf caddy is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Gavin Chen,\" Harrell says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Victoria Rodriquez?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Isabella's golf caddy? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Gavin Chen in my presence, Detective!\" Harrell demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Isabella refers to as her golf caddy,\" Harrell says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Crawford's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Gavin Chen,\" Harrell says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
