__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Isabella's lover,\" Harrell says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
