__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Moe Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Moe Tran, Detective,\" Harrell says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Dining Room, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Harrell says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Kitchen?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Moe Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Moe Tran, Detective,\" Harrell says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Dining Room, if you require more information than that.\""));
