__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Saul Miranda. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Smoking Lounge,\" Harrell sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Lily Levine in my presence, Detective!\" Harrell demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
