__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Lily Levine,\" Harrell says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
