__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Harrell scowls. \"Isabella really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a lover such as Lily Levine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Saul Miranda?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Saul Miranda?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Harrell says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
