__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>Harrell snorts derisively. \"Isabella's business partner is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
