__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" he says. \"That's Isabella Crawford's golf caddy. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Bathroom,\" Gavin says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Zoey Harrell. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Gavin says. \"That's the victim's golf caddy, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
