__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh boy!\" Gavin says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Lily Levine for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh boy!\" Gavin says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Lily Levine for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly! You really want to know what I think, Detective?\" Gavin says, excitedly, and pulls out a notebook. \"Okay, so, first I measured some footprints out in the driveway, and...\" <p>\"Kid, we're short on time. Cut to the chase and tell me the details later, okay?\"<p>\"Oh, okay! It was Lily Levine!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh boy!\" Gavin says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Lily Levine for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It's just gotta be Lily Levine, Detective,\" Gavin says excitedly. \"Means, motive, and opportunity -- just like the Junior Detective's Handbook says!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh boy!\" Gavin says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Lily Levine for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
