__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, she mutters, \"Probably Lily Levine.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>She glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Victoria tilts her head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Lily Levine.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Victoria turns a page and goes back to her reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, she mutters, \"Probably Lily Levine.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>She glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>She looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Lily Levine.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
