__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Lily says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Servants' Quarters, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Zoey Harrell. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Zoey Harrell. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Lily says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Servants' Quarters, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's physician? Oh, you mean Zoey Harrell,\" Lily says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Zoey Harrell's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Servants' Quarters if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Zoey Harrell. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
