__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Isabella's physician? Oh, you mean Zoey Harrell,\" Lily says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Isabella's personal assistant,\" Lily says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Lily says. \"I think they'd be in the Boiler Room at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Isabella's personal assistant, I know him,\" Lily says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Lily says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Boiler Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
