__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Isabella's personal assistant, I know him,\" Lily says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Gavin Chen!\" Lily says. \"That's Isabella's personal assistant. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Isabella's personal assistant,\" Lily says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Lily grunts. \"That's Isabella's sibling -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Lily sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Billiard Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a sibling,\" Lily snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use her as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Lily says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Billiard Room right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a sibling,\" Lily snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use her as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Lily thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Billiard Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
