__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Isabella's butler, I know her,\" Lily says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's butler? Oh, you mean Mackenzie Neal,\" Lily says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's butler? Oh, you mean Mackenzie Neal,\" Lily says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
