__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Lily says. \"I think they'd be in the Breakfast Nook at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bill Howard?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Bill Howard!\" Lily says. \"That's Isabella's golf caddy. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
