__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Breakfast Nook.\""));
