__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Faith Ferguson?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Lily snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Kitchen, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Lily says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Kitchen right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Faith Ferguson?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Lily snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Kitchen.\""));
