__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Lily thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Kitchen if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
