__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Lily sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Kitchen. That's all I know or care.\""));
