__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Faith Ferguson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Lily snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Kitchen, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Crawford's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Lily thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Kitchen if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Lily says. \"It was Isabella's physician.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Lily says. \"It was Isabella's physician.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" She flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Lily says. \"It was Isabella's physician.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" She flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Lily says. \"It was Isabella's physician.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Lily says. \"It was Isabella's physician.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Isabella?\" Lily says. \"That's easy, it was her physician.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Lily flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Isabella?\" Lily says. \"That's easy, it was her physician.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Lily flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Mackenzie Neal, Detective,\" Tran says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Mackenzie Neal, Detective,\" Tran says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Crawford's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Mackenzie Neal to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Mackenzie Neal, Tran says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Mackenzie Neal, Detective,\" Tran says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Isabella Crawford's lover,\" Tran says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Mackenzie Neal to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Boiler Room at the moment,\" Tran says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Tran says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Boiler Room at the moment,\" Tran says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Tran says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Boiler Room,\" Tran says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Tran says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Breakfast Nook is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Boiler Room,\" Tran says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
