__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Tran says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Isabella Crawford's physician,\" Tran says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Crawford's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Gavin Chen, Detective,\" Tran says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
