__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Sunroom,\" Tran says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Faith Ferguson to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Tran says. \"You will find her in the Sunroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Faith Ferguson, Detective,\" Tran says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Tran says. \"Presently, she is in the Sunroom. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
