__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Saul Miranda?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Smoking Lounge,\" Tran says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Lily Levine, Detective,\" Tran says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
