__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Saul says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Isabella like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Saul says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Isabella like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Saul says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Isabella like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Saul says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
