__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Saul says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
