__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Isabella's physician, dude!\" she says. \"She's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
