__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"I met him once or twice,\" Mackenzie says. \"He seemed like real bad news to me. He's in the Boiler Room if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Gavin Chen?\" Mackenzie asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez man, I dunno much,\" she replies. \"Except he's a total control freak buzzkill. Like, he's in the Boiler Room, so like, just check out that scene for yourself and you'll see.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Mackenzie says. \"His name's Gavin Chen. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"I met him once or twice,\" Mackenzie says. \"He seemed like real bad news to me. He's in the Boiler Room if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Mackenzie says, rolling her eyes. \"Him. Gavin Chen. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
