__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>Bill scowls. \"What, now you're after Lily Levine? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Sunroom, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
