__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" he sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
