__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's physician and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes, Zoey Harrell and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Faith says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's physician and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Zoey Harrell?\" Faith asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
