__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Zoey Harrell and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Faith says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zoey Harrell?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's physician. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Crawford's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Zoey Harrell?\" Faith asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Faith says. \"We get along quite well. He's Isabella's personal assistant, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Crawford's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Boiler Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's personal assistant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Faith says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's personal assistant. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the personal assistant,\" Faith muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Boiler Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
