__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Lily Levine. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Isabella's cousin, and an absolute philistine,\" Faith scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Lily Levine? Bah,\" Faith says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Faith asks. \"Oh -- you mean Isabella's cousin. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Faith snorts. \"You're referring to Lily Levine. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Faith asks. \"Oh -- you mean Isabella's cousin. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Faith sniffs. \"Her name is Lily Levine, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lily Levine?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Faith says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The cousin. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Faith sniffs. \"Her name is Lily Levine, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Moe Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Faith says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Dining Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Moe Tran? Bah,\" Faith says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Faith says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Dining Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
