__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Saul Miranda?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Faith says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Smoking Lounge, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Faith says. \"We get along quite well. She's Isabella's butler, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Mackenzie Neal and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Faith says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's butler. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Mackenzie Neal and I get along rather well,\" Faith says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's butler. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mackenzie Neal and I get along rather well,\" Faith says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's butler and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Mackenzie Neal?\" Faith asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's butler. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Mackenzie Neal?\" Faith asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's butler. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Isabella's butler and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mackenzie Neal and I get along rather well,\" Faith says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Mackenzie Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Isabella's butler. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Faith says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Bill Howard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Faith smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Breakfast Nook -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Crawford's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Faith says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bill Howard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Faith smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Breakfast Nook -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the golf caddy,\" Faith muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Breakfast Nook, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Bill Howard. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Bill Howard is my biggest fan!\" Faith says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Breakfast Nook at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Bill Howard. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Faith says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bill Howard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Bill Howard is my biggest fan!\" Faith says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the golf caddy,\" Faith muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Breakfast Nook, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Isabella Crawford's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Faith says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Bill Howard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Bill Howard is my biggest fan!\" Faith says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Breakfast Nook at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bill Howard?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Faith says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Faith says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Faith says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Isabella?\" Faith asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Isabella?\" Faith asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Faith says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Faith says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Faith says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Faith says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Master Bedroom, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Makayla Hubbard, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Foyer, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the dossier, this is Archie Dale, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Smoking Lounge and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Maury Stark, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "In the Living Room you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Hilary Camacho, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Game Room, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Your dossier identifies him as Rufus Morris, the victim's child.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Addison O'Neal, the victim's personal assistant.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Lounge and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. \"You must be Joey Delacruz, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Study, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Zoey Gutierrez, the victim's ex-child.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Zoey. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Bathroom and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Gavin Norton, the victim's ex-physician.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's lawyer?\" Makayla says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Archie Dale? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Makayla exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Makayla exclaims. \"Grant's lawyer? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Archie Dale? Stay away from him!\" Makayla says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Makayla says. \"I wouldn't associate with Grant's creepy lawyer if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Archie Dale? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Makayla exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Makayla exclaims. \"Grant's lawyer? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Makayla says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Archie Dale, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Makayla exclaims. \"Grant's lawyer? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Makayla says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Archie Dale, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Archie Dale. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's lawyer?\" Makayla says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Bentley's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Archie Dale? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Makayla exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Makayla exclaims. \"Grant's lawyer? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Archie Dale? Stay away from him!\" Makayla says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's lawyer?\" Makayla says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's lawyer?\" Makayla says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Archie Dale? Stay away from him!\" Makayla says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Maury Stark. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Maury Stark?\" Makayla says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Maury Stark?\" Makayla says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Maury Stark. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Grant's housekeeper,\" she replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Maury Stark is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Makayla says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Makayla says. \"He's Grant's housekeeper. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Makayla says. \"His name's Maury Stark. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Maury Stark is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Makayla says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Makayla says. \"He's Grant's housekeeper. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
