__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Makayla asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Makayla shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Grant committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Makayla exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
