__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's ex-child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, yeah. I think I saw them in the Master Bedroom?\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, making a note of it. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah. S'alright, I guess? We don't really interact.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Zoey Gutierrez?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Zoey Gutierrez is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Study and ask she yourself.\""));
