__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's ex-child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know much about 'em. Alright, I suppose. Go find out for yourself -- in the Master Bedroom, I think.\""));
