__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" he sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" he sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
