__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Makayla Hubbard, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Grant's personal assistant. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's golf caddy?\" Hilary says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Makayla Hubbard is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Hilary says. \"She's Grant's personal assistant. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Hilary says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Makayla Hubbard is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Hilary says. \"She's Grant's personal assistant. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
