__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Hilary says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Foyer. Does that count?\""));
