__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Grant's golf caddy,\" Hilary replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Hilary mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Bathroom, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Hilary mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Bathroom, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
