__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>Hilary shudders. \"He's Grant's golf caddy. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bentley's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Bathroom,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Maury Stark. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Grant's golf caddy,\" Hilary replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Bathroom, if you want to talk to them,\" Hilary says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Hilary mutters. \"I don't know how Grant got stuck with a golf caddy like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
