__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Game Room,\" Hilary says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Child...\" Hilary mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Makayla Hubbard. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Game Room,\" Hilary says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Hilary says. \"Everyone loves Makayla Hubbard.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Game Room,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Child...\" Hilary mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Makayla Hubbard. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Rufus Morris. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Game Room,\" Hilary says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Makayla Hubbard,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Game Room,\" Hilary says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
