__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Child...\" Hilary mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Makayla Hubbard. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Game Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Hilary says. \"Everyone loves Makayla Hubbard.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Servants' Quarters. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Joey Delacruz. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Servants' Quarters. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Joey Delacruz,\" Hilary says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Addison O'Neal,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
