__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Gavin Norton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Grant's cousin,\" Hilary replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bentley's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"The only ex-physician I'm aware of around here is Maury Stark, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Grant's cousin,\" Hilary replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Maury Stark. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>Hilary shudders. \"He's Grant's cousin. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Gavin Norton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Hilary mutters. \"I don't know how Grant got stuck with a cousin like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Maury Stark. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
