__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Hilary grumbles. \"It was Zoey Gutierrez. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know who I think killed Grant?\" Hilary asks. \"Yeah, sure. Why not? I might as well tell you, what do I care anyway? It was Zoey Gutierrez. Take 'em away, it's one less person I'll have to clean up after in this place.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Hilary asks. \"All right. It was Zoey Gutierrez. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Hilary asks. \"All right. It was Zoey Gutierrez. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Hilary grumbles. \"It was Zoey Gutierrez. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Hilary asks. \"All right. It was Zoey Gutierrez. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You want to know who I think killed Grant?\" Hilary asks. \"Yeah, sure. Why not? I might as well tell you, what do I care anyway? It was Zoey Gutierrez. Take 'em away, it's one less person I'll have to clean up after in this place.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Rufus exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Master Bedroom and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Rufus says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Master Bedroom right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Rufus says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Master Bedroom right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
