__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Archie Dale. He's pretty funny,\" Rufus says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
