__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Rufus says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Bentley's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's housekeeper, Detective,\" Rufus says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
