__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Addison O'Neal. She's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think she did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Addison O'Neal's great fun!\" Rufus says. \"She's in the Servants' Quarters right now. She'll probably share her chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Rufus says. \"She's in the Servants' Quarters. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Addison O'Neal?\" Rufus says. \"I'd be real surprised if she did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Lounge -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Rufus says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Rufus says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Lounge right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Rufus says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Lounge right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Lounge,\" Rufus says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Lounge -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Rufus says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Rufus says. \"They're in the Lounge, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Rufus exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Lounge and see for yourself!\""));
