__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Rufus exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Makayla Hubbard,\" Addison says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Master Bedroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Addison ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Makayla Hubbard? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Grant's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Makayla Hubbard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Addison says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Master Bedroom, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Makayla Hubbard, isn't it?\" Addison asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Makayla Hubbard,\" Addison says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Master Bedroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Makayla Hubbard,\" Addison says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Makayla Hubbard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Makayla Hubbard!\" Addison says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
