__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Bentley's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Addison ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Makayla Hubbard? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Grant's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Makayla Hubbard!\" Addison says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Addison ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Makayla Hubbard? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Grant's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's lawyer, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Foyer, Detective,\" Addison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's lawyer, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Foyer, Detective,\" Addison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Grant's lawyer?\" Addison says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Foyer, Detective,\" Addison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Addison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Grant's lawyer? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Foyer with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Addison declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Addison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Grant's lawyer? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
