__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Bentley's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Addison says as sternly as she can muster, \"Grant's lawyer is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Foyer. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's lawyer, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Foyer with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Addison declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Addison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Grant's lawyer? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
