__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Rufus Morris's a positive delight!\" Addison says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Rufus Morris,\" Addison says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rufus Morris?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Rufus Morris. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Addison says. \"Did you know he's Grant's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
