__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Addison says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Addison says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Lounge, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Grant's cousin, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Bentley's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Addison says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Joey Delacruz. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Addison says. \"Did you know he's Grant's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Addison says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Joey Delacruz. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Addison says. \"Did you know he's Grant's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Addison says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Lounge, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Joey Delacruz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Grant's cousin, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Addison says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Lounge? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Zoey Gutierrez?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Addison says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Study, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Addison says as sternly as she can muster, \"Grant's ex-child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Study. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Zoey Gutierrez?\" you ask.<p>\"Zoey Gutierrez is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Addison says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Study, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Addison says as sternly as she can muster, \"Grant's ex-child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Study. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
