__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Zoey Gutierrez?\" you ask.<p>\"Zoey Gutierrez is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Addison says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Study, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-child? you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Study, Detective,\" Addison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Zoey Gutierrez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Addison says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Study, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-child?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Study, Detective,\" Addison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zoey Gutierrez?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Addison says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Study, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-child?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Study with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Addison declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zoey Gutierrez?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Addison says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Study, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Study, Detective,\" Addison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim's ex-child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Addison says as sternly as she can muster, \"Grant's ex-child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Study. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's ex-physician, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Bentley's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Addison says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Gavin Norton, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's ex-physician, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Addison says. \"Calls himself 'Gavin Norton', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Gavin Norton' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Grant's ex-physician?\" Addison says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Addison says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Gavin Norton, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's ex-physician, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Gavin Norton, Detective?\" Addison asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Addison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Grant's ex-physician? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Addison says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Gavin Norton, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Addison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Grant's ex-physician? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
