__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Addison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Grant's ex-physician? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Gavin Norton, Detective?\" Addison asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Addison says. \"He's Grant's ex-physician, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Grant's housekeeper, Detective,\" Addison says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Addison says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Grant Bentley?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the housekeeper, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Addison says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Grant's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Addison says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Grant Bentley?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the housekeeper, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Addison says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Grant Bentley?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the housekeeper, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Addison says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Grant's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Addison says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Grant's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Addison says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Grant's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Archie Dale,\" Delacruz says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Archie Dale in my presence, Detective!\" Delacruz demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Master Bedroom.\""));
