__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Archie Dale,\" Delacruz says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
