__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Delacruz says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Archie Dale,\" Delacruz says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
