__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Master Bedroom,\" Delacruz sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Delacruz scowls. \"Grant really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a golf caddy such as Archie Dale.\""));
