__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Maury Stark in my presence, Detective!\" Delacruz demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Delacruz says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Smoking Lounge at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know him, yes,\" he says. \"Hilary Camacho. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Maury Stark, Detective,\" Delacruz says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Smoking Lounge, if you require more information than that.\""));
