__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Smoking Lounge and ask him directly.\""));
