__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Bentley's ex-physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Delacruz sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>Delacruz snorts derisively. \"Grant's personal assistant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's ex-physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Living Room,\" he says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
