__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Grant's personal assistant, dude!\" she says. \"She's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, dunno much, dude,\" Zoey says. \"I guess look in the Foyer? That's where I'd look, if I was looking.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's cool,\" she replies. \"Like, maybe you wouldn't think it to meet her, but like deep down, you know? She's good people.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything <i>useful</i> about Makayla Hubbard?\"<p>\"Oh, uhh... Well, she's Grant's personal assistant, does that help?\""));
