__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Gavin Norton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Gavin Norton is a total downer,\" she replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think he's Grant's child? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
