__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Grant's golf caddy. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Gavin says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Makayla Hubbard and I get along rather well,\" Gavin says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Gavin says. \"We get along quite well. She's Grant's golf caddy, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Makayla Hubbard and I get along rather well,\" Gavin says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Gavin says. \"We get along quite well. She's Grant's golf caddy, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Makayla Hubbard and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Gavin says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Makayla Hubbard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Gavin says. \"We get along quite well. She's Grant's golf caddy, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Makayla Hubbard?\" Gavin asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
