__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Makayla Hubbard?\" Gavin asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Gavin says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Archie Dale and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Gavin says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Gavin says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Archie Dale and I get along rather well,\" Gavin says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes, Archie Dale and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Gavin says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Gavin says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Archie Dale and I get along rather well,\" Gavin says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Archie Dale is my biggest fan!\" Gavin says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Archie Dale and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Gavin says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Archie Dale. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Gavin smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Foyer -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Archie Dale and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Gavin says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Archie Dale. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Archie Dale is my biggest fan!\" Gavin says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Archie Dale?\" Gavin asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Archie Dale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Archie Dale is my biggest fan!\" Gavin says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Archie Dale?\" Gavin asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Archie Dale?\" Gavin asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Grant's housekeeper. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Gavin says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Maury Stark?\" Gavin asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant's housekeeper and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Maury Stark and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Gavin says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maury Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Gavin says. \"We get along quite well. He's Grant's housekeeper, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Maury Stark and I get along rather well,\" Gavin says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
