__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Hilary Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Gavin smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Living Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Bentley's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the college roommate,\" Gavin muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Living Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Hilary Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Hilary Camacho is my biggest fan!\" Gavin says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Living Room at the moment.\""));
