__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Gavin asks. \"Oh -- you mean Grant's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Gavin snorts. \"You're referring to Addison O'Neal. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Addison O'Neal?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Gavin says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Addison O'Neal? Bah,\" Gavin says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Addison O'Neal? Bah,\" Gavin says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
