__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Addison O'Neal. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Gavin asks. \"Oh -- you mean Grant's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Gavin snorts. \"You're referring to Addison O'Neal. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Joey Delacruz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Gavin says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Lounge, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Gavin snorts. \"Their presence in the Lounge is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Gavin says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Lounge, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Grant Bentley's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Lounge,\" Gavin says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Joey Delacruz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Lounge, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Lounge,\" Gavin says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Joey Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Gavin says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Lounge, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Lounge,\" Gavin says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Lounge,\" Gavin says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
