__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Gavin grumbles, \"it was Grant's housekeeper. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Grant Bentley's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his housekeeper,\" he grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Gavin grumbles, \"it was Grant's housekeeper. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Gavin grumbles, \"it was Grant's housekeeper. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Gavin grumbles, \"it was Grant's housekeeper. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Grant Bentley's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his housekeeper,\" he grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Gavin says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" he sniffs. \"It was his housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Gavin says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" he sniffs. \"It was his housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Grant Bentley's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his housekeeper,\" he grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Billiard Room you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Frederick Arnold, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Clyde Salinas,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Bathroom you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Your dossier identifies him as Perry Day, the victim's lover.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Boiler Room you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. \"You must be Molly Dickerson, the victim's boss,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Molly Dickerson. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Servants' Quarters, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. \"You must be Khloe Sosa, the victim's chauffeur,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Attic, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. \"You must be Gabrielle Bryant, the victim's housekeeper,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Sunroom and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Perry Colon, the victim's bodyguard,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Wine Cellar, you find a large and powerfully-muscled woman doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Sophia Hopkins, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Sophia grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "In the Smoking Lounge you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. \"You must be Harold Phillips, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You walk into the Foyer, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. According to the dossier, this is John Bell, the victim's ex-butler.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Frederick says. \"He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Calls herself 'Molly Dickerson', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Molly Dickerson' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Perry Day. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Frederick says. \"He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Calls herself 'Molly Dickerson', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Molly Dickerson' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Frederick muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Clyde's chauffeur? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Molly Dickerson, Detective?\" Frederick asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Frederick muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Clyde's chauffeur? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Molly Dickerson, Detective?\" Frederick asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Frederick says. \"He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Frederick says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Molly Dickerson, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Calls herself 'Molly Dickerson', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Molly Dickerson' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Clyde's chauffeur?\" Frederick says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Frederick says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Molly Dickerson, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Molly Dickerson, Detective?\" Frederick asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
