__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Frederick says. \"She's Clyde's lover, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Salinas's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Calls herself 'Sophia Hopkins', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Sophia Hopkins' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Clyde's lover?\" Frederick says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
