__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Frederick muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Clyde's lover? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
