__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Frederick muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Clyde's lover? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Gabrielle Bryant's a positive delight!\" Frederick says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Frederick ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Harold Phillips? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Clyde's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Gabrielle Bryant's a positive delight!\" Frederick says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Frederick ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Harold Phillips? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Clyde's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Gabrielle Bryant. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Gabrielle Bryant. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Frederick says. \"Did you know she's Clyde's lover? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Frederick ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Harold Phillips? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Clyde's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
