__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Frederick ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Harold Phillips? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Clyde's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Gabrielle Bryant. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Frederick says. \"Did you know she's Clyde's lover? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Harold Phillips, isn't it?\" Frederick asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Gabrielle Bryant's a positive delight!\" Frederick says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Harold Phillips,\" Frederick says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Harold Phillips,\" Frederick says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Gabrielle Bryant. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Frederick says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Clyde's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Harold Phillips,\" Frederick says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Harold Phillips,\" Frederick says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Perry Colon,\" Frederick says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Sunroom, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Frederick says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Wine Cellar, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Perry Colon!\" Frederick says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Frederick says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Wine Cellar, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Sunroom, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Frederick says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Wine Cellar, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
