__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Frederick says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Wine Cellar and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Frederick says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Wine Cellar, go see for yourself!\""));
