__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Sophia Hopkins is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Frederick says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Wine Cellar, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Molly Dickerson, Detective?\" Frederick asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
