__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Frederick says as sternly as he can muster, \"Clyde's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Boiler Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Frederick says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Smoking Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Boiler Room, Detective,\" Frederick says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Frederick says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Smoking Lounge is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Frederick says as sternly as he can muster, \"Clyde's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Boiler Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Frederick declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Harold Phillips is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Frederick says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Smoking Lounge, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Frederick declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Boiler Room, Detective,\" Frederick says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What do you know about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Frederick says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Clyde's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Salinas's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Frederick says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bathroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Frederick says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Clyde's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim had an ex-butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Frederick says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bathroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Frederick says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Clyde's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Salinas's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Frederick says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bathroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, John Bell. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Frederick says. \"Did you know he's Clyde's lover? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Frederick says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bathroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Frederick says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Clyde's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
