__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, John Bell. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Frederick says. \"Did you know he's Clyde's lover? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Frederick says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Bathroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, John Bell. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Frederick says. \"Did you know he's Clyde's lover? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
