__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Frederick says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bathroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Frederick says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Clyde's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Frederick says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bathroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Clyde?\" Frederick asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Simon Bush?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Frederick looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Clyde's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Clyde's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Clyde's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Clyde?\" Frederick asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Stan Armstrong?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Frederick looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Frederick says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Clyde's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Clyde?\" Frederick asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Rufus Fletcher?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Clyde Salinas's college roommate,\" Day says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Day says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Clyde Salinas's college roommate, I believe,\" Day says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Day says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Billiard Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Clyde Salinas's college roommate,\" Day says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Salinas's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Day says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Billiard Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Clyde Salinas's college roommate,\" Day says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Salinas's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Day says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
