__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Clyde Salinas's boss, I believe,\" Day says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Molly Dickerson,\" Day says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Clyde Salinas's boss,\" Day says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Molly Dickerson,\" Day says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Clyde Salinas's boss,\" Day says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Molly Dickerson, I presume,\" Day says. \"She is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Clyde Salinas's boss, I believe,\" Day says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Molly Dickerson, Detective,\" Day says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Clyde Salinas's boss,\" Day says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
