__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Clyde Salinas's boss,\" Day says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Day says. \"Presently, she is in the Servants' Quarters. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Salinas's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Khloe Sosa, Detective,\" Day says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Day says. \"You will find her in the Servants' Quarters, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Khloe Sosa to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Servants' Quarters,\" Day says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Salinas's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Khloe Sosa, Day says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Day says. \"You will find her in the Servants' Quarters, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
