__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Gabrielle Bryant. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Day says. \"Presently, she is in the Attic. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Day says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Attic, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Day says. \"You will find her in the Attic, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Day says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Attic, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Gabrielle Bryant. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Day says. \"You will find her in the Attic, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Attic, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Day says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Gabrielle Bryant. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic,\" Day says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Day says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Attic, you might send my regards.\""));
