__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Clyde Salinas's bodyguard,\" Day says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Day says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Clyde Salinas's bodyguard,\" Day says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Day says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Clyde Salinas's bodyguard, I believe,\" Day says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
