__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Day says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Sunroom is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Clyde Salinas's lawyer,\" Day says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Salinas's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Sophia Hopkins, Detective,\" Day says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Clyde Salinas's lawyer,\" Day says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Sophia Hopkins to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Clyde Salinas's lawyer,\" Day says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
