__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Harold Phillips, Detective,\" Day says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
