__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>Khloe scowls. \"What, now you're after Frederick Arnold? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! He's in the Billiard Room, you can go talk to him yourself!\""));
