__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Perry asks. \"Oh -- you mean Clyde's ex-butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Salinas's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Perry snorts. \"You're referring to Sophia Hopkins. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Frederick Arnold. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Perry says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The ex-butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Perry snorts. \"You're referring to Sophia Hopkins. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Perry asks. \"Oh -- you mean Clyde's ex-butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Sophia Hopkins? Bah,\" Perry says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Sophia Hopkins? Bah,\" Perry says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Perry asks. \"Oh -- you mean Clyde's ex-butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Sophia Hopkins? Bah,\" Perry says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Perry asks. \"Oh -- you mean Clyde's ex-butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Frederick Arnold. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Clyde's ex-butler, and an absolute philistine,\" Perry scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Perry snorts. \"You're referring to Sophia Hopkins. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Perry snorts. \"You're referring to Sophia Hopkins. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Perry snorts. \"You're referring to Sophia Hopkins. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's boss and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Perry Day. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's boss. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the lover,\" Perry muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Smoking Lounge, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's boss. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. He's Clyde's boss, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Smoking Lounge at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's boss. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Perry Day. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's boss and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's boss. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Perry smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Boiler Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Billiard Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Molly Dickerson is my biggest fan!\" Perry says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Molly Dickerson is my biggest fan!\" Perry says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Boiler Room.\""));
