__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Perry smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Boiler Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the boss,\" Perry muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Billiard Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Perry says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Perry smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Boiler Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Molly Dickerson is my biggest fan!\" Perry says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Perry says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. She's Clyde's ex-butler, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Molly Dickerson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Perry says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. She's Clyde's ex-butler, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Molly Dickerson and I get along rather well,\" Perry says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's ex-butler and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Molly Dickerson?\" Perry asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. She's Clyde's ex-butler, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Molly Dickerson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Perry says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's ex-butler. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
