__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Harold Phillips? Bah,\" Perry says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Perry says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Perry snorts. \"You're referring to Harold Phillips. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Perry says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Perry sniffs. \"His name is Harold Phillips, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Perry says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Perry sniffs. \"His name is Harold Phillips, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Perry sniffs. \"His name is Harold Phillips, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Clyde's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Perry scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Perry sniffs. \"His name is Harold Phillips, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Perry says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Billiard Room,\" Perry says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Sophia Hopkins. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Perry says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
