__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Perry says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Perry snorts. \"Their presence in the Billiard Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Perry says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Billiard Room,\" Perry says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Billiard Room,\" Perry says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Perry says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
