__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Harold Phillips. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Clyde's college roommate, and an absolute philistine,\" Perry scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
