__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Perry asks. \"Oh -- you mean Clyde's college roommate. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
