__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's chauffeur. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-butler? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Perry Day?\" Perry asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes, Perry Day and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Perry says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"John Bell. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Clyde's chauffeur. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Perry says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim's ex-butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Perry Day?\" Perry asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Perry Day?\" Perry asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's chauffeur and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Perry Day and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Perry says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-butler? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Perry Day and I get along rather well,\" Perry says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"John Bell. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Perry says. \"We get along quite well. He's Clyde's chauffeur, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Perry Day and I get along rather well,\" Perry says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's chauffeur and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Perry says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Perry says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Perry says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Perry says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Clyde?\" Perry asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Clyde?\" Perry asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Perry says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Clyde?\" Perry asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Perry says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Sophia says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Billiard Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Gabrielle Bryant. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Sophia says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Billiard Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Gabrielle Bryant,\" Sophia says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Sophia says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Billiard Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, her name's Gabrielle Bryant. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Clyde's college roommate? Oh, you mean Gabrielle Bryant,\" Sophia says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Sophia says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Billiard Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
