__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, that's Gabrielle Bryant,\" Sophia says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Gabrielle Bryant,\" Sophia says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Sophia says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Billiard Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Perry Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Sophia grunts. \"That's Clyde's bodyguard -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Sophia says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Servants' Quarters right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Perry Day. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a bodyguard,\" Sophia snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Sophia sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Servants' Quarters. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Perry Day. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Clyde's bodyguard,\" Sophia says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
