__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Sophia says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Boiler Room, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Perry Day. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Molly Dickerson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Sophia says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Boiler Room, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Salinas's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's boss? Oh, you mean Perry Day,\" Sophia says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Sophia says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Boiler Room, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Perry Day. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Molly Dickerson's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Boiler Room if you want to meet her.\""));
