__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Clyde's boss,\" Sophia says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's housekeeper? Oh, you mean Harold Phillips,\" Sophia says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Clyde's boss, I know her,\" Sophia says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
