__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Sophia snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Umm...\" Sophia thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Boiler Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Harold Phillips's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Smoking Lounge if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Clyde's child? Oh, you mean Khloe Sosa,\" Sophia says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Sophia says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Smoking Lounge, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Khloe Sosa. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
