__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Clyde's housekeeper,\" Sophia says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-butler? you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Sophia says. \"Perry Day, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a housekeeper,\" Sophia snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
