__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Sophia grunts. \"That's Clyde's housekeeper -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
