__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Clyde?\" Sophia says. \"That's easy, it was his college roommate.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Sophia flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Clyde?\" Sophia says. \"That's easy, it was his college roommate.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Sophia flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Clyde?\" Sophia says. \"That's easy, it was his college roommate.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Sophia flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Sophia says. \"It was Clyde's college roommate.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" She flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Sophia says. \"It was Clyde's college roommate.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" She flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Sophia says. \"It was Clyde's college roommate.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" She flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Clyde's chauffeur,\" Harold replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"They're in the Wine Cellar,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Clyde's chauffeur,\" Harold replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Salinas's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Wine Cellar, if you want to talk to them,\" Harold says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>Harold shudders. \"He's Clyde's chauffeur. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Harold mutters. \"I don't know how Clyde got stuck with a chauffeur like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a child like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
