__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Boiler Room. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Billiard Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Harold says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Boiler Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Harold mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Billiard Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Boiler Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Billiard Room,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Harold mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Billiard Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Molly Dickerson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Molly Dickerson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Billiard Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Harold says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Molly Dickerson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Harold mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Billiard Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Molly Dickerson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Boiler Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Salinas's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Harold mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Billiard Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Molly Dickerson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Clyde's ex-butler,\" Harold replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Perry Day,\" Harold says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Clyde's ex-butler,\" Harold replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Day. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>Harold shudders. \"She's Clyde's ex-butler. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Day. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Harold mutters. \"I don't know how Clyde got stuck with a ex-butler like her. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a child like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"The only chauffeur I'm aware of around here is Perry Day, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
