__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Perry Colon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Sunroom. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only bodyguard I'm aware of around here is Sophia Hopkins, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sophia Hopkins, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Clyde's lover. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Harold says. \"Everyone loves Perry Day.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Sophia Hopkins. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Sophia Hopkins is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Harold says. \"She's Clyde's lover. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Harold says. \"Everyone loves Perry Day.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Clyde's lover,\" Harold says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sophia Hopkins, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Clyde's lover. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Day,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sophia Hopkins, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Clyde's lover. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer...\" Harold mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Perry Day. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sophia Hopkins, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Clyde's lover. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Day,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Sophia Hopkins is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Harold says. \"She's Clyde's lover. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Day,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Clyde's lover,\" Harold says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer...\" Harold mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Perry Day. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Foyer, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's ex-butler?\" Harold says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What do you know about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Foyer,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Harold says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What do you know about John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Foyer,\" Harold says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Clyde's ex-butler?\" Harold says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"John Bell. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Foyer,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-butler? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Harold says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Foyer,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Foyer,\" Harold says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim's ex-butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's ex-butler?\" Harold says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Salinas's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Harold says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Attic. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know John Bell?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Foyer,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-butler? you ask.<p>\"Clyde's ex-butler?\" Harold says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Harold asks. \"All right. It was Perry Colon. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Harold grumbles. \"It was Perry Colon. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Harold grumbles. \"It was Perry Colon. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Harold asks. \"All right. It was Perry Colon. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Harold asks. \"All right. It was Perry Colon. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Harold asks. \"All right. It was Perry Colon. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Harold asks. \"All right. It was Perry Colon. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Foyer, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" John says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Billiard Room isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Foyer, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" John exclaims. \"They'rein the Foyer, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" John says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Billiard Room!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" John says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Billiard Room isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Frederick Arnold?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" John declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Billiard Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
