__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" John says. \"She's Clyde's boss. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Molly Dickerson?\" John says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's boss,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Molly Dickerson?\" John says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
