__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Pfft, Molly Dickerson is just a dupe, a patsy!\" John says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" John says. \"She's Clyde's boss. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
