__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Molly Dickerson?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's boss? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
