__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" John says. \"I wouldn't associate with Clyde's creepy chauffeur if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Khloe Sosa? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" John exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Khloe Sosa. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" John says. \"I wouldn't associate with Clyde's creepy chauffeur if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"No! No, never!\" John says, alarmed. \"She's one of them! Her name's Khloe Sosa, she's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Khloe Sosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's chauffeur?\" John says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
