__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" John says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Foyer, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's housekeeper,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Attic, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" John says. \"She's Clyde's housekeeper. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's housekeeper,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's housekeeper,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Attic, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" John says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Foyer, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Attic, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Gabrielle Bryant?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" John says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Foyer, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Salinas's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" John says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Foyer, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Foyer, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Clyde never even had a bodyguard! Go to the Sunroom and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" John says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Sunroom!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Clyde never even had a bodyguard! Go to the Sunroom and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" John says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Sunroom isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" John exclaims. \"They'rein the Foyer, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" John declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Sunroom if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" John declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Sunroom if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Clyde never even had a bodyguard! Go to the Sunroom and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Foyer, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" John declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Sunroom if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Clyde never even had a bodyguard! Go to the Sunroom and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Perry Colon?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" John says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Sunroom!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Sophia Hopkins. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" John says. \"I wouldn't associate with Clyde's creepy lawyer if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sophia Hopkins? Stay away from her!\" John says. \"I've seen her mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" John says. \"I wouldn't associate with Clyde's creepy lawyer if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Sophia Hopkins? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" John exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's lawyer?\" John says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Sophia Hopkins? Stay away from her!\" John says. \"I've seen her mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" John says. \"I wouldn't associate with Clyde's creepy lawyer if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Sophia Hopkins? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" John exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" John exclaims. \"Clyde's lawyer? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" John says, alarmed. \"She's one of them! Her name's Sophia Hopkins, she's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" John exclaims. \"Clyde's lawyer? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Salinas's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" John says, alarmed. \"She's one of them! Her name's Sophia Hopkins, she's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Sophia Hopkins?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" John exclaims. \"Clyde's lawyer? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Sophia Hopkins? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" John exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's child,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Salinas's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" John says. \"His name's Harold Phillips. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's child,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Harold Phillips?\" John says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's child? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" John says. \"His name's Harold Phillips. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's child? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Salinas's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Harold Phillips is just a dupe, a patsy!\" John says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Clyde Salinas's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Harold Phillips is just a dupe, a patsy!\" John says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" John says. \"His name's Harold Phillips. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Harold Phillips is just a dupe, a patsy!\" John says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Harold Phillips. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Clyde's child,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Harold Phillips?\" you ask.<p>\"Clyde's child? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" John says. \"His name's Harold Phillips. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"John says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Clyde's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" John says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>John looks around, then whispers, \"It was Clyde's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"John says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Clyde's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" John says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>John looks around, then whispers, \"It was Clyde's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know,\" John says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Clyde's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know,\" John says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Clyde's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Family Room, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Audrey Sharpe, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Study, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Mitch Blackwell, the victim's physician.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask him. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Morgan Strong was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" he says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Wine Cellar and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Jonas Barlow, the victim's neighbor.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Game Room and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the dossier, this is Elizabeth Callahan, the victim's accountant.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Attic is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Your dossier identifies her as Lillian Vang, the victim's lover.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Strong may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Bar. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Serenity Hanson, the victim's boss.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Serenity Hanson. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Pantry, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Chuck Day, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Chuck grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "In the Lounge you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Doc McPherson, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Library, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Avery Rowe, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Study and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Strong's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Mitch Blackwell? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Study at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Sharpe says. \"His name is Mitch Blackwell. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Study and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Mitch Blackwell? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Mitch Blackwell, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Study, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Sharpe says. \"His name is Mitch Blackwell. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Mitch Blackwell, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Study, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Mitch Blackwell? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
