__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chuck Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Morgan refers to as her best friend,\" Sharpe says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Sharpe scowls. \"Morgan really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a best friend such as Chuck Day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Chuck Day?\" you ask.<p>\"Chuck Day?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Morgan's best friend? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Chuck Day in my presence, Detective!\" Sharpe demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
