__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Sharpe scowls. \"Morgan really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a college roommate such as Doc McPherson.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Doc McPherson?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Sharpe says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Doc McPherson,\" Sharpe says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
