__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Library and ask her directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Sharpe says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Library?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Library and ask her directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Sharpe says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Library?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Avery Rowe, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Library, if you require more information than that.\""));
