__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" she says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Sharpe smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Avery Rowe?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Sharpe smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Avery Rowe?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Avery Rowe. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Sharpe sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Avery Rowe? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Sharpe sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Avery Rowe? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Audrey Sharpe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Family Room right now,\" Mitch says, \"but I don't think she did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Strong's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Game Room right now, Detective, \"Mitch says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
