__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Chuck Day?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Mitch exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Pantry and see for yourself!\""));
