__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Mitch says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Mitch exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Mitch exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Jonas muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Morgan's boss? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Game Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Jonas declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Jonas says. \"She's Morgan's boss, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Strong's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Jonas says as sternly as he can muster, \"Morgan's cousin is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Game Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Morgan's boss?\" Jonas says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Game Room, Detective,\" Jonas says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Audrey Sharpe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Morgan's boss?\" Jonas says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
