__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Game Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Jonas declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Jonas muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Morgan's boss? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
