__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Morgan's boss?\" Jonas says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Jonas says as sternly as he can muster, \"Morgan's cousin is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Game Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Mitch Blackwell,\" Jonas says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Study, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Physician, physician. Hmm,\" Jonas ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Chuck Day? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Morgan's physician. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Mitch Blackwell!\" Jonas says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Strong's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Physician, physician. Hmm,\" Jonas ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Chuck Day? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Morgan's physician. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Jonas says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Study, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Chuck Day,\" Jonas says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Mitch Blackwell,\" Jonas says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Study, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
