__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lillian Vang?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Lillian Vang,\" Jonas says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Attic, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
