__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Jonas says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Family Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Hanson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Jonas says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Morgan's physician, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Jonas says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Family Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
