__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Doc McPherson?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Morgan's accountant?\" Jonas says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Strong's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Lillian Vang, Detective?\" Jonas asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Doc McPherson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Jonas says. \"He's Morgan's accountant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Jonas says. \"Calls herself 'Lillian Vang', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Lillian Vang' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Jonas says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Lillian Vang, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Doc McPherson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Jonas says. \"He's Morgan's accountant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
