__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Avery Rowe. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Jonas says. \"Did you know she's Morgan's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer, lawyer. Hmm,\" Jonas ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Elizabeth Callahan? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Morgan's lawyer. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Jonas says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Morgan's cousin, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
