__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Elizabeth Callahan,\" Jonas says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
