__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know who I think did it?\" Jonas says, looking surprised. \"Well, that's a rum go. I hadn't even considered the question. I suppose it must've been Audrey Sharpe, though, mustn't it? Stands to reason.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who put paid to old Morgan? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Jonas says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Audrey Sharpe, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who put paid to old Morgan? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Jonas says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Audrey Sharpe, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who put paid to old Morgan? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Jonas says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Audrey Sharpe, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who put paid to old Morgan? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Jonas says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Audrey Sharpe, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well now, I'm not sure it would be right to be a squealer, Detective,\" Jonas says. \"Not quite cricket, you know. ...Then again, neither is murder, what? Very well, you've forced my hand. It was Audrey Sharpe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who put paid to old Morgan? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Jonas says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Audrey Sharpe, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Morgan's lawyer? She's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Cousin? Cousin...\" Elizabeth lights a cigarette and thinks for a moment. \"...Oh! You mean Mitch Blackwell. Yeah, I don't give a crap about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Morgan's lawyer? She's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
