__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Doc McPherson?\" you ask.<p>\"Doc McPherson? Morgan's physician? He's cool, he's a good person. Don't you be hasslin' him!\" she snarls, jabbing a forefinger at you."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Serenity Hanson. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Avery Rowe? I can't stand the sight of that slimy worm. I think she's in the Library? Go see for yourself what a piece of crap she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Strong's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm... Yeah, I think I know who you mean, but I can't think of their name. Never cared to know. They're probably in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Avery Rowe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Feh!\" she growls, and stomps her cigarette out on the floor. \"If you wanna know about Avery Rowe, go to the Library and ask her yourself. I don't want anything to do with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm... Yeah, I think I know who you mean, but I can't think of their name. Never cared to know. They're probably in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"I can tell you that piece of crap is stinking up the Library. You want any more than that, go ask her for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Morgan's lawyer? I ain't gonna even say that piece of crap's name. Go to the Pantry and find out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Strong's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>that</i> jerkoff. Go to the Pantry and see for yourself why I wouldn't give a wet fart.\""));
