__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" she sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Family Room,\" Vang says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Strong's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Vang says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Family Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Family Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Vang says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Vang says. \"You will find her in the Family Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Vang says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Family Room, you might send my regards.\""));
