__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Study,\" Vang says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Mitch Blackwell, I presume,\" Vang says. \"He is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Study,\" Vang says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Mitch Blackwell,\" Vang says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Study,\" Vang says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Mitch Blackwell, Detective,\" Vang says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
