__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Morgan Strong's neighbor,\" Vang says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Jonas Barlow, Vang says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Morgan Strong's neighbor,\" Vang says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Jonas Barlow, Detective,\" Vang says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Morgan Strong's neighbor,\" Vang says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Strong's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Jonas Barlow to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Morgan Strong's neighbor,\" Vang says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
