__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Morgan Strong's neighbor,\" Vang says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
