__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Elizabeth Callahan?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Game Room,\" Vang says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Vang says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Elizabeth Callahan?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Game Room,\" Vang says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Vang says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Game Room.\""));
