__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Vang says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
