__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Vang says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Game Room.\""));
