__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Avery Rowe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Library,\" Vang says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Avery Rowe, Vang says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Vang says. \"You will find her in the Library, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Avery Rowe, Detective,\" Vang says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Library,\" Vang says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Strong's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Avery Rowe to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Avery Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Library,\" Vang says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
