__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"The lawyer.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Morgan Strong's lawyer, Detective,\" Vang says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Morgan Strong's lawyer,\" Vang says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"The lawyer.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Morgan Strong's lawyer, Detective,\" Vang says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Vang says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Morgan Strong's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Morgan Strong's lawyer,\" Vang says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Vang says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Morgan Strong's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Vang says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Morgan Strong's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Morgan Strong's lawyer,\" Vang says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Morgan's accountant,\" she replies. \"Don't care much for her. She's a crook, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Serenity muses. \"I think I know who you mean, Detective, but I dunno them real well. I think they're in the Library, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Morgan's accountant,\" she replies. \"Don't care much for her. She's a crook, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Serenity says. \"Try the Library, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Morgan's accountant?\" Serenity asks. \"I know <i>of</i> her, but that's about it. We ain't what you'd call 'chummy'.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, I got no use for them,\" Serenity says. \"Nothin' but trouble. Probably hangin' around the Library, if you've got time to waste.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Morgan's accountant?\" Serenity asks. \"I know <i>of</i> her, but that's about it. We ain't what you'd call 'chummy'.\""));
