__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Serenity says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Serenity says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Morgan like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Serenity says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Serenity says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Morgan like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
