__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a physician,\" Chuck snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Chuck says. \"Mitch Blackwell, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Morgan's physician,\" Chuck says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Chuck says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Chuck grunts. \"That's Morgan's physician -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Chuck says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
