__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Jonas Barlow's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Wine Cellar if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, his name's Jonas Barlow. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Jonas Barlow's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Wine Cellar if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Jonas Barlow,\" Chuck says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
