__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Serenity Hanson?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Chuck snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Bar, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Chuck says. \"Serenity Hanson, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
