__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Audrey Sharpe, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Morgan's best friend. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Doc says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Audrey Sharpe is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Doc says. \"She's Morgan's best friend. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Doc says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Audrey Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Audrey Sharpe is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Doc says. \"She's Morgan's best friend. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Strong's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Doc says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Game Room.\""));
