__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Wine Cellar. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Elizabeth Callahan,\" Doc says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Jonas Barlow,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only neighbor I'm aware of around here is Elizabeth Callahan, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
