__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Lillian Vang?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Morgan's boss,\" Doc replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
