__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Avery Rowe,\" Doc says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
