__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Day?\" you ask.<p>Doc shudders. \"He's Morgan's lover. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"The only best friend I'm aware of around here is Mitch Blackwell, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
