__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Chuck Day. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Doc mutters. \"I don't know how Morgan got stuck with a lover like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
