__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"Morgan's accountant? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Jonas Barlow?\" Avery says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mitch Blackwell?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Avery says. \"He's Morgan's accountant. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Strong's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Avery says. \"His name's Jonas Barlow. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
