__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"Jonas Barlow? I think he's safe,\" Avery says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Avery says. \"Her name's Elizabeth Callahan. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jonas Barlow?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Avery says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Wine Cellar, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
