__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Strong's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Audrey Sharpe is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Avery says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Avery says. \"Her name's Audrey Sharpe. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Doc McPherson?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Avery says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Lounge and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Audrey Sharpe?\" Avery says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Audrey Sharpe?\" Avery says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Doc McPherson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Avery says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Lounge and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Strong's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Audrey Sharpe is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Avery says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know,\" Avery says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Avery says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Avery says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Avery says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Avery looks around, then whispers, \"It was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Avery says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Avery looks around, then whispers, \"It was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Avery says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Avery says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Morgan's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Dining Room, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Chuck Todd, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" he says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and his eyes widen when you show him your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" he pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Servants' Quarters is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Riff Byers, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Billiard Room, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the dossier, this is Ed Prince, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Boiler Room, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Ferris McConnell, the victim's sibling.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You walk into the Smoking Lounge, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Sophie Elliott, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to her. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The only person in the Living Room is a hugely-muscled man, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. According to the dossier, this is Franklin Delgado, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Douglas'd had a proper regimen like I told him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "Inside the Bathroom you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Buck Wallace, the victim's butler.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Douglas. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "As you enter the Basement, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. According to the dossier, this is Boris Scott, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Pantry and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Randy Mack, the victim's ex-butler.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Douglas Buckner's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Riff Byers!\" Chuck says. \"He's the victim's ex-butler. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Buck Wallace. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas Buckner's ex-butler!\" Chuck says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Buck Wallace. He's pretty funny,\" Chuck says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Riff Byers!\" Chuck says. \"He's the victim's ex-butler. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Buck Wallace. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas Buckner's ex-butler!\" Chuck says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Buckner's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Buck Wallace?\" Chuck says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's ex-butler,\" Chuck says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Buck Wallace?\" Chuck says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's ex-butler,\" Chuck says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Buck Wallace. He's pretty funny,\" Chuck says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Riff Byers. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas Buckner's ex-butler!\" Chuck says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
