__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Buck Wallace. He's pretty funny,\" Chuck says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Chuck says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's neighbor, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Chuck says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Living Room right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" he says. \"That's Douglas Buckner's neighbor. He has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"They're in the Living Room, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Chuck says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's neighbor, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"They're in the Living Room, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's neighbor, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Buckner's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"They're in the Living Room, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
