__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Living Room,\" Chuck says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
