__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Ferris McConnell?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas Buckner's bodyguard!\" Chuck says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"I think they're in the Basement?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ferris McConnell?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas Buckner's bodyguard!\" Chuck says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Buckner's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Basement right now, Detective, \"Chuck says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
