__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Sophie Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Chuck says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Smoking Lounge right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's bodyguard. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
