__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Chuck pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Chuck exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Chuck exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
