__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Chuck exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
