__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Douglas Buckner's chauffeur,\" Byers says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Buck Wallace, Detective,\" Byers says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Buck Wallace,\" Byers says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
