__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Douglas Buckner's chauffeur,\" Byers says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Billiard Room,\" Byers says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Byers says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Billiard Room,\" Byers says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Byers says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Pantry is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Billiard Room,\" Byers says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Buckner's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Byers says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Billiard Room at the moment,\" Byers says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
