__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Randy Mack, Byers says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Randy Mack to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Buck Wallace. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Douglas Buckner's college roommate,\" Byers says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Randy Mack, Detective,\" Byers says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Buck Wallace. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Douglas Buckner's college roommate,\" Byers says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Randy Mack to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
