__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, I consider Randy Mack to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Douglas Buckner's butler,\" Byers says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Byers says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Douglas Buckner's butler,\" Byers says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Buckner's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Byers says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Boris Scott. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Douglas Buckner's butler, I believe,\" Byers says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Byers says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Boiler Room.\""));
