__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Byers says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Boiler Room is where you can find them.\""));
