__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Randy Mack?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Douglas Buckner's sibling,\" Byers says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Byers says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Billiard Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Randy Mack?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Douglas Buckner's sibling,\" Byers says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Byers says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Billiard Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Randy Mack?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Douglas Buckner's sibling,\" Byers says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim had an ex-butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Billiard Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Byers says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
