__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know him,\" Ferris replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. He's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. He's probably in the Dining Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
