__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Ferris looks over his shoulder. \"Okay, well, you didn't hear this from me, right dude? But it was Riff Byers. Don't ask me how I know, but like, scout's honor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Riff Byers. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Ferris says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Riff Byers. No question.\""));
