__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Sophie says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Dining Room and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Buck Wallace?\" Sophie says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
