__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Sophie says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Smoking Lounge, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Sophie says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Servants' Quarters and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Sophie says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Smoking Lounge, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Sophie says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Servants' Quarters and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"Riff Byers? I think he's safe,\" Sophie says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Sophie says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Smoking Lounge, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Ed Prince. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Smoking Lounge, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Boris Scott? Stay away from him!\" Sophie says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Sophie says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Billiard Room!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Boris Scott? Stay away from him!\" Sophie says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
