__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Douglas's college roommate,\" she replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
