__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Sophie says. \"He's Douglas's college roommate. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
