__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Boris Scott. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Sophie declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Basement if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Ferris McConnell? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Sophie exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Randy Mack. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Sophie says. \"He's Douglas's butler. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Pfft, Boris Scott is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Sophie says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Randy Mack?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Douglas's butler,\" she replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Sophie says. \"His name's Boris Scott. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Randy Mack?\" you ask.<p>\"Douglas's butler? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Boris Scott?\" Sophie says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
