__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Boris Scott is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Sophie says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Buckner's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Boris Scott?\" Sophie says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Sophie exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Sophie shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Douglas committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Sophie shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Douglas committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Sophie exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Sophie asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Sophie asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Chuck Todd!\" Franklin says. \"That's Douglas's sibling. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Franklin says. \"I think they'd be in the Bathroom at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Douglas's sibling,\" Franklin says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Douglas's sibling, I know him,\" Franklin says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
