__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Franklin says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Bathroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
