__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Franklin says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Billiard Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Dining Room.\""));
