__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Franklin says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Billiard Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Franklin says. \"I think they'd be in the Dining Room at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Ed Prince's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Billiard Room if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Franklin says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Dining Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
