__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Franklin snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Basement, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
