__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Franklin shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, sorry,\" he says. \"No idea. I was blastin' my delts at the time, so I didn't notice anything unusual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Franklin shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Beats me,\" he mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
