__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, I got no use for them,\" Buck says. \"Nothin' but trouble. Probably hangin' around the Pantry, if you've got time to waste.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Buck says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Riff Byers. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Buck says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Riff Byers. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Buck says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Riff Byers*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Buck says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Riff Byers*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Buck says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Riff Byers. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Buck grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Riff Byers. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Chuck Todd,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Servants' Quarters,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Dining Room. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Servants' Quarters,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Chuck Todd,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Boris mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Servants' Quarters, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Chuck Todd,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Servants' Quarters,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Chuck Todd,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Dining Room. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Servants' Quarters, if you want to talk to them,\" Boris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Chuck Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Dining Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Boris mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Servants' Quarters, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Riff Byers. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Boris mutters. \"I don't know how Douglas got stuck with a chauffeur like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"They're in the Dining Room,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Riff Byers?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Douglas's chauffeur,\" Boris replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Boris mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
