__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ed Prince?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Boris mutters. \"I don't know how Douglas got stuck with a butler like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ferris McConnell?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Boiler Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Boris mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ferris McConnell?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Boiler Room. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Dining Room,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ferris McConnell?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Ferris McConnell,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Boris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
