__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Boiler Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Boris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Franklin Delgado. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Franklin Delgado, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Douglas's cousin. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie Elliott,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Franklin Delgado is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Boris says. \"He's Douglas's cousin. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Buckner's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie Elliott,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Franklin Delgado, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Douglas's cousin. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie Elliott,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas's cousin,\" Boris says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie Elliott,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Franklin Delgado, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Douglas's cousin. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Douglas's cousin,\" Boris says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor...\" Boris mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Sophie Elliott. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Neighbor...\" Boris mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Sophie Elliott. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Franklin Delgado is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Boris says. \"He's Douglas's cousin. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Buck Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Douglas's chauffeur,\" Boris replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Servants' Quarters, if you want to talk to them,\" Boris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
