__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Sophie Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Sophie Elliott,\" Mack says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Sophie Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Smoking Lounge,\" Mack sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Mack scowls. \"Douglas really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a bodyguard such as Sophie Elliott.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sophie Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Mack says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Sophie Elliott in my presence, Detective!\" Mack demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
