__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Franklin Delgado?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Douglas's neighbor,\" Mack says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
