__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Buck Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Douglas's butler,\" Mack says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured man. He may even make something of himself one day.\""));
