__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Boris Scott, Detective,\" Mack says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Basement, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Buckner's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Boris Scott. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Basement and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Mack says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Basement?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Mack says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Basement at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Basement.\""));
