__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Mack says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Basement at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Basement and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Buckner's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Mack says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Basement?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Boris Scott?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Boris Scott, Detective,\" Mack says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Basement, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Douglas Buckner's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Mack says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Basement?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Without question, it was Douglas's cousin,\" he replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Without question, it was Douglas's cousin,\" he replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Mack sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Douglas's cousin -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Mack sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Mack sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Mack sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Servants' Quarters and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. \"You must be Savannah Perry, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Mariah Rocha's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Basement, you encounter a young man wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of his pencil. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Glenn Harper, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Kitchen and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. \"You must be Kylie Holder, the victim's chauffeur,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" she mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" she says, rolling her eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Billiard Room, where a dark-haired young woman in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; she doesn't look up as you come in. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Victoria Valenzuela, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Boiler Room, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the dossier, this is Olivia Pace, the victim's best friend.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Mariah Rocha, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Foyer, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Stephen Thomas, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Wine Cellar and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Stevie Fisher, the victim's boss.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. According to the dossier, this is Manny Sharp, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "The only person in the Sunroom is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Emily Shaffer, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her chauffeur,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Kitchen,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her chauffeur,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Perry sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Perry sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Kitchen at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Glenn Harper?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Mariah's chauffeur? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Kitchen at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>Perry snorts derisively. \"Mariah's chauffeur is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Kitchen,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Glenn Harper?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Mariah's chauffeur? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Kitchen at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her chauffeur,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Perry sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her chauffeur,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>\"Kylie Holder?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Mariah's personal assistant? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Perry scowls. \"Mariah really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a chauffeur such as Stephen Thomas.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her personal assistant,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Stephen Thomas in my presence, Detective!\" Perry demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>Perry snorts derisively. \"Mariah's personal assistant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Stephen Thomas,\" Perry says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>Perry snorts derisively. \"Mariah's personal assistant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Rocha's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Perry scowls. \"Mariah really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a chauffeur such as Stephen Thomas.\""));
