__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Perry scowls. \"Mariah really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a chauffeur such as Stephen Thomas.\""));
