__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Perry sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her boss,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>Perry snorts derisively. \"Mariah's boss is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Rocha's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Boiler Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Emily Shaffer?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Mariah's boss? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Rocha's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Perry sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Mariah refers to as her boss,\" Perry says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Boiler Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Perry sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Perry smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Glenn Harper?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Glenn Harper. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Perry smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Glenn Harper?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Glenn Harper. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Glenn Harper. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Glenn Harper. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Perry sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Glenn Harper? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Perry sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Glenn Harper? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Servants' Quarters, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Rocha's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Manny Sharp? Bah,\" Glenn says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Glenn says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Servants' Quarters, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Glenn sniffs. \"His name is Manny Sharp, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Glenn says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Servants' Quarters, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Glenn snorts. \"You're referring to Manny Sharp. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Glenn says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Servants' Quarters, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Glenn sniffs. \"His name is Manny Sharp, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Glenn snorts. \"You're referring to Manny Sharp. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
