__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Glenn sniffs. \"His name is Manny Sharp, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Kylie Holder is my biggest fan!\" Glenn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the chauffeur,\" Glenn muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Glenn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Kitchen -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Glenn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Kylie Holder. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Glenn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Kitchen -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Rocha's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Glenn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Kylie Holder. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Glenn says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the chauffeur,\" Glenn muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Glenn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Kitchen -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Glenn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Kylie Holder. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Kylie Holder is my biggest fan!\" Glenn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Kylie Holder?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Glenn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Kitchen -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Glenn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Mariah's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Glenn scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Wine Cellar,\" Glenn says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Glenn says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Wine Cellar,\" Glenn says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Glenn says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Glenn snorts. \"Their presence in the Wine Cellar is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Glenn asks. \"Oh -- you mean Mariah's boss. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
