__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Wine Cellar,\" Glenn says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
