__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Glenn snorts. \"You're referring to Victoria Valenzuela. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Glenn says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Foyer, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Glenn sniffs. \"Her name is Victoria Valenzuela, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Glenn says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Foyer, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
