__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Mariah's lawyer. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Glenn says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Savannah Perry and I get along rather well,\" Glenn says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Mariah's lawyer. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Glenn says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Savannah Perry and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Glenn says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Glenn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Mariah's lawyer, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Savannah Perry?\" Glenn asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Mariah's lawyer. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Glenn says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Savannah Perry?\" Glenn asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"Mariah's lawyer and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
