__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Mariah's child, and an absolute philistine,\" Glenn scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Emily Shaffer? Bah,\" Glenn says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Glenn asks. \"Oh -- you mean Mariah's child. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
