__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Glenn says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The child. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
