__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Glenn grumbles, \"it was Mariah's chauffeur. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Glenn says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" he sniffs. \"It was her chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Mariah Rocha's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was her chauffeur,\" he grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Mariah Rocha's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was her chauffeur,\" he grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Glenn says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" he sniffs. \"It was her chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Glenn grumbles, \"it was Mariah's chauffeur. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>Kylie scowls. \"What, now you're after Savannah Perry? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Servants' Quarters, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Manny Sharp. he's all right. Can't tell you much about him, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Savannah Perry? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Servants' Quarters? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Mariah's child? He's called Manny Sharp. He seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Savannah Perry? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Servants' Quarters? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him, that's Manny Sharp. He's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Savannah Perry is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Servants' Quarters and ask she yourself.\""));
