__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Emily Shaffer is a total downer,\" she replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Mariah's lawyer? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" she replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Sunroom and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
