__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Mariah's child? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Stephen says. \"Her name's Savannah Perry. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
