__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Stephen declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Basement if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Stephen says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Glenn Harper, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Glenn Harper. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Stephen says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Basement!\""));
