__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Stephen says. \"She's Mariah's best friend. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
