__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Stephen says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Foyer, check them out for yourself.\""));
