__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Stephen says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Foyer, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"Stevie Fisher? I think he's safe,\" Stephen says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Stevie Fisher is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Stephen says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Stevie Fisher?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Stephen says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Wine Cellar and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Stephen says. \"His name's Stevie Fisher. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Stevie Fisher. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Stephen says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Wine Cellar, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
