__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Stephen declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Guest Bedroom if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Mariah never even had a neighbor! Go to the Guest Bedroom and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Stephen says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Guest Bedroom!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Stephen says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Guest Bedroom isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
