__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Stephen exclaims. \"They'rein the Foyer, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Foyer, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
