__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Stephen says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then he looks around and whispers, \"It was Stevie Fisher!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Stephen looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. He writes the name \"Stevie Fisher\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in his mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Stephen says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then he looks around and whispers, \"It was Stevie Fisher!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" he says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Stevie Fisher!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Stephen says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then he looks around and whispers, \"It was Stevie Fisher!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Stephen looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. He writes the name \"Stevie Fisher\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in his mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Stephen looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. He writes the name \"Stevie Fisher\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in his mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Savannah Perry,\" Stevie says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Servants' Quarters, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Kylie Holder,\" Stevie says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Savannah Perry!\" Stevie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Kylie Holder,\" Stevie says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Stevie says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Stevie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Kylie Holder? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Mariah's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Savannah Perry. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Savannah Perry!\" Stevie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Kylie Holder, isn't it?\" Stevie asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Savannah Perry!\" Stevie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Kylie Holder, isn't it?\" Stevie asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Savannah Perry,\" Stevie says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Servants' Quarters, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Kylie Holder,\" Stevie says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Kylie Holder,\" Stevie says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Savannah Perry. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Savannah Perry,\" Stevie says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Servants' Quarters, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Kylie Holder, isn't it?\" Stevie asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Savannah Perry. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Stevie says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Stevie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Kylie Holder? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Mariah's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Glenn Harper is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Stevie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Kylie Holder, Detective?\" Stevie asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Glenn Harper is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Stevie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Stevie says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Kylie Holder, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Glenn Harper. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Stevie says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Basement, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Kylie Holder, Detective?\" Stevie asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Stevie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Basement is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Stevie says. \"Calls herself 'Kylie Holder', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Kylie Holder' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Glenn Harper is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Stevie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
