__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Stevie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Basement and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Victoria Valenzuela. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Stevie says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Basement? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Stevie says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Basement, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Victoria Valenzuela. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Victoria Valenzuela's a positive delight!\" Stevie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Stevie says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Basement? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Victoria Valenzuela. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Stevie says. \"Did you know she's Mariah's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know Rocha's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Stevie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Basement and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
