__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Victoria Valenzuela?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Victoria Valenzuela's a positive delight!\" Stevie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Stevie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Basement and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Stevie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Boiler Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Stevie says as sternly as he can muster, \"Mariah's best friend is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Kitchen. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"Olivia Pace is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Stevie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Boiler Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
