__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Stevie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Basement and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Stephen Thomas. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Stephen Thomas's a positive delight!\" Stevie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Stevie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Basement and ask for yourself.\""));
