__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Stephen Thomas. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Stevie says. \"Did you know he's Mariah's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
