__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Stevie says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Kylie Holder, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
