__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Emily Shaffer's a positive delight!\" Stevie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Stephen Thomas, isn't it?\" Stevie asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Stephen Thomas,\" Stevie says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's chauffeur, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
