__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Emily Shaffer. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's chauffeur, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer, lawyer. Hmm,\" Stevie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Stephen Thomas? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Mariah's lawyer. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Emily Shaffer. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Stevie says. \"Did you know she's Mariah's chauffeur? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Lawyer, lawyer. Hmm,\" Stevie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Stephen Thomas? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Mariah's lawyer. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Emily Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Stevie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Mariah's chauffeur, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Stevie says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Mariah's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Mariah?\" Stevie asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Newton Holloway?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Mariah?\" Stevie asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Saul Young?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Stevie says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Mariah's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Stevie says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Mariah's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Mariah?\" Stevie asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Clive Davis?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Mariah?\" Stevie asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Arthur Fernandez?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Stevie looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>Manny rolls his eyes. \"Pfft. Yeah, I know Savannah Perry. That's Mariah's lawyer. I trust that woman about as far as I can throw her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Rocha's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Sheesh,\" Manny grumbles. \"Yeah, I know Olivia Pace. Know her like a kick in the teeth. Got about as much need for her, too.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Mariah's lawyer,\" he replies. \"Don't care much for her. She's a crook, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"Her name's Olivia Pace. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Savannah Perry. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Mariah's lawyer?\" Manny asks. \"I know <i>of</i> her, but that's about it. We ain't what you'd call 'chummy'.\""));
