__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Harper?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Manny says. \"Ever since he first became Mariah's boss. Practically inseparable, him and me.\""));
