__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now,\" Manny says, \"I wouldn't wanna be tellin' tales outta school, Detective. I haven't got any evidence for this, y'unnerstand. But if ya ask me -- which you did -- I'd say it was Mariah's cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now,\" Manny says, \"I wouldn't wanna be tellin' tales outta school, Detective. I haven't got any evidence for this, y'unnerstand. But if ya ask me -- which you did -- I'd say it was Mariah's cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well Detective, you know what they always say,\" he says with a twinkle in his eye. \"The cousin did it!\"<p>\"...Is that what they always say?\"<p>\"Something like that, yeah. Pretty sure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well Detective, you know what they always say,\" he says with a twinkle in his eye. \"The cousin did it!\"<p>\"...Is that what they always say?\"<p>\"Something like that, yeah. Pretty sure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Manny says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Mariah's cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Manny says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Mariah's cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Mariah Rocha's child,\" Shaffer says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Savannah Perry to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Savannah Perry?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Mariah Rocha's child,\" Shaffer says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Savannah Perry, Shaffer says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
