__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Boiler Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Mariah Rocha's best friend,\" Shaffer says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Shaffer says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Boiler Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Mariah Rocha's best friend,\" Shaffer says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Olivia Pace. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Mariah Rocha's best friend,\" Shaffer says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Shaffer says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Boiler Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Mariah Rocha's best friend,\" Shaffer says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Shaffer says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Boiler Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Shaffer says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Boiler Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Mariah Rocha's best friend,\" Shaffer says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Shaffer says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Boiler Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Olivia Pace?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Mariah Rocha's best friend,\" Shaffer says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Foyer,\" Shaffer says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Mariah Rocha's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Shaffer says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Foyer,\" Shaffer says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Foyer,\" Shaffer says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Foyer is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Stephen Thomas?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Foyer at the moment,\" Shaffer says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
