__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Manny Sharp. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Guest Bedroom,\" Shaffer says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Manny Sharp?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Guest Bedroom,\" Shaffer says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Shaffer says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Shaffer says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Mariah Rocha has true relevance, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Mariah Rocha has true relevance, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Shaffer says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Mariah Rocha has true relevance, Detective,\" Shaffer says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Shaffer says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Smoking Lounge. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. According to the dossier, this is Bert Harding, the victim's butler.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Bert Harding. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Basement, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. \"You must be Grace Heath, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Grace grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Lounge, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young woman wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out her \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. Your dossier identifies her as Grace Kaufman, the victim's ex-chauffeur.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Grace. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Hall Closet, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Madelyn Merrill, the victim's lover.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Laundry Room you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Your dossier identifies him as Archie Grimes, the victim's accountant.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Library and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Mariah Hays, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Billiard Room and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Elizabeth Garner, the victim's chauffeur,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Elizabeth sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Guest Bedroom, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. \"You must be Avery Rosa, the victim's personal assistant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" she mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" she says, rolling her eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Wine Cellar, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. \"You must be Ariana Benjamin, the victim's dental hygienist,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Grace Heath. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her,\" Bert says. \"Don't care much for her, though. She's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
