__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Bert says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Bert says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Edgar like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Bert says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Edgar like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Bert says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Edgar like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Bert says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Edgar like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Bert says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Edgar like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Bert says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Bert says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Bert Harding!\" Grace says. \"That's Edgar's lover. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Edgar's butler? Oh, you mean Avery Rosa,\" Grace says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Bert Harding!\" Grace says. \"That's Edgar's lover. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Avery Rosa. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Edgar's lover,\" Grace says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, that's Avery Rosa,\" Grace says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Edgar's lover,\" Grace says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
