__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Edgar's lover, I know him,\" Grace says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
