__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Grace says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Lounge, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's ex-chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Avery Rosa. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Grace Kaufman's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Lounge if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Avery Rosa,\" Grace says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
