__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Grace snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Guest Bedroom, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Grace says. \"Grace Kaufman, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
