__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Grace snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Wine Cellar, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
