__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Bert Harding. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Smoking Lounge at the moment,\" Grimes says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Elizabeth Garner,\" Grimes says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
