__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Edgar Hendricks's college roommate,\" Grimes says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Basement, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Edgar Hendricks's college roommate,\" Grimes says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
