__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Edgar Hendricks's personal assistant, I believe,\" Grimes says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Elizabeth Garner, I presume,\" Grimes says. \"She is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
