__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
