__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Grimes says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Hall Closet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Elizabeth Garner, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Elizabeth Garner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Grimes asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Elizabeth Garner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Elizabeth Garner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Elizabeth Garner, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Grimes asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Elizabeth Garner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Elizabeth Garner, Detective,\" Grimes says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Bert Harding?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Edgar's accountant? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Hays scowls. \"Edgar really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a butler such as Avery Rosa.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Bert Harding?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Edgar's accountant? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Avery Rosa,\" Hays says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Bert Harding?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Edgar's accountant? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Hays scowls. \"Edgar really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a butler such as Avery Rosa.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>Hays snorts derisively. \"Edgar's accountant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Edgar refers to as his accountant,\" Hays says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Avery Rosa in my presence, Detective!\" Hays demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Bert Harding. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>Hays snorts derisively. \"Edgar's accountant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Avery Rosa,\" Hays says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
