__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Avery Rosa in my presence, Detective!\" Hays demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Edgar refers to as his accountant,\" Hays says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Hays scowls. \"Edgar really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a butler such as Avery Rosa.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Hays scowls. \"Edgar really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a butler such as Avery Rosa.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Basement,\" Hays sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Wine Cellar,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Hendricks's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Grace Heath. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Hays says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Basement.\""));
