__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Edgar's lover,\" Hays says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with her with any frequency.\""));
