__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him, yes,\" she says. \"Bert Harding. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Hays says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Mariah Hays and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Elizabeth says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Bert Harding. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mariah Hays and I get along rather well,\" Elizabeth says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Bert Harding. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Elizabeth smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Smoking Lounge -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Hendricks's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mariah Hays and I get along rather well,\" Elizabeth says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Bert Harding is my biggest fan!\" Elizabeth says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Mariah Hays?\" Elizabeth asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Bert Harding is my biggest fan!\" Elizabeth says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
