__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Elizabeth smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Basement -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Elizabeth says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Grace Heath is my biggest fan!\" Elizabeth says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the college roommate,\" Elizabeth muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Library, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
