__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Edgar's dental hygienist and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim had an ex-chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the ex-chauffeur,\" Elizabeth muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Edgar's dental hygienist and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Edgar's dental hygienist and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
