__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Elizabeth says. \"We get along quite well. She's Edgar's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim had an ex-chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
