__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Elizabeth says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Avery Rosa? Bah,\" Elizabeth says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Hall Closet, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Elizabeth snorts. \"You're referring to Avery Rosa. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Hall Closet, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Elizabeth snorts. \"You're referring to Avery Rosa. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Elizabeth says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know Hendricks's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Elizabeth snorts. \"You're referring to Avery Rosa. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Elizabeth says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Elizabeth sniffs. \"Her name is Avery Rosa, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
