__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Archie Grimes?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Elizabeth says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Laundry Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
