__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Elizabeth says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The ex-chauffeur. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Elizabeth snorts. \"Their presence in the Smoking Lounge is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Elizabeth asks. \"Oh -- you mean Edgar's ex-chauffeur. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
