__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Smoking Lounge,\" Elizabeth says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Edgar's ex-chauffeur, and an absolute philistine,\" Elizabeth scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Elizabeth snorts. \"Their presence in the Smoking Lounge is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
