__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Edgar's ex-chauffeur, and an absolute philistine,\" Elizabeth scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Avery Rosa. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Avery Rosa. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Elizabeth smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Guest Bedroom -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Elizabeth says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Avery Rosa is my biggest fan!\" Elizabeth says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the personal assistant,\" Elizabeth muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Laundry Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Avery Rosa is my biggest fan!\" Elizabeth says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
