__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Elizabeth smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Guest Bedroom -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Elizabeth says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Archie Grimes and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Elizabeth says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Archie Grimes and I get along rather well,\" Elizabeth says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Elizabeth says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
