__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Elizabeth smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Wine Cellar -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Hendricks's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Archie Grimes?\" Elizabeth asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
