__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Elizabeth smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Wine Cellar -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Archie Grimes?\" Elizabeth asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Benjamin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Ariana Benjamin is my biggest fan!\" Elizabeth says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Hendricks's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Archie Grimes and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Elizabeth says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Archie Grimes?\" Elizabeth asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Elizabeth says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Archie Grimes,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Elizabeth says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Archie Grimes'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Elizabeth says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Archie Grimes,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Elizabeth says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Archie Grimes'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Elizabeth muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Archie Grimes.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Elizabeth says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Archie Grimes,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Elizabeth says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Archie Grimes,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Elizabeth muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Archie Grimes.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Bert Harding? I can't stand the sight of that slimy worm. I think he's in the Smoking Lounge? Go see for yourself what a piece of crap he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler? Butler...\" Avery lights a cigarette and thinks for a moment. \"...Oh! You mean Bert Harding. Yeah, I don't give a crap about that man.\""));
