__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Bert Harding. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Bert Harding. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Avery says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Avery says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Bert Harding. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Bert Harding. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Bert Harding. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Avery says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Bert Harding. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Avery says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Bert Harding. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Bert Harding. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Avery says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Edgar's butler,\" Ariana replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"The only butler I'm aware of around here is Bert Harding, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Ariana mutters. \"I don't know how Edgar got stuck with a butler like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a dental hygienist like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Bert Harding,\" Ariana says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only butler I'm aware of around here is Bert Harding, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bert Harding?\" you ask.<p>Ariana shudders. \"He's Edgar's butler. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Bert Harding. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
