__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Grace Heath,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Ariana says. \"Everyone loves Grace Heath.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Grace Heath, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Edgar's college roommate. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Grace Heath, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Edgar's college roommate. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate...\" Ariana mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Grace Heath. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Grace Heath?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Edgar's college roommate,\" Ariana says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate...\" Ariana mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Grace Heath. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Grace Heath,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate...\" Ariana mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Grace Heath. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Lounge. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Grace Kaufman,\" Ariana says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Lounge. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"The only ex-chauffeur I'm aware of around here is Grace Kaufman, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
