__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Lounge. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
