__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Grace Kaufman?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Grace Kaufman,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Lounge.\""));
