__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Madelyn Merrill?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Hall Closet. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Hall Closet,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
