__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Archie Grimes. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Laundry Room,\" Ariana says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Ariana says. \"Everyone loves Archie Grimes.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Archie Grimes. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Laundry Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Edgar Hendricks's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Accountant...\" Ariana mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Archie Grimes. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
