__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Edgar's best friend,\" Ariana says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Hendricks's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Ariana says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mariah Hays?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Mariah Hays is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Ariana says. \"She's Edgar's best friend. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Edgar's best friend?\" Ariana says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Library.\""));
