__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Elizabeth Garner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Billiard Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They're in the Billiard Room,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Elizabeth Garner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Elizabeth Garner,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Hendricks's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Ariana mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Billiard Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Billiard Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Ariana says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Elizabeth Garner. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Elizabeth Garner,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Billiard Room,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Elizabeth Garner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Billiard Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Guest Bedroom. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Avery Rosa,\" Ariana says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Guest Bedroom. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Avery Rosa,\" Ariana says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Guest Bedroom. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only personal assistant I'm aware of around here is Avery Rosa, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Guest Bedroom. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Avery Rosa. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Avery Rosa,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"The only personal assistant I'm aware of around here is Avery Rosa, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Avery Rosa,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Avery Rosa,\" Ariana says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Avery Rosa,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Avery Rosa?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Guest Bedroom. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Avery Rosa. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Edgar, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Edgar Hendricks? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Edgar, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Edgar Hendricks? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Edgar, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Edgar, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you enter the Guest Bedroom, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Your dossier identifies her as Natalie Lewis, the victim's sibling.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Game Room, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Clancy Odom, the victim's child.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Breakfast Nook, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. According to the dossier, this is Peyton Rush, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Study, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Audrey Carter, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Emil Sullivan's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Bar, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Mick Hopper, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Billiard Room and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. Your dossier identifies her as Samantha Barrera, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "The only person in the Bathroom is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Hailey Ingram, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Pantry, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. \"You must be Joey Atkins, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Living Room and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Martin Fox, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Martin Fox. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Natalie says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Emil's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Clancy Odom,\" Natalie says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Clancy Odom's a positive delight!\" Natalie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Clancy Odom, isn't it?\" Natalie asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Clancy Odom's a positive delight!\" Natalie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Clancy Odom's a positive delight!\" Natalie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Natalie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Clancy Odom? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Emil's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Natalie says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Emil's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Natalie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Clancy Odom? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Emil's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Clancy Odom. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Natalie says. \"Did you know he's Emil's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Clancy Odom, isn't it?\" Natalie asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Clancy Odom. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Clancy Odom's a positive delight!\" Natalie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
