__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Clancy Odom's a positive delight!\" Natalie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Natalie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Clancy Odom? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Emil's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Natalie says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Emil's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Natalie ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Clancy Odom? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Emil's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Emil's personal assistant?\" Natalie says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Breakfast Nook with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Natalie declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Natalie says as sternly as she can muster, \"Emil's personal assistant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Breakfast Nook. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Natalie muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Emil's personal assistant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Breakfast Nook with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Natalie declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Natalie says. \"She's Emil's personal assistant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Breakfast Nook with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Natalie declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Breakfast Nook, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Breakfast Nook, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Natalie muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Emil's personal assistant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Breakfast Nook with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Natalie declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Natalie muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Emil's personal assistant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Breakfast Nook with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Natalie declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Emil's personal assistant?\" Natalie says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sullivan's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Breakfast Nook, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Study, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sullivan's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Natalie says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Study? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Carter!\" Natalie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Natalie says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Study? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Carter!\" Natalie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Natalie says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Study, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Carter!\" Natalie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Carter!\" Natalie says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Natalie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Study and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Audrey Carter,\" Natalie says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Study, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Natalie says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Study? Is that the one?\""));
