__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Natalie says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Study, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Natalie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Study and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bar, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"Calls himself 'Mick Hopper', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Mick Hopper' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Mick Hopper is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Natalie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Bar, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"Calls himself 'Mick Hopper', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Mick Hopper' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Bar is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"Calls himself 'Mick Hopper', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Mick Hopper' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Bar is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Natalie says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Mick Hopper, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Bar is nothing like a good friend!\""));
