__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Natalie says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Mick Hopper, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Bar is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Mick Hopper, Detective?\" Natalie asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Bar, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mick Hopper, Detective?\" Natalie asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
