__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"Calls himself 'Mick Hopper', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Mick Hopper' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Natalie says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Emil's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Natalie says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Billiard Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Samantha Barrera's a positive delight!\" Natalie says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
