__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Samantha Barrera. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Natalie says. \"Did you know she's Emil's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
