__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Natalie says as sternly as she can muster, \"Emil's cousin is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Pantry. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Emil's cousin?\" Natalie says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Pantry with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Natalie declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Natalie says. \"He's Emil's cousin, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Pantry, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Natalie muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Emil's cousin? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
