__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Natalie says as sternly as she can muster, \"Emil's cousin is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Pantry. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Living Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Natalie says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Martin Fox, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Martin Fox is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Natalie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Living Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Martin Fox, Detective?\" Natalie asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Natalie says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Living Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"Calls himself 'Martin Fox', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Martin Fox' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Martin Fox is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Natalie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Living Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
