__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Martin Fox is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Natalie says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Living Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Emil's college roommate, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Natalie says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Emil Sullivan?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the college roommate, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Natalie says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Emil's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the college roommate.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Emil's college roommate, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Emil's college roommate, Detective,\" Natalie says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Natalie says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Emil Sullivan?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the college roommate, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Natalie says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Emil Sullivan?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the college roommate, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Natalie Lewis. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Clancy nods slightly. \"Emil's golf caddy\".<p>\"Is there anything else you can tell me?\"<p>Silence."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Know her a little. Her name's Peyton Rush. She doesn't get on my nerves like some people.\"<p>\"Like who?\"<p>He looks up at you, then looks back at his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>Clancy shrugs. \"Emil's golf caddy. We get along.\"<p>\"Is that all?\"<p>\"That's all.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sullivan's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Her name's Peyton Rush.\"<p>\"...Anything else? Anything at all?\"<p>Shrug."));
