__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Emil's housekeeper,\" she replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Living Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Emil's housekeeper,\" she replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Peyton says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Breakfast Nook, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Audrey Carter. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Emil's housekeeper? Well, I don't trust her,\" she says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
