__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Peyton exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Peyton exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Peyton exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Peyton shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Emil committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who did it?\" Peyton asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Peyton asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it?\" Peyton asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Peyton shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Emil committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Guest Bedroom,\" Carter sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Carter sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Carter sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Guest Bedroom,\" Carter sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Pantry,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Carter says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Carter sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Pantry.\""));
