__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
