__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Clancy Odom, Detective,\" Carter says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Game Room, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Carter says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Bar?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Carter says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Game Room at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Carter says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Bar?\""));
