__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Carter says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Bar?\""));
