__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Emil's accountant,\" Carter says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Carter says. \"His name is Martin Fox. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Emil's accountant,\" Carter says. \"A perfectly charming woman, despite her upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him, yes,\" she says. \"Martin Fox. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
