__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Carter sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Martin Fox? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Carter sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Martin Fox? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Carter smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Martin Fox?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Carter smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Martin Fox?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Martin Fox. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
