__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Hailey Ingram. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Mick says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Mick says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Hailey Ingram. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Hailey Ingram. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Mick says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Hailey Ingram. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Mick says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Hailey Ingram. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Mick says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Hailey Ingram. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Emil's cousin. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Samantha says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Samantha says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Emil's cousin and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the sibling,\" Samantha muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Game Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Samantha says. \"We get along quite well. She's Emil's cousin, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Game Room at the moment.\""));
