__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Clancy Odom. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Emil's sibling, and an absolute philistine,\" Samantha scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Pantry,\" Samantha says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Pantry,\" Samantha says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Samantha says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The sibling. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Samantha snorts. \"Their presence in the Pantry is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
