__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Emil's personal assistant. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Samantha says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Joey Atkins and I get along rather well,\" Samantha says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Emil's personal assistant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Joey Atkins and I get along rather well,\" Samantha says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Samantha says. \"We get along quite well. He's Emil's personal assistant, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Joey Atkins and I get along rather well,\" Samantha says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
