__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Joey Atkins is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes, Natalie Lewis and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Samantha says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Joey Atkins is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Natalie Lewis?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Joey Atkins is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Natalie Lewis?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Samantha smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Pantry -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Natalie Lewis?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Samantha says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Pantry.\""));
