__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Martin Fox. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Samantha smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Living Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Pantry at the moment.\""));
