__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Pantry at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Samantha smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Living Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the accountant,\" Samantha muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Pantry, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Martin Fox is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the accountant,\" Samantha muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Pantry, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Martin Fox is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the accountant,\" Samantha muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Pantry, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Samantha says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Pantry at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Martin Fox is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Samantha says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Emil?\" Samantha asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Samantha says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Samantha says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Samantha says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Samantha says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Samantha says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Emil?\" Samantha asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Emil Sullivan's sibling,\" Ingram says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Natalie Lewis, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Emil Sullivan's sibling,\" Ingram says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Natalie Lewis, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Emil Sullivan's sibling,\" Ingram says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Natalie Lewis, Ingram says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Emil Sullivan's sibling,\" Ingram says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Sullivan's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Natalie Lewis to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
