__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Emil Sullivan's personal assistant, I believe,\" Ingram says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Emil Sullivan's personal assistant,\" Ingram says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Emil Sullivan's personal assistant,\" Ingram says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
