__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Peyton Rush?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Emil Sullivan's personal assistant,\" Ingram says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Sullivan's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Breakfast Nook is where you can find them.\""));
