__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know Audrey Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Study,\" Ingram says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
