__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Ingram says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Bar, I believe.\""));
