__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Bar, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
