__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Emil Sullivan's golf caddy,\" Ingram says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Ingram says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Bar, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Emil Sullivan's golf caddy,\" Ingram says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Emil Sullivan's neighbor,\" Ingram says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Samantha Barrera. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Emil Sullivan's neighbor, I believe,\" Ingram says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Billiard Room is where you can find them.\""));
