__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Joey Atkins?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Emil Sullivan's cousin,\" Ingram says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
