__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Emil Sullivan has true relevance, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Emil Sullivan has true relevance, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Ingram says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Ingram says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Joey says. \"She's in the Guest Bedroom. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh sure, that's Natalie Lewis. She's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think she did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Guest Bedroom right now,\" Joey says, \"but I don't think she did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Natalie Lewis?\" Joey says. \"I'd be real surprised if she did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
