__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Natalie Lewis. She's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think she did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Natalie Lewis. She's pretty funny,\" Joey says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Sullivan's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Natalie Lewis. She's pretty funny,\" Joey says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Natalie Lewis's great fun!\" Joey says. \"She's in the Guest Bedroom right now. She'll probably share her chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Natalie Lewis?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Guest Bedroom right now,\" Joey says, \"but I don't think she did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
