__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Clancy Odom. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" he says. \"That's Emil Sullivan's child. He has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Sullivan's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's child, Detective,\" Joey says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Odom?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Joey says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's child, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Sullivan's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Joey nods. \"That's Clancy Odom. He's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
