__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Joey says. \"I think they're in the Living Room?\""));
