__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Living Room right now, Detective, \"Joey says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Living Room, if I know who you mean, Detective,\" Joey says. \"We've never really talked or anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Martin Fox?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Martin Fox!\" Joey says. \"He's the victim's accountant. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Joey says. \"I think they're in the Living Room?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Golly!\" Joey exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's college roommate, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Joey exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's college roommate, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Joey says, excitedly pulling out his notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's college roommate! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the college roommate, Detective!\" Joey says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the college roommate, Detective!\" Joey says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
