__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the college roommate, Detective!\" Joey says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Joey exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's college roommate, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
