__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mick Hopper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Emil's housekeeper?\" Martin asks. \"I know <i>of</i> him, but that's about it. We ain't what you'd call 'chummy'.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Martin muses. \"I think I know who you mean, Detective, but I dunno them real well. I think they're in the Breakfast Nook, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Emil Sullivan's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Martin says. \"Try the Breakfast Nook, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
