__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh, yeah, I know Samantha Barrera,\" Martin says. \"She's in the Billiard Room. If she says anything about me, though, it's a total lie.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Sullivan's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Emil's neighbor... Oh. You mean Peyton Rush,\" Martin says, shaking his head. \"Yeah, no. I don't need the stress, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- she's not really my cup of tea. She's in the Billiard Room, though, if you wanna meet her yourself.\""));
