__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Samantha Barrera?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- she's not really my cup of tea. She's in the Billiard Room, though, if you wanna meet her yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"Her name's Peyton Rush. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
