__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Hailey Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Hailey Ingram's great, just great,\" Martin says. \"Go check out the Bathroom, that's where she is. See for yourself how great she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Sullivan's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Clancy Odom,\" he says. \"Me and him, we go way back. Waaay back. Can't say enough good things about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Hailey Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, me and Hailey Ingram, we get along great!\" Martin says. \"Two peas in a pod, that's us. She'll be in the Bathroom, tell her I sent ya.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Clancy Odom?\" Martin asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Clancy Odom.\""));
