__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper... Housekeeper...\" Martin mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Clancy Odom! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Emil's housekeeper!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Joey Atkins. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him,\" Martin says. \"Don't care much for him, though. He's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"Her name's Natalie Lewis. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
