__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Martin says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Emil like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Martin says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Emil like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Hall Closet, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Ella Guerra, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Attic and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. According to the dossier, this is Kenny Patel, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" he  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>He glares at you for a second, then rolls his eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Wine Cellar you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Red Simpson, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Kelly Newman,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Billiard Room, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Abe Gay, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Game Room, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. Your dossier identifies him as Duncan Holloway, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Study you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Aaliyah Palmer, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Aaliyah sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Family Room, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Alyssa Justice, the victim's gardener.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Servants' Quarters. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Destiny Eaton, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Good, good,\" she says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Bathroom, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Red Schwartz, the victim's boss.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Kelly Newman's housekeeper!\" Ella says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Billiard Room, if I know who you mean, Detective,\" Ella says. \"We've never really talked or anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's housekeeper,\" Ella says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Ella says. \"I think they're in the Billiard Room?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's housekeeper,\" Ella says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
