__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's housekeeper,\" Ella says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They're in the Billiard Room, if I know who you mean, Detective,\" Ella says. \"We've never really talked or anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Kenny Patel!\" Ella says. \"He's the victim's housekeeper. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Billiard Room right now, Detective, \"Ella says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
