__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Red Simpson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Wine Cellar -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ella says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Bathroom,\" Ella says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Wine Cellar -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ella says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Ella says. \"They're in the Bathroom, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Wine Cellar -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ella says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Ella says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Bathroom right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Red Simpson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Ella says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Wine Cellar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
