__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Alyssa Justice?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" she says. \"That's Kelly Newman's golf caddy. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Ella says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Billiard Room right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Alyssa Justice?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Ella says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about her! She's the victim's golf caddy, and she has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
