__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's in the Servants' Quarters -- you should check her out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ella says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on her a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's the victim's college roommate, Detective,\" Ella says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Ella says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Servants' Quarters right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Ella nods. \"That's Kenny Patel. He's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
