__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly! You really want to know what I think, Detective?\" Ella says, excitedly, and pulls out a notebook. \"Okay, so, first I measured some footprints out in the driveway, and...\" <p>\"Kid, we're short on time. Cut to the chase and tell me the details later, okay?\"<p>\"Oh, okay! It was Red Schwartz!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly! You really want to know what I think, Detective?\" Ella says, excitedly, and pulls out a notebook. \"Okay, so, first I measured some footprints out in the driveway, and...\" <p>\"Kid, we're short on time. Cut to the chase and tell me the details later, okay?\"<p>\"Oh, okay! It was Red Schwartz!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It's just gotta be Red Schwartz, Detective,\" Ella says excitedly. \"Means, motive, and opportunity -- just like the Junior Detective's Handbook says!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh boy!\" Ella says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Red Schwartz for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
