__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh boy!\" Ella says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Red Schwartz for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
