__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Kelly's child,\" Patel says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" he says. \"Alyssa Justice. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Ella Guerra. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Kelly's child,\" Patel says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Kelly's child,\" Patel says. \"A perfectly charming woman, despite her upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" he says. \"Alyssa Justice. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Kelly's child,\" Patel says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with her with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Newman's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Alyssa Justice? Why yes,\" he replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
