__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>Patel snorts derisively. \"Kelly's gardener is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Alyssa Justice,\" Patel says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"Red Simpson?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Kelly's gardener? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Alyssa Justice in my presence, Detective!\" Patel demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Kelly refers to as his gardener,\" Patel says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Patel scowls. \"Kelly really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a golf caddy such as Alyssa Justice.\""));
