__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Abe Gay?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Billiard Room,\" Patel sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Ella Guerra,\" Patel says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Abe Gay?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Billiard Room.\""));
