__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Abe Gay?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Patel says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Billiard Room.\""));
