__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Abe Gay?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Ella Guerra,\" Patel says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Abe Gay. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Patel scowls. \"Kelly really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a housekeeper such as Ella Guerra.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Patel scowls. \"Kelly really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a housekeeper such as Ella Guerra.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Abe Gay?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Patel says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Ella Guerra in my presence, Detective!\" Patel demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Ella Guerra in my presence, Detective!\" Patel demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Newman's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Patel scowls. \"Kelly really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a housekeeper such as Ella Guerra.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Duncan Holloway. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Duncan Holloway?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Kelly's boss? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Billiard Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Duncan Holloway?\" you ask.<p>Patel snorts derisively. \"Kelly's boss is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Billiard Room at the moment.\""));
