__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Aaliyah Palmer?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Patel says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Study at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ella Guerra? Why yes,\" he replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
