__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Aaliyah Palmer?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Aaliyah Palmer, Detective,\" Patel says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Study, if you require more information than that.\""));
