__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Patel says. \"Her name is Ella Guerra. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
