__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Kelly's sibling?\" Red says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Game Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Red declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Red muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Kelly's sibling? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
