__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know Duncan Holloway?\" you ask.<p>\"Duncan Holloway is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Red says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Game Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Servants' Quarters, Detective,\" Red says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Duncan Holloway?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Red says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Game Room, go see for yourself!\""));
