__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Aaliyah Palmer. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Aaliyah Palmer. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Red says. \"Did you know she's Kelly's gardener? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Kenny Patel, isn't it?\" Red asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Aaliyah Palmer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Aaliyah Palmer's a positive delight!\" Red says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Kenny Patel,\" Red says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Aaliyah Palmer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Aaliyah Palmer. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Red says. \"Did you know she's Kelly's gardener? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Red ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Kenny Patel? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Kelly's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Aaliyah Palmer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Aaliyah Palmer's a positive delight!\" Red says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Child, child. Hmm,\" Red ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Kenny Patel? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Kelly's child. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Aaliyah Palmer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Aaliyah Palmer. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Red says. \"Did you know she's Kelly's gardener? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
