__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Red says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Red says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Billiard Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Destiny Eaton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Red says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Red says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Billiard Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Destiny Eaton,\" Red says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Servants' Quarters, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Red says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Billiard Room and ask for yourself.\""));
