__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Destiny Eaton!\" Red says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
