__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Red says. \"He's Kelly's child, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Aaliyah Palmer, Detective?\" Red asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Kelly's child?\" Red says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Red says. \"Calls herself 'Aaliyah Palmer', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Aaliyah Palmer' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Red muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Kelly's child? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Newman's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Aaliyah Palmer, Detective?\" Red asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
