__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, her,\" Red says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Aaliyah Palmer, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Kelly's child?\" Red says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
