__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Red Schwartz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Red says. \"He's Kelly's child, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Red says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Kelly's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Red says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Kelly's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Red looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Red looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Red looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Kelly?\" Red asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Dale Potter?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Red says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Kelly's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" he says. \"Yeah man. That's Kelly's sibling. I've run into her a couplea times. She's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Newman's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Ella Guerra?\" Abe asks. \"Yeah I kinda know her, I guess. Like I know her well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" he says. \"Yeah man. That's Kelly's sibling. I've run into her a couplea times. She's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Newman's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her, yeah. I know her, kinda,\" Abe says. \"Her name's Ella Guerra. I'm not real into her. She's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her, yeah. I know her, kinda,\" Abe says. \"Her name's Ella Guerra. I'm not real into her. She's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
