__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her, yeah. I know her, kinda,\" Abe says. \"Her name's Ella Guerra. I'm not real into her. She's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Ella Guerra is a total downer,\" he replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Kelly's sibling? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Abe says, rolling his eyes. \"Her. Ella Guerra. Phew, she's a real piece of work, dude. When she comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
