__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aaliyah says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Hall Closet,\" Aaliyah says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Ella Guerra. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aaliyah says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Hall Closet,\" Aaliyah says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aaliyah says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Hall Closet,\" Aaliyah says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aaliyah says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Aaliyah snorts. \"Their presence in the Hall Closet is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Hall Closet, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aaliyah says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Hall Closet,\" Aaliyah says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Hall Closet,\" Aaliyah says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Hall Closet,\" Aaliyah says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Kelly's best friend. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Aaliyah says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Newman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Kenny Patel and I get along rather well,\" Aaliyah says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Kenny Patel?\" Aaliyah asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"Kelly's best friend and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Kenny Patel and I get along rather well,\" Aaliyah says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
