__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Kenny Patel. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Aaliyah says. \"We get along quite well. He's Kelly's best friend, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Newman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Kenny Patel and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Aaliyah says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
