__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Wine Cellar, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Red Simpson? Bah,\" Aaliyah says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aaliyah says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
