__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Red Simpson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aaliyah says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Abe Gay?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Kelly's housekeeper, and an absolute philistine,\" Aaliyah scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
