__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Alyssa Justice?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Kelly's gardener, and an absolute philistine,\" Aaliyah scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Aaliyah says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Destiny Eaton?\" Aaliyah asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Aaliyah says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Destiny Eaton and I get along rather well,\" Aaliyah says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Destiny Eaton and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Aaliyah says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Aaliyah smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Servants' Quarters -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
