__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Bathroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Aaliyah snorts. \"Their presence in the Bathroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aaliyah says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Bathroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Bathroom,\" Aaliyah says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Red Schwartz?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aaliyah says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Bathroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Bathroom,\" Aaliyah says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
