__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Alyssa says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Kelly's sibling.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Alyssa asks. \"Okay. It was Kelly's sibling.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" She reaches into her jacket pocket, and pulls out her middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Alyssa says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Kelly's sibling.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Alyssa asks. \"Okay. It was Kelly's sibling.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" She reaches into her jacket pocket, and pulls out her middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the sibling. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Alyssa asks. \"Okay. It was Kelly's sibling.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" She reaches into her jacket pocket, and pulls out her middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the sibling. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
