__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Red says. \"She's Kelly's gardener. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Kenny Patel?\" Red says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Guerra?\" you ask.<p>\"Kelly's gardener? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Red says. \"His name's Kenny Patel. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Kenny Patel is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Red says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
