__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Kenny Patel?\" you ask.<p>\"Kelly's golf caddy?\" Red says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
