__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Red exclaims. \"They'rein the Bathroom, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Eaton?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Red says. \"I wouldn't associate with Kelly's creepy gardener if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Kelly Newman's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Kelly never even had a college roommate! Go to the Billiard Room and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it?\" Red asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Red shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Kelly committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Red exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Red shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Kelly committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Red exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Red exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Red exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Red asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Master Bedroom, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. According to the dossier, this is Brooklyn McCall, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Kitchen and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Madeline Guzman, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "The only person in the Wine Cellar is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Lauren Cunningham, the victim's ex-business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Foyer you find a young man deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping his pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Zachary Blackburn, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Lounge you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Your dossier identifies her as Maya Pierce, the victim's boss.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" she says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Ariana. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Laundry Room and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Mia Leonard, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "As you enter the Sunroom, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. Your dossier identifies her as Evelyn Quinn, the victim's butler.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Servants' Quarters, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. \"You must be Lily Lamb, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>She looks up at you, and her eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" she says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Dining Room, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Lauren Warner, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" she mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" she says, rolling her eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Kitchen,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Servants' Quarters. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Kitchen,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Servants' Quarters. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Kitchen,\" Brooklyn says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Brooklyn says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Madeline Guzman. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Kitchen,\" Brooklyn says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Brooklyn says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Kitchen,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's housekeeper?\" Brooklyn says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Kitchen,\" Brooklyn says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Bennett's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Servants' Quarters. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Kitchen,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's housekeeper?\" Brooklyn says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Kitchen, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Servants' Quarters. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ariana's golf caddy,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's ex-business partner?\" Brooklyn says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ariana's golf caddy,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's ex-business partner?\" Brooklyn says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Lauren Cunningham, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Ariana's golf caddy. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-business partner? you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Lauren Cunningham. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Lauren Cunningham, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Ariana's golf caddy. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ariana's golf caddy,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Bennett's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Brooklyn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Lauren Cunningham is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's Ariana's golf caddy. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Brooklyn says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Lauren Cunningham is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's Ariana's golf caddy. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had an ex-business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's ex-business partner?\" Brooklyn says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zachary Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Zachary Blackburn,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Brooklyn mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zachary Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Foyer. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Brooklyn says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Zachary Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Zachary Blackburn,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Bennett's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Brooklyn mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zachary Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Foyer. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Brooklyn mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Zachary Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Foyer. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Zachary Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Foyer. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Brooklyn mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Brooklyn mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Brooklyn mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Brooklyn says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ariana's housekeeper,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Brooklyn says. \"Everyone loves Madeline Guzman.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Maya Pierce, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Ariana's housekeeper. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Boss...\" Brooklyn mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Madeline Guzman. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ariana's housekeeper,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Madeline Guzman,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Maya Pierce is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Brooklyn says. \"She's Ariana's housekeeper. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
