__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Servants' Quarters,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ariana's cousin?\" Brooklyn says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Servants' Quarters,\" Brooklyn says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
