__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Servants' Quarters, having a grand old time.\""));
