__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Madeline muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Ariana's butler? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
