__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Calls herself 'Lily Lamb', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Lily Lamb' by choice, can you?\""));
