__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Calls herself 'Lily Lamb', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Lily Lamb' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Madeline says. \"She's Ariana's personal assistant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Madeline says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Lily Lamb, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Lily Lamb, Detective?\" Madeline asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Madeline muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Ariana's personal assistant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Mia Leonard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Madeline says. \"She's Ariana's personal assistant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Calls herself 'Lily Lamb', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Lily Lamb' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Madeline says. \"She's Ariana's personal assistant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Calls herself 'Lily Lamb', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Lily Lamb' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Madeline says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Ariana's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Zachary Blackburn,\" Madeline says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Madeline says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Ariana's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Bennett's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Zachary Blackburn, isn't it?\" Madeline asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Bennett's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler, butler. Hmm,\" Madeline ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Zachary Blackburn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Ariana's butler. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Evelyn Quinn's a positive delight!\" Madeline says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Zachary Blackburn,\" Madeline says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Madeline says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Ariana's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Zachary Blackburn,\" Madeline says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Evelyn Quinn. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Madeline says. \"Did you know she's Ariana's personal assistant? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Zachary Blackburn, isn't it?\" Madeline asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Evelyn Quinn. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Evelyn Quinn's a positive delight!\" Madeline says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Zachary Blackburn,\" Madeline says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Madeline says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Lounge, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Madeline says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Lounge? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Lily Lamb,\" Madeline says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Servants' Quarters, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Madeline says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Lounge? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Lily Lamb!\" Madeline says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Servants' Quarters, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Madeline says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Lounge? Is that the one?\""));
