__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Lily Lamb!\" Madeline says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Lily Lamb!\" Madeline says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Madeline says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Ariana's boss?\" Madeline says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Master Bedroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Madeline declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Madeline says. \"She's Ariana's boss, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Master Bedroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Madeline declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Madeline muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Ariana's boss? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Madeline says as sternly as she can muster, \"Ariana's personal assistant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Master Bedroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
