__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Madeline muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Ariana's boss? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Master Bedroom, Detective,\" Madeline says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Madeline says. \"She's Ariana's boss, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Master Bedroom, Detective,\" Madeline says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Madeline says as sternly as she can muster, \"Ariana's personal assistant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Master Bedroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Ariana's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Ariana's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Ariana's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Madeline says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Ariana's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Ariana?\" Madeline asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Ricky Johnson?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Madeline looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Ariana?\" Madeline asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Douglas Clay?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Ariana?\" Madeline asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Travis Christian?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Ariana Bennett's best friend,\" Cunningham says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Cunningham says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Master Bedroom is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Ariana Bennett's best friend,\" Cunningham says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Cunningham says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Ariana Bennett's best friend, I believe,\" Cunningham says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
