__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Ariana Bennett's butler,\" Cunningham says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Evelyn Quinn, Detective,\" Cunningham says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Ariana Bennett's butler,\" Cunningham says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know Bennett's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Evelyn Quinn to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Ariana Bennett's butler,\" Cunningham says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Evelyn Quinn to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Ariana Bennett's butler,\" Cunningham says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Ariana Bennett's butler,\" Cunningham says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
