__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Ariana Bennett's butler,\" Cunningham says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Evelyn Quinn, Cunningham says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
