__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Cunningham says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Ariana Bennett's cousin,\" Cunningham says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Ariana Bennett's cousin,\" Cunningham says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Cunningham says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Cunningham says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Ariana Bennett's cousin, I believe,\" Cunningham says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Ariana Bennett's personal assistant,\" Cunningham says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Bennett's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Lauren Warner to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Ariana Bennett's personal assistant,\" Cunningham says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Lauren Warner, Cunningham says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Ariana Bennett's personal assistant,\" Cunningham says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Lauren Warner, Cunningham says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Ariana Bennett's personal assistant,\" Cunningham says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Lauren Warner, Detective,\" Cunningham says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Lauren Warner to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
