__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Lauren Warner to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Lauren Warner. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Ariana Bennett's personal assistant,\" Cunningham says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Ariana Bennett's personal assistant,\" Cunningham says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Lauren Warner to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Ariana Bennett's housekeeper,\" Cunningham says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Ariana Bennett's housekeeper,\" Cunningham says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Cunningham says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Ariana Bennett's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Ariana Bennett's housekeeper,\" Cunningham says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"The housekeeper.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Ariana Bennett's housekeeper, Detective,\" Cunningham says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"The housekeeper.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Ariana Bennett's housekeeper, Detective,\" Cunningham says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"The housekeeper.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Ariana Bennett's housekeeper, Detective,\" Cunningham says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Zachary smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Master Bedroom -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Brooklyn McCall and I get along rather well,\" Zachary says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Brooklyn McCall is my biggest fan!\" Zachary says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bennett's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Brooklyn McCall and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Zachary says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Zachary smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Master Bedroom -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Brooklyn McCall and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Zachary says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Brooklyn McCall?\" Zachary asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Brooklyn McCall. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Zachary smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Master Bedroom -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Zachary says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Brooklyn McCall and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Zachary says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
