__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Zachary says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Madeline Guzman. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zachary says. \"We get along quite well. She's Ariana's housekeeper, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Madeline Guzman?\" Zachary asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's housekeeper and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Madeline Guzman and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Zachary says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
