__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Ariana's housekeeper. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Zachary says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Madeline Guzman?\" Zachary asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Madeline Guzman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zachary says. \"We get along quite well. She's Ariana's housekeeper, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bennett's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Madeline Guzman?\" Zachary asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Ariana's ex-business partner, and an absolute philistine,\" Zachary scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Zachary snorts. \"You're referring to Lauren Cunningham. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Zachary asks. \"Oh -- you mean Ariana's ex-business partner. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Zachary sniffs. \"Her name is Lauren Cunningham, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Zachary asks. \"Oh -- you mean Ariana's ex-business partner. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Zachary sniffs. \"Her name is Lauren Cunningham, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Ariana's ex-business partner, and an absolute philistine,\" Zachary scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Zachary snorts. \"You're referring to Lauren Cunningham. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Lauren Cunningham? Bah,\" Zachary says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Zachary asks. \"Oh -- you mean Ariana's ex-business partner. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Zachary snorts. \"You're referring to Lauren Cunningham. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Zachary asks. \"Oh -- you mean Ariana's ex-business partner. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Zachary says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The ex-business partner. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Lauren Cunningham? Bah,\" Zachary says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zachary says. \"We get along quite well. She's Ariana's boss, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bennett's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the boss,\" Zachary muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Lounge, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's boss and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Bennett's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Lounge at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"Ariana's boss and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Zachary says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zachary says. \"We get along quite well. She's Ariana's boss, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Ariana's boss. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Zachary says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Lounge at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Zachary says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Lounge.\""));
