__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Lounge at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zachary says. \"We get along quite well. She's Ariana's boss, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Maya Pierce?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Ariana's boss. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Zachary says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Zachary says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Mia Leonard and I get along rather well,\" Zachary says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Mia Leonard is my biggest fan!\" Zachary says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mia Leonard and I get along rather well,\" Zachary says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Mia Leonard is my biggest fan!\" Zachary says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Mia Leonard and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Zachary says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Zachary smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mia Leonard and I get along rather well,\" Zachary says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Mia Leonard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Zachary says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mia Leonard and I get along rather well,\" Zachary says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Mia Leonard is my biggest fan!\" Zachary says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Mia Leonard?\" Zachary asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mia Leonard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Mia Leonard is my biggest fan!\" Zachary says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Mia Leonard and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Zachary says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mia Leonard and I get along rather well,\" Zachary says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Ariana's butler, and an absolute philistine,\" Zachary scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Zachary snorts. \"You're referring to Evelyn Quinn. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Zachary says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Zachary sniffs. \"Her name is Evelyn Quinn, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Zachary asks. \"Oh -- you mean Ariana's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Evelyn Quinn? Bah,\" Zachary says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Evelyn Quinn?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Zachary asks. \"Oh -- you mean Ariana's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
