__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Zachary says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
