__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Brooklyn McCall, Detective,\" Leonard says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Master Bedroom, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Ariana Bennett's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Leonard says. \"Her name is Lauren Warner. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Leonard says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Leonard says. \"Her name is Lauren Warner. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
