__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Madeline Guzman,\" Leonard says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Wine Cellar,\" Leonard sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Madeline Guzman in my presence, Detective!\" Leonard demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Lauren Cunningham. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Leonard says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
