__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from her as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Sunroom, because she has it all wired up with recording devices. She's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Lily Lamb? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Evelyn exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
