__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Lauren Cunningham?\" you ask.<p>\"Lauren Cunningham? I think she's safe,\" Evelyn says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
