__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Brooklyn McCall?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Lily says. \"That's the victim's golf caddy, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's best friend, Detective,\" Lily says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
