__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Madeline Guzman. she's all right. Can't tell you much about her, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
