__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily Lamb? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Servants' Quarters? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Foyer. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Lily Lamb is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Servants' Quarters and ask she yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Bennett's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know much about 'em. Alright, I suppose. Go find out for yourself -- in the Foyer, I think.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>Lauren scowls. \"What, now you're after Lily Lamb? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Servants' Quarters, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Foyer. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lily Lamb?\" you ask.<p>Lauren scowls. \"What, now you're after Lily Lamb? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Servants' Quarters, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, yeah. I think I saw them in the Foyer?\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, making a note of it. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah. S'alright, I guess? We don't really interact.\""));
