__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Foyer. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Lauren asks. \"Okay. It was Ariana's cousin.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" She reaches into her jacket pocket, and pulls out her middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Lauren says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Ariana's cousin.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the cousin. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the cousin. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the cousin. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the cousin. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the cousin. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Lauren says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Ariana's cousin.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Lauren says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Ariana's cousin.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Foyer, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Allison Cameron, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" she asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Guest Bedroom, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. \"You must be Harold Blake, the victim's ex-business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Madison Booth,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You walk into the Ballroom and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Nicky Gill, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Pantry, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Lewis Snow, the victim's boss.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Boiler Room you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Your dossier identifies her as Anna Camacho, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Laundry Room, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. Your dossier identifies him as Ike Shepard, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "The only person in the Bathroom is a hugely-muscled man, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies him as Quinn Skinner, the victim's lover.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Quinn grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Billiard Room and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Theodore McClain, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Sunroom, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. Your dossier identifies her as Mariah Cruz, the victim's ex-neighbor.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Harold Blake. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Heck yeah, I know Harold Blake,\" she says. \"He's like, crazy cool. He's a real trip. He's in the Guest Bedroom, give him a high-five for me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Theodore McClain? Yeah dude! He's a riot! He's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, sure man,\" Allison says. \"He's a solid bro. He'll be in the Guest Bedroom, that's where he hangs out. Tell him I said hey.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had an ex-business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Theodore McClain? Yeah dude! He's a riot! He's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh man, all I know about him is that he's like the coolest! He's wild as hell, go check out the Guest Bedroom and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-business partner? you ask.<p>\"You mean Theodore McClain? Yeah dude! He's a riot! He's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
