__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh man, all I know about him is that he's like the coolest! He's wild as hell, go check out the Bathroom and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Anna Camacho? Yeah dude! She's a riot! She's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's cool,\" she replies. \"Like, maybe you wouldn't think it to meet him, but like deep down, you know? He's good people.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything <i>useful</i> about Theodore McClain?\"<p>\"Oh, uhh... Well, he's Madison's ex-neighbor, does that help?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, dunno much, dude,\" Allison says. \"I guess look in the Pantry? That's where I'd look, if I was looking.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, man!\" Allison says. \"He's cool, he's a real bro. He's, like, Madison's ex-neighbor and stuff. We don't get to hang out much, but he's fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know 'em. I mean, not really,\" she says. \"They're cool, but we're not like bros or anything. Check the Pantry, maybe?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Madison's ex-neighbor, dude!\" she says. \"He's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
