__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Mariah Cruz is a total downer,\" she replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Madison's chauffeur? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Allison says, rolling her eyes. \"Him. Quinn Skinner. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Mariah Cruz. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah I know her,\" she says. \"I mean, kinda. We don't, like, hang. Real unchill woman. I think she's Madison's chauffeur or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Booth's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Quinn Skinner?\" Allison asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
