__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Quinn Skinner. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Allison says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Quinn Skinner. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Quinn Skinner. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Quinn Skinner. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Quinn Skinner. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Quinn Skinner. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Allison says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Quinn Skinner. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Allison looks over her shoulder. \"Okay, well, you didn't hear this from me, right dude? But it was Quinn Skinner. Don't ask me how I know, but like, scout's honor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Allison Cameron is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Harold says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Foyer, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Foyer, Detective,\" Harold says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Harold says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Foyer, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Harold says as sternly as he can muster, \"Madison's dental hygienist is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Foyer. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Harold says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Foyer, go see for yourself!\""));
