__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Harold says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Foyer, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Foyer with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Harold declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Allison Cameron is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Harold says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Foyer, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Foyer with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Harold declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Harold says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Ballroom, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Harold says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Ballroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Nicky Gill,\" Harold says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Ballroom, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Harold says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Ballroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Nicky Gill!\" Harold says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Nicky Gill,\" Harold says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Ballroom, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Harold says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Ballroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
