__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Lewis Snow's a positive delight!\" Harold says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Harold says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Pantry? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Lewis Snow. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Harold says. \"Did you know he's Madison's boss? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Harold says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Pantry and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Lewis Snow. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Harold says. \"Did you know he's Madison's boss? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Lewis Snow's a positive delight!\" Harold says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Harold says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Pantry? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Lewis Snow. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Harold says. \"Did you know he's Madison's boss? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Harold says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Pantry and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Lewis Snow's a positive delight!\" Harold says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Harold says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Pantry? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Harold says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Madison's boss, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Harold says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Pantry? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Lewis Snow's a positive delight!\" Harold says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Harold says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Pantry? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Harold says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Pantry, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Anna Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Madison's chauffeur?\" Harold says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know Booth's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Boiler Room, Detective,\" Harold says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Anna Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Madison's chauffeur?\" Harold says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Harold declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Anna Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Harold says. \"She's Madison's chauffeur, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Boiler Room, Detective,\" Harold says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Anna Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Harold muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Madison's chauffeur? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Harold says as sternly as he can muster, \"Madison's chauffeur is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Boiler Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Anna Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Harold says. \"She's Madison's chauffeur, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
