__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Ike Shepard?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Harold says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Laundry Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Harold says as sternly as he can muster, \"Madison's business partner is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Laundry Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Ike Shepard. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ike Shepard is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Harold says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Laundry Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Harold says as sternly as he can muster, \"Madison's business partner is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Laundry Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Ike Shepard?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Harold says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Laundry Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
