__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Bathroom, Detective,\" Harold says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Theodore McClain,\" Harold says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Billiard Room, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Theodore McClain, isn't it?\" Harold asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Harold says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Billiard Room, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Theodore McClain, isn't it?\" Harold asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Theodore McClain!\" Harold says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Theodore McClain,\" Harold says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Theodore McClain. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Theodore McClain,\" Harold says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Billiard Room, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
