__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Harold says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's ex-neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Harold says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Mariah Cruz, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Harold says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Harold says. \"Calls herself 'Mariah Cruz', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Mariah Cruz' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Harold says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Mariah Cruz. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Harold says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Booth's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Harold says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Mariah Cruz, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Harold says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mariah Cruz, Detective?\" Harold asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
