__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Madison's ex-neighbor, Detective,\" Harold says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Madison's ex-neighbor, Detective,\" Harold says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Harold says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Madison's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the ex-neighbor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Harold says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Madison's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the ex-neighbor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Harold says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Madison Booth?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the ex-neighbor, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Harold says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Madison Booth?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the ex-neighbor, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Gill says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Foyer at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Gill says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Foyer?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Gill says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Foyer at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Gill says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Foyer?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Foyer and ask her directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Foyer and ask her directly.\""));
