__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Allison Cameron, Detective,\" Gill says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Foyer, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Gill says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Foyer?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Gill says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Foyer?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>Gill snorts derisively. \"Madison's ex-business partner is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Guest Bedroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Harold Blake?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Madison's ex-business partner? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Guest Bedroom at the moment.\""));
