__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him, yes,\" he says. \"Ike Shepard. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
