__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Theodore McClain. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Gill says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Billiard Room.\""));
