__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Anna says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Anna says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Allison Cameron. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Anna says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Ballroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Anna smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Foyer -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Ballroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Anna smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Foyer -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the dental hygienist,\" Anna muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Ballroom, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Anna smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Foyer -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Anna says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Ballroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Anna says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the dental hygienist,\" Anna muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Ballroom, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Anna asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madison's ex-neighbor. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Anna sniffs. \"Her name is Mariah Cruz, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Harold Blake. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madison's ex-neighbor, and an absolute philistine,\" Anna scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-business partner? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Anna sniffs. \"Her name is Mariah Cruz, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mariah Cruz? Bah,\" Anna says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Anna says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The ex-neighbor. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mariah Cruz? Bah,\" Anna says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Anna says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The ex-neighbor. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Anna snorts. \"You're referring to Mariah Cruz. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
