__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Anna says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Ballroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Booth's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Anna snorts. \"You're referring to Mariah Cruz. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Anna says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Ballroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mariah Cruz? Bah,\" Anna says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
