__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Lewis Snow. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madison's ex-business partner, and an absolute philistine,\" Anna scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Anna snorts. \"Their presence in the Billiard Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
