__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Anna snorts. \"Their presence in the Sunroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
