__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Sunroom,\" Anna says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Ike Shepard?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Anna says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Laundry Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
