__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Quinn Skinner. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Quinn Skinner is my biggest fan!\" Anna says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Anna says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know Booth's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Quinn Skinner is my biggest fan!\" Anna says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, the lover,\" Anna muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Laundry Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
