__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the lover,\" Anna muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Laundry Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Anna smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Bathroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Anna says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the lover,\" Anna muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Laundry Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
