__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Theodore McClain is my biggest fan!\" Anna says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Booth's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mariah Cruz and I get along rather well,\" Anna says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Theodore McClain. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Anna says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Mariah Cruz and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Anna says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
