__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Mariah Cruz and I get along rather well,\" Anna says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Mariah Cruz?\" Anna asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
