__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Sunroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Foyer,\" Anna says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Anna says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Sunroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Anna snorts. \"Their presence in the Foyer is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Anna says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Sunroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
