__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh, well,\" Anna says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Theodore McClain,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Anna says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Theodore McClain,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Anna muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Theodore McClain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, well,\" Anna says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Theodore McClain,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Anna muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Theodore McClain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Anna muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Theodore McClain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Anna says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Theodore McClain'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Allison Cameron is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Ike says. \"She's Madison's dental hygienist. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Ike says. \"Everyone loves Allison Cameron.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Allison Cameron. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Allison Cameron, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Madison's dental hygienist. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Allison Cameron,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Madison's dental hygienist,\" Ike says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Allison Cameron,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Madison's dental hygienist,\" Ike says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Ike mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Allison Cameron. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
