__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Allison Cameron,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Harold Blake is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Ike says. \"He's Madison's ex-business partner. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's ex-business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Ike says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Harold Blake, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Madison's ex-business partner. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Madison's ex-business partner?\" Ike says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Guest Bedroom.\""));
