__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Ike says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Guest Bedroom. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Madison's ex-business partner,\" Ike says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
