__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Ballroom,\" Ike says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
