__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Ballroom,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
