__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Bathroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Ike says. \"Everyone loves Quinn Skinner.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Bathroom,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Lover...\" Ike mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Quinn Skinner. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
