__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Booth's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Ike says. \"Everyone loves Quinn Skinner.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Bathroom,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Ike says. \"Everyone loves Quinn Skinner.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Bathroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Lover...\" Ike mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Quinn Skinner. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Bathroom,\" Ike says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Quinn Skinner,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Theodore McClain is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Ike says. \"He's Madison's golf caddy. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Booth's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Ike says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Billiard Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Theodore McClain, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Madison's golf caddy. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Ike says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Theodore McClain. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Madison's golf caddy,\" Ike says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Ike says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Billiard Room. Does that count?\""));
