__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Theodore McClain, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Madison's golf caddy. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Theodore McClain, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Madison's golf caddy. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Booth's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Madison's golf caddy?\" Ike says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Theodore McClain is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Ike says. \"He's Madison's golf caddy. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Madison's golf caddy?\" Ike says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madison's ex-neighbor,\" Ike replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Mariah Cruz,\" Ike says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>Ike shudders. \"She's Madison's ex-neighbor. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim's ex-neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only ex-neighbor I'm aware of around here is Mariah Cruz, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Cruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Ike mutters. \"I don't know how Madison got stuck with a ex-neighbor like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a business partner like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Mariah Cruz. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Mariah Cruz. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
