__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"The only ex-neighbor I'm aware of around here is Mariah Cruz, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Madison, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Madison, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Madison Booth? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Allison Cameron,\" Quinn says. \"You'll find her in the Foyer, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Quinn says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Ballroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Allison Cameron. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Quinn snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Quinn says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Ballroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Quinn snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Quinn thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Ballroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Allison Cameron,\" Quinn says. \"You'll find her in the Foyer, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Umm...\" Quinn thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Ballroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Quinn snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Foyer, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Booth's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Quinn says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Ballroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Allison Cameron,\" Quinn says. \"You'll find her in the Foyer, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Quinn sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Ballroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Quinn snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Foyer, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Quinn snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Cameron?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Quinn snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Foyer, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Harold Blake's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Guest Bedroom if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Quinn says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Pantry if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Blake?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Quinn says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Guest Bedroom, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Pantry.\""));
