__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Nicky Gill. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Quinn says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Ballroom, if you're looking for him.\""));
