__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Nicky Gill's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Ballroom if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Laundry Room.\""));
