__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Quinn says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Laundry Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Lewis Snow,\" Quinn says. \"You'll find him in the Pantry, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried him away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know Booth's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Quinn says. \"Nicky Gill, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Lewis Snow?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Quinn snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Pantry.\""));
