__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ike Shepard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Madison's boss,\" Quinn says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Quinn says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Ballroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know Ike Shepard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Madison's boss,\" Quinn says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
