__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Ike Shepard?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a boss,\" Quinn snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Quinn sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Ballroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
