__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Anna Camacho?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Mariah says. \"She's Madison's dental hygienist. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Booth's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Ballroom, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
