__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nicky Gill? Stay away from him!\" Mariah says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Quinn Skinner. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Mariah says. \"I wouldn't associate with Madison's creepy chauffeur if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Nicky Gill? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Mariah exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Mariah exclaims. \"Madison's chauffeur? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Booth's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Mariah says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Nicky Gill, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Madison's chauffeur?\" Mariah says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
