__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Quinn Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Madison's chauffeur?\" Mariah says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Mariah says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Nicky Gill, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Mariah says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Billiard Room, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Mariah says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Sunroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Mariah says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Billiard Room and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Mariah says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Sunroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Bathroom, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Theodore McClain? I think he's safe,\" Mariah says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Mariah says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Sunroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Theodore McClain? I think he's safe,\" Mariah says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Billiard Room.\""));
