__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Mariah says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Billiard Room and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Mariah says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Billiard Room, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madison Booth's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Mariah says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Sunroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Theodore McClain? I think he's safe,\" Mariah says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Mariah says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Sunroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Theodore McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Mariah says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Billiard Room and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Mariah says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Sunroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Mariah exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Mariah exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Mariah asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Mariah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Madison committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Mariah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Madison committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Mariah exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Wine Cellar and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Lauren Sharpe, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Living Room and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be John Buck, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" he  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>He glares at you for a second, then rolls his eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Basement, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Sofia Crosby, the victim's boss.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Sofia grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You walk into the Bathroom, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Your dossier identifies her as Camila Watts, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" she asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Breakfast Nook, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. According to the dossier, this is Sydney Rivera, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Foyer, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. \"You must be Clayton Hahn, the victim's bodyguard,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask him. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Maya Olson was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" he says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Kitchen, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the dossier, this is Maria McDowell, the victim's accountant.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Master Bedroom, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Dave Ryan, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Bar, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Avery Peterson, the victim's child.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Sharpe says. \"You will find him in the Living Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Sharpe says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Breakfast Nook, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room,\" Sharpe says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Sharpe says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Breakfast Nook, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Sharpe says. \"Presently, he is in the Living Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Sharpe says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Breakfast Nook, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room,\" Sharpe says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Olson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Breakfast Nook, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room,\" Sharpe says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Sharpe says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Breakfast Nook, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Sharpe says. \"Presently, he is in the Living Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Sharpe says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Breakfast Nook, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Breakfast Nook, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Sharpe says. \"Presently, he is in the Living Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Sharpe says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Breakfast Nook, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room,\" Sharpe says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Maya Olson's golf caddy,\" Sharpe says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Sharpe says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Kitchen, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Maya Olson's golf caddy,\" Sharpe says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Olson's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Kitchen, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
