__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Maya Olson's golf caddy,\" Sharpe says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
