__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Maria McDowell. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Kitchen,\" Sharpe says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Breakfast Nook is where you can find them.\""));
