__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Sharpe says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Maya Olson's boss,\" Sharpe says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Maya Olson's boss,\" Sharpe says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Olson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Sharpe says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Sharpe says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Maya Olson's boss,\" Sharpe says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Maya Olson's boss,\" Sharpe says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Foyer is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Sharpe says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Maya Olson has true relevance, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Maya Olson has true relevance, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Maya Olson has true relevance, Detective,\" Sharpe says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Lauren Sharpe?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Maya's housekeeper? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Olson's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Wine Cellar,\" he says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Lauren Sharpe?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Maya's housekeeper? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>Buck snorts derisively. \"Maya's housekeeper is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>Buck snorts derisively. \"Maya's housekeeper is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Wine Cellar,\" he says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>Buck snorts derisively. \"Maya's housekeeper is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Lauren Sharpe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lauren Sharpe?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Maya's housekeeper? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Buck sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Buck sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Lauren Sharpe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Buck snorts derisively. \"Maya's housekeeper is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Maya refers to as her housekeeper,\" Buck says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Buck sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Maya's boss,\" Buck says. \"A perfectly charming woman, despite her upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" he says. \"Sofia Crosby. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Maya's boss,\" Buck says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Sofia Crosby? Why yes,\" he replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Maya's boss,\" Buck says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with her with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Buck says. \"Her name is Sofia Crosby. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
