__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Camila Watts in my presence, Detective!\" Buck demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Buck scowls. \"Maya really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a chauffeur such as Camila Watts.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Camila Watts. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Bathroom,\" Buck sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
