__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Buck says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Camila Watts in my presence, Detective!\" Buck demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
