__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Sydney Rivera?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Buck says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Breakfast Nook at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Buck says. \"Her name is Sydney Rivera. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
