__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Clayton Hahn?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Foyer and ask him directly.\""));
