__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Foyer.\""));
