__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Buck says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Olson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Dave Ryan,\" Buck says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Master Bedroom,\" Buck sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Buck scowls. \"Maya really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a neighbor such as Dave Ryan.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Master Bedroom,\" Buck sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
