__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Dave Ryan,\" Buck says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Buck scowls. \"Maya really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a neighbor such as Dave Ryan.\""));
