__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" he exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" he exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" he exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Buck says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" he says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Buck says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Sofia says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Wine Cellar, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Lauren Sharpe's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Wine Cellar if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Sofia says. \"I think they'd be in the Wine Cellar at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Sofia says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Wine Cellar, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Sofia says. \"I think they'd be in the Wine Cellar at this time of day.\""));
