__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Maya's golf caddy,\" Sofia says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Maya's golf caddy? Oh, you mean John Buck,\" Sofia says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"John Buck. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Maya's golf caddy,\" Sofia says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What do you know about John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know John Buck!\" Sofia says. \"That's Maya's golf caddy. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's John Buck,\" Sofia says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Maya's golf caddy, I know him,\" Sofia says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's John Buck. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named John Buck?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Maya's golf caddy,\" Sofia says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
