__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Maya's golf caddy? Oh, you mean John Buck,\" Sofia says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
