__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Sofia says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Master Bedroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
