__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah I know her,\" she says. \"I mean, kinda. We don't, like, hang. Real unchill woman. I think she's Maya's golf caddy or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Olson's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Camila says, rolling her eyes. \"Her. Maria McDowell. Phew, she's a real piece of work, dude. When she comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
