__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
