__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from her as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Breakfast Nook, because she has it all wired up with recording devices. She's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Sydney exclaims. \"They'rein the Breakfast Nook, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Sydney declares. \"You can go talk to her in the Wine Cellar if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Sydney says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Bathroom isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
