__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Maria McDowell? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Sydney exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
