__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Sydney says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Bathroom and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Avery Peterson?\" Sydney says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"Camila Watts? I think she's safe,\" Sydney says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Avery Peterson is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Sydney says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Sydney says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Bathroom, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Sydney says. \"Her name's Avery Peterson. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
