__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clayton Hahn?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Sydney says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Foyer and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Sydney says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Breakfast Nook, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
