__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Sydney says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Breakfast Nook, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Olson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Wine Cellar, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
