__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Maria McDowell?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Sydney says. \"I wouldn't associate with Maya's creepy golf caddy if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
