__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maria McDowell?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Sydney exclaims. \"Maya's golf caddy? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" she says. \"Maya never even had a accountant! Go to the Foyer and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Maria McDowell?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Sydney exclaims. \"Maya's golf caddy? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" she says. \"Maya never even had a accountant! Go to the Foyer and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Maria McDowell?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Sydney says. \"I wouldn't associate with Maya's creepy golf caddy if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Sydney exclaims. \"They'rein the Breakfast Nook, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Maya's chauffeur,\" she replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Olson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Kitchen, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Maya's chauffeur,\" she replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Sydney says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Breakfast Nook, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Sydney says. \"He's Maya's chauffeur. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Olson's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Sydney says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Breakfast Nook, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Kitchen, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Maya's chauffeur? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Sydney says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Breakfast Nook, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
