__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Sydney declares. \"You can go talk to her in the Bar if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Lauren Sharpe? Stay away from her!\" Sydney says. \"I've seen her mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
