__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that woman as I possibly can,\" Sydney says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Bar!\""));
