__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that woman as I possibly can,\" Sydney says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Bar!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Sydney declares. \"You can go talk to her in the Bar if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Avery Peterson?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from her as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Breakfast Nook, because she has it all wired up with recording devices. She's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Lauren Sharpe? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Sydney exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Sydney shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Maya committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Sydney exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Sydney asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Sydney exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
