__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Sydney asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Clayton says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Wine Cellar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Clayton says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Bathroom right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Clayton exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Wine Cellar and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Bathroom,\" Clayton says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Clayton exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Wine Cellar and see for yourself!\""));
