__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's in the Wine Cellar -- you should check her out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Clayton says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on her a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
