__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Avery Peterson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Clayton says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Bar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
