__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>Maria turns a page in her book. \"I think it was the bodyguard.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, writing it down. \"Why do you say that? ...Hello?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>Dave scowls. \"What, now you're after Lauren Sharpe? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Wine Cellar, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
