__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
