__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Lauren Sharpe,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"The only housekeeper I'm aware of around here is Sydney Rivera, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Wine Cellar. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Olson's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sydney Rivera. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Lauren Sharpe,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Lauren Sharpe,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Sydney Rivera. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Wine Cellar. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sydney Rivera. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Lauren Sharpe?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Lauren Sharpe,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Sydney Rivera,\" Avery says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
