__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sofia Crosby, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Maya's neighbor. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Camila Watts,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sofia Crosby, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Maya's neighbor. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Camila Watts,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Sofia Crosby, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Maya's neighbor. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Boss...\" Avery mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Camila Watts. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Sofia Crosby. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Sofia Crosby is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Avery says. \"She's Maya's neighbor. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Avery says. \"Everyone loves Camila Watts.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Maya's neighbor,\" Avery says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Sofia Crosby. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Maya's neighbor,\" Avery says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Camila Watts,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"That's Camila Watts,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Sofia Crosby?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Sofia Crosby is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Avery says. \"She's Maya's neighbor. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Boss...\" Avery mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Camila Watts. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Bathroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Maya Olson's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Avery says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Living Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Bathroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Maya's chauffeur?\" Avery says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Bathroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Avery says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Living Room.\""));
