__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Camila Watts?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Bathroom,\" Avery says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
