__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Maria McDowell. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Kitchen. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
