__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Master Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Avery says. \"Everyone loves Maria McDowell.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Maria McDowell,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Neighbor...\" Avery mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Maria McDowell. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Dave Ryan?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Master Bedroom,\" Avery says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor...\" Avery mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Maria McDowell. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well gosh,\" Avery says, her eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Maya's housekeeper killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Maya's housekeeper,\" Avery says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Avery says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Maya's housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Maya's housekeeper,\" Avery says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Avery says, her eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Maya's housekeeper killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Avery says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Maya's housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Lounge and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the dossier, this is Isaiah Spence, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Hall Closet, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young woman wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out her \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. According to the dossier, this is Charlotte Gilliam, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" she asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Attic and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Ryan Skinner, the victim's butler,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Ryan sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Library, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. According to the dossier, this is Brianna Chen, the victim's chauffeur.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Sunroom, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. \"You must be Autumn Cotton, the victim's lawyer,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "In the Smoking Lounge you find a pale, drably-dressed woman slouched on a small chair. She looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Audrey Wong, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You walk into the Servants' Quarters, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. \"You must be Eva Keller, the victim's dental hygienist,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "The only person in the Foyer is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Carl O'Brien, the victim's accountant.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Study and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. \"You must be Natalie McKee, the victim's neighbor,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Charlotte Gilliam. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Charlotte Gilliam is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Hall Closet and ask she yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Charlotte Gilliam. she's all right. Can't tell you much about her, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Charlotte Gilliam? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Hall Closet? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's golf caddy? She's called Charlotte Gilliam. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>Isaiah scowls. \"What, now you're after Charlotte Gilliam? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Hall Closet, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Charlotte Gilliam. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Charlotte Gilliam? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Hall Closet? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Charlotte Gilliam. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
