__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>Isaiah scowls. \"What, now you're after Charlotte Gilliam? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Hall Closet, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Molly's golf caddy? She's called Charlotte Gilliam. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Charlotte Gilliam. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Charlotte Gilliam? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Hall Closet? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ryan Skinner, that's Molly's butler. I ain't got a single good word to say about that sleazy friggin' weasel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm... Yeah, I think I know who you mean, but I can't think of their name. Never cared to know. They're probably in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ryan Skinner? That jerk? All I know is he's Molly's butler, and that's all I wanna know about that jerk.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Molly's butler? I ain't gonna even say that piece of crap's name. Go to the Attic and find out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Ryan Skinner. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ryan Skinner? That jerk? All I know is he's Molly's butler, and that's all I wanna know about that jerk.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Umm... Yeah, I think I know who you mean, but I can't think of their name. Never cared to know. They're probably in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Ryan Skinner. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ryan Skinner, that's Molly's butler. I ain't got a single good word to say about that sleazy friggin' weasel.\""));
