__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Lounge, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Ryan sniffs. \"Her name is Eva Keller, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Lounge, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Ryan snorts. \"You're referring to Eva Keller. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Ryan sniffs. \"Her name is Eva Keller, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Ryan says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Lounge, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Ryan snorts. \"You're referring to Eva Keller. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Ryan says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Lounge, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Ryan sniffs. \"Her name is Eva Keller, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Ryan says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Lounge, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller? Bah,\" Ryan says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Lounge, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Lounge, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Ryan snorts. \"You're referring to Eva Keller. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Ryan sniffs. \"Her name is Eva Keller, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Charlotte Gilliam. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Molly's bodyguard. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Ryan says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Study at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Ryan says. \"We get along quite well. She's Molly's bodyguard, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Ryan says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Charlotte Gilliam. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's bodyguard and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Study at the moment.\""));
