__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the golf caddy,\" Ryan muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Study, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
