__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Molly's lawyer, and an absolute philistine,\" Ryan scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Servants' Quarters,\" Ryan says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Ryan says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The lawyer. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Servants' Quarters,\" Ryan says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Ryan asks. \"Oh -- you mean Molly's lawyer. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Ryan snorts. \"Their presence in the Servants' Quarters is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
