__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Wong?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Ryan says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Smoking Lounge, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Ryan snorts. \"Their presence in the Hall Closet is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
