__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know Eva Keller?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Ryan says. \"We get along quite well. She's Molly's best friend, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Ryan says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
