__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Smoking Lounge at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Molly's bodyguard. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Ryan says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
