__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Natalie McKee. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Ryan says. \"We get along quite well. She's Molly's best friend, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Autumn Cotton and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Ryan says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Molly's best friend. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Ryan says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's best friend and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Autumn Cotton?\" Ryan asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's best friend and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Autumn Cotton and I get along rather well,\" Ryan says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
