__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Autumn Cotton?\" Ryan asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Ryan says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Ryan says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Molly?\" Ryan asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Ryan says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Ryan says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Ryan says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Ryan says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Ryan says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Lounge is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Sunroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Brianna declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Brianna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Molly's bodyguard is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Sunroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Lounge is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Sunroom, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Sunroom, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Isaiah Spence is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Brianna says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Lounge, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Brianna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Molly's bodyguard is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Sunroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Lounge is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Brianna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Molly's bodyguard is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Sunroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Lounge, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Brianna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Molly's bodyguard is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Sunroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Brianna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Molly's butler? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller, Detective?\" Brianna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Brianna says. \"She's Molly's butler, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Brianna says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Eva Keller, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Brianna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Molly's butler? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Brianna says. \"Calls herself 'Eva Keller', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Eva Keller' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Charlotte Gilliam. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Brianna says. \"She's Molly's butler, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller, Detective?\" Brianna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Brianna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Molly's butler? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Molly's butler?\" Brianna says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller, Detective?\" Brianna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
