__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Brianna says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Eva Keller, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller, Detective?\" Brianna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Brianna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Molly's butler? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Brianna says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Molly's bodyguard, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Brianna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Ryan Skinner. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Brianna says. \"Did you know he's Molly's bodyguard? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Brianna says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Smoking Lounge? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ryan Skinner's a positive delight!\" Brianna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Brianna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Ryan Skinner. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Brianna says. \"Did you know he's Molly's bodyguard? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Brianna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Ryan Skinner. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Brianna says. \"Did you know he's Molly's bodyguard? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Brianna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Ryan Skinner. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Ryan Skinner. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Brianna says. \"Did you know he's Molly's bodyguard? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Brianna says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Molly's bodyguard, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Brianna says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Smoking Lounge, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Brianna says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Molly's bodyguard, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Leach's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Brianna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Brianna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Autumn Cotton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Autumn Cotton is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Brianna says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Sunroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Brianna says. \"Calls herself 'Eva Keller', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Eva Keller' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Autumn Cotton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller, Detective?\" Brianna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Brianna says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Eva Keller, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
