__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Eva Keller, Detective?\" Brianna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Brianna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself!\""));
