__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Wong?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Brianna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Molly's bodyguard? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
