__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Eva Keller?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Brianna says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Molly's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Charlotte Gilliam, isn't it?\" Brianna asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know Eva Keller?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Brianna says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Molly's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist, dental hygienist. Hmm,\" Brianna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Charlotte Gilliam? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Molly's dental hygienist. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Eva Keller. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Eva Keller's a positive delight!\" Brianna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Charlotte Gilliam,\" Brianna says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
