__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Brianna says. \"Calls herself 'Natalie McKee', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Natalie McKee' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Natalie McKee's a positive delight!\" Brianna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Brianna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Carl O'Brien? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Molly's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Natalie McKee's a positive delight!\" Brianna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Carl O'Brien,\" Brianna says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Natalie McKee. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Brianna says. \"Did you know she's Molly's lawyer? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Carl O'Brien, isn't it?\" Brianna asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Brianna says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Molly's lawyer, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Leach's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Brianna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Carl O'Brien? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Molly's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
