__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Natalie McKee. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Brianna says. \"Did you know she's Molly's lawyer? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Brianna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Carl O'Brien? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Molly's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Molly?\" Brianna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Quinn Fitzpatrick?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Molly?\" Brianna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Louis Wynn?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Brianna says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Molly's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Molly?\" Brianna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Andre Villarreal?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Brianna says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Molly's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who murdered Molly?\" Brianna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Frederick Leonard?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Molly?\" Brianna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Brendan Ray?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Brianna looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>Autumn sniffs disdainfully. \"Lounge.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"He's a jerk.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"No.\"<p>\"Nothing at all?\"<p>\"Try the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He's a jackass,\" Autumn replies, \"and he's in the Lounge.\"<p>\"Good lord. Don't wear yourself out, saying that many words all at once.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Study.\"<p>\"And that's all you're going to say?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about him.\"<p>\"At this point,\" you growl, \"I would be delighted to get any kind of information at all out of you.\"<p>\"He's in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Met them once.\"<p>\"And?\"<p>\"And they're in the Study if you want to try it yourself.\""));
