__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Know her a little. Her name's Audrey Wong. She doesn't get on my nerves like some people.\"<p>\"Like who?\"<p>She looks up at you, then looks back at her book."));
