__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>Autumn tilts her head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Isaiah Spence.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Autumn turns a page and goes back to her reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>Autumn tilts her head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Isaiah Spence.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Autumn turns a page and goes back to her reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>She looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Isaiah Spence.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, she mutters, \"Probably Isaiah Spence.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>She glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>She looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Isaiah Spence.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Autumn tilts her head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Isaiah Spence.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Autumn turns a page and goes back to her reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's bodyguard?\" Audrey says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Audrey says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's bodyguard?\" Audrey says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's bodyguard?\" Audrey says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Lounge,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Audrey says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Lounge,\" Audrey says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Audrey says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Lounge.\""));
