__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Audrey says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Audrey says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Molly's golf caddy,\" Audrey replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Charlotte Gilliam,\" Audrey says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Molly's golf caddy,\" Audrey replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Charlotte Gilliam,\" Audrey says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
