__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only golf caddy I'm aware of around here is Charlotte Gilliam, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>Audrey shudders. \"She's Molly's golf caddy. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"The only golf caddy I'm aware of around here is Charlotte Gilliam, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"I don't know how Molly got stuck with a golf caddy like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a best friend like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Charlotte Gilliam,\" Audrey says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
