__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Charlotte Gilliam. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Audrey shudders. \"She's Molly's golf caddy. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Charlotte Gilliam. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"I don't know how Molly got stuck with a golf caddy like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a best friend like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"The only golf caddy I'm aware of around here is Charlotte Gilliam, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Attic. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Attic, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Ryan Skinner,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Attic, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Ryan Skinner,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Attic, if you want to talk to them,\" Audrey says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Attic. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Ryan Skinner,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Attic,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Attic, if you want to talk to them,\" Audrey says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Attic. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Attic, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Attic. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Leach's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Attic, if you want to talk to them,\" Audrey says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Molly's chauffeur,\" Audrey says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Brianna Chen,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Molly's chauffeur,\" Audrey says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Audrey mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Brianna Chen. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Brianna Chen, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Molly's chauffeur. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Audrey says. \"Everyone loves Brianna Chen.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Molly's chauffeur,\" Audrey says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Audrey says. \"Everyone loves Brianna Chen.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Audrey mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Brianna Chen. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Brianna Chen is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Audrey says. \"She's Molly's chauffeur. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Audrey mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Brianna Chen. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
