__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Brianna Chen,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Brianna Chen is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Audrey says. \"She's Molly's chauffeur. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Audrey says. \"Everyone loves Brianna Chen.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Sunroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Molly's lawyer?\" Audrey says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Sunroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Audrey says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Sunroom. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Autumn Cotton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Sunroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
