__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Sunroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Audrey says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Sunroom.\""));
