__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Molly's accountant,\" Audrey replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Carl O'Brien. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>Audrey shudders. \"He's Molly's accountant. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Leach's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Carl O'Brien. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"I don't know how Molly got stuck with a accountant like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a best friend like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Carl O'Brien. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
