__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Carl O'Brien,\" Audrey says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Carl O'Brien,\" Audrey says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
