__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Molly's accountant,\" Audrey replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Study. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Audrey mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Study, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Natalie McKee,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Study, if you want to talk to them,\" Audrey says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Natalie McKee,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Study.\""));
