__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Study. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Leach's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Study,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
