__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Audrey asks. \"All right. It was Carl O'Brien. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know who I think killed Molly?\" Audrey asks. \"Yeah, sure. Why not? I might as well tell you, what do I care anyway? It was Carl O'Brien. Take 'em away, it's one less person I'll have to clean up after in this place.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Audrey asks. \"All right. It was Carl O'Brien. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know who I think killed Molly?\" Audrey asks. \"Yeah, sure. Why not? I might as well tell you, what do I care anyway? It was Carl O'Brien. Take 'em away, it's one less person I'll have to clean up after in this place.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know who I think killed Molly?\" Audrey asks. \"Yeah, sure. Why not? I might as well tell you, what do I care anyway? It was Carl O'Brien. Take 'em away, it's one less person I'll have to clean up after in this place.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, is that all you want to know?\" Audrey asks. \"All right. It was Carl O'Brien. Go ahead and make a big show about how you solved the case all by yourself with your big detective skills, I don't expect to receive any credit for the information.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Audrey grumbles. \"It was Carl O'Brien. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know who I think killed Molly?\" Audrey asks. \"Yeah, sure. Why not? I might as well tell you, what do I care anyway? It was Carl O'Brien. Take 'em away, it's one less person I'll have to clean up after in this place.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Eva says. \"I wouldn't associate with Molly's creepy bodyguard if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Isaiah Spence? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Eva exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Eva exclaims. \"Molly's bodyguard? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Eva says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Isaiah Spence, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
