__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from her as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Servants' Quarters, because she has it all wired up with recording devices. She's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Eva exclaims. \"They'rein the Servants' Quarters, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that woman as I possibly can,\" Eva says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Hall Closet!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" she says. \"Molly never even had a golf caddy! Go to the Hall Closet and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Eva declares. \"You can go talk to her in the Hall Closet if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
