__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Natalie McKee? I think she's safe,\" Eva says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Study.\""));
