__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Eva says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Study, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
