__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Carl O'Brien!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Eva says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then she looks around and whispers, \"It was Carl O'Brien!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Eva looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. She writes the name \"Carl O'Brien\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in her mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Carl O'Brien!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Eva says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then she looks around and whispers, \"It was Carl O'Brien!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Carl O'Brien!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Lounge,\" O'Brien says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Servants' Quarters, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Lounge,\" O'Brien says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Servants' Quarters, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" O'Brien says. \"Presently, he is in the Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" O'Brien says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Servants' Quarters, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" O'Brien says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Servants' Quarters, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" O'Brien says. \"Presently, he is in the Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" O'Brien says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Servants' Quarters, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" O'Brien says. \"Presently, he is in the Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" O'Brien says. \"You will find him in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" O'Brien says. \"Presently, he is in the Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Servants' Quarters, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Lounge,\" O'Brien says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" O'Brien says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Servants' Quarters, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Molly Leach's bodyguard,\" O'Brien says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Brianna Chen, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Molly Leach's bodyguard,\" O'Brien says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Brianna Chen to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Charlotte Gilliam. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Molly Leach's bodyguard,\" O'Brien says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Brianna Chen, O'Brien says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Molly Leach's bodyguard,\" O'Brien says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Brianna Chen, O'Brien says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
