__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ryan Skinner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" O'Brien says. \"You will find him in the Attic, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Autumn Cotton, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Library at the moment,\" O'Brien says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" O'Brien says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Brianna Chen. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Library,\" O'Brien says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" O'Brien says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Library at the moment,\" O'Brien says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" O'Brien says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Library,\" O'Brien says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Sunroom is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Library,\" O'Brien says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Brianna Chen?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Library,\" O'Brien says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
