__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Molly Leach's neighbor,\" O'Brien says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" O'Brien says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
