__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" O'Brien says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Hall Closet, you might send my regards.\""));
