__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" O'Brien says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Hall Closet, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Autumn Cotton?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Molly Leach's neighbor,\" O'Brien says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Hall Closet, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Wong?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Molly Leach's golf caddy,\" O'Brien says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Eva Keller, O'Brien says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Audrey Wong?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Molly Leach's golf caddy,\" O'Brien says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Leach's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Eva Keller, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
