__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Natalie McKee. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" O'Brien says. \"You will find her in the Study, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Sunroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" O'Brien says. \"Presently, she is in the Study. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" O'Brien says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Sunroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" O'Brien says. \"Presently, she is in the Study. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" O'Brien says. \"You will find her in the Study, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" O'Brien says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Sunroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Natalie McKee?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Study,\" O'Brien says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" O'Brien says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Sunroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Natalie McKee. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Study,\" O'Brien says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" O'Brien says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Sunroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" O'Brien says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Molly Leach has true relevance, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" O'Brien says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" O'Brien says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" O'Brien says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Isaiah Spence?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Molly's chauffeur? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" McKee scowls. \"Molly really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a bodyguard such as Autumn Cotton.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>McKee snorts derisively. \"Molly's chauffeur is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Autumn Cotton in my presence, Detective!\" McKee demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Molly refers to as her chauffeur,\" McKee says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Autumn Cotton,\" McKee says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Isaiah Spence. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>McKee snorts derisively. \"Molly's chauffeur is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Autumn Cotton in my presence, Detective!\" McKee demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Isaiah Spence?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Molly's chauffeur? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Autumn Cotton,\" McKee says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
