__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Molly refers to as her chauffeur,\" McKee says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Leach's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Autumn Cotton,\" McKee says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Isaiah Spence?\" you ask.<p>McKee snorts derisively. \"Molly's chauffeur is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Autumn Cotton,\" McKee says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Hall Closet,\" McKee sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Foyer at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Hall Closet,\" McKee sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Foyer at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Hall Closet,\" McKee sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Foyer,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" McKee says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Hall Closet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Molly Leach's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" McKee sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Charlotte Gilliam?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Hall Closet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Foyer,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
