__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Eva Keller?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Eva Keller, Detective,\" McKee says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Servants' Quarters, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" McKee says. \"His name is Isaiah Spence. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Eva Keller?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Servants' Quarters and ask her directly.\""));
