__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Autumn Cotton? Why yes,\" she replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Molly's best friend,\" McKee says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Autumn Cotton? Why yes,\" she replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Molly's best friend,\" McKee says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" she says. \"Autumn Cotton. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Carl O'Brien?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Molly's best friend,\" McKee says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Autumn Cotton? Why yes,\" she replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" McKee says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Detective,\" McKee says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Detective,\" McKee says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Sunroom, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Oliver Slater, the victim's boss.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Kitchen you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Your dossier identifies her as Stella Stevenson, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Cantu may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Living Room, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. Your dossier identifies him as Toby Pena, the victim's sibling.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Basement, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Alexa Massey, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" she mutters, holding up her wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Smoking Lounge, a wild-eyed man accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. Your dossier identifies him as Hilary Wallace, the victim's lover.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to him. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The only person in the Dining Room is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Anna Elliott, the victim's cousin.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Marlon'd had a proper regimen like I told him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "Inside the Pantry, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. \"You must be Taylor Martinez, the victim's personal assistant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Marlon Cantu, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "When you enter the Lounge, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Paul Blackburn, the victim's housekeeper.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "Inside the Servants' Quarters, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Addison Chapman, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Marlon Cantu was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Stella Stevenson?\" you ask.<p>Oliver shrugs.<p>\"Nothing at all?\"<p>\"She's in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>Oliver shrugs. \"Try the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stella Stevenson?\" you ask.<p>Oliver shakes his head. \"Don't know her well. She's in the Kitchen, I think.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Only know them a little. They're in the Kitchen.\"<p>\"What do you think of them?\"<p>\"'S'alright.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Stella Stevenson?\" you ask.<p>Oliver shakes his head. \"Don't know her well. She's in the Kitchen, I think.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>Oliver shrugs. \"Try the Kitchen.\""));
