__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>Oliver snorts quietly. \"An ass.\"<p>\"Okay. Can you tell me anything more... concrete?\"<p>\"Marlon's sibling. Garbage.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>Oliver grimaces and turns a page. \"Ugh.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything about them at all?\"<p>\"Name's Toby Pena.\"<p>\"...That's it, huh?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
