__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Know her a little. Her name's Alexa Massey. She doesn't get on my nerves like some people.\"<p>\"Like who?\"<p>He looks up at you, then looks back at his book."));
