__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Marlon Cantu's neighbor,\" Stevenson says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Stevenson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Stevenson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
