__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Oliver Slater. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Marlon Cantu's neighbor,\" Stevenson says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Marlon Cantu's neighbor,\" Stevenson says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Marlon Cantu's neighbor,\" Stevenson says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
