__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Marlon Cantu's neighbor,\" Stevenson says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Stevenson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
