__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Marlon Cantu's college roommate,\" Stevenson says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Paul Blackburn,\" Stevenson says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
