__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Hilary Wallace. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Stevenson says. \"Presently, he is in the Smoking Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Taylor Martinez to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Stevenson says. \"Presently, he is in the Smoking Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Taylor Martinez, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Stevenson says. \"Presently, he is in the Smoking Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Taylor Martinez to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know Cantu's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Taylor Martinez, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Stevenson says. \"You will find him in the Smoking Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Taylor Martinez, Stevenson says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Stevenson says. \"Presently, he is in the Smoking Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
