__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Stevenson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Servants' Quarters, you might send my regards.\""));
