__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Servants' Quarters, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Anna Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Stevenson says. \"You will find her in the Dining Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Stevenson says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Servants' Quarters, I believe.\""));
