__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Taylor Martinez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Pantry,\" Stevenson says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Cantu's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Servants' Quarters is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Stevenson says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
