__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Paul Blackburn. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Lounge,\" Stevenson says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Pantry, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
