__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Stevenson says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Pantry, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Addison Chapman. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Marlon Cantu's housekeeper,\" Stevenson says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Stevenson says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Smoking Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Marlon Cantu's housekeeper,\" Stevenson says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Stevenson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Smoking Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Marlon Cantu's housekeeper,\" Stevenson says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Cantu's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Stevenson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Smoking Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
