__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Smoking Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Marlon Cantu's housekeeper,\" Stevenson says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Stevenson says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Smoking Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Marlon Cantu's housekeeper,\" Stevenson says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Stevenson says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Stevenson says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Stevenson says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Marlon Cantu has true relevance, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Marlon Cantu has true relevance, Detective,\" Stevenson says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Stevenson says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Oliver Slater. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver Slater? Marlon's cousin? He's cool, he's a good person. Don't you be hasslin' him!\" he snarls, jabbing a forefinger at you."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Marlon's boss? She's called Stella Stevenson. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
