__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>Alexa shudders. \"He's Marlon's cousin. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Alexa mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Pantry, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Marlon's cousin,\" Alexa replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Pantry, if you want to talk to them,\" Alexa says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
