__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Stella Stevenson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Stella Stevenson,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Hilary Wallace. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stella Stevenson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Kitchen. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
