__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Stella Stevenson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Kitchen. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"The only dental hygienist I'm aware of around here is Hilary Wallace, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
