__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Living Room,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Alexa says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Pantry. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Living Room,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
