__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Alexa says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Pantry. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Living Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Alexa says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Living Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"Marlon's sibling?\" Alexa says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Living Room, having a grand old time.\""));
