__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Living Room,\" Alexa says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Living Room,\" Alexa says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Alexa mutters. \"I don't know how Marlon got stuck with a cousin like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a neighbor like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"The only lover I'm aware of around here is Paul Blackburn, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
