__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Taylor Martinez?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Marlon's housekeeper,\" Alexa says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Alexa says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Taylor Martinez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Taylor Martinez is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Alexa says. \"She's Marlon's housekeeper. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
