__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper...\" Alexa mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Taylor Martinez. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
