__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Cantu's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Alexa says. \"Everyone loves Taylor Martinez.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
