__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Lounge,\" Alexa says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Taylor Martinez,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Lounge,\" Alexa says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Alexa says. \"Everyone loves Taylor Martinez.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper...\" Alexa mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Taylor Martinez. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Servants' Quarters. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Anna Elliott,\" Alexa says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
