__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"That's Anna Elliott. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
