__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Addison Chapman. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Addison Chapman,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
