__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Servants' Quarters. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Anna Elliott,\" Alexa says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison Chapman?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Addison Chapman,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Anna Elliott. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Marlon, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Marlon Cantu? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Marlon, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Marlon Cantu? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Marlon, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Marlon, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Smoking Lounge, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Hilary exclaims. \"They'rein the Smoking Lounge, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Smoking Lounge, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Marlon never even had a boss! Go to the Servants' Quarters and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Hilary says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Sunroom!\""));
