__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Taylor Martinez? Stay away from her!\" Hilary says. \"I've seen her mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
