__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Hilary says. \"He's Marlon's boss. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Hilary says. \"Her name's Alexa Massey. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Toby Pena?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Marlon's boss,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Alexa Massey is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Hilary says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
