__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Hilary says. \"Her name's Alexa Massey. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Alexa Massey?\" you ask.<p>\"Alexa Massey? I think she's safe,\" Hilary says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Hilary says. \"Her name's Taylor Martinez. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Alexa Massey. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Hilary says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Basement and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Cantu's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Hilary says. \"Her name's Taylor Martinez. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Taylor Martinez?\" Hilary says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Alexa Massey?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Hilary says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Basement, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
