__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Hilary says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Hilary says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Hilary says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Hilary says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Hilary looks around, then whispers, \"It was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Hilary says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Hilary looks around, then whispers, \"It was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know,\" Hilary says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Hilary says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Marlon's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Marlon's sibling,\" Anna says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Anna sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Kitchen. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Anna grunts. \"That's Marlon's sibling -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Anna thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Kitchen if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
