__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Anna says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Smoking Lounge, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Hilary Wallace's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Smoking Lounge if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know Cantu's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Anna says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Living Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Anna says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Smoking Lounge, you can find him there.\""));
