__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Heck if I know, dude,\" she says. \"Like, your guess is as good as mine, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Paul says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Paul says. \"Calls herself 'Addison Chapman', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Addison Chapman' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Oliver Slater. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Paul says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Paul says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Paul says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Addison Chapman, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Paul says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Sunroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Paul says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Addison Chapman, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver Slater is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Paul says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Sunroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver Slater is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Paul says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Sunroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
