__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Hilary Wallace,\" Paul says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Smoking Lounge, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Taylor Martinez,\" Paul says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Hilary Wallace?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Hilary Wallace!\" Paul says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
