__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Paul says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Marlon's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Paul looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Paul says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Marlon's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Paul says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Marlon's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Marlon?\" Paul asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Wallace Reese?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Marlon?\" Paul asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Victor Roth?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Marlon?\" Paul asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Noah Hobbs?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Sunroom right now,\" Addison says, \"but I don't think he did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Oliver Slater. He's pretty funny,\" Addison says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Oliver Slater. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Oliver Slater's great fun!\" Addison says. \"He's in the Sunroom right now. He'll probably share his chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Oliver Slater. He's pretty funny,\" Addison says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Addison says. \"He's in the Sunroom. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Addison says. \"He's in the Sunroom. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Addison says. \"He's in the Sunroom. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Oliver Slater. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" she gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Oliver Slater?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Oliver Slater's great fun!\" Addison says. \"He's in the Sunroom right now. He'll probably share his chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Oliver Slater. He's pretty funny,\" Addison says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
