__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Anna Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Addison says. \"That's the victim's cousin, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Dining Room,\" Addison says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Anna Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Addison says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about her! She's the victim's cousin, and she has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Cantu's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Dining Room,\" Addison says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Anna Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" she says. \"That's Marlon Cantu's cousin. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Addison says. \"They're in the Dining Room, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Anna Elliott?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" she says. \"That's Marlon Cantu's cousin. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Addison says. \"They're in the Dining Room, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Dining Room,\" Addison says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Martinez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Taylor Martinez's great fun!\" Addison says. \"She's in the Pantry right now. She'll probably share her chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Taylor Martinez. She's pretty funny,\" Addison says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Taylor Martinez?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Addison says. \"She's in the Pantry. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Taylor Martinez. She's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think she did the murder, do you?\" she gasps."));
