__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Martinez?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Pantry right now,\" Addison says, \"but I don't think she did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Taylor Martinez?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Addison says. \"She's in the Pantry. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Taylor Martinez?\" Addison says. \"I'd be real surprised if she did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Addison says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Addison nods. \"That's Paul Blackburn. He's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Addison says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
