__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Addison says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's housekeeper, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Marlon Cantu's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Addison says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Addison says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
