__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Paul Blackburn. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Addison says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's housekeeper, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Paul Blackburn. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" she says. \"That's Marlon Cantu's housekeeper. He has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paul Blackburn?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Addison says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Cantu's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's housekeeper, Detective,\" Addison says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Addison says, excitedly pulling out her notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's dental hygienist! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the dental hygienist, Detective!\" Addison says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Addison says, excitedly pulling out her notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's dental hygienist! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the dental hygienist, Detective!\" Addison says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Golly!\" Addison exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>She flips open her notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's dental hygienist, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the dental hygienist, Detective!\" Addison says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Addison exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>She flips open her notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's dental hygienist, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Addison exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>She flips open her notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's dental hygienist, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Bar and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Destiny Cash, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Foyer, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Curly Carter, the victim's cousin.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" he mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Master Bedroom, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. According to the dossier, this is Aldous Nunez, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" he replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Basement, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the dossier, this is Ariana Wilkinson, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Bathroom you find a young man deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping his pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Aldous Le, the victim's boss.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Guest Bedroom, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. \"You must be Mark English, the victim's lover,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing him your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You walk into the Dining Room, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Allison Allen, the victim's chauffeur.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Gabrielle Glover, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Family Room and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the dossier, this is Victor Dominguez, the victim's neighbor.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "Inside the Wine Cellar you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Davey Best, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Gabrielle. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Curly Carter?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Gabrielle's neighbor? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Aldous Nunez in my presence, Detective!\" Cash demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Curly Carter. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Curly Carter?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Gabrielle's neighbor? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Aldous Nunez,\" Cash says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Gabrielle refers to as her neighbor,\" Cash says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Aldous Nunez in my presence, Detective!\" Cash demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Curly Carter?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Gabrielle's neighbor? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Cash scowls. \"Gabrielle really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a cousin such as Aldous Nunez.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Gabrielle refers to as her neighbor,\" Cash says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Aldous Nunez in my presence, Detective!\" Cash demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Curly Carter?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Gabrielle's neighbor? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Aldous Nunez,\" Cash says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>Cash snorts derisively. \"Gabrielle's neighbor is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Cash scowls. \"Gabrielle really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a cousin such as Aldous Nunez.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>Cash snorts derisively. \"Gabrielle's neighbor is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
