__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Cash says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Bathroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Victor Dominguez?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Family Room and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" she says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Victor Dominguez?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Family Room and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Cash says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Bathroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Victor Dominguez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Victor Dominguez, Detective,\" Cash says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Family Room, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Cash says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Bathroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Cash says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Allison Allen in my presence, Detective!\" Cash demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Cash scowls. \"Gabrielle really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a business partner such as Allison Allen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Davey Best. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Cash says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
