__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable woman,\" Cash scowls. \"Gabrielle really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a business partner such as Allison Allen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Allison Allen,\" Cash says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Cash says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Without question, it was Gabrielle's lover,\" she replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Without question, it was Gabrielle's lover,\" she replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Cash sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Gabrielle's lover -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Cash sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Cash sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Gabrielle's lover -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Without question, it was Gabrielle's lover,\" she replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Without question, it was Gabrielle's lover,\" she replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Destiny Cash. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Curly shudders. \"She's Gabrielle's lover. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victor Dominguez. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Gabrielle got stuck with a lover like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a cousin like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Glover's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"The only sibling I'm aware of around here is Victor Dominguez, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Gabrielle's lover,\" Curly replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victor Dominguez. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Gabrielle got stuck with a lover like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a cousin like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Glover's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victor Dominguez. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Gabrielle's lover,\" Curly replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Victor Dominguez,\" Curly says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"The only sibling I'm aware of around here is Victor Dominguez, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>Curly shudders. \"She's Gabrielle's lover. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Victor Dominguez,\" Curly says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
