__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Gabrielle got stuck with a lover like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a cousin like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Best,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Master Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Glover's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Davey Best. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Best,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Master Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Davey Best.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Master Bedroom,\" Curly says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Davey Best. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
