__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Ariana Wilkinson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Gabrielle's neighbor,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Destiny Cash,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Gabrielle's neighbor,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Destiny Cash.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Ariana Wilkinson, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Gabrielle's neighbor. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Ariana Wilkinson is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Curly says. \"She's Gabrielle's neighbor. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Personal assistant...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Destiny Cash. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
