__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"The only boss I'm aware of around here is Mark English, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Gabrielle's neighbor,\" Curly replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"The only boss I'm aware of around here is Mark English, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Gabrielle got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a cousin like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
