__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Guest Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Curly says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Mark English. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Guest Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Curly says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Dining Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Guest Bedroom,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Glover's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's lover?\" Curly says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Guest Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Curly says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Dining Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Guest Bedroom,\" Curly says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's lover?\" Curly says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Dining Room.\""));
