__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Guest Bedroom,\" Curly says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Curly says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Gabrielle's boss,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Aldous Le. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Gabrielle's boss,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Glover's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Aldous Le,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Allison Allen, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Gabrielle's boss. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Glover's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Aldous Le.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
