__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Curly says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Basement. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Gabrielle Glover? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Gabrielle Glover? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Gabrielle, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Gabrielle Glover? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Gabrielle Glover? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Gabrielle Glover? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Aldous snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Bar, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Aldous sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Guest Bedroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Aldous snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Aldous sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Guest Bedroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
