__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Aldous thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Guest Bedroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Destiny Cash,\" Aldous says. \"You'll find her in the Bar, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Aldous says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Guest Bedroom right now.\""));
