__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Aldous snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Foyer, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>Aldous rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. Her name's Destiny Cash. Totally useless. Maybe if she had some muscle mass, she'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
