__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Her?\" Aldous says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in her for. She's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Aldous says. \"Destiny Cash, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
