__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Aldous says. \"Destiny Cash, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Ariana Wilkinson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Ariana Wilkinson's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Basement if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's personal assistant? Oh, you mean Curly Carter,\" Aldous says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Aldous says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Basement, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Glover's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Curly Carter. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Aldous says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Basement, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's personal assistant? Oh, you mean Curly Carter,\" Aldous says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Curly Carter,\" Aldous says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
