__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a personal assistant,\" Aldous snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
