__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Aldous grunts. \"That's Gabrielle's personal assistant -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
