__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Aldous grunts. \"That's Gabrielle's business partner -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Aldous says. \"Victor Dominguez, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
