__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Victor Dominguez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Gabrielle's business partner, I know him,\" Aldous says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Glover's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Aldous says. \"I think they'd be in the Wine Cellar at this time of day.\""));
