__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Wine Cellar.\""));
