__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Aldous snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Aldous thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Dining Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Aldous snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Wine Cellar, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Aldous says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Dining Room right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Aldous snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Wine Cellar, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
