__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Aldous sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Dining Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
