__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Beats me,\" he mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>Aldous shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Beats me,\" he mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, sorry,\" he says. \"No idea. I was blastin' my delts at the time, so I didn't notice anything unusual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>Aldous shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Beats me,\" he mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Aldous shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Beats me,\" he mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Ariana exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Bar and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Ariana says. \"They're in the Foyer, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
