__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Ariana says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Bar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's sibling,\" Ariana says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
