__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Curly Carter!\" Ariana says. \"He's the victim's sibling. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
