__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Aldous Le. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Bathroom -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ariana says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Ariana says. \"That's the victim's boss. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Ariana exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Bathroom and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's boss, Detective,\" Ariana says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
