__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Ariana says. \"That's the victim's neighbor, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
