__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Ariana says. \"They're in the Wine Cellar, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Ariana says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Wine Cellar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's the victim's business partner, Detective,\" Ariana says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Davey Best. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Ariana says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Wine Cellar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Ariana says. \"That's the victim's business partner. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Ariana says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Wine Cellar right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Ariana nods. \"That's Mark English. He's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Wine Cellar -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ariana says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Ariana says. \"That's the victim's business partner. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Ariana nods. \"That's Mark English. He's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Wine Cellar -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Ariana says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Ariana says. \"That's the victim's business partner. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Ariana exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Wine Cellar and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Ariana says. \"That's the victim's business partner. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Davey Best. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Ariana exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Wine Cellar and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Ariana nods. \"That's Mark English. He's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Ariana exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Ariana says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Ariana exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Ariana exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Ariana says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Ariana says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Ariana pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Destiny Cash. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Bar, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Aldous sniffs. \"Her name is Destiny Cash, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aldous says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Bar, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Aldous sniffs. \"Her name is Destiny Cash, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aldous says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Bar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Destiny Cash? Bah,\" Aldous says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aldous says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Bar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
