__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Aldous snorts. \"You're referring to Destiny Cash. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aldous says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Bar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
