__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Aldous sniffs. \"Her name is Destiny Cash, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's cousin and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Curly Carter?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Gabrielle's cousin. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Aldous says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Curly Carter?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Gabrielle's cousin. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Aldous says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Curly Carter and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Aldous says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Curly Carter. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's cousin and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
