__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Curly Carter and I get along rather well,\" Aldous says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Curly Carter?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
