__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Aldous says. \"We get along quite well. He's Gabrielle's cousin, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
