__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Gabrielle's dental hygienist. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Aldous says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
