__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's personal assistant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Ariana Wilkinson?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Aldous says. \"We get along quite well. She's Gabrielle's personal assistant, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Ariana Wilkinson?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Aldous says. \"We get along quite well. She's Gabrielle's personal assistant, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ariana Wilkinson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Aldous says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Ariana Wilkinson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's personal assistant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Ariana Wilkinson and I get along rather well,\" Aldous says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's personal assistant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Ariana Wilkinson?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Aldous says. \"We get along quite well. She's Gabrielle's personal assistant, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aldous says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Guest Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mark English? Bah,\" Aldous says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Aldous says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Guest Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Aldous snorts. \"You're referring to Mark English. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Mark English. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Guest Bedroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Aldous sniffs. \"His name is Mark English, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
