__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Dining Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Allison Allen? Bah,\" Aldous says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Dining Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Allison Allen? Bah,\" Aldous says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Allison Allen. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Aldous says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Dining Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Allison Allen? Bah,\" Aldous says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
