__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Dining Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Victor Dominguez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Aldous smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Family Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Victor Dominguez and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Aldous says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Victor Dominguez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Victor Dominguez is my biggest fan!\" Aldous says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Victor Dominguez and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Aldous says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Victor Dominguez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Aldous says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Victor Dominguez?\" Aldous asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
