__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Aldous smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Wine Cellar -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Aldous says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Davey Best is my biggest fan!\" Aldous says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Aldous says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
