__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the business partner,\" Aldous muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Aldous says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Aldous says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Aldous says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the business partner,\" Aldous muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Aldous says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Ariana Wilkinson'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Aldous says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Ariana Wilkinson,\" he says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Aldous says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Ariana Wilkinson,\" he says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Aldous says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Ariana Wilkinson,\" he says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Aldous muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Ariana Wilkinson.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Gabrielle's sibling?\" Mark says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Gabrielle never even had a sibling! Go to the Bar and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
