__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Curly Carter? I think he's safe,\" Mark says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Mark says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Guest Bedroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Mark says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Guest Bedroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Mark says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Foyer and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
