__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Mark says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Gabrielle's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Mark says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Gabrielle's personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Mark says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Mark looks around, then whispers, \"It was Gabrielle's personal assistant.\""));
