__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" she replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Bathroom and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
