__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man,\" Allison says, shaping her head. \"I know enough to stay the hell out of the Bathroom when they're there, which is like always, and that's all I need to know, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Davey Best is a total downer,\" she replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think he's Gabrielle's boss? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
