__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>Allison shakes her head. \"Man, I got nothing to say about that freak. Try the Bathroom, if you wanna see a real headcase, dude.\""));
