__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" she replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Bathroom and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Allison looks over her shoulder. \"Okay, well, you didn't hear this from me, right dude? But it was Curly Carter. Don't ask me how I know, but like, scout's honor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Allison says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Curly Carter. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Curly Carter. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Curly Carter. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Allison says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Curly Carter. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>Allison looks over her shoulder. \"Okay, well, you didn't hear this from me, right dude? But it was Curly Carter. Don't ask me how I know, but like, scout's honor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Allison looks over her shoulder. \"Okay, well, you didn't hear this from me, right dude? But it was Curly Carter. Don't ask me how I know, but like, scout's honor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Allison says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Curly Carter. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Destiny Cash. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Destiny Cash. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Victor says. \"Did you know she's Gabrielle's personal assistant? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Victor says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Victor says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Gabrielle's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Victor says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Victor says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Gabrielle's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Victor says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Destiny Cash. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Victor says. \"Did you know she's Gabrielle's personal assistant? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Destiny Cash. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Victor says. \"Did you know she's Gabrielle's personal assistant? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Victor says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Destiny Cash's a positive delight!\" Victor says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Victor says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Victor says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Master Bedroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Victor says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Gabrielle's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Destiny Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Destiny Cash's a positive delight!\" Victor says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Victor says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Victor says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Foyer, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Allison Allen, isn't it?\" Victor asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Curly Carter. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Curly Carter!\" Victor says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Victor says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Foyer, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Allison Allen, isn't it?\" Victor asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Curly Carter,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Foyer, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Allison Allen,\" Victor says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Victor says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Foyer, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Cousin, cousin. Hmm,\" Victor ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Allison Allen? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Gabrielle's cousin. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Carter?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Curly Carter,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Foyer, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
