__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Aldous Nunez?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Victor says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Gabrielle's chauffeur, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Victor says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Guest Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Victor says. \"She's Gabrielle's dental hygienist, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Dining Room, Detective,\" Victor says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Ariana Wilkinson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist?\" Victor says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Dining Room, Detective,\" Victor says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist?\" Victor says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Victor says as sternly as he can muster, \"Gabrielle's personal assistant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Dining Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Victor muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Victor says as sternly as he can muster, \"Gabrielle's personal assistant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Dining Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist?\" Victor says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
