__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Victor says as sternly as he can muster, \"Gabrielle's personal assistant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Dining Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist?\" Victor says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Dining Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Victor declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Victor muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Gabrielle's dental hygienist?\" Victor says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Dining Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Victor declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Victor says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Bathroom, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Boss, boss. Hmm,\" Victor ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Aldous Nunez? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Gabrielle's boss. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Victor says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Bathroom, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Boss, boss. Hmm,\" Victor ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Aldous Nunez? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Gabrielle's boss. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Aldous Le!\" Victor says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Aldous Nunez, isn't it?\" Victor asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Aldous Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Aldous Le,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Bathroom, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Aldous Nunez,\" Victor says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
