__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Allison Allen. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Victor says. \"Did you know she's Gabrielle's boss? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Victor says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Foyer, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Victor says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Gabrielle's boss, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Victor says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Foyer and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Allen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Allison Allen's a positive delight!\" Victor says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
