__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Victor says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Wine Cellar, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Business partner, business partner. Hmm,\" Victor ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Allison Allen? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Gabrielle's business partner. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Davey Best,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Wine Cellar, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Allison Allen, isn't it?\" Victor asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Davey Best,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Wine Cellar, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Allison Allen, isn't it?\" Victor asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Davey Best,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Wine Cellar, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner, business partner. Hmm,\" Victor ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Allison Allen? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Gabrielle's business partner. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Davey Best!\" Victor says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Allison Allen,\" Victor says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Glover's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner, business partner. Hmm,\" Victor ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Allison Allen? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Gabrielle's business partner. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Best?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Davey Best,\" Victor says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Wine Cellar, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Victor says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Gabrielle's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Victor says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Gabrielle's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Victor says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Gabrielle's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Victor looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Victor says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Gabrielle's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Gabrielle?\" Victor asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Abe Tyler?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Gabrielle?\" Victor asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Stanley Swanson?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Victor looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
