__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"D'you mean Destiny Cash?\" Davey asks. \"She's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Destiny Cash.\""));
