__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her,\" Davey says. \"Don't care much for her, though. She's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
