__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Wilkinson?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- she's not really my cup of tea. She's in the Basement, though, if you wanna meet her yourself.\""));
