__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him,\" Davey says. \"Don't care much for him, though. He's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Davey says. \"Try the Guest Bedroom, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him,\" Davey says. \"Don't care much for him, though. He's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh, yeah, I know Mark English,\" Davey says. \"He's in the Guest Bedroom. If he says anything about me, though, it's a total lie.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, I got no use for them,\" Davey says. \"Nothin' but trouble. Probably hangin' around the Guest Bedroom, if you've got time to waste.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mark English?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- he's not really my cup of tea. He's in the Guest Bedroom, though, if you wanna meet him yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Gabrielle Glover's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Davey muses. \"I think I know who you mean, Detective, but I dunno them real well. I think they're in the Guest Bedroom, though.\""));
