__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Davey says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Gabrielle like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Davey says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Gabrielle like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Davey says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Gabrielle like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Family Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Roy Morales, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing him your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Breakfast Nook is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Clarence Parker, the victim's cousin.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Hall Closet and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. According to the dossier, this is Gustav Montoya, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Dining Room, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Harold Munoz, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Bar is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies her as Mackenzie Oliver, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Mackenzie grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Guest Bedroom, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Clancy Travis, the victim's housekeeper.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Pantry and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Ariana Melendez, the victim's butler.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You walk into the Smoking Lounge and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. Your dossier identifies him as Bill Bishop, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Alexandra Foreman's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "In the Ballroom you find a pale, drably-dressed woman slouched on a small chair. She looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. Your dossier identifies her as Alexis Franks, the victim's boss.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Roy says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Breakfast Nook!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Clancy Travis? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Roy exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Family Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"No! No, never!\" Roy says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Clancy Travis, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
