__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Roy says, alarmed. \"She's one of them! Her name's Mackenzie Oliver, she's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from her as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Family Room, because she has it all wired up with recording devices. She's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mackenzie Oliver? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Roy exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that woman as I possibly can,\" Roy says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Pantry!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mackenzie Oliver? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Roy exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
