__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Roy says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Smoking Lounge and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Clarence Parker?\" Roy says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Roy says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Smoking Lounge, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Clarence Parker is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Roy says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"Bill Bishop? I think he's safe,\" Roy says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
