__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Family Room,\" Parker says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Foreman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Roy Morales, Parker says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Roy Morales to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Parker says. \"Presently, he is in the Family Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Roy Morales, Detective,\" Parker says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Gustav Montoya?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Alexandra Foreman's college roommate,\" Parker says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Hall Closet, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Parker says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Gustav Montoya?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Alexandra Foreman's college roommate,\" Parker says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Parker says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Gustav Montoya. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Alexandra Foreman's college roommate,\" Parker says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Parker says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Hall Closet, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Parker says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gustav Montoya?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Alexandra Foreman's college roommate,\" Parker says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Parker says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Gustav Montoya?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Alexandra Foreman's college roommate,\" Parker says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
