__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Harold Munoz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Alexandra Foreman's child,\" Parker says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Harold Munoz, Detective,\" Parker says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Harold Munoz?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Alexandra Foreman's child,\" Parker says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Harold Munoz to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Munoz?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Alexandra Foreman's child,\" Parker says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Harold Munoz, Parker says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Harold Munoz?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Alexandra Foreman's child,\" Parker says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
