__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Mackenzie Oliver. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Alexandra Foreman's sibling, I believe,\" Parker says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Mackenzie Oliver,\" Parker says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
