__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mackenzie Oliver?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Alexandra Foreman's sibling, I believe,\" Parker says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Mackenzie Oliver, I presume,\" Parker says. \"She is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mackenzie Oliver?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Alexandra Foreman's sibling,\" Parker says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Mackenzie Oliver,\" Parker says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
