__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clancy Travis?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Parker says. \"Presently, he is in the Guest Bedroom. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Foreman's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Guest Bedroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Parker says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Clancy Travis. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Guest Bedroom,\" Parker says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Parker says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Guest Bedroom, I believe.\""));
