__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Parker says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Guest Bedroom, you might send my regards.\""));
