__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Smoking Lounge,\" Parker says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Parker says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Smoking Lounge is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Smoking Lounge at the moment,\" Parker says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Parker says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Smoking Lounge is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Smoking Lounge,\" Parker says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Parker says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Parker says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
