__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Roy Morales, Detective,\" Parker says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Parker says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Roy Morales.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Parker says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Roy Morales.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Parker asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Roy Morales.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Parker asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Roy Morales.\""));
