__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Roy Morales.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Roy Morales.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Harold tilts his head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Roy Morales.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Harold turns a page and goes back to his reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Roy Morales.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Harold tilts his head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Roy Morales.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Harold turns a page and goes back to his reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Roy Morales's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Family Room if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Mackenzie says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Guest Bedroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Mackenzie says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Family Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Mackenzie says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Guest Bedroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Mackenzie says. \"I think they'd be in the Guest Bedroom at this time of day.\""));
