__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Mackenzie says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Family Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Guest Bedroom.\""));
