__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Alexandra's best friend,\" Mackenzie says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Mackenzie says. \"Clancy Travis, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
