__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Mackenzie grunts. \"That's Alexandra's best friend -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>Mackenzie rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Clancy Travis. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
