__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a best friend,\" Mackenzie snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
