__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Gustav Montoya?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Mackenzie snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Hall Closet, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Mackenzie says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Dining Room right now.\""));
