__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Clancy Travis?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Mackenzie snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Guest Bedroom, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Foreman's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>Mackenzie rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Roy Morales. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>Mackenzie rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Roy Morales. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Mackenzie says. \"Roy Morales, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Ariana Melendez's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Pantry if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know Foreman's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Mackenzie says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Pantry, if you're looking for her.\""));
