__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Alexis Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Alexis Franks!\" Mackenzie says. \"That's Alexandra's butler. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
