__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Mackenzie says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Clancy Travis. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Mackenzie says. I know who it was. It was Clancy Travis. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Mackenzie says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Clancy Travis. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh ho!\" Mackenzie exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Clancy Travis. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
