__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Mackenzie says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Clancy Travis. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
