__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh ho!\" Mackenzie exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Clancy Travis. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Roy Morales. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Clancy says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Family Room right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's best friend, Detective,\" Clancy says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Foreman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Clancy says. \"That's the victim's best friend. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Family Room -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Clancy says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
