__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Roy Morales. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Clancy exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Family Room and see for yourself!\""));
