__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Clancy exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Breakfast Nook and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Clancy says. \"That's the victim's cousin. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
