__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Clancy pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
