__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Gustav Montoya?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Gustav Montoya, Detective,\" Bishop says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Hall Closet, if you require more information than that.\""));
