__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"I know him, yes,\" he says. \"Clancy Travis. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Ariana Melendez, Detective,\" Bishop says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Pantry, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Clancy Travis? Why yes,\" he replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Pantry and ask her directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Clancy Travis? Why yes,\" he replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
