__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know Foreman's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him, yes,\" he says. \"Clancy Travis. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
