__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Clancy Travis? Why yes,\" he replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Alexis Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Ballroom,\" Bishop sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Clarence Parker,\" Bishop says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Alexis Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Bishop says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Clarence Parker,\" Bishop says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Alexis Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Bishop says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Bishop scowls. \"Alexandra really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a boss such as Clarence Parker.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I presume you are asking about Clarence Parker,\" Bishop says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Alexis Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Bishop scowls. \"Alexandra really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a boss such as Clarence Parker.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Alexis Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Bishop says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Foreman's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Bishop scowls. \"Alexandra really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a boss such as Clarence Parker.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Clarence Parker in my presence, Detective!\" Bishop demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Bishop scowls. \"Alexandra really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a boss such as Clarence Parker.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Alexis Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Foreman's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Clarence Parker in my presence, Detective!\" Bishop demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Without question, it was Alexandra's butler,\" he replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Bishop sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Alexandra's butler -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Bishop sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Bishop sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Alexandra's butler -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Without question, it was Alexandra's butler,\" he replies. <p>\"How do you know that?\" you ask. <p>\"Are you serious, Detective? Have you <i>met</i> them?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Bishop sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Bishop sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Alexandra's butler -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Roy Morales. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Roy Morales,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Roy Morales,\" Alexis says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Family Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"The only best friend I'm aware of around here is Roy Morales, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Roy Morales,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"The only best friend I'm aware of around here is Roy Morales, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Family Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"The only best friend I'm aware of around here is Roy Morales, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only best friend I'm aware of around here is Roy Morales, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Family Room. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Roy Morales. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Roy Morales?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Roy Morales,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Breakfast Nook. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Breakfast Nook,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Clarence Parker,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Breakfast Nook, if you want to talk to them,\" Alexis says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clarence Parker?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Breakfast Nook. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
