__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Alexis mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
