__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Alexis says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Harold Munoz?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Dining Room. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
