__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Foreman's child?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Dining Room,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
