__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Alexis mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Harold Munoz?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Harold Munoz,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Alexis says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Alexis says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mackenzie Oliver?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Bar,\" Alexis says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Alexis says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mackenzie Oliver?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Bar, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Alexandra's sibling?\" Alexis says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Mackenzie Oliver. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Bar,\" Alexis says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
