__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mackenzie Oliver?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Bar,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
