__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Clancy Travis?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Alexandra's housekeeper,\" Alexis replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"The only housekeeper I'm aware of around here is Clancy Travis, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Travis?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Alexis mutters. \"I don't know how Alexandra got stuck with a housekeeper like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a boss like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Clancy Travis,\" Alexis says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clancy Travis?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Alexandra's housekeeper,\" Alexis replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Clancy Travis. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
