__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Ariana Melendez is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Alexis says. \"She's Alexandra's butler. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler...\" Alexis mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Ariana Melendez. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ariana Melendez?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Alexandra's butler,\" Alexis says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alexandra Foreman's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler...\" Alexis mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Ariana Melendez. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
