__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Alexis says. \"Everyone loves Ariana Melendez.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
