__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ariana Melendez,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
