__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Bill Bishop, yeah,\" she says. \"He's Alexandra's business partner. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
