__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Bill Bishop, yeah,\" she says. \"He's Alexandra's business partner. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Alexis says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Alexandra's business partner,\" Alexis says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Foreman's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Alexis says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Bill Bishop is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Alexis says. \"He's Alexandra's business partner. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Alexandra's business partner?\" Alexis says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Foreman's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Alexis says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Smoking Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Bill Bishop?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Alexandra's business partner,\" Alexis says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Alexandra Foreman? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Alexandra Foreman? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Alexandra, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Alexandra, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Alexandra, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Wine Cellar, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. According to the dossier, this is Emily Robertson, the victim's ex-lover.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" she mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" she says, rolling her eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Library is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Grant Aguilar, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Mathis may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Bathroom you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Autumn Houston, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Autumn sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "In the Servants' Quarters, you find a large and powerfully-muscled man doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Wallace Walker, the victim's accountant.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" he replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Game Room you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. \"You must be Lonnie Ratliff, the victim's butler,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Lonnie Ratliff. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Kitchen, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. Your dossier identifies him as Clayton Dyer, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Clayton. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You walk into the Laundry Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. According to the dossier, this is Duncan Hartman, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Pantry, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. Your dossier identifies her as Nevaeh Brown, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Foyer, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Victor Perez, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Jasmine's chauffeur? He's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, you mean Lonnie Ratliff, right? I don't know anything about him except that he's a real ass and I don't want anything to do with him. Does that help?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Jasmine's chauffeur? He's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
