__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Emily says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Wallace Walker. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Wallace Walker. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Wallace Walker. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Emily says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
