__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Wallace Walker. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's business partner,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Wine Cellar, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Jasmine Mathis's business partner,\" Aguilar says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Wine Cellar, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's business partner,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Aguilar says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Wine Cellar, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's business partner,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Aguilar says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Wine Cellar, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Jasmine Mathis's business partner,\" Aguilar says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
