__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Wallace Walker, Aguilar says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
