__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Pantry,\" Aguilar says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Pantry,\" Aguilar says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Pantry,\" Aguilar says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Aguilar says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Pantry at the moment,\" Aguilar says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Mathis's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
