__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Pantry,\" Aguilar says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Pantry, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Aguilar says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Pantry, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Aguilar says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Pantry, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"If you seek them out in the Pantry, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Pantry, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Aguilar says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Pantry, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
