__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Jasmine Mathis's ex-lover,\" Aguilar says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Pantry, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Jasmine Mathis has true relevance, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Aguilar says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Jasmine Mathis has true relevance, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Jasmine Mathis has true relevance, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Aguilar says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Aguilar says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Aguilar says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Autumn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Wine Cellar -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Kitchen at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Emily Robertson is my biggest fan!\" Autumn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's ex-lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the ex-lover,\" Autumn muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Kitchen, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Emily Robertson is my biggest fan!\" Autumn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Autumn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's ex-lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Kitchen at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Autumn says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Mathis's ex-lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the ex-lover,\" Autumn muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Kitchen, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Emily Robertson is my biggest fan!\" Autumn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had an ex-lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Autumn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Autumn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Wine Cellar -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Emily Robertson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Emily Robertson is my biggest fan!\" Autumn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-lover? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Autumn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Autumn says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Library, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Mathis's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Autumn sniffs. \"Her name is Nevaeh Brown, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Library, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Autumn sniffs. \"Her name is Nevaeh Brown, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Library, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Nevaeh Brown? Bah,\" Autumn says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Library, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Autumn snorts. \"You're referring to Nevaeh Brown. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Autumn says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Library, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Autumn sniffs. \"Her name is Nevaeh Brown, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
