__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Nevaeh Brown? Bah,\" Autumn says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Wallace Walker. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Jasmine's butler, and an absolute philistine,\" Autumn scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Autumn snorts. \"You're referring to Grant Aguilar. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Jasmine's butler, and an absolute philistine,\" Autumn scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Jasmine's butler, and an absolute philistine,\" Autumn scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Autumn sniffs. \"His name is Grant Aguilar, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Autumn sniffs. \"His name is Grant Aguilar, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Autumn says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Autumn snorts. \"You're referring to Grant Aguilar. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Wallace Walker. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Autumn asks. \"Oh -- you mean Jasmine's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Wallace Walker. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Autumn says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Autumn sniffs. \"His name is Grant Aguilar, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Autumn asks. \"Oh -- you mean Jasmine's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Autumn asks. \"Oh -- you mean Jasmine's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Lonnie Ratliff?\" you ask.<p>\"Jasmine's child and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Library at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Lonnie Ratliff?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Autumn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Jasmine's child, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the butler,\" Autumn muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Library, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Lonnie Ratliff?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Autumn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Jasmine's child, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know Mathis's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Autumn says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Library.\""));
