__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Clayton Dyer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Autumn says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Pantry,\" Autumn says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Autumn asks. \"Oh -- you mean Jasmine's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Pantry,\" Autumn says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Jasmine's butler, and an absolute philistine,\" Autumn scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Autumn snorts. \"Their presence in the Pantry is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
