__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Jasmine's ex-lover. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Autumn says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Grant Aguilar and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Autumn says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Autumn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Jasmine's ex-lover, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Grant Aguilar and I get along rather well,\" Autumn says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Grant Aguilar?\" Autumn asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Autumn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Jasmine's ex-lover, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
