__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Nevaeh Brown is my biggest fan!\" Autumn says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Wallace Walker?\" Autumn asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Autumn smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Pantry -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Wallace Walker?\" Autumn asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
