__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"Jasmine's child and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Victor Perez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Autumn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Jasmine's child, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Autumn says. \"We get along quite well. He's Jasmine's child, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Emily Robertson?\" Autumn asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Autumn says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Jasmine?\" Autumn asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Jasmine?\" Autumn asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Jasmine?\" Autumn asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Jasmine?\" Autumn asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Autumn says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
