__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Jasmine's ex-lover,\" Wallace says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Wallace says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Wine Cellar if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Jasmine's ex-lover, I know her,\" Wallace says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had an ex-lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Wine Cellar.\""));
