__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Emily Robertson!\" Wallace says. \"That's Jasmine's ex-lover. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
