__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Emily Robertson!\" Wallace says. \"That's Jasmine's ex-lover. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wallace grunts. \"That's Jasmine's child -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Wallace thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Library if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a child,\" Wallace snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Wallace thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Library if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
