__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Wallace says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Library right now.\""));
