__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Clayton Dyer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Clayton Dyer's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Kitchen if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Clayton Dyer,\" Wallace says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Wallace says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Kitchen, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Clayton Dyer,\" Wallace says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
