__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now,\" Lonnie says, \"I wouldn't wanna be tellin' tales outta school, Detective. I haven't got any evidence for this, y'unnerstand. But if ya ask me -- which you did -- I'd say it was Jasmine's college roommate.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well Detective, you know what they always say,\" he says with a twinkle in his eye. \"The college roommate did it!\"<p>\"...Is that what they always say?\"<p>\"Something like that, yeah. Pretty sure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well Detective, you know what they always say,\" he says with a twinkle in his eye. \"The college roommate did it!\"<p>\"...Is that what they always say?\"<p>\"Something like that, yeah. Pretty sure.\""));
