__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"I met him once or twice,\" Clayton says. \"He seemed like real bad news to me. He's in the Library if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You mean Grant Aguilar?\" Clayton asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
