__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Clayton says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Grant Aguilar. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
