__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Wallace Walker is a total downer,\" he replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think he's Jasmine's accountant? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man,\" Clayton says, shaping his head. \"I know enough to stay the hell out of the Servants' Quarters when they're there, which is like always, and that's all I need to know, right?\""));
