__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-lover? you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Duncan exclaims. \"They'rein the Laundry Room, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Jasmine's cousin?\" Duncan says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's ex-lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Duncan says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Game Room isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
