__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"Grant Aguilar? I think he's safe,\" Duncan says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Duncan says. \"His name's Clayton Dyer. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
