__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Duncan says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Library and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
