__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Duncan says. \"I wouldn't associate with Jasmine's creepy ex-lover if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Nevaeh Brown? I think she's safe,\" Duncan says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Library, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Duncan says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Pantry, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Duncan says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Laundry Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Nevaeh Brown?\" you ask.<p>\"Nevaeh Brown? I think she's safe,\" Duncan says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Pantry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Duncan says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Laundry Room, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
