__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Victor Perez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Duncan declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Foyer if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nevaeh Brown? Stay away from her!\" Duncan says. \"I've seen her mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Victor Perez?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Laundry Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Nevaeh Brown? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Duncan exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
