__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Wine Cellar. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-lover?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Emily Robertson,\" Victor says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Emily Robertson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mathis's ex-lover?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Emily Robertson,\" Victor says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"The only ex-lover I'm aware of around here is Emily Robertson, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Emily Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Wine Cellar. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Emily Robertson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Wine Cellar. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's ex-lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Emily Robertson. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Emily Robertson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Emily Robertson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-lover?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Emily Robertson. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
