__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had an ex-lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Emily Robertson,\" Victor says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had an ex-lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only ex-lover I'm aware of around here is Emily Robertson, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Grant Aguilar, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Jasmine's child. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mathis's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Victor says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Library. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Jasmine's child,\" Victor says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Victor says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Grant Aguilar. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Grant Aguilar, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Jasmine's child. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Jasmine's child?\" Victor says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Jasmine's child,\" Victor says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
