__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Victor says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Grant Aguilar?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Grant Aguilar is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Victor says. \"He's Jasmine's child. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Victor says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
