__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Victor says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Library. Does that count?\""));
