__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Victor mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Bathroom, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
