__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Wallace Walker?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victor mutters. \"I don't know how Jasmine got stuck with a accountant like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a dental hygienist like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
