__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Victor says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Kitchen. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Kitchen,\" Victor says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Jasmine's chauffeur?\" Victor says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Clayton Dyer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Kitchen, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Jasmine's chauffeur?\" Victor says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Jasmine's chauffeur?\" Victor says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Kitchen,\" Victor says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mathis's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Victor says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Jasmine's chauffeur?\" Victor says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Clayton Dyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Kitchen, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Victor says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>Victor shudders. \"He's Jasmine's business partner. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"The only business partner I'm aware of around here is Duncan Hartman, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victor mutters. \"I don't know how Jasmine got stuck with a business partner like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a dental hygienist like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Duncan Hartman,\" Victor says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victor mutters. \"I don't know how Jasmine got stuck with a business partner like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a dental hygienist like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"The only business partner I'm aware of around here is Duncan Hartman, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Jasmine Mathis's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"The only business partner I'm aware of around here is Duncan Hartman, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Duncan Hartman?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Jasmine's business partner,\" Victor replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Duncan Hartman. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Duncan Hartman. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victor mutters. \"I don't know how Jasmine got stuck with a business partner like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a dental hygienist like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
