__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Nevaeh Brown,\" Victor says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Jasmine's butler,\" Victor says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jasmine's butler,\" Victor says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Victor says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Jasmine's butler killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Victor says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Jasmine's butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Victor says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Jasmine's butler killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well,\" Victor says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Jasmine's butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jasmine's butler,\" Victor says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jasmine's butler,\" Victor says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. \"You must be Johnny Dejesus, the victim's gardener,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Oliver Chase,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Basement, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. According to the dossier, this is Curly Mayer, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Smoking Lounge and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Randy Browning, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Lounge and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Genesis Stark, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Oliver Chase's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Billiard Room, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. Your dossier identifies her as Victoria Chavez, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" she mutters, holding up her wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Ballroom, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Cal Ortiz, the victim's chauffeur.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Oliver Chase, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "The only person in the Servants' Quarters is a hugely-muscled man, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies him as Todd Cleveland, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" he replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Master Bedroom, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. \"You must be Douglas Martin, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "The only person in the Wine Cellar is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Isaiah Mejia, the victim's lover.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Chase may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Curly Mayer,\" Johnny says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Basement, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Johnny says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Master Bedroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Johnny says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Curly Mayer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chase's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Johnny says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Curly Mayer,\" Johnny says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Basement, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
