__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Curly Mayer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Curly Mayer,\" Johnny says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Basement, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Johnny says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Master Bedroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Johnny says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Master Bedroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Randy Browning!\" Johnny says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Johnny says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Servants' Quarters, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Randy Browning!\" Johnny says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
