__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Genesis Stark's a positive delight!\" Johnny says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
