__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Genesis Stark. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Genesis Stark. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Johnny says. \"Did you know she's Oliver's chauffeur? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
