__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Johnny says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Oliver's chauffeur, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
