__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Victoria Chavez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Johnny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Ballroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Johnny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Johnny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Ballroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Johnny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Ballroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Johnny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Johnny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Ballroom, Detective,\" Johnny says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Johnny says. \"She's Oliver's dental hygienist, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chase's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Ballroom, Detective,\" Johnny says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Ballroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Johnny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Johnny says. \"She's Oliver's dental hygienist, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Johnny says as sternly as he can muster, \"Oliver's lawyer is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Ballroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's dental hygienist?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Ballroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Johnny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Cal Ortiz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Johnny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Ballroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Calls herself 'Victoria Chavez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Victoria Chavez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Cal Ortiz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Cal Ortiz is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Johnny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Ballroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Calls herself 'Victoria Chavez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Victoria Chavez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Cal Ortiz is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Johnny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Ballroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Victoria Chavez, Detective?\" Johnny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Cal Ortiz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Johnny says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Ballroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Johnny says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Ballroom, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Calls herself 'Victoria Chavez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Victoria Chavez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Johnny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Ballroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Victoria Chavez, Detective?\" Johnny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Johnny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Victoria Chavez, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Cal Ortiz is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Johnny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Ballroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Johnny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Victoria Chavez, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Cal Ortiz is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Johnny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Ballroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Victoria Chavez, Detective?\" Johnny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Todd Cleveland?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Todd Cleveland,\" Johnny says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Servants' Quarters, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Isaiah Mejia,\" Johnny says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Cleveland?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Todd Cleveland,\" Johnny says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Servants' Quarters, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chase's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Personal assistant, personal assistant. Hmm,\" Johnny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Isaiah Mejia? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Oliver's personal assistant. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
