__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Cleveland?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Servants' Quarters, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
