__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Personal assistant, personal assistant. Hmm,\" Johnny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Isaiah Mejia? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Oliver's personal assistant. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Douglas Martin. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Johnny says. \"Did you know he's Oliver's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Johnny says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Billiard Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Douglas Martin. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Johnny says. \"Did you know he's Oliver's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Johnny says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Billiard Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Douglas Martin. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Johnny says. \"Did you know he's Oliver's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chase's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Johnny says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Billiard Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Johnny says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Billiard Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Douglas Martin's a positive delight!\" Johnny says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Douglas Martin's a positive delight!\" Johnny says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
