__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Johnny says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Billiard Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Douglas Martin. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Johnny says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Oliver's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Douglas Martin's a positive delight!\" Johnny says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Johnny says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Billiard Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Isaiah Mejia. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's chauffeur?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Todd Cleveland, Detective?\" Johnny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's chauffeur?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Johnny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Todd Cleveland, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Oliver's chauffeur?\" Johnny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Johnny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Todd Cleveland, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Johnny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Oliver's chauffeur? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
