__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Isaiah Mejia. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Johnny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Oliver's chauffeur? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Calls himself 'Todd Cleveland', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Todd Cleveland' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Johnny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Oliver's chauffeur? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Todd Cleveland, Detective?\" Johnny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Oliver's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Johnny looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Oliver?\" Johnny asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Andy Atkins?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Oliver's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Johnny looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Johnny says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Oliver's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Oliver?\" Johnny asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Leonard Alvarez?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Johnny Dejesus, that's Oliver's chauffeur. I ain't got a single good word to say about that sleazy friggin' weasel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm... Yeah, I think I know who you mean, but I can't think of their name. Never cared to know. They're probably in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Johnny Dejesus? That jerk? All I know is he's Oliver's chauffeur, and that's all I wanna know about that jerk.\""));
