__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Randy Browning is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Smoking Lounge and ask he yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's dental hygienist? She's called Genesis Stark. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>Curly scowls. \"What, now you're after Randy Browning? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! He's in the Smoking Lounge, you can go talk to him yourself!\""));
