__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Isaiah Mejia. He's Oliver's cousin. Or was, I guess. He's okay. I never had any trouble with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Isaiah Mejia? Oliver's cousin? He's cool, he's a good person. Don't you be hasslin' him!\" he snarls, jabbing a forefinger at you."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's lover? He's called Douglas Martin. He seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" he sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Johnny Dejesus. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's gardener and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Johnny Dejesus?\" Randy asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Oliver's gardener. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Randy says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Johnny Dejesus and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Randy says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Chase's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Johnny Dejesus and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Randy says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's gardener and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Johnny Dejesus and I get along rather well,\" Randy says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's gardener and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
