__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Randy says. \"We get along quite well. He's Oliver's gardener, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
