__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Oliver's business partner, and an absolute philistine,\" Randy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Genesis Stark? Bah,\" Randy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Randy says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The business partner. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Chase's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Genesis Stark? Bah,\" Randy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Randy says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The business partner. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Randy snorts. \"You're referring to Genesis Stark. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Randy says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The business partner. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
