__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Randy sniffs. \"Her name is Genesis Stark, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Genesis Stark. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Oliver's business partner, and an absolute philistine,\" Randy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
