__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Chase's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Randy sniffs. \"Her name is Genesis Stark, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Randy asks. \"Oh -- you mean Oliver's business partner. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Randy sniffs. \"Her name is Genesis Stark, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Victoria Chavez is my biggest fan!\" Randy says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Randy says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Victoria Chavez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Randy says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the lawyer,\" Randy muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Billiard Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Victoria Chavez is my biggest fan!\" Randy says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Billiard Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Randy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Billiard Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Randy says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Billiard Room.\""));
