__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Randy says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Randy says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The chauffeur. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Randy snorts. \"You're referring to Cal Ortiz. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Cal Ortiz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Oliver's chauffeur, and an absolute philistine,\" Randy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Chase's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Cal Ortiz? Bah,\" Randy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Randy says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The chauffeur. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Randy sniffs. \"His name is Cal Ortiz, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Randy asks. \"Oh -- you mean Oliver's chauffeur. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
