__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Todd Cleveland. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Randy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Servants' Quarters -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, the personal assistant,\" Randy muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Servants' Quarters, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Todd Cleveland?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Randy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Servants' Quarters -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
