__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Todd Cleveland. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Randy says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
