__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Servants' Quarters at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the personal assistant,\" Randy muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Servants' Quarters, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
