__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Randy says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
