__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Cleveland?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Todd Cleveland is my biggest fan!\" Randy says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Servants' Quarters at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Randy says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Randy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Master Bedroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Chase's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Douglas Martin and I get along rather well,\" Randy says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
