__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Randy says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Douglas Martin and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Randy says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Douglas Martin and I get along rather well,\" Randy says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
