__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Chase's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Douglas Martin?\" Randy asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Douglas Martin and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Randy says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Randy says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
