__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Oliver's dental hygienist,\" Stark says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured man. He may even make something of himself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Stark says. \"His name is Randy Browning. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
