__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"Randy Browning?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Oliver's personal assistant? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Servants' Quarters at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>Stark snorts derisively. \"Oliver's personal assistant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
