__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know Chase's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Smoking Lounge at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know Todd Cleveland?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Stark says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Douglas Martin, Detective,\" Stark says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Master Bedroom, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" she says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Stark says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Stark says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Ballroom?\""));
