__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Master Bedroom and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Stark says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Ballroom?\""));
