__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" she says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Chase's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Stark says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Ballroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Stark says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Stark sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Wine Cellar,\" Stark sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Stark sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Stark sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Guest Bedroom,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Wine Cellar,\" Stark sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
