__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Chase's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Victoria says. \"Everyone loves Johnny Dejesus.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Johnny Dejesus is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Victoria says. \"He's Oliver's gardener. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Gardener...\" Victoria mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Johnny Dejesus. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"I don't know how Oliver got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Victoria says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Curly Mayer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"I don't know how Oliver got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Chase's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Basement,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Oliver's neighbor,\" Victoria replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Victoria says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"I don't know how Oliver got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Basement,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"I don't know how Oliver got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Victoria says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"I don't know how Oliver got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Basement, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>Victoria shudders. \"He's Oliver's neighbor. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Basement,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Smoking Lounge,\" Victoria says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Victoria mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Randy Browning. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Smoking Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Victoria says. \"Everyone loves Randy Browning.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
