__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Smoking Lounge,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
