__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Oliver Chase's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Victoria mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Randy Browning. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Randy Browning?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Smoking Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Chase's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Victoria mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Randy Browning. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Lounge. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Lounge,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Genesis Stark. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Lounge. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Lounge,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
