__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Genesis Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Genesis Stark,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Lounge, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
