__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Cal Ortiz?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Ballroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Victoria says. \"Everyone loves Cal Ortiz.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
