__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Cal Ortiz,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
