__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Todd Cleveland. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Servants' Quarters, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's personal assistant?\" Victoria says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Servants' Quarters.\""));
