__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Victoria says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
