__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Douglas Martin, yeah,\" she says. \"He's Oliver's cousin. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Victoria says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Master Bedroom. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Oliver's cousin,\" Victoria says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oliver's cousin?\" Victoria says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Master Bedroom.\""));
