__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Douglas Martin is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Victoria says. \"He's Oliver's cousin. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
