__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Victoria mutters. \"I don't know how Oliver got stuck with a lover like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Wine Cellar,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Isaiah Mejia. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>Victoria shudders. \"He's Oliver's lover. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
