__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, sure man,\" Cal says. \"He's a solid bro. He'll be in the Guest Bedroom, that's where he hangs out. Tell him I said hey.\""));
