__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Heck if I know, dude,\" he says. \"Like, your guess is as good as mine, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
