__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Johnny Dejesus's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Guest Bedroom if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Chase's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Johnny Dejesus. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Todd says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Guest Bedroom, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, his name's Johnny Dejesus. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Todd says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Guest Bedroom, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Oliver's gardener? Oh, you mean Johnny Dejesus,\" Todd says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Johnny Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Todd says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Guest Bedroom, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Johnny Dejesus,\" Todd says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
