__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>Todd rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Douglas Martin. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
