__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Todd snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Todd says. \"Douglas Martin, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Todd snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Master Bedroom, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Oliver's lover,\" Todd says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Todd sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Wine Cellar. That's all I know or care.\""));
