__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Oliver's lover,\" Todd says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Todd says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Wine Cellar right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Todd grunts. \"That's Oliver's lover -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Todd thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Wine Cellar if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Isaiah Mejia?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a lover,\" Todd snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
