__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>Douglas tilts his head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Douglas turns a page and goes back to his reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Victoria Chavez.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
