__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Curly Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Basement at the moment,\" Mejia says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Chase's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Randy Browning, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
