__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Victoria Chavez?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Oliver Chase's business partner,\" Mejia says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
