__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Mejia says. \"Presently, he is in the Master Bedroom. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Todd Cleveland, Mejia says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Master Bedroom,\" Mejia says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Todd Cleveland to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Mejia says. \"You will find him in the Master Bedroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Todd Cleveland, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Mejia says. \"You will find him in the Master Bedroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
