__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Chase's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Todd Cleveland, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Douglas Martin?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Master Bedroom,\" Mejia says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Todd Cleveland, Mejia says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Curly Mayer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Curly Mayer, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Curly Mayer, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Curly Mayer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Curly Mayer, Detective,\" Mejia says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Mejia asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Curly Mayer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Mejia asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Curly Mayer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Smoking Lounge. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Davey Livingston, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Davey Livingston. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Family Room, and find a young man wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. He looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" he says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Cletus Farley, the victim's gardener.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Madelyn Compton, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Billiard Room, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Marlon McClain, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Sunroom, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. \"You must be Chuck Hickman, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Attic you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. \"You must be Marlon Moody, the victim's neighbor,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Boiler Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Brooklyn Holman, the victim's physician.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "As you enter the Game Room, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking man dressed for a white-tie occasion. He looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what he sees. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Todd Wise, the victim's boss.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Library you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Samantha Warner, the victim's lawyer,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Living Room, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. \"You must be Charlie Kelley, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Madelyn'd had a proper regimen like I told her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madelyn's physician,\" Davey says. \"He's good people. Dependable, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know them real well,\" Davey says, \"but we run into each other from time to time, sure. They're alright. Check in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Davey says. \"Ever since he first became Madelyn's physician. Practically inseparable, him and me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure,\" Davey says. \"Madelyn's gardener is great. I don't know them much more than to say hello to, but I can tell they're a decent sort. Check in the Living Room, if you wanna chat.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know them real well,\" Davey says, \"but we run into each other from time to time, sure. They're alright. Check in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Madelyn's physician, I know him pretty well,\" he says. \"He's a real straight-shooter. Real trustworthy.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Oh sure,\" Davey says. \"Madelyn's gardener is great. I don't know them much more than to say hello to, but I can tell they're a decent sort. Check in the Living Room, if you wanna chat.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Madelyn's physician, I know him pretty well,\" he says. \"He's a real straight-shooter. Real trustworthy.\""));
