__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Brooklyn Holman,\" he says. \"Me and her, we go way back. Waaay back. Can't say enough good things about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Davey says. \"Ever since he first became Madelyn's lawyer. Practically inseparable, him and me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Personal assistant... Personal assistant...\" Davey mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Brooklyn Holman! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot she's Madelyn's personal assistant!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madelyn's lawyer,\" Davey says. \"He's good people. Dependable, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Compton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Brooklyn Holman?\" Davey asks. \"She's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Brooklyn Holman.\""));
