__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>Davey rolls his eyes. \"Pfft. Yeah, I know Chuck Hickman. That's Madelyn's lawyer. I trust that man about as far as I can throw him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Sheesh,\" Davey grumbles. \"Yeah, I know Samantha Warner. Know her like a kick in the teeth. Got about as much need for her, too.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>Davey rolls his eyes. \"Pfft. Yeah, I know Chuck Hickman. That's Madelyn's lawyer. I trust that man about as far as I can throw him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's college roommate... Oh. You mean Samantha Warner,\" Davey says, shaking his head. \"Yeah, no. I don't need the stress, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madelyn's lawyer,\" he replies. \"Don't care much for him. He's a crook, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sheesh,\" Davey grumbles. \"Yeah, I know Samantha Warner. Know her like a kick in the teeth. Got about as much need for her, too.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Madelyn's lawyer?\" Davey asks. \"I know <i>of</i> him, but that's about it. We ain't what you'd call 'chummy'.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"Her name's Samantha Warner. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Chuck Hickman. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Madelyn's lawyer?\" Davey asks. \"I know <i>of</i> him, but that's about it. We ain't what you'd call 'chummy'.\""));
