__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Davey Livingston. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's child,\" Chuck says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
