__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Do you know Compton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Brooklyn Holman. She's pretty funny,\" Chuck says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Brooklyn Holman?\" Chuck says. \"I'd be real surprised if she did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Todd Wise. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Chuck says. \"He's in the Game Room. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Samantha Warner. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Chuck says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about her! She's the victim's boss, and she has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Family Room,\" Chuck says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's boss, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Chuck says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Family Room right now, though.\""));
