__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" he says. \"That's Madelyn Compton's boss. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
