__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Samantha Warner. She's pretty funny,\" Chuck says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
