__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madelyn's boss,\" Marlon replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Samantha Warner,\" Marlon says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about her, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Cletus Farley. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Madelyn's boss,\" Marlon replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
