__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Compton's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"The only gardener I'm aware of around here is Samantha Warner, and she isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Marlon mutters. \"I don't know how Madelyn got stuck with a boss like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a neighbor like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Samantha Warner. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
