__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Marlon says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Billiard Room,\" Marlon says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
