__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Billiard Room,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Billiard Room,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Billiard Room,\" Marlon says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Marlon says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Billiard Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Marlon says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Library. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Chuck Hickman. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Sunroom. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Livingston. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Chuck Hickman,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Davey Livingston,\" Marlon says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
