__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Sunroom. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
