__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Boiler Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Marlon says. \"Everyone loves Todd Wise.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Boiler Room,\" Marlon says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Physician...\" Marlon mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Todd Wise. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
