__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Madelyn's boss,\" Marlon says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's lawyer?\" Marlon says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Samantha Warner is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Marlon says. \"She's Madelyn's boss. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
