__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Davey Livingston is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Brooklyn says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Brooklyn says. \"He's Madelyn's dental hygienist. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
