__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Compton's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Brooklyn says. \"His name's Davey Livingston. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
