__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Brooklyn says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Family Room and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Family Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Brooklyn says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Family Room and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Brooklyn says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Boiler Room, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Cletus Farley? I think he's safe,\" Brooklyn says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Brooklyn says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Family Room, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
