__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Brooklyn declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Billiard Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Brooklyn says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Marlon McClain, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Brooklyn declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Billiard Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Marlon McClain? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Brooklyn exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
