__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Todd Wise. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Madelyn's boss,\" she replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Game Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's boss? Well, I don't trust him,\" she says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
