__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Todd Wise. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Brooklyn says. \"He's Madelyn's boss. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
