__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Compton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Brooklyn says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Boiler Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
