__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Samantha Warner? I think she's safe,\" Brooklyn says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Samantha Warner?\" Brooklyn says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"Samantha Warner? I think she's safe,\" Brooklyn says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Library.\""));
