__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Brooklyn says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Library, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Samantha Warner is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Brooklyn says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Samantha Warner?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Brooklyn says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Library and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
