__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Compton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Brooklyn says. \"Her name's Samantha Warner. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
