__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Brooklyn says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then she looks around and whispers, \"It was Cletus Farley!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>Brooklyn looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. She writes the name \"Cletus Farley\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in her mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Brooklyn looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. She writes the name \"Cletus Farley\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in her mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Brooklyn says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then she looks around and whispers, \"It was Cletus Farley!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>Brooklyn looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. She writes the name \"Cletus Farley\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in her mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Cletus Farley!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Cletus Farley!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Brooklyn says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then she looks around and whispers, \"It was Cletus Farley!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Smoking Lounge and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Wise says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Attic?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Wise says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Smoking Lounge at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Davey Livingston, Detective,\" Wise says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Smoking Lounge, if you require more information than that.\""));
