__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Smoking Lounge and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Wise says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Smoking Lounge at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Madelyn's personal assistant,\" Wise says. \"A perfectly charming man, despite his upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Compton's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Wise says. \"Her name is Samantha Warner. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
