__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Marlon McClain. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>Wise snorts derisively. \"Madelyn's child is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Attic,\" he says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Marlon McClain?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Madelyn's child? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
