__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Charlie Kelley?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Madelyn refers to as her physician,\" Wise says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
