__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlie Kelley?\" you ask.<p>Wise snorts derisively. \"Madelyn's physician is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
