__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Charlie Kelley. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Charlie Kelley?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Madelyn's physician? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
