__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Samantha says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
