__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the dental hygienist,\" Samantha muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Smoking Lounge, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
