__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Cletus Farley. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's gardener. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Samantha says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Cletus Farley and I get along rather well,\" Samantha says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's gardener and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Cletus Farley?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Samantha says. \"We get along quite well. He's Madelyn's gardener, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Cletus Farley?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
