__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Samantha says. \"We get along quite well. He's Madelyn's gardener, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Samantha says. \"We get along quite well. He's Madelyn's gardener, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Cletus Farley and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Samantha says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's gardener and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Cletus Farley?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Samantha asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Marlon McClain? Bah,\" Samantha says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's personal assistant, and an absolute philistine,\" Samantha scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Marlon McClain? Bah,\" Samantha says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Samantha sniffs. \"His name is Marlon McClain, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Compton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Samantha sniffs. \"His name is Marlon McClain, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
