__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Samantha asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Samantha sniffs. \"His name is Marlon McClain, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Samantha says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Samantha smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Sunroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Chuck Hickman and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Samantha says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Chuck Hickman is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Chuck Hickman and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Samantha says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Chuck Hickman. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Chuck Hickman is my biggest fan!\" Samantha says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Chuck Hickman?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Samantha smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Sunroom -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Chuck Hickman and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Samantha says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Samantha says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Chuck Hickman?\" Samantha asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Samantha says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Chuck Hickman and I get along rather well,\" Samantha says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Compton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Chuck Hickman and I get along rather well,\" Samantha says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
