__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's neighbor and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Compton's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's neighbor and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the neighbor,\" Samantha muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Attic, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Madelyn's neighbor. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Samantha says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Samantha says. \"We get along quite well. He's Madelyn's neighbor, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Samantha says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Attic.\""));
