__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Todd Wise. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Game Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Game Room,\" Samantha says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Game Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Game Room,\" Samantha says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Samantha says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Game Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Game Room,\" Samantha says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Game Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Samantha says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Game Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Samantha snorts. \"Their presence in the Game Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
