__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlie Kelley?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Samantha asks. \"Oh -- you mean Madelyn's child. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
