__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Charlie Kelley?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's child, and an absolute philistine,\" Samantha scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Living Room,\" Samantha says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Samantha says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Cletus Farley'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Samantha muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Cletus Farley.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Samantha says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Cletus Farley'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Samantha says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Cletus Farley'?\""));
