__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Samantha muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Cletus Farley.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Davey Livingston's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Smoking Lounge if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Charlie says. \"I think they'd be in the Smoking Lounge at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Charlie says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Smoking Lounge, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Davey Livingston?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Davey Livingston's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Smoking Lounge if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Smoking Lounge.\""));
