__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Cletus Farley?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Cletus Farley!\" Charlie says. \"That's Madelyn's gardener. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
