__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Charlie snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Charlie thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Billiard Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Marlon McClain?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Charlie snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Billiard Room, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Charlie sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Billiard Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
