__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Charlie says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Billiard Room right now.\""));
