__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Chuck Hickman!\" Charlie says. \"That's Madelyn's college roommate. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Compton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Chuck Hickman,\" Charlie says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Chuck Hickman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Madelyn's college roommate, I know him,\" Charlie says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Madelyn's college roommate? Oh, you mean Chuck Hickman,\" Charlie says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
