__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's neighbor? Oh, you mean Marlon Moody,\" Charlie says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Madelyn's neighbor, I know him,\" Charlie says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell him training tips and he listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Marlon Moody,\" Charlie says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's neighbor,\" Charlie says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Marlon Moody,\" Charlie says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, that's Marlon Moody,\" Charlie says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Marlon Moody?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Madelyn's neighbor,\" Charlie says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Madelyn's neighbor? Oh, you mean Marlon Moody,\" Charlie says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Brooklyn Holman,\" Charlie says. \"You'll find her in the Boiler Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Charlie thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Boiler Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Charlie snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Boiler Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Charlie thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Boiler Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Charlie snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Compton's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Charlie thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Boiler Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Charlie snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Boiler Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Charlie says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Boiler Room right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Charlie snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Charlie snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Boiler Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Charlie sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Boiler Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Brooklyn Holman,\" Charlie says. \"You'll find her in the Boiler Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Charlie sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Boiler Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Brooklyn Holman?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Brooklyn Holman,\" Charlie says. \"You'll find her in the Boiler Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Charlie sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Boiler Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Brooklyn Holman. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Charlie snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Charlie says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Game Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Charlie says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Game Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Charlie says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Game Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Wise?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Todd Wise's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Game Room if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Charlie says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Game Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
