__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Madelyn Compton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Samantha Warner. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
