__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Charlie says. \"It was Madelyn's gardener.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Charlie says. \"It was Madelyn's gardener.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Charlie says. \"It was Madelyn's gardener.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Charlie says. \"It was Madelyn's gardener.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Madelyn?\" Charlie says. \"That's easy, it was her gardener.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Charlie flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Charlie says. \"It was Madelyn's gardener.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Charlie says. \"It was Madelyn's gardener.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Laundry Room, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Audrey Hunt, the victim's child.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Audrey. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Servants' Quarters, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Jake Johnston, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You walk into the Sunroom, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Your dossier identifies him as Mickey Rollins, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to him. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Library, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. According to the dossier, this is Aldous McMillan, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Attic and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the dossier, this is Paco Mendoza, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The only person in the Master Bedroom is a hugely-muscled man, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Simon Hodges, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Simon grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Boiler Room you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. According to the dossier, this is Carl Jacobs, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Lily Barrett,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Billiard Room you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Leonard Britt, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Leonard Britt. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Study and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. Your dossier identifies him as Todd Nelson, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Jake Johnston. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh man, all I know about him is that he's like the coolest! He's wild as hell, go check out the Servants' Quarters and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Don't know 'em. I mean, not really,\" she says. \"They're cool, but we're not like bros or anything. Check the Attic, maybe?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh man, all I know about him is that he's like the coolest! He's wild as hell, go check out the Servants' Quarters and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, dunno much, dude,\" Audrey says. \"I guess look in the Attic? That's where I'd look, if I was looking.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Heck yeah, I know Jake Johnston,\" she says. \"He's like, crazy cool. He's a real trip. He's in the Servants' Quarters, give him a high-five for me.\""));
