__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, dunno much, dude,\" Audrey says. \"I guess look in the Attic? That's where I'd look, if I was looking.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" she says. \"Yeah man. That's Lily's cousin. I've run into him a couplea times. He's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" she replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Boiler Room and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah I know him,\" she says. \"I mean, kinda. We don't, like, hang. Real unchill man. I think he's Lily's cousin or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man,\" Audrey says, shaping her head. \"I know enough to stay the hell out of the Boiler Room when they're there, which is like always, and that's all I need to know, right?\""));
