__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Mickey says. \"He's Lily's dental hygienist. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Servants' Quarters, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
