__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Carl Jacobs?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's chauffeur? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Carl Jacobs?\" Mickey says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Carl Jacobs?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Lily's chauffeur,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Mickey says. \"His name's Carl Jacobs. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
