__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Leonard Britt? I think he's safe,\" Mickey says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Billiard Room.\""));
