__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's cousin?\" Mickey says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
