__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Aldous mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Laundry Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Laundry Room. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
