__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Audrey Hunt,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Audrey Hunt,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Aldous mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Laundry Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Audrey Hunt,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Laundry Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Aldous says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Jake Johnston is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Aldous says. \"He's Lily's dental hygienist. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Aldous says. \"Everyone loves Jake Johnston.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Jake Johnston, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Lily's dental hygienist. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Aldous says. \"Everyone loves Jake Johnston.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Jake Johnston, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Lily's dental hygienist. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Aldous mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Jake Johnston. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Jake Johnston is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Aldous says. \"He's Lily's dental hygienist. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Jake Johnston,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Jake Johnston,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Jake Johnston is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Aldous says. \"He's Lily's dental hygienist. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Aldous mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Jake Johnston. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lily's dental hygienist,\" Aldous says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Jake Johnston,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lily's dental hygienist,\" Aldous says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Sunroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's personal assistant?\" Aldous says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Sunroom,\" Aldous says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's personal assistant?\" Aldous says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Sunroom,\" Aldous says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Aldous says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Mickey Rollins. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Sunroom, having a grand old time.\""));
