__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paco Mendoza?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Aldous mutters. \"I don't know how Lily got stuck with a college roommate like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a sibling like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"The only college roommate I'm aware of around here is Paco Mendoza, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"The only college roommate I'm aware of around here is Paco Mendoza, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Paco Mendoza. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Lily's college roommate,\" Aldous replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
