__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Paco Mendoza. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
