__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Simon Hodges?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Master Bedroom. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
