__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's chauffeur?\" Aldous says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Boiler Room.\""));
