__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lily's gardener,\" Aldous says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Aldous says. \"Everyone loves Leonard Britt.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lily's gardener,\" Aldous says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Gardener...\" Aldous mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Leonard Britt. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Leonard Britt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lily's gardener,\" Aldous says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Aldous says. \"Everyone loves Leonard Britt.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Leonard Britt is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Aldous says. \"He's Lily's gardener. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Aldous says. \"Everyone loves Leonard Britt.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Leonard Britt, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Lily's gardener. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Leonard Britt,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
