__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Todd Nelson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Lily's cousin,\" Aldous replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Todd Nelson,\" Aldous says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Todd Nelson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>Aldous shudders. \"He's Lily's cousin. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Todd Nelson,\" Aldous says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Aldous mutters. \"I don't know how Lily got stuck with a cousin like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a sibling like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Barrett's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"The only cousin I'm aware of around here is Todd Nelson, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
