__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Mickey Rollins? He's alright, he's cool. I think he's over in the Sunroom? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmm, yeah. I think I saw them in the Sunroom?\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, making a note of it. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah. S'alright, I guess? We don't really interact.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>Paco scowls. \"What, now you're after Mickey Rollins? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! He's in the Sunroom, you can go talk to him yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Sunroom. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Mickey Rollins is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Sunroom and ask he yourself.\""));
