__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Carl Jacobs?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a dental hygienist,\" Simon snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Simon says. \"Aldous McMillan, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Carl Jacobs?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Simon grunts. \"That's Lily's dental hygienist -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Simon says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
