__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Simon grunts. \"That's Lily's sibling -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Simon says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Attic right now.\""));
