__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Simon thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Attic if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
