__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Simon says. \"It was Lily's gardener.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Lily?\" Simon says. \"That's easy, it was her gardener.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Simon flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Simon says. \"It was Lily's gardener.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Simon says. \"It was Lily's gardener.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Lily?\" Simon says. \"That's easy, it was her gardener.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Simon flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Carl says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Laundry Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Carl says as sternly as he can muster, \"Lily's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Carl says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Laundry Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Library with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Carl declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Audrey Hunt. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Carl says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Laundry Room, go see for yourself!\""));
