__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Carl says as sternly as he can muster, \"Lily's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Carl says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Laundry Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Barrett's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Carl says as sternly as he can muster, \"Lily's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Audrey Hunt is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Carl says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Laundry Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Library, Detective,\" Carl says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Carl says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Laundry Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Carl says as sternly as he can muster, \"Lily's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
