__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Carl says as sternly as he can muster, \"Lily's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Audrey Hunt is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Carl says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Laundry Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Aldous McMillan, isn't it?\" Carl asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist, dental hygienist. Hmm,\" Carl ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Aldous McMillan? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Lily's dental hygienist. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Jake Johnston. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Carl says. \"Did you know he's Lily's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Aldous McMillan,\" Carl says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Jake Johnston's a positive delight!\" Carl says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Aldous McMillan,\" Carl says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Jake Johnston. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Jake Johnston. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Carl says. \"Did you know he's Lily's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
