__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Aldous McMillan, isn't it?\" Carl asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's cousin, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Carl says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Servants' Quarters and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Mickey Rollins's a positive delight!\" Carl says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
