__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Carl says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Servants' Quarters, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
