__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Mickey Rollins. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Carl says. \"Did you know he's Lily's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Carl says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Servants' Quarters and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Aldous McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Aldous McMillan is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Carl says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Library, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Carl says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Audrey Hunt, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Aldous McMillan. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Aldous McMillan is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Carl says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Library, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Audrey Hunt, Detective?\" Carl asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Aldous McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Carl says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Library is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Carl says. \"Calls herself 'Audrey Hunt', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Audrey Hunt' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Aldous McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Carl says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Library, go see for yourself!\""));
