__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Carl says. \"Calls herself 'Audrey Hunt', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Audrey Hunt' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know Paco Mendoza?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's dental hygienist, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Todd Nelson,\" Carl says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate, college roommate. Hmm,\" Carl ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Todd Nelson? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Lily's college roommate. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
