__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Lily's golf caddy?\" Carl says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Carl says. \"Calls herself 'Audrey Hunt', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Audrey Hunt' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Carl muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Lily's golf caddy? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Carl says. \"Calls herself 'Audrey Hunt', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Audrey Hunt' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Leonard Britt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Carl says. \"He's Lily's golf caddy, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Audrey Hunt, Detective?\" Carl asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Carl says. \"He's Lily's golf caddy, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Barrett's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Audrey Hunt, Detective?\" Carl asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Audrey Hunt, Detective?\" Carl asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Carl muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Lily's golf caddy? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Carl says. \"Calls herself 'Audrey Hunt', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Audrey Hunt' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Carl says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Audrey Hunt, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Carl says. \"He's Lily's golf caddy, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Leonard Britt?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Lily's golf caddy?\" Carl says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's gardener, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Barrett's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Mickey Rollins, isn't it?\" Carl asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Todd Nelson. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Carl says. \"Did you know he's Lily's gardener? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Mickey Rollins,\" Carl says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Carl says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lily's gardener, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Mickey Rollins,\" Carl says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Todd Nelson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Todd Nelson's a positive delight!\" Carl says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Barrett's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Cousin, cousin. Hmm,\" Carl ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Mickey Rollins? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Lily's cousin. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Todd Nelson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Todd Nelson. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Carl says. \"Did you know he's Lily's gardener? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
