__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Mickey Rollins,\" Carl says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Lily's sibling, Detective,\" Carl says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Carl says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lily Barrett?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the sibling, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Lily's sibling, Detective,\" Carl says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Carl says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lily Barrett?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the sibling, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Lily's sibling, Detective,\" Carl says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Carl says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lily Barrett?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the sibling, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Carl says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Lily's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the sibling.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Carl says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lily Barrett?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the sibling, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Carl says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lily Barrett?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the sibling, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Lily's personal assistant,\" Leonard says. \"She's good people. Dependable, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Aldous McMillan,\" he says. \"Me and him, we go way back. Waaay back. Can't say enough good things about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Leonard says. \"Ever since she first became Lily's personal assistant. Practically inseparable, her and me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"D'you mean Aldous McMillan?\" Leonard asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Aldous McMillan.\""));
