__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh, yeah, I know Jake Johnston,\" Leonard says. \"He's in the Servants' Quarters. If he says anything about me, though, it's a total lie.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Leonard muses. \"I think I know who you mean, Detective, but I dunno them real well. I think they're in the Attic, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, I got no use for them,\" Leonard says. \"Nothin' but trouble. Probably hangin' around the Attic, if you've got time to waste.\""));
