__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Jake Johnston. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- he's not really my cup of tea. He's in the Servants' Quarters, though, if you wanna meet him yourself.\""));
