__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Leonard says. \"Try the Attic, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Mickey Rollins's great, just great,\" Leonard says. \"Go check out the Sunroom, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"D'you mean Carl Jacobs?\" Leonard asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Carl Jacobs.\""));
