__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Leonard says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Paco Mendoza. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Leonard says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Paco Mendoza*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Leonard says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Paco Mendoza*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well now!\" Leonard says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Paco Mendoza*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Leonard says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Paco Mendoza*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well now!\" Leonard says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Paco Mendoza*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Leonard grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Paco Mendoza. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Leonard grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Paco Mendoza. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Audrey Hunt is my biggest fan!\" Todd says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the child,\" Todd muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Servants' Quarters, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Todd says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Audrey Hunt. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Todd smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Todd says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Todd says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, the child,\" Todd muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Servants' Quarters, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Todd says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Servants' Quarters at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Audrey Hunt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Todd smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
