__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Todd says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Paco Mendoza?\" Todd asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Jake Johnston is my biggest fan!\" Todd says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Todd smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Servants' Quarters -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Barrett's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Paco Mendoza and I get along rather well,\" Todd says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Todd smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Servants' Quarters -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Paco Mendoza and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Todd says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Paco Mendoza and I get along rather well,\" Todd says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
