__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Paco Mendoza?\" Todd asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Jake Johnston?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Jake Johnston is my biggest fan!\" Todd says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Lily's child, and an absolute philistine,\" Todd scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Servants' Quarters,\" Todd says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Lily's child, and an absolute philistine,\" Todd scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Barrett's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Todd snorts. \"Their presence in the Servants' Quarters is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Todd says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The child. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Servants' Quarters,\" Todd says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Mickey Rollins?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Todd asks. \"Oh -- you mean Lily's child. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Todd snorts. \"Their presence in the Servants' Quarters is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
