__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Paco Mendoza. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Todd says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Attic, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Billiard Room,\" Todd says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Paco Mendoza?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Todd says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Attic, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
