__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Paco Mendoza?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Attic, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Billiard Room,\" Todd says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Paco Mendoza?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Todd says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Attic, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
