__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Billiard Room,\" Todd says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Simon Hodges?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Todd says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Todd says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
