__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Laundry Room,\" Todd says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Simon Hodges?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Todd says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Todd says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Simon Hodges?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Todd says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
