__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Simon Hodges?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Todd says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Todd snorts. \"Their presence in the Laundry Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Todd snorts. \"Their presence in the Laundry Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Carl Jacobs. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Lily's college roommate. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Todd says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Todd says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Carl Jacobs?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Todd says. \"We get along quite well. He's Lily's college roommate, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, the chauffeur,\" Todd muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Library, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Carl Jacobs?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's college roommate and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lily Barrett's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Todd says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Library.\""));
