__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Barrett's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Library at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Carl Jacobs. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Lily's college roommate and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
