__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Lily?\" Todd asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Lily?\" Todd asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Todd says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Todd says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Todd says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Todd says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Todd says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Todd says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Wine Cellar and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the dossier, this is Zane Leach, the victim's housekeeper.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Lounge, you encounter a young man wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of his pencil. Your dossier identifies him as Merle Sandoval, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Study, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Madelyn Hunter, the victim's best friend.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Sophie Owen was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "In the Library, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the dossier, this is Chloe Le, the victim's gardener.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Laundry Room you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Byron Dillon, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Sunroom, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. \"You must be Del Peters, the victim's butler,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Family Room, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Elmer Shaffer, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Dining Room you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Kenny Weber, the victim's lover.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Game Room, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Perry Roman, the victim's sibling.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner, business partner. Hmm,\" Zane ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Perry Roman? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Sophie's business partner. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Perry Roman,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Merle Sandoval's a positive delight!\" Zane says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Perry Roman,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Roman, isn't it?\" Zane asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Merle Sandoval. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Zane says. \"Did you know he's Sophie's butler? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Roman, isn't it?\" Zane asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Merle Sandoval. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Perry Roman,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Merle Sandoval's a positive delight!\" Zane says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
