__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Madelyn Hunter. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Zane says. \"Did you know she's Sophie's lover? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
