__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Merle Sandoval,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Zane says. \"She's Sophie's lover, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Del Peters, Detective?\" Zane asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Zane muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Sophie's lover? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Owen's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Zane says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Del Peters, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Sophie's lover?\" Zane says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, him,\" Zane says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Del Peters, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Zane says. \"Calls himself 'Del Peters', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Del Peters' by choice, can you?\""));
