__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Zane says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Family Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Zane says as sternly as he can muster, \"Sophie's neighbor is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Game Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Zane says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Owen's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Game Room, Detective,\" Zane says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
