__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Elmer Shaffer is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Zane says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
