__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Elmer Shaffer is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Zane says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Owen's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Game Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Zane declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Elmer Shaffer is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Zane says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Game Room, Detective,\" Zane says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Zane says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Family Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Zane says as sternly as he can muster, \"Sophie's neighbor is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Game Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Zane says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Dining Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Zane says. \"Calls himself 'Del Peters', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Del Peters' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Kenny Weber. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Zane says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Dining Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Zane says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Dining Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Zane says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Del Peters, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Kenny Weber is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Zane says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Dining Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
