__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Kenny Weber. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Kenny Weber is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Zane says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Dining Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Del Peters, Detective?\" Zane asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Owen's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Zane says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Del Peters, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Owen's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Sibling, sibling. Hmm,\" Zane ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Chloe Le? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Sophie's sibling. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Sibling, sibling. Hmm,\" Zane ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Chloe Le? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Sophie's sibling. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Chloe Le,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Perry Roman. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Zane says. \"Did you know he's Sophie's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Chloe Le,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Perry Roman. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Zane says. \"Did you know he's Sophie's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
