__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Perry Roman. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Zane says. \"Did you know he's Sophie's neighbor? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sibling, sibling. Hmm,\" Zane ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Chloe Le? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Sophie's sibling. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Chloe Le,\" Zane says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Perry Roman's a positive delight!\" Zane says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Chloe Le, isn't it?\" Zane asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Zane says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Sophie's neighbor, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Zane says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Sophie's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Zane says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Sophie's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Zane looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Sophie?\" Zane asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Archie Duffy?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Zane says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Sophie's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Zane says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Sophie's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Wine Cellar, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Library,\" Merle says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Merle says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Library,\" Merle says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Merle says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Merle snorts. \"Their presence in the Library is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Merle snorts. \"Their presence in the Library is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
