__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Merle says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Wine Cellar, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Merle snorts. \"Their presence in the Library is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Library,\" Merle says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Zane Leach. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Wine Cellar, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
