__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Library,\" Merle says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Merle smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Study -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Merle says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Merle smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Study -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Merle says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Merle smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Study -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Merle says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the best friend,\" Merle muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Merle says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the best friend,\" Merle muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the best friend,\" Merle muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Wine Cellar, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Madelyn Hunter is my biggest fan!\" Merle says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Merle says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Merle smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Study -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Merle says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Madelyn Hunter is my biggest fan!\" Merle says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Chloe Le. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Library, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Merle says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Merle says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Library, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Merle says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Chloe Le. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Merle says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Library, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Merle snorts. \"Their presence in the Laundry Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Merle says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Library, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Laundry Room,\" Merle says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
