__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Merle says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Library, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Byron Dillon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Merle says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Merle says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Byron Dillon. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Merle smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Game Room at the moment.\""));
