__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the personal assistant,\" Merle muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Game Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Byron Dillon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Merle smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
