__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know Byron Dillon?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Byron Dillon is my biggest fan!\" Merle says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Laundry Room.\""));
