__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Del Peters. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Merle says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Sunroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
