__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Merle asks. \"Oh -- you mean Sophie's neighbor. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Merle says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Sophie's neighbor, and an absolute philistine,\" Merle scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
