__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Merle says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The neighbor. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
