__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Merle snorts. \"Their presence in the Laundry Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
