__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Wine Cellar,\" Merle says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Merle asks. \"Oh -- you mean Sophie's lover. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
