__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Madelyn says. \"That's the victim's sibling, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Madelyn says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Laundry Room right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Madelyn says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's sibling, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" she says. \"That's Sophie Owen's sibling. He has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
