__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Madelyn says. \"She's in the Library. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Kenny Weber. He's pretty funny,\" Madelyn says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
