__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Madelyn says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Family Room right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
