__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"No idea,\" she says, turning a page in her book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>She shakes her head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Zane Leach,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"That's Zane Leach. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Wine Cellar. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Zane Leach,\" Byron says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Wine Cellar. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"The only housekeeper I'm aware of around here is Zane Leach, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Wine Cellar. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
