__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Zane Leach,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Merle Sandoval is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Byron says. \"He's Sophie's business partner. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Byron says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Merle Sandoval. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Merle Sandoval is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Byron says. \"He's Sophie's business partner. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Byron says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Merle Sandoval, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Sophie's business partner. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Byron says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie's business partner,\" Byron says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sophie's business partner?\" Byron says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie's business partner,\" Byron says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
