__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Owen's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Byron says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Byron says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Lounge. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Study,\" Byron says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Sophie's best friend?\" Byron says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Study, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Byron says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Study. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Study,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Byron says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Study. Does that count?\""));
