__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Sophie's gardener,\" Byron replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Library, if you want to talk to them,\" Byron says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Sophie's gardener,\" Byron replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Library, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"I don't know how Sophie got stuck with a gardener like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a personal assistant like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"I don't know how Sophie got stuck with a gardener like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a personal assistant like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Sophie's gardener,\" Byron replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Library, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"I don't know how Sophie got stuck with a gardener like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a personal assistant like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Library, if you want to talk to them,\" Byron says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"I don't know how Sophie got stuck with a gardener like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a personal assistant like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"They're in the Library,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Byron mutters. \"I don't know how Sophie got stuck with a gardener like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a personal assistant like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Owen's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Library,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Del Peters?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Del Peters, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Sophie's butler. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Byron says. \"Everyone loves Del Peters.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Del Peters?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Del Peters is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Byron says. \"He's Sophie's butler. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"That's Del Peters,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Del Peters?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Del Peters is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Byron says. \"He's Sophie's butler. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler...\" Byron mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Del Peters. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
