__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Del Peters?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Sophie's butler,\" Byron says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Del Peters,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
