__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Dining Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Sophie's lover?\" Byron says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Dining Room,\" Byron says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Byron says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Dining Room.\""));
