__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Byron says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Dining Room. Does that count?\""));
