__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Game Room. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
