__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Perry Roman?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Perry Roman,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Perry Roman. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
