__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Byron says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Sophie's neighbor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gosh,\" Byron says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Sophie's neighbor killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well,\" Byron says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Sophie's neighbor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Sophie's neighbor,\" Byron says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Sophie's neighbor,\" Byron says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Sophie's neighbor,\" Byron says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Byron says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Sophie's neighbor killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Byron says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Sophie's neighbor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Zane Leach? I think he's safe,\" Del says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Owen's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Kenny Weber is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Del says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Del says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Wine Cellar, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
