__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Del says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Sophie's sibling.\""));
