__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Sophie Owen's housekeeper,\" Weber says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Weber says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Wine Cellar, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Weber says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Wine Cellar, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Sophie Owen's housekeeper,\" Weber says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Wine Cellar, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Weber says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Sophie Owen's housekeeper,\" Weber says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Weber says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Wine Cellar, you might send my regards.\""));
