__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Weber says. \"Presently, he is in the Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Owen's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Weber says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Weber says. \"You will find him in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Weber says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
