__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Sophie Owen's best friend,\" Weber says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Madelyn Hunter, Detective,\" Weber says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Sophie Owen's best friend,\" Weber says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Madelyn Hunter. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Sophie Owen's best friend,\" Weber says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, I consider Madelyn Hunter to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Sophie Owen's best friend,\" Weber says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Madelyn Hunter, Weber says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
