__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Library,\" Weber says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Owen's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Chloe Le, I presume,\" Weber says. \"She is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Library at the moment,\" Weber says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Chloe Le, Detective,\" Weber says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Chloe Le?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Library,\" Weber says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
