__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Byron Dillon?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Laundry Room at the moment,\" Weber says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Weber says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Laundry Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Byron Dillon?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Laundry Room at the moment,\" Weber says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Weber says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Byron Dillon?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Laundry Room at the moment,\" Weber says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Owen's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Weber says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Laundry Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Byron Dillon?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Laundry Room,\" Weber says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Owen's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Weber says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Laundry Room.\""));
