__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Del Peters. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Sophie Owen's butler,\" Weber says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Del Peters, I presume,\" Weber says. \"He is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Del Peters?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Sophie Owen's butler,\" Weber says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Owen's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Del Peters,\" Weber says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
