__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Del Peters,\" Weber says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Del Peters?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Sophie Owen's butler,\" Weber says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Del Peters, Detective,\" Weber says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Sophie Owen's neighbor,\" Weber says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Elmer Shaffer, Detective,\" Weber says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Sophie Owen's neighbor,\" Weber says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Elmer Shaffer to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Sophie Owen's neighbor,\" Weber says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Elmer Shaffer, Weber says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
