__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Weber says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"I met him once or twice,\" Perry says. \"He seemed like real bad news to me. He's in the Wine Cellar if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Perry says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Zane Leach. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Zane Leach?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez man, I dunno much,\" he replies. \"Except he's a total control freak buzzkill. Like, he's in the Wine Cellar, so like, just check out that scene for yourself and you'll see.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You mean Zane Leach?\" Perry asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
