__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Zane Leach. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know him,\" Perry replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. He's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. He's probably in the Wine Cellar, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Perry says. \"His name's Zane Leach. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, man!\" Perry says. \"He's cool, he's a real bro. He's, like, Sophie's business partner and stuff. We don't get to hang out much, but he's fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Owen's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner...\" Perry muses, then his eyes light up. \"Oh, yeah, dude! I know who you mean. They're cool. Go check out the Lounge, you'll find 'em there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Sophie's business partner, dude!\" he says. \"He's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know 'em. I mean, not really,\" he says. \"They're cool, but we're not like bros or anything. Check the Lounge, maybe?\""));
