__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Merle Sandoval?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's cool,\" he replies. \"Like, maybe you wouldn't think it to meet him, but like deep down, you know? He's good people.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything <i>useful</i> about Merle Sandoval?\"<p>\"Oh, uhh... Well, he's Sophie's business partner, does that help?\""));
