__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" he says. \"Yeah man. That's Sophie's best friend. I've run into her a couplea times. She's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>Perry shakes his head. \"Man, I got nothing to say about that freak. Try the Study, if you wanna see a real headcase, dude.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah I know her,\" he says. \"I mean, kinda. We don't, like, hang. Real unchill woman. I think she's Sophie's best friend or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Owen's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" he replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Study and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
