__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Madelyn Hunter?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Madelyn Hunter is a total downer,\" he replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Sophie's best friend? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
