__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know him,\" Perry replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. He's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. He's probably in the Family Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Sophie Owen's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Elmer Shaffer?\" Perry asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Elmer Shaffer?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez man, I dunno much,\" he replies. \"Except he's a total control freak buzzkill. Like, he's in the Family Room, so like, just check out that scene for yourself and you'll see.\""));
