__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Kenny Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez man, I dunno much,\" he replies. \"Except he's a total control freak buzzkill. Like, he's in the Dining Room, so like, just check out that scene for yourself and you'll see.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Perry says. \"His name's Kenny Weber. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Perry says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Sophie's neighbor. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, well, uhh...\" Perry hesitates. \"...Like I don't wanna be a narc or whatever, so I don't wanna name names, you know dude? But okay, I will say you should check out Sophie's neighbor. Like for real, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Perry says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Sophie's neighbor. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Perry says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Sophie's neighbor. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Perry says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Sophie's neighbor. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, well, uhh...\" Perry hesitates. \"...Like I don't wanna be a narc or whatever, so I don't wanna name names, you know dude? But okay, I will say you should check out Sophie's neighbor. Like for real, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Perry asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Sophie's neighbor! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Smoking Lounge, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. Your dossier identifies her as Claire Baird, the victim's physician.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Billiard Room, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Gunther Juarez, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Gunther. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Boiler Room, you find a large and powerfully-muscled woman doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. \"You must be Serenity Rowe, the victim's golf caddy,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" she replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Master Bedroom and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. Your dossier identifies her as Melanie Pugh, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Melanie Pugh. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Kitchen and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Marlon Schultz, the victim's gardener.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Bella Schwartz,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Lounge, and encounter a young woman -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Serenity Combs, the victim's child.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "As you enter the Bathroom, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. According to the dossier, this is Faith Benson, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Laundry Room, where a dark-haired young woman in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; she doesn't look up as you come in. According to the dossier, this is Jessica Small, the victim's boss.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Study and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Bill Ewing, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Schwartz may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Bella's boss? He's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm... Yeah, I think I know who you mean, but I can't think of their name. Never cared to know. They're probably in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Bella's boss? He's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
