__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Serenity Rowe? I can't stand the sight of that slimy worm. I think she's in the Boiler Room? Go see for yourself what a piece of crap she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, you mean Marlon Schultz, right? I don't know anything about him except that he's a real ass and I don't want anything to do with him. Does that help?\""));
