__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Serenity Rowe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Feh!\" she growls, and stomps her cigarette out on the floor. \"If you wanna know about Serenity Rowe, go to the Boiler Room and ask her yourself. I don't want anything to do with her.\""));
