__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Marlon Schultz?\" you ask.<p>Claire scowls. \"What, now you're after Marlon Schultz? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! He's in the Kitchen, you can go talk to him yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Bella's gardener? She's called Serenity Combs. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Marlon Schultz?\" you ask.<p>\"Marlon Schultz? He's alright, he's cool. I think he's over in the Kitchen? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Serenity Combs. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
