__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Gunther asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Bella's boss! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Gunther says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Bella's boss. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Okay, well, uhh...\" Gunther hesitates. \"...Like I don't wanna be a narc or whatever, so I don't wanna name names, you know dude? But okay, I will say you should check out Bella's boss. Like for real, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Gunther asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Bella's boss! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
