__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Serenity snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Smoking Lounge, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Schwartz's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Serenity says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Kitchen right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Claire Baird,\" Serenity says. \"You'll find her in the Smoking Lounge, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
