__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Bella's gardener,\" Serenity says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
