__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Bella's physician,\" Serenity says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Him?\" Serenity says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Serenity grunts. \"That's Bella's physician -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>Serenity rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Marlon Schultz. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a physician,\" Serenity snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use her as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
