__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a gardener,\" Serenity snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Her?\" Serenity says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in her for. She's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Serenity grunts. \"That's Bella's gardener -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
