__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Bella's gardener,\" Serenity says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Serenity says. \"Melanie Pugh, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
