__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Bella?\" Serenity says. \"That's easy, it was her child.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Serenity flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Serenity says. \"It was Bella's child.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
