__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Claire Baird. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Bella's child?\" Marlon says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Marlon says as sternly as he can muster, \"Bella's physician is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Study. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Marlon muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Bella's child? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
