__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Master Bedroom, Detective,\" Marlon says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Marlon says as sternly as he can muster, \"Bella's college roommate is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Master Bedroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Bella's housekeeper?\" Marlon says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Bella's housekeeper?\" Marlon says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Marlon says as sternly as he can muster, \"Bella's college roommate is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Master Bedroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Marlon muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Bella's housekeeper? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Marlon says as sternly as he can muster, \"Bella's college roommate is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Master Bedroom. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Bella's housekeeper?\" Marlon says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Master Bedroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Marlon declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Boiler Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Jessica Small,\" Marlon says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Serenity Rowe,\" Marlon says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Boiler Room, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Marlon ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Jessica Small? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Bella's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Boiler Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Marlon ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Jessica Small? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Bella's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Serenity Rowe!\" Marlon says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Boiler Room.\""));
