__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Serenity Rowe!\" Marlon says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Jessica Small, isn't it?\" Marlon asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Marlon says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Master Bedroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Bill Ewing, Detective?\" Marlon asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"Calls himself 'Bill Ewing', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Bill Ewing' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"Melanie Pugh is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Marlon says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Master Bedroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"Calls himself 'Bill Ewing', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Bill Ewing' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Marlon says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Master Bedroom is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Marlon says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Bill Ewing, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
