__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Serenity Combs?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Serenity Combs. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Marlon says. \"Did you know she's Bella's college roommate? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Faith Benson, isn't it?\" Marlon asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Serenity Combs?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Serenity Combs's a positive delight!\" Marlon says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Faith Benson,\" Marlon says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Serenity Combs. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Marlon says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Bella's college roommate, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
