__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Jessica Small!\" Marlon says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Marlon says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Jessica Small,\" Marlon says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Laundry Room, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Marlon says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Jessica Small!\" Marlon says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Marlon says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Jessica Small!\" Marlon says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Marlon says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Master Bedroom and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Laundry Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Marlon says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Master Bedroom, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Marlon says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Marlon says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Marlon says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Laundry Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Marlon says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Master Bedroom? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Bill Ewing. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Marlon says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Bella's boss, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Jessica Small,\" Marlon says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Bill Ewing. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Marlon says. \"Did you know he's Bella's boss? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Schwartz's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Marlon ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Jessica Small? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Bella's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Marlon says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Bella's boss, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Jessica Small,\" Marlon says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Marlon says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Bella's boss, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Jessica Small,\" Marlon says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Bill Ewing's a positive delight!\" Marlon says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Jessica Small, isn't it?\" Marlon asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Bill Ewing's a positive delight!\" Marlon says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
