__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Bill Ewing's a positive delight!\" Marlon says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Marlon says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Bella's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Bella?\" Marlon asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Maury Watson?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Marlon looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Bella?\" Marlon asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Niles McClain?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Marlon looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Marlon looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Marlon looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Marlon looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Serenity says. \"That's the victim's college roommate, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Serenity says. \"They're in the Master Bedroom, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" she says. \"That's Bella Schwartz's college roommate. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Serenity says. \"They're in the Master Bedroom, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Serenity says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about her! She's the victim's college roommate, and she has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Schwartz's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Serenity says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Master Bedroom right now, though.\""));
