__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Master Bedroom,\" Serenity says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
