__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Serenity says. \"That's the victim's boss, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Serenity nods. \"That's Faith Benson. She's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Serenity says. \"That's the victim's boss, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's college roommate, Detective,\" Serenity says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure she's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make her the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Gunther Juarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Serenity says. \"That's the victim's boss, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
