__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Serenity Rowe's great fun!\" Serenity says. \"She's in the Boiler Room right now. She'll probably share her chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Melanie Pugh. She's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think she did the murder, do you?\" she gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Boiler Room right now,\" Serenity says, \"but I don't think she did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Melanie Pugh. She's pretty funny,\" Serenity says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Serenity Rowe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Boiler Room right now,\" Serenity says, \"but I don't think she did the murder. At least, I haven't found any evidence to suggest it yet!\""));
