__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Serenity says. \"She's in the Boiler Room. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
