__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Melanie Pugh. She's pretty funny,\" Serenity says. \"Wait, do you think she did it? Should I be investigating her?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Serenity exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Master Bedroom and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Serenity nods. \"That's Faith Benson. She's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Serenity says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Master Bedroom right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
