__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Serenity says. \"I think they're in the Smoking Lounge?\""));
