__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Serenity says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Bella's college roommate,\" Benson says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with her with any frequency.\""));
