__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Gunther Juarez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Bella's golf caddy,\" Benson says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Benson says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Benson sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Boiler Room,\" Benson sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know Schwartz's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Laundry Room,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Boiler Room.\""));
