__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Melanie Pugh?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Benson says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
