__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Study,\" Benson sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Benson says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Schwartz's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Laundry Room,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bill Ewing?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Benson sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Laundry Room.\""));
