__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Benson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Benson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
