__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Claire Baird?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Bella Schwartz's physician, I believe,\" Ewing says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Ewing says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Smoking Lounge.\""));
