__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Serenity Rowe?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Ewing says. \"You will find her in the Boiler Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Serenity Rowe, Ewing says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Serenity Rowe. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Boiler Room,\" Ewing says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Serenity Rowe to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
