__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Serenity Combs?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Bella Schwartz's child,\" Ewing says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Ewing says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Combs?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Bella Schwartz's child,\" Ewing says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Ewing says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Lounge, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Serenity Combs?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Bella Schwartz's child,\" Ewing says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
