__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Schwartz's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Ewing says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Serenity Combs?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Bella Schwartz's child,\" Ewing says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's child?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Ewing says. \"Presently, she is in the Bathroom. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Bella Schwartz's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Bathroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Ewing says. \"Presently, she is in the Bathroom. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Bathroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Ewing says. \"You will find her in the Bathroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Schwartz's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Ewing says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Bathroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Ewing says. \"You will find her in the Bathroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Faith Benson?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Bathroom,\" Ewing says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Ewing says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Bathroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Faith Benson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Ewing says. \"You will find her in the Bathroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
