__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Ewing says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Bathroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Jessica Small. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Bella Schwartz's boss,\" Ewing says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Laundry Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Jessica Small. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Bella Schwartz's boss,\" Ewing says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Ewing says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Laundry Room, I believe.\""));
