__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Laundry Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Bella Schwartz's boss,\" Ewing says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Jessica Small?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Bella Schwartz's boss,\" Ewing says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Ewing says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Laundry Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Jessica Small, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jessica Small, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Ewing asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Jessica Small.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Jessica Small.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Ewing asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Jessica Small.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jessica Small, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jessica Small, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Ewing asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Jessica Small.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Ewing says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Jessica Small.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Breakfast Nook, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Moe Bender, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Moe. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Guest Bedroom, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. According to the dossier, this is Gianna Landry, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Sunroom, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the dossier, this is Mitch Bridges, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" he says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and his eyes widen when you show him your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" he pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You walk into the Servants' Quarters, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Jedediah Garza, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Hall Closet and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Kenny Benton, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and he looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Lounge and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. \"You must be Jim Adams, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Jim Adams. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "The only person in the Game Room is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Buck Jenkins, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Bar, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Louis Gates, the victim's butler.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Basement, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Jake Cash, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" he mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Gianna Landry is a total downer,\" he replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Elizabeth's neighbor? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Jedediah Garza?\" Moe asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Gianna Landry. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah I know her,\" he says. \"I mean, kinda. We don't, like, hang. Real unchill woman. I think she's Elizabeth's neighbor or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Moe says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Jedediah Garza. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" he says. \"Yeah man. That's Elizabeth's neighbor. I've run into her a couplea times. She's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Moe says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Jedediah Garza. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Moe says. \"His name's Jedediah Garza. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" he says. \"Yeah man. That's Elizabeth's neighbor. I've run into her a couplea times. She's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Jedediah Garza?\" Moe asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Gianna Landry is a total downer,\" he replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think she's Elizabeth's neighbor? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Moe says. \"His name's Jedediah Garza. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"I met him once or twice,\" Moe says. \"He seemed like real bad news to me. He's in the Sunroom if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Moe says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Buck Jenkins. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know him,\" Moe replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. He's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. He's probably in the Sunroom, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Moe says. \"His name's Buck Jenkins. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez man, I dunno much,\" he replies. \"Except he's a total control freak buzzkill. Like, he's in the Sunroom, so like, just check out that scene for yourself and you'll see.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Moe says. \"His name's Buck Jenkins. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
