__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" he says. \"Yeah man. That's Elizabeth's neighbor. I've run into him a couplea times. He's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Moe says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Buck Jenkins. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Kenny Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Kenny Benton is a total downer,\" he replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think he's Elizabeth's neighbor? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
