__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Breakfast Nook and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Landry says. \"His name is Mitch Bridges. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Moe Bender, Detective,\" Landry says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Breakfast Nook, if you require more information than that.\""));
