__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Mitch Bridges? Why yes,\" she replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
