__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Kenny Benton. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Landry sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Kenny Benton? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Landry smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Kenny Benton?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Kenny Benton. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
