__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Mitch says. \"That's the victim's bodyguard, and he's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know he's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of his spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Mitch says. \"They're in the Breakfast Nook, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Mitch says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about him! He's the victim's bodyguard, and he has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Mitch says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Breakfast Nook right now, though.\""));
