__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Breakfast Nook,\" Mitch says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
