__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Mitch says. \"They're in the Bar, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
