__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Elizabeth Wilkerson's lawyer!\" Mitch says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Basement right now, Detective, \"Mitch says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Jake Cash!\" Mitch says. \"He's the victim's lawyer. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"They're in the Basement, if I know who you mean, Detective,\" Mitch says. \"We've never really talked or anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's lawyer,\" Mitch says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Mitch says. \"I think they're in the Basement?\""));
