__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Basement right now, Detective, \"Mitch says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Mitch pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Mitch pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Mitch exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Mitch pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Mitch exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Mitch pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Mitch says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Moe Bender. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Moe Bender? I think he's safe,\" Jedediah says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Jim Adams is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Jedediah says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Jedediah says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Breakfast Nook and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Moe Bender? I think he's safe,\" Jedediah says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Jim Adams?\" Jedediah says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Jedediah says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Breakfast Nook, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Jedediah says. \"His name's Jim Adams. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Jedediah says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Breakfast Nook and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
