__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Jedediah says. \"I wouldn't associate with Elizabeth's creepy butler if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Mitch Bridges? Stay away from him!\" Jedediah says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
