__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Jedediah says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Guest Bedroom isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
