__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Jedediah says. \"I wouldn't associate with Elizabeth's creepy bodyguard if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Jedediah says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Hall Closet, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Jedediah says. \"His name's Jim Adams. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
