__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Elizabeth's best friend,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Jedediah exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Jedediah exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Jedediah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Elizabeth committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Jedediah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Elizabeth committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Jedediah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Elizabeth committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Jedediah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Elizabeth committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Jedediah asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Moe Bender is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Breakfast Nook, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Gianna Landry, Detective?\" Kenny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Breakfast Nook is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Calls herself 'Gianna Landry', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Gianna Landry' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Breakfast Nook is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, her,\" Kenny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Gianna Landry, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Moe Bender is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Breakfast Nook, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
