__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Breakfast Nook is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Breakfast Nook, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Kenny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Gianna Landry, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
