__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Gianna Landry, Detective?\" Kenny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Moe Bender. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Breakfast Nook, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Calls herself 'Gianna Landry', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Gianna Landry' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Kenny says. \"She's Elizabeth's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Servants' Quarters with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Kenny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Kenny muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Elizabeth's bodyguard? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Servants' Quarters, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Elizabeth's bodyguard?\" Kenny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Elizabeth's bodyguard?\" Kenny says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
