__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Servants' Quarters with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Kenny declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Kenny says. \"She's Elizabeth's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Kenny says as sternly as he can muster, \"Elizabeth's best friend is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Servants' Quarters. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Servants' Quarters with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Kenny declares."));
