__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Mitch Bridges. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Mitch Bridges is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Sunroom, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Calls himself 'Buck Jenkins', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Buck Jenkins' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself!\""));
