__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Kenny says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Elizabeth's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Mitch Bridges, isn't it?\" Kenny asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Kenny says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Elizabeth's butler, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
