__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Mitch Bridges, isn't it?\" Kenny asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Jim Adams. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Jim Adams's a positive delight!\" Kenny says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Cousin, cousin. Hmm,\" Kenny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Mitch Bridges? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Elizabeth's cousin. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Jim Adams's a positive delight!\" Kenny says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Mitch Bridges,\" Kenny says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Jim Adams. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Kenny says. \"Did you know he's Elizabeth's butler? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
