__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Buck Jenkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Buck Jenkins,\" Kenny says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Game Room, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Kenny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Moe Bender? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Elizabeth's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Buck Jenkins?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Game Room, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Kenny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Moe Bender? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Elizabeth's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
