__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Louis Gates. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Kenny says. \"Did you know he's Elizabeth's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler, butler. Hmm,\" Kenny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Gianna Landry? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Elizabeth's butler. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Kenny says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Elizabeth's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Butler, butler. Hmm,\" Kenny ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Gianna Landry? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Elizabeth's butler. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
