__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Gianna Landry,\" Kenny says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Kenny says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Elizabeth's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Basement is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Louis Gates, Detective?\" Kenny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Jake Cash is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Louis Gates, Detective?\" Kenny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Jake Cash is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Louis Gates, Detective?\" Kenny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Basement, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Kenny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Louis Gates, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Jake Cash is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Louis Gates, Detective?\" Kenny asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Jake Cash. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Jake Cash is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Kenny says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Basement, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Calls himself 'Louis Gates', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Louis Gates' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Jake Cash. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Basement is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Kenny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Louis Gates, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Kenny says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Basement is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Kenny says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Louis Gates, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Kenny looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Elizabeth's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Kenny looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Elizabeth's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Kenny looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Kenny says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Elizabeth's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him,\" Jim says. \"Don't care much for him, though. He's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"His name's Moe Bender. I don't recommend you waste your time with him though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him,\" Jim says. \"Don't care much for him, though. He's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Sheesh,\" Jim grumbles. \"Yeah, I know Moe Bender. Know him like a kick in the teeth. Got about as much need for him, too.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- he's not really my cup of tea. He's in the Breakfast Nook, though, if you wanna meet him yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"His name's Moe Bender. I don't recommend you waste your time with him though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
