__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him,\" Jim says. \"Don't care much for him, though. He's up to something shifty, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Elizabeth's bodyguard... Oh. You mean Moe Bender,\" Jim says, shaking his head. \"Yeah, no. I don't need the stress, know what I mean?\""));
