__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Jake Cash's great, just great,\" Jim says. \"Go check out the Basement, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Jake Cash?\" Jim asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Jake Cash.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure!\" Jim says. \"That man's a real peach. He's over in the Basement -- tell him I said hi.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer... Lawyer...\" Jim mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Jake Cash! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Elizabeth's lawyer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, me and Jake Cash, we get along great!\" Jim says. \"Two peas in a pod, that's us. He'll be in the Basement, tell him I sent ya.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Jake Cash?\" Jim asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Jake Cash.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh sure, that's Jake Cash,\" he says. \"Me and him, we go way back. Waaay back. Can't say enough good things about him.\""));
