__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well now,\" Jim says, \"I wouldn't wanna be tellin' tales outta school, Detective. I haven't got any evidence for this, y'unnerstand. But if ya ask me -- which you did -- I'd say it was Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Jim says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Jim says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Jim says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now,\" Jim says, \"I wouldn't wanna be tellin' tales outta school, Detective. I haven't got any evidence for this, y'unnerstand. But if ya ask me -- which you did -- I'd say it was Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now,\" Jim says, \"I wouldn't wanna be tellin' tales outta school, Detective. I haven't got any evidence for this, y'unnerstand. But if ya ask me -- which you did -- I'd say it was Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Jenkins says. \"You will find him in the Breakfast Nook, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Jim Adams to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jenkins says. \"Presently, he is in the Breakfast Nook. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Jim Adams, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Jim Adams, Jenkins says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
