__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Guest Bedroom,\" Jenkins says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Jenkins says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Guest Bedroom at the moment,\" Jenkins says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
