__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Basement is where you can find them.\""));
