__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Louis Gates,\" Jenkins says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jedediah Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Servants' Quarters,\" Jenkins says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Louis Gates, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Jenkins says. \"You will find him in the Hall Closet, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Jenkins says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Bar, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Jenkins says. \"You will find him in the Hall Closet, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Jenkins says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Bar, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jenkins says. \"Presently, he is in the Hall Closet. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Bar, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Hall Closet,\" Jenkins says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Bar, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
