__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jenkins says. \"Presently, he is in the Hall Closet. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Jenkins says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Bar, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jenkins says. \"Presently, he is in the Hall Closet. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
