__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Jenkins says. \"You will find him in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Moe Bender to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Moe Bender, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Jenkins says. \"You will find him in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jenkins says. \"Presently, he is in the Lounge. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Moe Bender, Jenkins says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
