__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Basement at the moment,\" Jenkins says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Jenkins says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Basement,\" Jenkins says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Basement at the moment,\" Jenkins says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Lounge is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Basement,\" Jenkins says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
