__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Jake Cash?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Basement,\" Jenkins says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Lounge is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Elizabeth Wilkerson's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"The butler.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Elizabeth Wilkerson's butler, Detective,\" Jenkins says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Elizabeth Wilkerson's butler,\" Jenkins says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"The butler.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Elizabeth Wilkerson's butler, Detective,\" Jenkins says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"The butler.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Elizabeth Wilkerson's butler, Detective,\" Jenkins says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Elizabeth Wilkerson's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Jenkins says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Elizabeth Wilkerson's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He's a jackass,\" Louis replies, \"and he's in the Breakfast Nook.\"<p>\"Good lord. Don't wear yourself out, saying that many words all at once.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't really know her. Name's Gianna Landry.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about her?\"<p>\"She's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He's a jackass,\" Louis replies, \"and he's in the Breakfast Nook.\"<p>\"Good lord. Don't wear yourself out, saying that many words all at once.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p><p>\"Gianna Landry. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>He turns a page and doesn't reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about him.\"<p>\"At this point,\" you growl, \"I would be delighted to get any kind of information at all out of you.\"<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Don't really know her. Name's Gianna Landry.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about her?\"<p>\"She's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p><p>\"Gianna Landry. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>He turns a page and doesn't reply."));
