__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
