__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Jake says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Elizabeth's bodyguard?\" Jake says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Jake says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Breakfast Nook. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Breakfast Nook, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Jake says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Jake says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Jake says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Breakfast Nook. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Jake says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Breakfast Nook,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Jake says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Jake says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Jake says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Elizabeth's bodyguard?\" Jake says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Moe Bender?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Breakfast Nook, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Gianna Landry. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Gianna Landry is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Jake says. \"She's Elizabeth's best friend. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Best friend...\" Jake mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Gianna Landry. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Gianna Landry, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Elizabeth's best friend. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Best friend...\" Jake mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Gianna Landry. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Elizabeth's best friend,\" Jake says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Best friend...\" Jake mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Gianna Landry. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Elizabeth's best friend,\" Jake says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Jake says. \"Everyone loves Gianna Landry.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Gianna Landry, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Elizabeth's best friend. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Gianna Landry,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Gianna Landry?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Gianna Landry is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Jake says. \"She's Elizabeth's best friend. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Gianna Landry,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
