__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Jake mutters. \"I don't know how Elizabeth got stuck with a college roommate like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Sunroom,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>Jake shudders. \"He's Elizabeth's college roommate. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Sunroom, if you want to talk to them,\" Jake says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Mitch Bridges?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Jake mutters. \"I don't know how Elizabeth got stuck with a college roommate like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Jake mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Sunroom, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Mitch Bridges. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Elizabeth's college roommate,\" Jake replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
