__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jedediah Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Jedediah Garza,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
