__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Jedediah Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Servants' Quarters. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Servants' Quarters, if you want to talk to them,\" Jake says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Kenny Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Hall Closet,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Kenny Benton,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Hall Closet, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Sibling...\" Jake mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Kenny Benton. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Hall Closet,\" Jake says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"That's Kenny Benton,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
