__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Hall Closet, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Kenny Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Hall Closet,\" Jake says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Jake says. \"Everyone loves Kenny Benton.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
