__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Jim Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
