__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Jake says. \"Everyone loves Jim Adams.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
