__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor...\" Jake mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Buck Jenkins. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Buck Jenkins. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Game Room, having a grand old time.\""));
