__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>Jake shudders. \"He's Elizabeth's butler. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"The only butler I'm aware of around here is Louis Gates, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Jake mutters. \"I don't know how Elizabeth got stuck with a butler like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Louis Gates. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Elizabeth's butler,\" Jake replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Louis Gates. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>Jake shudders. \"He's Elizabeth's butler. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"That's Louis Gates. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Elizabeth's butler,\" Jake replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Louis Gates,\" Jake says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Jake mutters. \"I don't know how Elizabeth got stuck with a butler like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a lawyer like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Louis Gates,\" Jake says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Wilkerson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"The only butler I'm aware of around here is Louis Gates, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Louis Gates?\" you ask.<p>Jake shudders. \"He's Elizabeth's butler. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Elizabeth Wilkerson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Louis Gates,\" Jake says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Elizabeth's dental hygienist,\" Jake says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Jake says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Elizabeth's dental hygienist killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Elizabeth's dental hygienist,\" Jake says. \"Does it make you happy to know that? If it does, please let me know, because having never experienced that emotion myself, it's difficult for me to detect it in others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Jake says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Elizabeth's dental hygienist killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Jake says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Jake says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well,\" Jake says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Elizabeth's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Dining Room, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Lonnie Spencer, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Attic, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. \"You must be Theodore Witt, the victim's dental hygienist,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Theodore grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Hall Closet, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. \"You must be Riley Stark, the victim's lawyer,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Laundry Room. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Maya Forbes, the victim's butler.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Maya Forbes. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Master Bedroom you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Lucy Hardy, the victim's chauffeur,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Smoking Lounge, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. \"You must be Arianna Erickson, the victim's best friend,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Sunroom you find a pale, drably-dressed woman slouched on a small chair. She looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. \"You must be Bella Wilson, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Servants' Quarters you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Jessica Park, the victim's business partner.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Boiler Room, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. Your dossier identifies her as Bella Gibson, the victim's boss.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>Lonnie scowls. \"What, now you're after Theodore Witt? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! He's in the Attic, you can go talk to him yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, yeah. I think I saw them in the Attic?\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, making a note of it. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah. S'alright, I guess? We don't really interact.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>Lonnie scowls. \"What, now you're after Theodore Witt? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! He's in the Attic, you can go talk to him yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Attic. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
