__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Lucy Hardy. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lucy Hardy? I can't stand the sight of that slimy worm. I think she's in the Master Bedroom? Go see for yourself what a piece of crap she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur? Chauffeur...\" Lonnie lights a cigarette and thinks for a moment. \"...Oh! You mean Lucy Hardy. Yeah, I don't give a crap about that woman.\""));
