__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Lonnie asks. \"Okay. It was Brooklyn's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" He reaches into his jacket pocket, and pulls out his middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Lonnie says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Brooklyn's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Lonnie asks. \"Okay. It was Brooklyn's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" He reaches into his jacket pocket, and pulls out his middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Theodore says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Dining Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Theodore says. \"I think they'd be in the Boiler Room at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Lonnie Spencer's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Dining Room if you want to meet him.\""));
