__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Theodore says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Dining Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Boiler Room.\""));
