__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Theodore says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Dining Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Theodore says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Boiler Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
