__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Riley Stark,\" Theodore says. \"You'll find her in the Hall Closet, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Theodore says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Laundry Room right now.\""));
