__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Theodore sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Boiler Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
