__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Brooklyn's boss, I know her,\" Theodore says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Brooklyn's boss,\" Theodore says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Theodore says. \"I think they'd be in the Dining Room at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Lucy Hardy!\" Theodore says. \"That's Brooklyn's boss. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
