__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Theodore says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Sunroom, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Horton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Riley Stark,\" Theodore says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
