__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Horton's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Riley Stark. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Bella Wilson's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Sunroom if you want to meet her.\""));
