__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Horton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Theodore says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Master Bedroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Theodore grunts. \"That's Brooklyn's business partner -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Theodore sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Master Bedroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Brooklyn's business partner,\" Theodore says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
