__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Brooklyn?\" Theodore says. \"That's easy, it was her college roommate.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Theodore flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Theodore says. \"It was Brooklyn's college roommate.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Brooklyn?\" Theodore says. \"That's easy, it was her college roommate.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Theodore flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Theodore says. \"It was Brooklyn's college roommate.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Theodore says. \"It was Brooklyn's college roommate.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
