__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Riley says. \"He's in the Dining Room. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
