__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Riley says. \"That's the victim's best friend. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
