__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Riley says, excitedly pulling out her notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's dental hygienist! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Golly!\" Riley exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>She flips open her notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's dental hygienist, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the dental hygienist, Detective!\" Riley says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Riley exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>She flips open her notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's dental hygienist, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh, it's definitely the dental hygienist, Detective!\" Riley says. \"I can't prove it, but if you send these hair and fingerprint samples to the police lab...\"<p>\"I'll just take your word for it, kid.\""));
