__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, Detective,\" Riley says, excitedly pulling out her notebook, \"if you correlate everyone's movements and alibis on this chart I made...\" <p>\"The short version, please,\" you interrupt. <p>\"It's gotta be the victim's dental hygienist! Nobody else fits!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure!\" Maya says. \"That man's a real peach. He's over in the Dining Room -- tell him I said hi.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure,\" Maya says. \"Brooklyn's personal assistant is great. I don't know them much more than to say hello to, but I can tell they're a decent sort. Check in the Master Bedroom, if you wanna chat.\""));
