__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Sheesh,\" Maya grumbles. \"Yeah, I know Arianna Erickson. Know her like a kick in the teeth. Got about as much need for her, too.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" she replies. \"Her name's Arianna Erickson. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
