__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Maya says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Brooklyn like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Maya says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Maya says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Maya says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Maya says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Maya says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Brooklyn like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Maya says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Maya says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Lucy says. \"We get along quite well. He's Brooklyn's lawyer, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Bella Gibson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Lucy says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Bella Gibson?\" Lucy asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Lucy says. \"We get along quite well. He's Brooklyn's lawyer, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
