__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Brooklyn's lawyer and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
