__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Lucy asks. \"Oh -- you mean Brooklyn's boss. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Theodore Witt. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Lucy says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Theodore Witt. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Lucy says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Theodore Witt. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Brooklyn's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Lucy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Theodore Witt. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Brooklyn's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Lucy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Horton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Lucy sniffs. \"His name is Theodore Witt, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Brooklyn's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Lucy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Theodore Witt? Bah,\" Lucy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Brooklyn's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Lucy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Theodore Witt? Bah,\" Lucy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Riley Stark?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Lucy asks. \"Oh -- you mean Brooklyn's boss. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Lucy sniffs. \"His name is Theodore Witt, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Maya Forbes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Lucy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Bella Gibson and I get along rather well,\" Lucy says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Maya Forbes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Lucy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Bella Gibson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Lucy says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Maya Forbes?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Lucy says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maya Forbes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Maya Forbes is my biggest fan!\" Lucy says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Bella Gibson and I get along rather well,\" Lucy says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maya Forbes?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Lucy says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Laundry Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Bella Gibson?\" Lucy asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Maya Forbes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Lucy smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Laundry Room -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
