__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Bella Gibson?\" Lucy asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Lucy says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Horton's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Hall Closet,\" Lucy says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Lucy says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Lucy snorts. \"Their presence in the Hall Closet is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Brooklyn's personal assistant, and an absolute philistine,\" Lucy scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Lucy says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Hall Closet,\" Lucy says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Lucy asks. \"Oh -- you mean Brooklyn's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
