__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Lucy says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Sunroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Bella Gibson? Bah,\" Lucy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Lucy says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Sunroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Bella Gibson. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Lucy says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Sunroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Bella Gibson. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Sunroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
