__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know Jessica Park?\" you ask.<p>\"Brooklyn's lawyer and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Yes, Maya Forbes and I get along rather well,\" Lucy says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Jessica Park. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Lucy says. \"We get along quite well. She's Brooklyn's lawyer, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
