__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Theodore Witt? Bah,\" Lucy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Lucy says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Boiler Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Theodore Witt. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Boiler Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Theodore Witt? Bah,\" Lucy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Theodore Witt? Bah,\" Lucy says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Lucy snorts. \"You're referring to Theodore Witt. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Lucy muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Maya Forbes.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Lucy says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Maya Forbes,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Lucy says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Maya Forbes'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Lucy muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Maya Forbes.\""));
