__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Brooklyn refers to as her personal assistant,\" Erickson says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Erickson scowls. \"Brooklyn really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a personal assistant such as Lonnie Spencer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lonnie Spencer?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Brooklyn's personal assistant? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Lonnie Spencer,\" Erickson says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>Erickson snorts derisively. \"Brooklyn's personal assistant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh! Do not even breathe the name Lonnie Spencer in my presence, Detective!\" Erickson demands. \"I didn't, but your request is noted,\" you reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>Erickson snorts derisively. \"Brooklyn's personal assistant is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
