__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Brooklyn refers to as her personal assistant,\" Erickson says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Erickson says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Attic at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Attic,\" Erickson sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Attic,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
