__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Bella Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Brooklyn's college roommate,\" Erickson says. \"A perfectly charming woman, despite her upbringing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Erickson says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Sunroom?\""));
