__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Bella Gibson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Erickson snorts derisively. \"Brooklyn's boss is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
