__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Bella Gibson?\" she muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Brooklyn's boss? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with her.\""));
