__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Erickson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Erickson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Erickson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Erickson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"I don't know how Brooklyn got stuck with a lawyer like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Smoking Lounge, if you want to talk to them,\" Bella says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Brooklyn's lawyer,\" Bella replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Smoking Lounge, if you want to talk to them,\" Bella says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>Bella shudders. \"He's Brooklyn's lawyer. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Smoking Lounge, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
