__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Smoking Lounge,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>Bella shudders. \"He's Brooklyn's lawyer. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
