__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lonnie Spencer,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Attic,\" Bella says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Bella mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Lonnie Spencer. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Attic,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lonnie Spencer,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Attic,\" Bella says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Bella says. \"Everyone loves Lonnie Spencer.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Attic, having a grand old time.\""));
