__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Lucy Hardy. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Lucy Hardy,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Master Bedroom. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Dining Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Master Bedroom. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Dining Room,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Lucy Hardy,\" she replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
