__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Dining Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Bella says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
