__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Arianna Erickson, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Brooklyn's boss. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Bella says. \"Everyone loves Maya Forbes.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Arianna Erickson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Arianna Erickson is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Bella says. \"She's Brooklyn's boss. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
