__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Bella says. \"Everyone loves Lucy Hardy.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner...\" Bella mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Lucy Hardy. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lucy Hardy,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jessica Park?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Brooklyn's boss,\" Bella says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Jessica Park?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Brooklyn's boss,\" Bella says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Lucy Hardy,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner...\" Bella mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Lucy Hardy. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Brooklyn's butler,\" Bella replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Laundry Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>Bella shudders. \"She's Brooklyn's butler. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Laundry Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"I don't know how Brooklyn got stuck with a butler like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Laundry Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>Bella shudders. \"She's Brooklyn's butler. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Laundry Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Bella says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Brooklyn's butler,\" Bella replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Laundry Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Bella says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Laundry Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Bella says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Horton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Laundry Room,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"I don't know how Brooklyn got stuck with a butler like her. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a college roommate like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Laundry Room,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>Bella shudders. \"She's Brooklyn's butler. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Bella mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Laundry Room, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Brooklyn Horton? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Brooklyn Horton? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Brooklyn, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Brooklyn Horton? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Brooklyn Horton? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Park says. \"You will find him in the Dining Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Park says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Master Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Park says. \"Presently, he is in the Dining Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Park says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Master Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Park says. \"Presently, he is in the Dining Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Park says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Master Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Park says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Master Bedroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Park says. \"You will find him in the Dining Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Dining Room,\" Park says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Park says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Master Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Park says. \"Presently, he is in the Dining Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Park says. \"Presently, he is in the Dining Room. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Master Bedroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Park says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Dining Room,\" Park says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Park says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Master Bedroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Attic,\" Park says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Lucy Hardy,\" Park says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Theodore Witt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Attic,\" Park says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Lucy Hardy, Detective,\" Park says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Theodore Witt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Attic,\" Park says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
