__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Attic at the moment,\" Park says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Lucy Hardy,\" Park says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Theodore Witt?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Attic,\" Park says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
