__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You are referring to Lucy Hardy, I presume,\" Park says. \"She is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
