__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Riley Stark. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Park says. \"You will find her in the Hall Closet, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
