__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Park says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Attic, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Master Bedroom,\" Park says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Park says. \"You will find her in the Master Bedroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Park says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Attic, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Master Bedroom,\" Park says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Attic, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Park says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Lucy Hardy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Park says. \"Presently, she is in the Master Bedroom. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Park says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Attic, you might send my regards.\""));
