__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Attic, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Park says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Smoking Lounge,\" Park says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Park says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this woman in the Smoking Lounge,\" Park says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for her own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Park says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Arianna Erickson?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Smoking Lounge at the moment,\" Park says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
