__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Bella Gibson?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brooklyn Horton's best friend,\" Park says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brooklyn Horton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Arianna Erickson, Park says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Park says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Brooklyn Horton has true relevance, Detective,\" Park says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Park says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Park says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Park says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Lonnie Spencer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about him.\"<p>\"At this point,\" you growl, \"I would be delighted to get any kind of information at all out of you.\"<p>\"He's in the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>Bella grimaces and turns a page. \"Ugh.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything about them at all?\"<p>\"Name's Riley Stark.\"<p>\"...That's it, huh?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Lonnie Spencer?\" you ask.<p>\"He's a jackass,\" Bella replies, \"and he's in the Dining Room.\"<p>\"Good lord. Don't wear yourself out, saying that many words all at once.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't really know her. Name's Riley Stark.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about her?\"<p>\"She's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
