__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" she says, turning a page in her book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" she says, turning a page in her book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" she says, turning a page in her book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>She shakes her head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Boiler Room and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. According to the dossier, this is Amelia Gill, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Laundry Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Douglas Sargent, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing him your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Sunroom and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the dossier, this is Oliver Bolton, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and he looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Wine Cellar, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Paige Warren, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Paige grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Guest Bedroom, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Andre McIntyre, the victim's child.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Study, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. Your dossier identifies him as Claudius Dunn, the victim's cousin.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Family Room and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. \"You must be Maury Adams, the victim's dental hygienist,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Dining Room and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Ella Zimmerman, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "Inside the Billiard Room you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Taylor Tyler, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Good, good,\" she says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Gill says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Study is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Gill says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Study is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's child, I believe,\" Gill says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sanchez's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's child, I believe,\" Gill says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Gill says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Douglas Sargent. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Gill says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Douglas Sargent. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's child, I believe,\" Gill says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Gill says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Oliver Bolton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Sunroom,\" Gill says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Family Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Gill says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Gill says. \"Presently, he is in the Sunroom. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Family Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Gill says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Gill says. \"Presently, he is in the Sunroom. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Gill says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Family Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Gill says. \"Presently, he is in the Sunroom. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Family Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Gill says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Gill says. \"You will find him in the Sunroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sanchez's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Gill says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Family Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Sunroom,\" Gill says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
