__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Family Room at the moment,\" Gill says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Claudius Dunn, Detective,\" Gill says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
