__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Brianna Sanchez's golf caddy,\" Gill says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sanchez's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Gill says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Study, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Brianna Sanchez's golf caddy,\" Gill says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Gill says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Study, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Gill says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Brianna Sanchez's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her child.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Gill says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Brianna Sanchez's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her child.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Gill says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Brianna Sanchez's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her child.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Gill says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Brianna Sanchez's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her child.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"The child.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Brianna Sanchez's child, Detective,\" Gill says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Douglas exclaims. \"Brianna's college roommate? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Douglas says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Boiler Room isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Brianna's college roommate?\" Douglas says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Brianna never even had a college roommate! Go to the Boiler Room and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Douglas says. \"I wouldn't associate with Brianna's creepy college roommate if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Douglas exclaims. \"They'rein the Laundry Room, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Brianna's college roommate?\" Douglas says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
