__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Laundry Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
