__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"Paige Warren? I think she's safe,\" Douglas says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Paige Warren is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Douglas says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Douglas says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Wine Cellar, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Paige Warren?\" Douglas says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Douglas says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Wine Cellar and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
