__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Andre McIntyre. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Douglas says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Guest Bedroom and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
