__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Guest Bedroom, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
