__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Douglas says. \"He's Brianna's cousin. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Claudius Dunn is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Douglas says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Brianna's cousin? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Claudius Dunn?\" Douglas says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Douglas says. \"He's Brianna's cousin. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
