__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Douglas says. \"His name's Claudius Dunn. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
