__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Brianna's cousin,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
