__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Brianna's cousin,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Maury Adams. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Laundry Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Douglas exclaims. \"They'rein the Laundry Room, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Laundry Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Douglas says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Family Room isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Douglas declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Family Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Brianna never even had a dental hygienist! Go to the Family Room and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
