__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Douglas says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Billiard Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Billiard Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Douglas says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Billiard Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Douglas says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Laundry Room, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Taylor Tyler? I think she's safe,\" Douglas says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Douglas says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Billiard Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
