__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Douglas says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Laundry Room, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Douglas says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Billiard Room and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sanchez's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Douglas says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Laundry Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Douglas says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Billiard Room and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
