__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Douglas says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Laundry Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Douglas says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Billiard Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
