__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Douglas asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Douglas exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who did it?\" Douglas asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Douglas asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Douglas asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Douglas exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Douglas exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Douglas shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Brianna committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Douglas shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Brianna committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Amelia Gill's a positive delight!\" Oliver says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Claudius Dunn,\" Oliver says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Amelia Gill. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Oliver says. \"Did you know she's Brianna's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"College roommate, college roommate. Hmm,\" Oliver ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Claudius Dunn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Brianna's college roommate. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Oliver says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Brianna's cousin, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Claudius Dunn, isn't it?\" Oliver asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Claudius Dunn,\" Oliver says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Amelia Gill. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Amelia Gill. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Oliver says. \"Did you know she's Brianna's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
