__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Amelia Gill. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Oliver says. \"Did you know she's Brianna's cousin? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate, college roommate. Hmm,\" Oliver ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Claudius Dunn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Brianna's college roommate. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
