__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Douglas Sargent. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Oliver says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Brianna's lawyer, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
