__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Oliver says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Wine Cellar, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
