__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Paige Warren,\" Oliver says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Wine Cellar, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
