__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Brianna's bodyguard?\" Oliver says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Dining Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Brianna's bodyguard?\" Oliver says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Dining Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Oliver muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Brianna's bodyguard? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Dining Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Do you know Sanchez's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Dining Room, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Brianna's bodyguard?\" Oliver says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Oliver says as sternly as he can muster, \"Brianna's cousin is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Dining Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Oliver says. \"He's Brianna's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
