__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Maury Adams. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Maury Adams is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Oliver says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Oliver says as sternly as he can muster, \"Brianna's dental hygienist is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Boiler Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Maury Adams is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Oliver says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
