__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Maury Adams is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Oliver says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Boiler Room, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Maury Adams is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Oliver says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Boiler Room, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Family Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Oliver declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Oliver says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Family Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Ella Zimmerman. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Ella Zimmerman. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Oliver says. \"Did you know she's Brianna's sibling? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Oliver says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Study? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Ella Zimmerman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ella Zimmerman's a positive delight!\" Oliver says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Oliver says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Study, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Ella Zimmerman?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ella Zimmerman's a positive delight!\" Oliver says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Oliver says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Study and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Zimmerman?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Oliver says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Brianna's sibling, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Oliver says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Study and ask for yourself.\""));
