__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Oliver muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Brianna's college roommate? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Sanchez's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Oliver says. \"Calls herself 'Paige Warren', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Paige Warren' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Oliver muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Brianna's college roommate? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Oliver says. \"Calls herself 'Paige Warren', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Paige Warren' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Taylor Tyler. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Oliver says. \"She's Brianna's college roommate, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Oliver says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Paige Warren, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Brianna's college roommate?\" Oliver says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Oliver says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Paige Warren, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
