__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Oliver says. \"She's Brianna's college roommate, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Paige Warren, Detective?\" Oliver asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Oliver says. \"She's Brianna's college roommate, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Oliver says. \"Calls herself 'Paige Warren', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Paige Warren' by choice, can you?\""));
