__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Paige says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Laundry Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
