__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Sanchez's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Laundry Room.\""));
