__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Paige says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Laundry Room, you can find him there.\""));
