__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Oliver Bolton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Oliver Bolton's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" she replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Sunroom if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Oliver Bolton. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
