__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Brianna Sanchez's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Brianna's golf caddy? Oh, you mean Oliver Bolton,\" Paige says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
