__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Paige says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Claudius Dunn. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Paige says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Claudius Dunn. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh ho!\" Paige exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Claudius Dunn. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Paige says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Claudius Dunn. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Paige says. I know who it was. It was Claudius Dunn. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"She's a jackass,\" Andre replies, \"and she's in the Boiler Room.\"<p>\"Good lord. Don't wear yourself out, saying that many words all at once.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p><p>\"Oliver Bolton. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>He turns a page and doesn't reply."));
