__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know him,\" Claudius replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. He's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. He's probably in the Laundry Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
