__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Maury says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Claudius Dunn. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
