__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Claudius Dunn. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Claudius Dunn. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Maury says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Claudius Dunn. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Maury says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Amelia Gill?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Boiler Room,\" Zimmerman sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Taylor Tyler,\" Zimmerman says. \"That loathsome little insect of a woman. I have nothing to do with her, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Amelia Gill. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" she snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with her, she is in the Boiler Room.\""));
