__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Zimmerman says. \"Her name is Taylor Tyler. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"He and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but he seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Family Room and ask him directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Taylor Tyler? Why yes,\" she replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
