__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Taylor Tyler?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Zimmerman says haughtily. \"You may speak to her yourself, if you wish -- she's in the Billiard Room.\""));
