__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Zimmerman says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
