__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Gill says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Gill says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Study is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Gill says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's child, I believe,\" Gill says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Study.\""));
