__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Douglas Sargent?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Brianna Sanchez's child,\" Gill says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Gill says. \"You will find him in the Sunroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Gill says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Family Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Gill says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Family Room, I believe.\""));
