__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Oliver Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Sunroom,\" Gill says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
