__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Paige Warren. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's cousin,\" Gill says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a sibling,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"If you seek them out in the Dining Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Gill says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's cousin,\" Gill says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Gill says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Dining Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's cousin,\" Gill says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paige Warren?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Brianna Sanchez's cousin,\" Gill says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Paige Warren. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Brianna Sanchez's cousin,\" Gill says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Gill says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Dining Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Gill says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Dining Room, you might send my regards.\""));
