__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Gill says. \"Presently, he is in the Study. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sanchez's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Oliver Bolton, Gill says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Oliver Bolton, Gill says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Oliver Bolton, Detective,\" Gill says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
