__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Gill says. \"You will find him in the Study, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Oliver Bolton, Detective,\" Gill says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Claudius Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Study,\" Gill says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Oliver Bolton to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Family Room,\" Gill says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sanchez's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Claudius Dunn, Detective,\" Gill says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Claudius Dunn, I presume,\" Gill says. \"He is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sanchez's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Claudius Dunn,\" Gill says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Family Room,\" Gill says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Claudius Dunn,\" Gill says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Maury Adams?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Family Room at the moment,\" Gill says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
