__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Gill says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Sunroom.\""));
