__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Taylor Tyler. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Brianna Sanchez's golf caddy,\" Gill says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
