__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Ballroom, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Max Bolton, the victim's accountant.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Attic, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. According to the dossier, this is Andrea Ramirez, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Kitchen, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking man dressed for a white-tie occasion. He looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what he sees. According to the dossier, this is Jacky Humphrey, the victim's butler.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" he  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>He glares at you for a second, then rolls his eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Breakfast Nook and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Angelina Tran, the victim's cousin.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" she mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" she says, rolling her eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "When you enter the Living Room, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. \"You must be Woody McGowan, the victim's chauffeur,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Leah White,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Bar, and encounter a young woman -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Madison Spears, the victim's child.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Leah White was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Library, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Stevie Allison, the victim's boss.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Servants' Quarters, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Boris Weiss, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Boris grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Boiler Room and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Joey Sanford, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh man, all I know about her is that she's like the coolest! She's wild as hell, go check out the Attic and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know White's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper...\" Max muses, then his eyes light up. \"Oh, yeah, dude! I know who you mean. They're cool. Go check out the Library, you'll find 'em there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, sure man,\" Max says. \"She's a solid bro. She'll be in the Attic, that's where she hangs out. Tell her I said hey.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Housekeeper...\" Max muses, then his eyes light up. \"Oh, yeah, dude! I know who you mean. They're cool. Go check out the Library, you'll find 'em there.\""));
