__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know her,\" Max replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. She's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. She's probably in the Breakfast Nook, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" he replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Attic and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez man, I dunno much,\" he replies. \"Except she's a total control freak buzzkill. Like, she's in the Breakfast Nook, so like, just check out that scene for yourself and you'll see.\""));
