__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Andrea says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Ballroom and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Andrea says. \"His name's Max Bolton. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
