__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Andrea says. \"Her name's Angelina Tran. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Leah's cousin? Well, I don't trust her,\" she says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Angelina Tran?\" Andrea says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Leah's cousin? Well, I don't trust her,\" she says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Woody McGowan?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody McGowan? I think he's safe,\" Andrea says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know White's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Living Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Woody McGowan?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody McGowan? I think he's safe,\" Andrea says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Andrea says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Attic, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
