__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Andrea declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Library if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
