__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Joey Sanford? Stay away from him!\" Andrea says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Joey Sanford. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Andrea says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Boiler Room!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Joey Sanford? Stay away from him!\" Andrea says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Joey Sanford?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Attic, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Andrea says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Andrea says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Andrea looks around, then whispers, \"It was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't know,\" Andrea says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Andrea says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Andrea says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Andrea looks around, then whispers, \"It was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Andrea says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Andrea says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Andrea looks around, then whispers, \"It was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Andrea says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Andrea looks around, then whispers, \"It was Leah's boss.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Humphrey says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Humphrey scowls. \"Leah really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a accountant such as Max Bolton.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Ballroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I utterly refuse to have anything to do with that despicable man,\" Humphrey scowls. \"Leah really suffered from the most appalling luck, to be stuck with a accountant such as Max Bolton.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Ballroom,\" Humphrey sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Max Bolton,\" Humphrey says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
