__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Leah refers to as her housekeeper,\" Humphrey says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Humphrey sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>Humphrey snorts derisively. \"Leah's housekeeper is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
