__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Woody McGowan?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Leah's chauffeur,\" Humphrey says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with him with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody McGowan? Why yes,\" he replies. \"He's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame he'll never amount to anything.\""));
