__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" he says. \"Madison Spears. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Madison Spears?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Leah's child,\" Humphrey says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Humphrey says. \"Her name is Madison Spears. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Library.\""));
