__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Library,\" Humphrey sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
