__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Humphrey smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Stevie Allison?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Humphrey smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Stevie Allison?\""));
