__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Humphrey sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Stevie Allison? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Humphrey sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Stevie Allison? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Stevie Allison. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Max Bolton? He's alright, he's cool. I think he's over in the Ballroom? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
