__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>that</i> jerkoff. Go to the Boiler Room and see for yourself why I wouldn't give a wet fart.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Sanford?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Leah's dental hygienist? He's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
