__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Angelina says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Stevie Allison. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Stevie Allison. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Angelina says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Stevie Allison. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Angelina says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Stevie Allison. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Angelina says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Stevie Allison. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Stevie Allison. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Angelina says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Angelina says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Stevie Allison. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Max Bolton. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Woody says. \"Did you know he's Leah's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Woody says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Servants' Quarters, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Max Bolton. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Woody says. \"Did you know he's Leah's child? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Woody says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Servants' Quarters and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Max Bolton's a positive delight!\" Woody says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Woody says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Servants' Quarters and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Max Bolton's a positive delight!\" Woody says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Woody says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Servants' Quarters? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Woody says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Leah's child, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Woody says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Servants' Quarters and ask for yourself.\""));
