__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Andrea Ramirez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Andrea Ramirez!\" Woody says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know White's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Woody ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Joey Sanford? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Leah's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Andrea Ramirez,\" Woody says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Attic, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Housekeeper, housekeeper. Hmm,\" Woody ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Joey Sanford? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Leah's housekeeper. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Woody says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Attic, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"That's Joey Sanford, isn't it?\" Woody asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
