__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Joey Sanford,\" Woody says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jacky Humphrey?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Jacky Humphrey!\" Woody says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Kitchen.\""));
