__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Angelina Tran is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Woody says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Breakfast Nook, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Calls herself 'Andrea Ramirez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Andrea Ramirez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Calls herself 'Andrea Ramirez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Andrea Ramirez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Woody says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Breakfast Nook is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Calls herself 'Andrea Ramirez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Andrea Ramirez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Angelina Tran is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Woody says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Breakfast Nook, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Woody says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Andrea Ramirez, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Woody says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Breakfast Nook is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know White's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Woody says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Andrea Ramirez, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Woody says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Breakfast Nook is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Calls herself 'Andrea Ramirez', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Andrea Ramirez' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Woody says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Breakfast Nook, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know White's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Andrea Ramirez, Detective?\" Woody asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Angelina Tran?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Woody says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Breakfast Nook, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Woody says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Andrea Ramirez, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Madison Spears?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Leah's personal assistant?\" Woody says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Woody says as sternly as he can muster, \"Leah's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Servants' Quarters. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madison Spears?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Woody says. \"She's Leah's personal assistant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Woody says as sternly as he can muster, \"Leah's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Servants' Quarters. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Madison Spears?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Woody muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Leah's personal assistant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Servants' Quarters with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Woody declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madison Spears?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Woody muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Leah's personal assistant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
