__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Servants' Quarters, Detective,\" Woody says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Madison Spears?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Woody says. \"She's Leah's personal assistant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know White's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Woody says as sternly as he can muster, \"Leah's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Servants' Quarters. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Woody says as sternly as he can muster, \"Leah's child is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Servants' Quarters. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Stevie Allison,\" Woody says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Library, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Boss, boss. Hmm,\" Woody ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Boris Weiss? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Leah's boss. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Boris Weiss,\" Woody says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Stevie Allison. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Woody says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Library, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Boris Weiss, isn't it?\" Woody asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Stevie Allison!\" Woody says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Library.\""));
