__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Joey Sanford?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Joey Sanford,\" Woody says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Boiler Room, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Woody says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Kitchen and ask for yourself.\""));
