__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Woody says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Kitchen? Is that the one?\""));
