__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know White's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Woody says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Kitchen, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Joey Sanford. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Joey Sanford,\" Woody says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Boiler Room, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Woody says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Kitchen and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Woody says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Kitchen, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Leah's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Woody looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Leah?\" Woody asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Tomas Shepard?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Leah?\" Woody asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Eddie Moody?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who murdered Leah?\" Woody asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Harold Dudley?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Woody looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Leah's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Woody says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Leah's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's boss,\" Madison says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Stevie Allison?\" Madison says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Leah White's boss!\" Madison says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Stevie Allison?\" Madison says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Stevie Allison?\" Madison says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Max Bolton!\" Madison says. \"He's the victim's boss. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Stevie Allison. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" she gasps."));
