__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Golly! You really want to know what I think, Detective?\" Madison says, excitedly, and pulls out a notebook. \"Okay, so, first I measured some footprints out in the driveway, and...\" <p>\"Kid, we're short on time. Cut to the chase and tell me the details later, okay?\"<p>\"Oh, okay! It was Woody McGowan!\""));
