__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It's just gotta be Woody McGowan, Detective,\" Madison says excitedly. \"Means, motive, and opportunity -- just like the Junior Detective's Handbook says!\""));
