__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Joey Sanford?\" you ask.<p>\"He's a jackass,\" Stevie replies, \"and he's in the Boiler Room.\"<p>\"Good lord. Don't wear yourself out, saying that many words all at once.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>Stevie grimaces and turns a page. \"Ugh.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything about them at all?\"<p>\"Name's Woody McGowan.\"<p>\"...That's it, huh?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Joey Sanford. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about him.\"<p>\"At this point,\" you growl, \"I would be delighted to get any kind of information at all out of you.\"<p>\"He's in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Don't really know him. Name's Woody McGowan.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about him?\"<p>\"He's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
