__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p><p>\"Woody McGowan. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>He turns a page and doesn't reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>He shakes his head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Max Bolton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Leah's chauffeur,\" Boris says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Angelina Tran. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Max Bolton!\" Boris says. \"That's Leah's chauffeur. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Angelina Tran. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Max Bolton!\" Boris says. \"That's Leah's chauffeur. I challenged him to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw him across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, he was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Leah's accountant? Oh, you mean Angelina Tran,\" Boris says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Angelina Tran,\" Boris says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Leah's chauffeur,\" Boris says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. He's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Angelina Tran. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
