__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Angelina Tran,\" Boris says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Angelina Tran,\" Boris says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Andrea Ramirez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Boris grunts. \"That's Leah's cousin -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Boris sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Kitchen. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Andrea Ramirez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Leah's cousin,\" Boris says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Boris says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Kitchen right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a cousin,\" Boris snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use her as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Boris thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Kitchen if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Leah's cousin,\" Boris says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
