__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jacky Humphrey?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Jacky Humphrey's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Kitchen if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Leah's butler? Oh, you mean Max Bolton,\" Boris says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jacky Humphrey?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Boris says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Kitchen, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know White's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Max Bolton,\" Boris says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
