__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Ballroom at the moment,\" Sanford says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Ballroom at the moment,\" Sanford says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
