__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Max Bolton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Ballroom,\" Sanford says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Living Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Ballroom,\" Sanford says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Ballroom,\" Sanford says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Sanford says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Max Bolton?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Ballroom,\" Sanford says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know White's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Sanford says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic,\" Sanford says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Madison Spears, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic,\" Sanford says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know White's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Madison Spears, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic,\" Sanford says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Madison Spears, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Sanford says. \"You will find her in the Attic, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"The victim's housekeeper -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Madison Spears, Sanford says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Andrea Ramirez. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Sanford says. \"You will find her in the Attic, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Madison Spears, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Sanford says. \"Presently, she is in the Attic. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's housekeeper? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Madison Spears to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Sanford says. \"Presently, she is in the Attic. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
