__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Andrea Ramirez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Sanford says. \"You will find her in the Attic, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Madison Spears to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Jacky Humphrey?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Leah White's chauffeur,\" Sanford says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"This man you are speaking of, his name is Stevie Allison,\" Sanford says. \"My interactions with him have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Jacky Humphrey. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Leah White's chauffeur, I believe,\" Sanford says. \"A man of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. He might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Stevie Allison, I presume,\" Sanford says. \"He is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Jacky Humphrey?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Leah White's chauffeur,\" Sanford says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Stevie Allison, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
