__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Leah White's housekeeper,\" Sanford says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know White's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Andrea Ramirez, Sanford says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Leah White's housekeeper,\" Sanford says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Leah White's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Andrea Ramirez, Sanford says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Stevie Allison?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Leah White's housekeeper,\" Sanford says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Andrea Ramirez, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Boris Weiss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Leah White's cousin,\" Sanford says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
