__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Boris Weiss?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Leah White's cousin,\" Sanford says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Andrea Ramirez, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
