__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Andrea Ramirez, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Andrea Ramirez, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Boris Weiss. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Leah White's cousin,\" Sanford says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Andrea Ramirez, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Boris Weiss?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Leah White's cousin,\" Sanford says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Boris Weiss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Leah White's cousin,\" Sanford says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Andrea Ramirez to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Boris Weiss?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Leah White's cousin,\" Sanford says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Leah White has true relevance, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Leah White has true relevance, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Sanford says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Sanford says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Leah White has true relevance, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Leah White has true relevance, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Sanford says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Sanford says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Family Room, where Willard Garza, the victim's gardener, is still puffing and sweating and lifting weights. \"How long do you intend to do that?\" you ask. <p>\"'Nother couple-a hours. On the free-weights, I mean. You gonna be done by then? I don't have a spare heavy-bag here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You return to the Game Room, and find the victim's neighbor, Chloe Graham, still working feverishly on her poem about the murder. Perhaps she's trying to race you to the conclusion. \"Oh! Hello,\" she says. \"I was hoping you would come back, so I could ask you: Victoria's last words -- how many were there?\"<p>\"How many? Well, I don't know that anyone but the murderer heard them, but according to the coroner's report it was a short sentence at the most. And probably just 'Ow'.\"<p>\"Not an entire sonnet? Well, that's a slight crimp in my plans.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Library, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. \"You must be Serenity Maynard, the victim's dental hygienist,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Smoking Lounge, a wild-eyed man accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Zachary Rodriquez, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing him your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You return to the Basement, where the victim's bodyguard, Dave Hewitt, is waiting impatiently. His icy glare as you enter drops the ambient temperature of the room by several degrees."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Master Bedroom you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Alistair Hardin, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Victoria. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Kitchen, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Ted Haynes, the victim's best friend.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Dining Room, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. \"You must be Curly Hale, the victim's ex-best friend,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "When you enter the Study, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Your dossier identifies him as Davey Suarez, the victim's butler.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Victoria Morrison,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Willard snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Willard says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Willard snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Game Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>Willard rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Ted Haynes. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Chloe Graham. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Willard snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Game Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>Willard rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Ted Haynes. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Willard snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Game Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>Willard rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Ted Haynes. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Chloe Graham,\" Willard says. \"You'll find her in the Game Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Willard snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Game Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Willard says. \"Ted Haynes, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Willard snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Morrison's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Willard says. \"Ted Haynes, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Chloe Graham,\" Willard says. \"You'll find her in the Game Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Willard says. \"Ted Haynes, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Victoria's butler,\" Willard says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Willard says. \"I think they'd be in the Dining Room at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Victoria's butler, I know her,\" Willard says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Serenity Maynard!\" Willard says. \"That's Victoria's butler. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Willard says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Dining Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Serenity Maynard!\" Willard says. \"That's Victoria's butler. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Dining Room.\""));
