__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Victoria's butler, I know her,\" Willard says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Willard says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Dining Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Serenity Maynard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Serenity Maynard!\" Willard says. \"That's Victoria's butler. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Willard says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Dining Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a neighbor,\" Willard snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Willard sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Kitchen. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Willard grunts. \"That's Victoria's neighbor -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Willard says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Kitchen right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Willard sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Kitchen. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Willard grunts. \"That's Victoria's neighbor -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Zachary Rodriquez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Victoria's neighbor,\" Willard says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Willard thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Kitchen if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
