__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a neighbor,\" Willard snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
