__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Willard snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Basement, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Willard says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Dave Hewitt,\" Willard says. \"You'll find him in the Basement, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried him away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Willard says. \"Davey Suarez, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
