__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, he's great,\" Willard says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. He's usually in the Dining Room, you can find him there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Curly Hale's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, he beats me at chess, and then I beat him at leg-wrestling. He's in the Dining Room if you want to meet him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim's ex-best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Willard says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Game Room if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like him,\" Willard says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. He'll be in the Dining Room, if you're looking for him.\""));
