__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Willard grunts. \"That's Victoria's cousin -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" His forehead creases as he considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's butler?\" you ask.<p>Willard rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Curly Hale. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Davey Suarez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a cousin,\" Willard snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Willard says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Victoria's cousin,\" Willard says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Willard says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a cousin,\" Willard snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victoria?\" Willard says. \"That's easy, it was her bodyguard.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Willard flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Willard says. \"It was Victoria's bodyguard.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Willard says. \"It was Victoria's bodyguard.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Willard says. \"It was Victoria's bodyguard.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victoria?\" Willard says. \"That's easy, it was her bodyguard.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Willard flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Willard says. \"It was Victoria's bodyguard.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's as easy as tearing a telephone in half,\" Willard says. \"It was Victoria's bodyguard.\"<p>'You don't mean 'telephone book', do you?\"<p>\"Nope.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Willard says. \"It was Victoria's bodyguard.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Family Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Willard Garza? Bah,\" Chloe says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chloe says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Chloe snorts. \"You're referring to Willard Garza. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chloe says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Morrison's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Willard Garza? Bah,\" Chloe says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chloe says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Willard Garza? Bah,\" Chloe says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Family Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chloe sniffs. \"His name is Willard Garza, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Chloe says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chloe sniffs. \"His name is Willard Garza, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Family Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chloe sniffs. \"His name is Willard Garza, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
