__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Morrison's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chloe sniffs. \"His name is Willard Garza, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Victoria's dental hygienist and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Serenity Maynard?\" Chloe asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Chloe says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victoria's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Serenity Maynard?\" Chloe asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Victoria's dental hygienist. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Chloe says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Serenity Maynard and I get along rather well,\" Chloe says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Serenity Maynard and I get along rather well,\" Chloe says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Chloe says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victoria's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Serenity Maynard and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Chloe says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Chloe says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victoria's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
