__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Chloe asks. \"Oh -- you mean Victoria's chauffeur. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Chloe snorts. \"You're referring to Zachary Rodriquez. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
