__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Zachary Rodriquez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Chloe says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The chauffeur. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
