__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Morrison's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Chloe snorts. \"Their presence in the Master Bedroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Master Bedroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Chloe snorts. \"Their presence in the Master Bedroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Chloe says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know Morrison's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Master Bedroom,\" Chloe says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chloe says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Master Bedroom,\" Chloe says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Alistair Hardin. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Chloe says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
