__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Chloe says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Master Bedroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Master Bedroom,\" Chloe says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Ted Haynes?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Chloe says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Ted Haynes?\" Chloe asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Ted Haynes. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Chloe says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh yes, Ted Haynes and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Chloe says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ted Haynes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Chloe smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Kitchen -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Ted Haynes and I get along rather well,\" Chloe says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Ted Haynes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Ted Haynes is my biggest fan!\" Chloe says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Ted Haynes and I get along rather well,\" Chloe says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
