__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Chloe says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The ex-best friend. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Dining Room,\" Chloe says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Chloe asks. \"Oh -- you mean Victoria's ex-best friend. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Dining Room,\" Chloe says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Victoria's ex-best friend, and an absolute philistine,\" Chloe scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
