__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Chloe says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Chloe snorts. \"You're referring to Davey Suarez. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Chloe says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The butler. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Davey Suarez? Bah,\" Chloe says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Chloe asks. \"Oh -- you mean Victoria's butler. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
