__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chloe sniffs. \"His name is Davey Suarez, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
