__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Zachary exclaims. \"Victoria's neighbor? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Zachary says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Alistair Hardin, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
