__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Victoria's bodyguard,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Library, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
