__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Zachary says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Smoking Lounge, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
