__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Zachary says. \"She's Victoria's bodyguard. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Morrison's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Library, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
