__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Zachary says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Smoking Lounge, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Victoria's cousin?\" Zachary says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that woman one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Zachary exclaims. \"They'rein the Smoking Lounge, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, not on your life,\" Zachary says. \"I wouldn't associate with Victoria's creepy cousin if you paid me. Not even in gold. Or bitcoins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Zachary says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Basement isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
