__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Dave Hewitt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Smoking Lounge, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Victoria never even had a bodyguard! Go to the Dining Room and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Zachary says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Master Bedroom and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Zachary says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Smoking Lounge, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Zachary says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Master Bedroom, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
