__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Do you know Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Master Bedroom.\""));
