__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Hewitt says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Master Bedroom.\""));
