__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ted Haynes?\" you ask.<p>\"Who? Oh, right. I know who ya mean,\" he replies. \"We don't pal around -- he's not really my cup of tea. He's in the Kitchen, though, if you wanna meet him yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"His name's Ted Haynes. I don't recommend you waste your time with him though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
