__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Alistair grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Serenity Maynard. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Alistair says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Serenity Maynard. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Alistair says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Serenity Maynard*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Alistair says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Serenity Maynard*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Alistair grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Serenity Maynard. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Alistair says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Serenity Maynard*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Alistair grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Serenity Maynard. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well now!\" Alistair says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Serenity Maynard*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Victoria's gardener? He's a scumbag, that's all I know. I wouldn't trust that sack of crap with my life.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Morrison's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Gardener? Gardener...\" Ted lights a cigarette and thinks for a moment. \"...Oh! You mean Willard Garza. Yeah, I don't give a crap about that man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Willard Garza. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Willard Garza, that's Victoria's gardener. I ain't got a single good word to say about that sleazy friggin' weasel.\""));
