__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Serenity Maynard. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Serenity Maynard. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Ted says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Serenity Maynard. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Ted says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Serenity Maynard. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Serenity Maynard. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Ted says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Ted says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Serenity Maynard. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" he says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Serenity Maynard. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Ted says, throwing his hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Victoria's bodyguard,\" Curly replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Library, if you want to talk to them,\" Curly says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Victoria got stuck with a bodyguard like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a ex-best friend like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Library,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
