__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Library, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
