__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Chloe Graham is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Curly says. \"She's Victoria's dental hygienist. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Suarez,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Chloe Graham is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Curly says. \"She's Victoria's dental hygienist. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Suarez,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's dental hygienist,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Neighbor...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Davey Suarez. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's dental hygienist,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's dental hygienist,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"Do you know Morrison's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Davey Suarez.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Chloe Graham, yeah,\" he says. \"She's Victoria's dental hygienist. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Davey Suarez,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Chloe Graham. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's dental hygienist,\" Curly says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Suarez,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Davey Suarez.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Serenity Maynard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Library, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Dental hygienist...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Ted Haynes. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Library,\" Curly says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Ted Haynes,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
