__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Ted Haynes.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Library,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Morrison's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Ted Haynes.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Ted Haynes.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Library, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's best friend,\" Curly says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Dave Hewitt. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's best friend,\" Curly says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Dave Hewitt.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Zachary Rodriquez is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Curly says. \"He's Victoria's best friend. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Zachary Rodriquez is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Curly says. \"He's Victoria's best friend. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Curly says. \"Everyone loves Dave Hewitt.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Do you know Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victoria's best friend,\" Curly says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Dave Hewitt,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Zachary Rodriquez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Zachary Rodriquez, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Victoria's best friend. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Dave Hewitt,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Curly mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Dave Hewitt. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Zachary Rodriquez is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Curly says. \"He's Victoria's best friend. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"That's Dave Hewitt,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Basement. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Study,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Dave Hewitt,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Study, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Dave Hewitt,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Study, if you want to talk to them,\" Curly says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
