__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Basement. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
