__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Morrison's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Zachary Rodriquez,\" Curly says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
