__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Victoria got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a ex-best friend like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Basement, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Victoria's neighbor,\" Curly replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
