__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Victoria's neighbor,\" Curly replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Basement,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>Curly shudders. \"He's Victoria's neighbor. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Curly says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Curly mutters. \"I don't know how Victoria got stuck with a neighbor like him. Of course, I don't know how she got stuck with a ex-best friend like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Curly says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Curly says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Davey Suarez?\" you ask.<p>Curly shudders. \"He's Victoria's neighbor. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Curly says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Victoria, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victoria Morrison? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Victoria, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victoria Morrison? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victoria Morrison? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Victoria, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"Calls himself 'Ted Haynes', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Ted Haynes' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Davey says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Family Room, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Davey says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Ted Haynes, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"Calls himself 'Ted Haynes', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Ted Haynes' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Willard Garza is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Davey says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Ted Haynes, Detective?\" Davey asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Willard Garza is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Davey says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Family Room, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Davey says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Ted Haynes, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Davey says. \"Calls himself 'Ted Haynes', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Ted Haynes' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Willard Garza?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Family Room is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Davey says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Ted Haynes, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Ted Haynes, Detective?\" Davey asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Chloe Graham!\" Davey says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Zachary Rodriquez,\" Davey says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Chloe Graham,\" Davey says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Game Room, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Zachary Rodriquez,\" Davey says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Davey says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Game Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Davey ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Zachary Rodriquez? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Victoria's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Chloe Graham?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Chloe Graham,\" Davey says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Game Room, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
