__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Zachary Rodriquez, isn't it?\" Davey asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Chloe Graham. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Davey says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Game Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
