__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Serenity Maynard is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Davey says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Library, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Kitchen, Detective,\" Davey says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Serenity Maynard is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Davey says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Library, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Kitchen, Detective,\" Davey says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Library is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Kitchen with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Davey declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Serenity Maynard is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Davey says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Library, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
