__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Davey says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Library, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Morrison's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Kitchen with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Davey declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Library is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Davey says as sternly as he can muster, \"Victoria's dental hygienist is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Kitchen. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Serenity Maynard is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Davey says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Library, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Davey says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, she could. She's in the Library, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Serenity Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Davey says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Library is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Victoria's bodyguard?\" Davey says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Curly Hale, Detective?\" Davey asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Davey says. \"He's Victoria's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Davey says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Curly Hale, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Zachary Rodriquez. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Davey muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Victoria's bodyguard? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Davey says. \"He's Victoria's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
