__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Davey says. \"He's Victoria's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Curly Hale, Detective?\" Davey asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Davey muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Victoria's bodyguard? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Davey says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Curly Hale, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=9", "\"Do you know Zachary Rodriquez?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Davey says. \"He's Victoria's bodyguard, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Davey says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Curly Hale, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Davey says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Davey says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Dining Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Dave Hewitt. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Davey says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Davey says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Dining Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Dave Hewitt,\" Davey says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Basement, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Davey says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Dining Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Davey says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Davey says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Dining Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Dave Hewitt,\" Davey says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Basement, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Davey says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Dining Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Davey says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Basement, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Davey says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Dining Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Dave Hewitt!\" Davey says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Dave Hewitt?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Dave Hewitt,\" Davey says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Basement, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Davey says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Dining Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Davey says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Victoria's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Ted Haynes,\" Davey says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Alistair Hardin. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Davey says. \"Did you know he's Victoria's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Ted Haynes,\" Davey says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Davey says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Victoria's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Ted Haynes, isn't it?\" Davey asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Alistair Hardin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Alistair Hardin's a positive delight!\" Davey says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Ted Haynes,\" Davey says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Cousin, cousin. Hmm,\" Davey ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Ted Haynes? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Victoria's cousin. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
