__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Victoria's dental hygienist?\" Davey says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Morrison's ex-best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Davey says as sternly as he can muster, \"Victoria's ex-best friend is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Davey says. \"He's Victoria's dental hygienist, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's ex-best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Davey says as sternly as he can muster, \"Victoria's ex-best friend is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Library. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Curly Hale. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Davey muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Victoria's dental hygienist? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victoria Morrison's ex-best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Library, Detective,\" Davey says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Curly Hale?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Davey says. \"He's Victoria's dental hygienist, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-best friend? you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Library with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Davey declares."));
