__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Victoria?\" Davey asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Curly Hendricks?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Davey says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Victoria's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Victoria?\" Davey asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Merle Macias?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Davey says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Victoria's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Davey looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Victoria?\" Davey asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Giles Paul?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who murdered Victoria?\" Davey asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Joey Jimenez?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Davey looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Victoria?\" Davey asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Joey Delaney?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Breakfast Nook, and find the victim's college roommate, Jim Davenport the Kid Detective, quickly brushing dirt off of his knees."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Glenn Brooks (the victim's child) scowls at you impatiently as you enter the Living Room. \"You again,\" he grumbles. \"Are we done here yet?\"<p>\"We're done when I say so,\" you reply, glaring. He glares back defiantly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Study, where Hilary Lancaster, the victim's ex-ex-golf caddy, is leafing impatiently through his appointment book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Game Room, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. Your dossier identifies him as Morris Delacruz, the victim's boss.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Sunroom. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. According to the dossier, this is Natalia Larsen, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Natalia Larsen. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You return to the Hall Closet, and find the victim's lover, Chuck Bartlett, still working feverishly on his poem about the murder. Perhaps he's trying to race you to the conclusion. \"Ah, good, you're just in time,\" he says. \"What do you think of this: 'life drains, falling, lost, blackened grains drain / 'twixt outstretched fingers grasping, gasping.'\"<p>\"I think you ought to have your poetic license revoked,\" you say. <p>\"Hmph! Well, I wouldn't expect a police detective to understand the emotional turmoil of violent death.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "The only person in the Boiler Room is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Clancy Todd, the victim's butler.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Roberson may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Library, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. According to the dossier, this is Zachary Sims, the victim's best friend.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "As you enter the Wine Cellar, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. According to the dossier, this is Diego Cervantes, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Glenn Brooks!\" Jim says. \"He's the victim's boss. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Clancy Todd?\" Jim says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Roberson's boss!\" Jim says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Clancy Todd. He's pretty funny,\" Jim says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, I know Glenn Brooks!\" Jim says. \"He's the victim's boss. He's way at the bottom of my suspects list, though. I don't think he has it in him to kill.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Clancy Todd. He's pretty funny,\" Jim says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Roberson's boss!\" Jim says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh sure, that's Clancy Todd. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Clancy Todd. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey Roberson's boss!\" Jim says. \"He's really very nice, once you get to know him! Or once you follow him around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Roberson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Clancy Todd. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" he gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's boss,\" Jim says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Clancy Todd?\" Jim says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Clancy Todd?\" Jim says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Jim exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Study and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Wine Cellar,\" Jim says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Study -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Jim says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's ex-ex-golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Jim says. \"They're in the Wine Cellar, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Jim says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Wine Cellar right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"He's one of my top suspects!\" Jim exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> him? He <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Study and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Jim says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Wine Cellar right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's in the Study -- you should check him out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Jim says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on him a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had an ex-ex-golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Wine Cellar,\" Jim says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Hilary Lancaster. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about him yet, Detective,\" Jim says, \"But you can tell just by looking at him that he has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! He's in the Study right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
