__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Natalia Larsen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's in the Sunroom -- you should check her out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Jim says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on her a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's golf caddy, Detective,\" Jim says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure he's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make him the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Natalia Larsen?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Jim says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Sunroom right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Roberson's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Jim says. \"That's the victim's golf caddy. He creeps me out. There's something real fishy about him, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalia Larsen?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Jim says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Sunroom right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
