__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Chuck Bartlett?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Jim says. \"He's in the Hall Closet. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
