__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
