__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, you're referring to that creature that Davey refers to as his college roommate,\" Lancaster says. \"I make it a policy never to interact with people of such low caliber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Lancaster sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Breakfast Nook.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Jim Davenport?\" he muses. \"I don't think I know anyone by that name... oh, are you referring to Davey's college roommate? Ha ha, no, I do not associate with him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Breakfast Nook at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>Lancaster snorts derisively. \"Davey's college roommate is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that man.\""));
