__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know him,\" Lancaster says. \"His name is Zachary Sims. Charming man. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that man, Detective,\" Lancaster says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe he is in the Library at present.\""));
