__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not associate with people of such low breeding and reprehensible moral character, Detective,\" Lancaster says haughtily. \"You may speak to him yourself, if you wish -- he's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Wine Cellar at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmph!\" he snorts. \"I don't know why you would take an interest in that rude little nobody, Detective. If you wish to lower yourself even further by actually speaking with him, he is in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Lancaster sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Diego Cervantes. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That... <i>guttersnipe</i> can be found in the Wine Cellar,\" Lancaster sniffs. \"Other than that, I have absolutely nothing to say about him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Wine Cellar,\" he says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
