__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Chuck Bartlett. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Lancaster sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Chuck Bartlett? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Chuck Bartlett. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Lancaster smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Chuck Bartlett?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Lancaster smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Chuck Bartlett?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Lancaster sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Chuck Bartlett? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Lancaster smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Chuck Bartlett?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Chuck Bartlett. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Breakfast Nook, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Morris says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Jim Davenport. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Breakfast Nook, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Davey's college roommate?\" Morris says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" he replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Breakfast Nook, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Davey's college roommate?\" Morris says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Morris says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Morris says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Library. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Morris says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Morris says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Library. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Breakfast Nook,\" Morris says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Morris says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Breakfast Nook,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Morris says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Library. Does that count?\""));
