__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Breakfast Nook,\" he says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's college roommate?\" Morris says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Living Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Wine Cellar, if you want to talk to them,\" Morris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Glenn Brooks. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Living Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
