__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Wine Cellar, if you want to talk to them,\" Morris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Glenn Brooks,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Living Room.\""));
