__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Morris mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Wine Cellar, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Morris mutters. \"I don't know how Davey got stuck with a golf caddy like him. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a boss like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"The victim's ex-ex-golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Clancy Todd,\" Morris says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Davey's golf caddy,\" Morris replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had an ex-ex-golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Clancy Todd,\" Morris says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=4", "\"Hilary Lancaster. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>Morris shudders. \"He's Davey's golf caddy. He's horrible. At least he's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect he's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=4", "\"Do you know Roberson's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Clancy Todd. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
