__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Davey's ex-ex-golf caddy,\" Morris replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Library. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Study, if you want to talk to them,\" Morris says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Zachary Sims,\" he replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Morris mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Study, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Library. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
