__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Diego Cervantes is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Morris says. \"He's Davey's lover. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Morris says. \"Everyone loves Hilary Lancaster.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey's lover,\" Morris says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Bodyguard...\" Morris mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Hilary Lancaster. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Diego Cervantes. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Diego Cervantes, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Davey's lover. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Morris says. \"Everyone loves Hilary Lancaster.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Diego Cervantes. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Davey's lover,\" Morris says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Morris says. \"Everyone loves Hilary Lancaster.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Diego Cervantes, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Davey's lover. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Hilary Lancaster,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Diego Cervantes, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Davey's lover. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Bodyguard...\" Morris mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Hilary Lancaster. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Diego Cervantes, yeah,\" he says. \"He's Davey's lover. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Hilary Lancaster,\" he replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Davey Roberson? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Davey, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Davey, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Davey Roberson? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, me and Jim Davenport, we get along great!\" Natalia says. \"Two peas in a pod, that's us. He'll be in the Breakfast Nook, tell him I sent ya.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Glenn Brooks?\" Natalia asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Glenn Brooks.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure!\" Natalia says. \"That man's a real peach. He's over in the Breakfast Nook -- tell him I said hi.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"College roommate... College roommate...\" Natalia mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Glenn Brooks! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Davey's college roommate!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Jim Davenport's great, just great,\" Natalia says. \"Go check out the Breakfast Nook, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate... College roommate...\" Natalia mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Glenn Brooks! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Davey's college roommate!\""));
