__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Glenn Brooks,\" she says. \"Me and him, we go way back. Waaay back. Can't say enough good things about him.\""));
