__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Glenn Brooks. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Davey's boss. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Natalia Larsen?\" Chuck asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Natalia Larsen and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Chuck says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's boss and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
