__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Natalia Larsen and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Chuck says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
