__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Natalia Larsen?\" Chuck asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Hilary Lancaster. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Davey's boss, and an absolute philistine,\" Chuck scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Game Room,\" Chuck says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Chuck says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The boss. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Game Room,\" Chuck says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
