__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"The victim had an ex-ex-golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Chuck snorts. \"Their presence in the Game Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Roberson's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Game Room,\" Chuck says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Morris Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Chuck says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Hilary Lancaster and I get along rather well,\" Chuck says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Morris Delacruz?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Morris Delacruz is my biggest fan!\" Chuck says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Game Room.\""));
