__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Morris Delacruz. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Chuck smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Game Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
