__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Boiler Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chuck sniffs. \"His name is Jim Davenport, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Boiler Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Hmpf,\" Chuck snorts. \"You're referring to Jim Davenport. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Boiler Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Do you mean Jim Davenport? Bah,\" Chuck says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Chuck says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Boiler Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Roberson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Chuck sniffs. \"His name is Jim Davenport, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Boiler Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Chuck says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Boiler Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Chuck snorts. \"You're referring to Jim Davenport. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Chuck says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Boiler Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Do you know Roberson's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Jim Davenport? Bah,\" Chuck says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Clancy Todd?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Boiler Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Jim Davenport? Bah,\" Chuck says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's golf caddy and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Diego Cervantes and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Chuck says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's golf caddy and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Are you referring to Diego Cervantes?\" Chuck asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Davey's golf caddy. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Diego Cervantes?\" Chuck asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Davey's golf caddy. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Diego Cervantes and I get along rather well,\" Chuck says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's golf caddy and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Diego Cervantes and I get along rather well,\" Chuck says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Chuck says. \"We get along quite well. He's Davey's golf caddy, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Diego Cervantes and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Chuck says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
