__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Diego Cervantes?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's best friend and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Davey?\" Chuck asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Davey?\" Chuck asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Chuck says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Chuck says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Davey?\" Chuck asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Chuck says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Chuck says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Breakfast Nook,\" Todd says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Zachary Sims to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Zachary Sims to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Todd says. \"Presently, he is in the Breakfast Nook. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Zachary Sims, Todd says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Jim Davenport. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Breakfast Nook,\" Todd says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Zachary Sims, Todd says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Todd says. \"Presently, he is in the Breakfast Nook. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Zachary Sims, Detective,\" Todd says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Breakfast Nook,\" Todd says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Zachary Sims to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Todd says. \"You will find him in the Breakfast Nook, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, I consider Zachary Sims to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Zachary Sims, Todd says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Zachary Sims to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Glenn Brooks. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Living Room,\" Todd says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Todd says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Living Room,\" Todd says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Roberson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Todd says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Living Room,\" Todd says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Todd says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room at the moment,\" Todd says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Roberson's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Todd says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Living Room at the moment,\" Todd says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Todd says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
