__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Study,\" Todd says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim had an ex-ex-golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Natalia Larsen, Detective,\" Todd says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Study at the moment,\" Todd says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-ex-golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Natalia Larsen, I presume,\" Todd says. \"She is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
