__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Natalia Larsen?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Davey Roberson's boss, I believe,\" Todd says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Todd says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"Do you know Natalia Larsen?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Davey Roberson's boss,\" Todd says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Todd says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Living Room.\""));
