__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Todd says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Living Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Natalia Larsen?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Davey Roberson's boss,\" Todd says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
