__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Todd says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Living Room.\""));
