__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Davey Roberson's bodyguard,\" Todd says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Todd says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Davey Roberson's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his bodyguard.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"The bodyguard.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Davey Roberson's bodyguard, Detective,\" Todd says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Davey Roberson's bodyguard,\" Todd says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"The bodyguard.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Davey Roberson's bodyguard, Detective,\" Todd says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Todd says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Davey Roberson's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his bodyguard.\""));
