__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was the lover,\" Zachary mutters from behind his book.<p>\"Do you have some kind of evidence for that?\" you ask.<p>No response."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Investigate the lover,\" Zachary mutters quietly.<p>\"All right,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything more concrete?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the lover,\" Zachary mutters from behind his book.<p>\"Do you have some kind of evidence for that?\" you ask.<p>No response."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Zachary turns a page in his book. \"I think it was the lover.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, writing it down. \"Why do you say that? ...Hello?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Zachary turns a page in his book. \"I think it was the lover.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, writing it down. \"Why do you say that? ...Hello?\""));
