__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the lover,\" Zachary mutters from behind his book.<p>\"Do you have some kind of evidence for that?\" you ask.<p>No response."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's college roommate? Well, I don't trust him,\" he says, \"but I don't think he's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Pfft, Jim Davenport is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Diego says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"I know him a little,\" Diego says. \"He's Davey's college roommate. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure he's not part of The Conspiracy. He's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching him for unusual activity,\" Diego says. \"His name's Jim Davenport. So far he seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Davey's college roommate,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Jim Davenport?\" Diego says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Jim Davenport?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Davey's college roommate,\" he replies. \"He's okay, I think. If he's an agent, they haven't activated him yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
