__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Diego declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Living Room if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Diego exclaims. \"They'rein the Wine Cellar, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Glenn Brooks. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Diego says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Living Room!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Davey never even had a child! Go to the Living Room and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Diego says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Living Room!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Diego says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Living Room isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Glenn Brooks?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" he says. \"I don't even go near the Wine Cellar, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
