__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Hilary Lancaster?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Diego says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Study!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-ex-golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Hilary Lancaster? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Diego exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Hilary Lancaster. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Diego declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Study if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
