__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Chuck Bartlett. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, he's fine, he's not dangerous,\" Diego says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. He's in the Hall Closet, go check him out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Chuck Bartlett?\" Diego says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Chuck Bartlett. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"I think he's okay,\" Diego says, glancing over his shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that he's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Hall Closet and check him out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Chuck Bartlett?\" Diego says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on him, but I think he might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Chuck Bartlett?\" you ask.<p>\"Chuck Bartlett? I think he's safe,\" Diego says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Hall Closet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Davey Roberson's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Chuck Bartlett is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Diego says. \"He doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep him safe, but I doubt it.\""));
