__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Clancy Todd. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Clancy Todd? I think he's safe,\" Diego says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on him in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Diego says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Wine Cellar, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
