__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Diego says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Wine Cellar, check them out for yourself.\""));
