__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"Davey's best friend?\" Diego says. \"Oh no, no no no. I don't trust that man one tiny bit. For all I know, that's a lizard underneath that human skin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Diego says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Library isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
