__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Zachary Sims?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Diego exclaims. \"Davey's best friend? He's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way he watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"There's no such person!\" he says. \"Davey never even had a best friend! Go to the Library and ask them for yourself, you'll see!\""));
