__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Diego shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Davey committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Diego asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who did it?\" Diego asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it?\" Diego asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Diego exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Diego exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Diego asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Diego shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Davey committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you return to the Guest Bedroom, the victim's golf caddy, Mariah Russell, is still grading papers with an unusual expression of mixed irritation, disgust, and amusement."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Sunroom, and the victom's cousin, Maury Talley, screams and dives behind a curtain. \"It's all right,\" you say. \"It's just me again. The detective.\"<p>\"Well, of course you'd say that!\" comes the response. \"How do I know you didn't just kill the detective and now you're wearing a detective skin to trick me?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Master Bedroom, where Nicky Manning, the victim's ex-cousin, is pacing around impatiently. \"Oh goody, more questions,\" he mutters, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You return to the Game Room, where Lonnie James's gardener, Edgar Christian, is adding another butt to a rapidly-filling ashtray. <p>\"I need to ask you some more questions,\" you say. <p>\"Hey, you got it! Never let it be said that Edgar Christian wasn't one hundred percent on-board when it comes to helping the cops -- I mean, police,\" he says, grinning broadly at you."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You return to the Boiler Room, where Ella McMillan (the victim's personal assistant) is still reading her book. She ignores you, though at least you get the sense that it's not out of dislike so much as absolute disinterest."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "When you return to the Bathroom, Kid Detective Ava Weber, the victim's boss, is sitting on a sofa twiddling her thumbs with a very innocent expression on her face."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You return to the Foyer, where Clive Kramer, the victim's accountant is hanging out. \"Hey, it's the dude on the case,\" he says. \"You got somethin' else you wanna know?\"<p>\"I have some more questions, yes,\" you say.<p>\"Killer. Lay it on me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "The victim's physician, Leah Dunlap, is pacing around the Bar with her hands behind her back, apparently looking for some means of entertaining herself. Her eyes light up when she sees you enter. \"I say!\" she says. \"Back for more questions, are you?\"<p>\"Yes, I'm sorry to disturb you, but --\"<p>\"Oh, no apologies needed, my good Detective! I've never been what you might call 'murder-adjacent' before! It's bally exciting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Servants' Quarters, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. \"You must be Wade Potts, the victim's bodyguard,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Lonnie'd had a proper regimen like I told him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Russell says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie James's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Russell says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know James's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Russell says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Russell says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Russell says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Sunroom at the moment,\" Russell says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Russell says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Sunroom at the moment,\" Russell says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Sunroom,\" Russell says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Russell says. \"You will find him in the Master Bedroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Game Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Russell says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Master Bedroom,\" Russell says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-cousin? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Russell says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Game Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Russell says. \"Presently, he is in the Master Bedroom. His outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's ex-cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Russell says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Game Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's ex-cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Russell says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Game Room, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Russell says. \"You will find him in the Master Bedroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. His views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim's ex-cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Russell says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Game Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Master Bedroom,\" Russell says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had an ex-cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Russell says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Game Room, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Master Bedroom,\" Russell says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Master Bedroom,\" Russell says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know James's ex-cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Game Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Russell says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Edgar Christian. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Lonnie James's personal assistant,\" Russell says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Maury Talley, Detective,\" Russell says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Edgar Christian. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Lonnie James's personal assistant,\" Russell says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Maury Talley, Russell says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Edgar Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Lonnie James's personal assistant,\" Russell says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Maury Talley, Detective,\" Russell says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Edgar Christian?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Lonnie James's personal assistant,\" Russell says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Maury Talley, Russell says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
