__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie James's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Edgar Christian to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Russell says. \"Presently, she is in the Bathroom. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know James's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Edgar Christian, Russell says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Russell says. \"You will find her in the Bathroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Edgar Christian, Detective,\" Russell says. \"I have found him to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in his opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Russell says. \"You will find her in the Bathroom, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
