__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Clive Kramer. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Lonnie James's cousin,\" Russell says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Russell says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Lonnie James's cousin,\" Russell says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know James's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Russell says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Game Room is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Russell says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Game Room.\""));
