__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Clive Kramer, I presume,\" Russell says. \"He is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
