__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Wade Potts. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Lonnie James's cousin,\" Russell says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The man himself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Lonnie James has true relevance, Detective,\" Russell says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Russell says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Russell says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Russell says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Russell says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Russell says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Lonnie James has true relevance, Detective,\" Russell says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Russell says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Lonnie's boss,\" he replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know James's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Maury says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Sunroom, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Maury says. \"She's Lonnie's boss. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Game Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Mariah Russell. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Lonnie's boss? Well, I don't trust her,\" he says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" he says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Game Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
