__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Maury says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Sunroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
