__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Maury says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Master Bedroom isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
