__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Wade Potts?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Edgar says. \"Ever since he first became Lonnie's bodyguard. Practically inseparable, him and me.\""));
