__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>Ella sniffs disdainfully. \"Guest Bedroom.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"She's a jerk.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a golf caddy,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"They're in the Bathroom.\"<p>\"And that's all you're going to say?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
