__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who that is!\" Ava says. \"That's the victim's cousin, and she's <i>real</i> suspicious! Did you know she's been married like <i>six</i> times? And two of her spouses died in mysterious circumstances!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Ava says. \"That's the victim's golf caddy. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Ava says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about her! She's the victim's cousin, and she has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Ava nods. \"That's Ella McMillan. She's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
