__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Maury Talley's great fun!\" Ava says. \"He's in the Sunroom right now. He'll probably share his chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Clive Kramer. He's real nice! ...Wait, you don't think he did the murder, do you?\" she gasps."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maury Talley?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Ava says. \"He's in the Sunroom. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know James's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Clive Kramer?\" Ava says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
