__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know her,\" Clive replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. She's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. She's probably in the Bar, if you're looking for her.\""));
