__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Mariah Russell!\" Leah says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie James's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Leah ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Mariah Russell? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Lonnie's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Mariah Russell!\" Leah says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Guest Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Mariah Russell,\" Leah says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Mariah Russell,\" Leah says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Guest Bedroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Mariah Russell, isn't it?\" Leah asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know James's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Golf caddy, golf caddy. Hmm,\" Leah ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Mariah Russell? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Lonnie's golf caddy. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
