__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Nicky Manning?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Leah says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Lonnie's ex-cousin, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
