__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Ella McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Ella McMillan. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Leah says. \"Did you know she's Lonnie's personal assistant? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
