__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Ella McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ella McMillan's a positive delight!\" Leah says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Leah says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Boiler Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
