__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Ella McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Ella McMillan. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Leah says. \"Did you know she's Lonnie's personal assistant? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Leah says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Boiler Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ella McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Leah says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Lonnie's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Leah says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Boiler Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella McMillan?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Leah says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Lonnie's personal assistant, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Ella McMillan. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ella McMillan's a positive delight!\" Leah says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Leah says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Boiler Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Leah says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Boiler Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Lonnie's boss?\" Leah says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Leah says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Ava Weber, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Ava Weber. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Leah muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Lonnie's boss? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know James's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Ava Weber, Detective?\" Leah asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Lonnie's boss?\" Leah says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie James's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Leah says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Ava Weber, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Leah says. \"She's Lonnie's boss, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Leah says. \"Calls herself 'Ava Weber', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Ava Weber' by choice, can you?\""));
