__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Clive Kramer,\" Leah says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Foyer, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Leah says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Foyer? Is that the one?\""));
