__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Clive Kramer!\" Leah says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Foyer.\""));
