__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=8", "\"Wade Potts. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Leah muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Lonnie's bodyguard? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, him,\" Leah says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Wade Potts, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
