__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Leah says. \"Calls himself 'Wade Potts', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Wade Potts' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Leah says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lonnie James?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the cousin, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Leah says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Lonnie's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Leah says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Lonnie's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Lonnie's cousin, Detective,\" Leah says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Leah says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lonnie James?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the cousin, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Lonnie's cousin, Detective,\" Leah says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Leah says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Lonnie's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the cousin.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Wade says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Guest Bedroom, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know James's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" he replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, she's great,\" Wade says. \"A bit scrawny, but a real go-getter. Smart as a whip, too, always helps me out with the math when I'm counting calories. She's usually in the Guest Bedroom, you can find her there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie James's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Wade says. \"I think they'd be in the Sunroom at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Mariah Russell?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Mariah Russell's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Guest Bedroom if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Wade says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Sunroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
