__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Wade says. \"I think they'd be in the Bar at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Ava Weber!\" Wade says. \"That's Lonnie's cousin. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Ava Weber?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Lonnie's cousin,\" Wade says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wade snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie James's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Wade says. \"Leah Dunlap, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wade snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Wade says. \"Leah Dunlap, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Wade snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Foyer, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Wade says. \"Leah Dunlap, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wade snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know James's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Wade says. \"Leah Dunlap, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Clive Kramer,\" Wade says. \"You'll find him in the Foyer, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried him away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>her</i>,\" Wade says. \"Leah Dunlap, I think her name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in her face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Clive Kramer,\" Wade says. \"You'll find him in the Foyer, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried him away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>Wade rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. Her name's Leah Dunlap. Totally useless. Maybe if she had some muscle mass, she'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wade snorts. \"Yeah, I know him. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Her?\" Wade says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in her for. She's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know James's accountant?\" you ask.<p>Wade rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. Her name's Leah Dunlap. Totally useless. Maybe if she had some muscle mass, she'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Clive Kramer?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Wade snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> He's in the Foyer, go see for yourself what a weakling he is.\""));
