__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Wade snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Bar, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Wade thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Sunroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Leah Dunlap,\" Wade says. \"You'll find her in the Bar, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Umm...\" Wade thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Sunroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Leah Dunlap. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Leah Dunlap,\" Wade says. \"You'll find her in the Bar, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Wade sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Sunroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's physician? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Wade says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Sunroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Wade snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Bar, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Wade sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Sunroom. That's all I know or care.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Wade snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Bar, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know James's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Wade thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Sunroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
