__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Wade says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Sunroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone named Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wade snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Leah Dunlap?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Wade snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Wade says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Sunroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh ho!\" Wade exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Ava Weber. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Wade says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Ava Weber. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Wade says. I know who it was. It was Ava Weber. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Wade says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Ava Weber. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Wade says. I know who it was. It was Ava Weber. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh ho!\" Wade exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Ava Weber. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Wade says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Ava Weber. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Wade says. I know who it was. It was Ava Weber. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Master Bedroom, where Addison Franks, the victim's business partner is struggling to compose her poetic masterpiece. Guess these artistic types get their inspiration from all sorts of places. \"Ah, good, you're just in time,\" she says. \"What do you think of this: 'life drains, falling, lost, blackened grains drain / 'twixt outstretched fingers grasping, gasping.'\"<p>\"I think you ought to have your poetic license revoked,\" you say. <p>\"Hmph! Well, I wouldn't expect a police detective to understand the emotional turmoil of violent death.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You return to the Lounge, and find Victor's bodyguard, Genesis Ingram, snoozing on a couch with her straw boater over her face. You clear your throat loudly, and she pushes up the brim of the hat and blinks at you. \"I say!\" she says. \"Back for more questions, are you?\"<p>\"Yes, I'm sorry to disturb you, but --\"<p>\"Oh, no apologies needed, my good Detective! I've never been what you might call 'murder-adjacent' before! It's bally exciting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Back at the Bar, Audrey Morton, the victim's accountant, is still lifting weights. Which is not, to be honest, all that surprising. \"How long do you intend to do that?\" you ask. <p>\"'Nother couple-a hours. On the free-weights, I mean. You gonna be done by then? I don't have a spare heavy-bag here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you return to the Foyer, the victim's dental hygienist, Steven Zamora, is still grading papers with an unusual expression of mixed irritation, disgust, and amusement."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Sunroom, and find a woman dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at her feet. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Rachel Dunn, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Living Room, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Rachel Robertson, the victim's lover.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Victor Sellers's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You return to the Laundry Room just in time to see Chuck Wilson, the Kid Detective and the victim's chauffeur, quickly shutting a window and adjusting his cardigan."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You walk into the Basement, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Your dossier identifies her as Madeline Kidd, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Madeline. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Family Room, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Barney Bryan, the victim's best friend.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Addison says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Rachel Robertson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Addison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Genesis Ingram is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Robertson?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Lounge -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Rachel Robertson and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Lounge -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Lounge -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Rachel Robertson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Addison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Genesis Ingram is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Robertson?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Genesis Ingram is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Robertson?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Lounge -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Robertson?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Victor's dental hygienist, and an absolute philistine,\" Addison scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Addison sniffs. \"His name is Chuck Wilson, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Addison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The dental hygienist. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Addison snorts. \"You're referring to Chuck Wilson. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Addison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Victor's dental hygienist. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Chuck Wilson? Bah,\" Addison says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Addison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Victor's dental hygienist. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Addison sniffs. \"His name is Chuck Wilson, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Audrey Morton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Victor's dental hygienist, and an absolute philistine,\" Addison scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Addison snorts. \"You're referring to Chuck Wilson. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
