__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Addison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The dental hygienist. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
