__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Victor's dental hygienist. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Addison says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the neighbor,\" Addison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Basement, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victor's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the neighbor,\" Addison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Basement, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Rachel Dunn. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victor's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the neighbor,\" Addison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Basement, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Basement at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Rachel Dunn. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Victor's dental hygienist. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Addison says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Addison says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Victor's dental hygienist. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Addison says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Addison says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's dental hygienist and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"She has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but she does the best she can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victor's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Addison says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"We get along quite well. She's Victor's dental hygienist, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Rachel Robertson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Addison says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Living Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Addison says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Addison says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Living Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Laundry Room,\" Addison says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Rachel Robertson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Addison says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Living Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Laundry Room,\" Addison says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Living Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Addison says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Living Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
