__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Addison says, shaking her head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Living Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lover,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Laundry Room,\" Addison says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Addison says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Living Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Laundry Room,\" Addison says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Chuck Wilson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Addison says. \"We get along quite well. He's Victor's accountant, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"The victim's chauffeur -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Rachel Robertson and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's accountant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Rachel Robertson and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Addison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's accountant and I have a very cordial relationship,\" she says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
