__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sellers's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Rachel Robertson and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Victor's accountant. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Addison says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Addison says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the cousin,\" Addison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Foyer, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Madeline Kidd is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the cousin,\" Addison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Foyer, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Basement -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Basement -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Addison says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Addison says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Madeline Kidd is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the cousin,\" Addison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Foyer, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Madeline Kidd. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Madeline Kidd is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"She is always asking me to read her my poems. I mean, I'm sure she would, if she wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find her in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Foyer at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Addison says. \"In fact, she once told me her favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have her tell me about it herself.\"<p>\"Very well! She's in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Foyer at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. She's quite an attentive and astute listener. She's in the Basement -- I'm positive that if you ask her, she'll tell you all about how she loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Addison says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Barney Bryan is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Rachel Dunn and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Addison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Family Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Dunn?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Barney Bryan is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Rachel Dunn and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Addison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Family Room -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Rachel Dunn and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Addison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Barney Bryan is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know Sellers's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Rachel Dunn and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Addison says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Rachel Dunn and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Barney Bryan is my biggest fan!\" Addison says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, Rachel Dunn and I get along rather well,\" Addison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Addison says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Family Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Dunn?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Rachel Dunn?\" Addison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victor?\" Addison asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Victor?\" Addison asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Addison says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Victor?\" Addison asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Addison says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Addison says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Addison says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Addison Franks. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Genesis says. \"Did you know she's Victor's business partner? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Addison Franks,\" Genesis says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Genesis says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Victor's business partner, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"That's Addison Franks, isn't it?\" Genesis asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Addison Franks's a positive delight!\" Genesis says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Business partner, business partner. Hmm,\" Genesis ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Addison Franks? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Victor's business partner. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Addison Franks. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Genesis says. \"Did you know she's Victor's business partner? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
