__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Addison Franks. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Genesis says. \"Did you know she's Victor's business partner? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Addison Franks. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Genesis says. \"Did you know she's Victor's business partner? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Business partner, business partner. Hmm,\" Genesis ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Addison Franks? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Victor's business partner. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Morton!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Genesis says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bar? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Morton!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Genesis says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bar and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Bar, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Genesis says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bar? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Bar, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Genesis says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bar and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Bar, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Genesis says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Bar, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Genesis says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Bar and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"Audrey Morton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Audrey Morton!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Bar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Audrey Morton,\" Genesis says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Bar, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Genesis says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bar? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Audrey Morton,\" Genesis says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Bar, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Genesis says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Bar? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Steven Zamora. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Steven Zamora is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Genesis says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Foyer, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"Calls himself 'Steven Zamora', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Steven Zamora' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Genesis says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Foyer is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"Calls himself 'Steven Zamora', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Steven Zamora' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Genesis says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Foyer is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Steven Zamora, Detective?\" Genesis asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Genesis says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Foyer, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Steven Zamora, Detective?\" Genesis asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Genesis says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Foyer, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, him,\" Genesis says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Steven Zamora, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Genesis says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Foyer is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Genesis says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Steven Zamora, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Steven Zamora is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Genesis says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Foyer, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sellers's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, him,\" Genesis says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Steven Zamora, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Steven Zamora is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Genesis says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Foyer, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Steven Zamora, Detective?\" Genesis asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Steven Zamora is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Genesis says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Foyer, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Rachel Dunn!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Rachel Dunn,\" Genesis says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Sunroom, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Rachel Dunn, isn't it?\" Genesis asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Rachel Dunn!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Genesis ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Rachel Dunn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Victor's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Rachel Dunn,\" Genesis says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Sunroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Genesis ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Rachel Dunn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Victor's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Rachel Dunn!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Genesis ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Rachel Dunn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Victor's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
