__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Sunroom, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Neighbor, neighbor. Hmm,\" Genesis ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Rachel Dunn? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Victor's neighbor. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Rachel Dunn!\" Genesis says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Sunroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Rachel Dunn,\" Genesis says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What do you know about Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Rachel Robertson,\" Genesis says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Living Room, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Genesis says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Living Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Rachel Robertson,\" Genesis says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Living Room, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Genesis says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Living Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Living Room, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
