__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Genesis says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Victor's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Genesis says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Family Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Barney Bryan. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Genesis says. \"Did you know he's Victor's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Genesis says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Family Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Barney Bryan's a positive delight!\" Genesis says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Genesis says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Family Room and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Barney Bryan. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Barney Bryan. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Genesis says. \"Did you know he's Victor's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Genesis says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Family Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Genesis says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Victor's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sellers's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Genesis says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Family Room, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
