__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Sellers's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Genesis says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Family Room? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Genesis looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Victor's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Victor's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Victor?\" Genesis asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Sam Juarez?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Genesis looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Genesis says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Victor's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Victor?\" Genesis asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Horace Berger?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Genesis looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Victor's dental hygienist, I know her,\" Audrey says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Steven Zamora,\" Audrey says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Victor's dental hygienist,\" Audrey says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Steven Zamora,\" Audrey says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Addison Franks!\" Audrey says. \"That's Victor's dental hygienist. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's business partner? Oh, you mean Steven Zamora,\" Audrey says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Victor's dental hygienist,\" Audrey says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
