__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Steven Zamora. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
