__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, that's Steven Zamora,\" Audrey says. \"He's all right, for a man with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a best friend,\" Audrey snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use her as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Audrey says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Laundry Room right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Audrey grunts. \"That's Victor's best friend -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Audrey thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Laundry Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Victor's best friend,\" Audrey says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Umm...\" Audrey thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Laundry Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
