__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Genesis Ingram. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Audrey grunts. \"That's Victor's best friend -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Audrey sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Laundry Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
