__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Audrey snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Her?\" Audrey says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in her for. She's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Rachel Dunn,\" Audrey says. \"You'll find her in the Sunroom, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>Audrey rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. Her name's Rachel Robertson. Totally useless. Maybe if she had some muscle mass, she'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
