__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Audrey grunts. \"That's Victor's lover -- a skinny little sneak. I trust her about as far as I can throw her... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw her?\""));
