__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Nah, sorry,\" she says. \"No idea. I was blastin' my delts at the time, so I didn't notice anything unusual.\""));
