__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Addison Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Victor Sellers's business partner,\" Zamora says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Zamora says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Addison Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Victor Sellers's business partner,\" Zamora says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Master Bedroom is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Victor Sellers's business partner,\" Zamora says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
