__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Addison Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Victor Sellers's business partner, I believe,\" Zamora says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Zamora says. \"Presently, she is in the Lounge. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Zamora says. \"Presently, she is in the Lounge. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Lounge, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Zamora says. \"You will find her in the Lounge, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Zamora says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Lounge, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Lounge,\" Zamora says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Zamora says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Lounge, I believe.\""));
