__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Victor Sellers's neighbor,\" Zamora says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Rachel Dunn to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Rachel Dunn. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Victor Sellers's neighbor,\" Zamora says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; she is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"The victim had a neighbor, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Rachel Dunn, Zamora says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Victor Sellers's neighbor,\" Zamora says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Do you know Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Rachel Dunn to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Rachel Dunn?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Victor Sellers's neighbor,\" Zamora says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Rachel Dunn, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
