__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Living Room,\" Zamora says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
