__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Laundry Room,\" Zamora says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
