__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Victor Sellers's cousin,\" Zamora says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"This person's name is Madeline Kidd, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Madeline Kidd. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Victor Sellers's cousin,\" Zamora says. \"She is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control her own destiny.\""));
