__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Barney Bryan, Zamora says. \"A fine man, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Victor Sellers's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"The chauffeur.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Victor Sellers's chauffeur, Detective,\" Zamora says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Victor Sellers's chauffeur,\" Zamora says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Victor Sellers's chauffeur,\" Zamora says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Victor Sellers's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Zamora says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Victor Sellers's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his chauffeur.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I can only assume it was Victor Sellers's chauffeur,\" Zamora says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"The chauffeur.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Victor Sellers's chauffeur, Detective,\" Zamora says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Master Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's business partner?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Addison Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Master Bedroom,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Master Bedroom,\" Rachel says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Rachel says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Basement. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Rachel says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Basement. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Master Bedroom,\" Rachel says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Victor's business partner?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Master Bedroom, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's business partner?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Lounge,\" Rachel says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a bodyguard,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Victor's bodyguard?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Lounge,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's bodyguard?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Genesis Ingram. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Lounge, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Master Bedroom.\""));
