__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's bodyguard?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Audrey Morton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Victor's lover,\" Rachel replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know Sellers's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Rachel says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>Rachel shudders. \"She's Victor's lover. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Rachel says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
