__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>Rachel shudders. \"She's Victor's lover. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Basement,\" she mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Audrey Morton. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Rachel mutters. \"I don't know how Victor got stuck with a lover like her. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a neighbor like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Rachel mutters. \"I don't know how Victor got stuck with a lover like her. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a neighbor like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Basement, if you want to talk to them,\" Rachel says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Audrey Morton?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Victor's lover,\" Rachel replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ugh,\" Rachel mutters. \"Well, if you want to talk to them, they're in the Basement, but I can't think of anyone I'd want to talk to less.\"<p>\"I can,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" she replies. \"He avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was his nickname for me. He's probably in the Foyer. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"The only dental hygienist I'm aware of around here is Chuck Wilson, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"I know he's in the Foyer. And that he hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like him much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Chuck Wilson. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Steven Zamora?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Steven Zamora,\" she replies. \"I bet he'll tell you he doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath his notice. Go on and ask him, you'll see. He's in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"The only dental hygienist I'm aware of around here is Chuck Wilson, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
