__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Chuck Wilson,\" Rachel says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
