__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=5", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Chuck Wilson. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Rachel Robertson is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Rachel says. \"She's Victor's cousin. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Foyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Rachel Robertson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Rachel Robertson, yeah,\" she says. \"She's Victor's cousin. I get less verbal abuse from her than from the others. Which is nice of her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's lover?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Foyer.\""));
