__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Chuck Wilson. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victor's accountant,\" Rachel says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Rachel mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Audrey Morton. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Victor's accountant,\" Rachel says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Audrey Morton,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with her once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know Chuck Wilson, yeah,\" she says. \"He's Victor's accountant. I get less verbal abuse from him than from the others. Which is nice of him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's great. Just great,\" Rachel says. \"Everyone loves Audrey Morton.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" she sighs."));
