__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Basement,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's cousin? you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Rachel says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Living Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Basement, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"She'll be in the Basement,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with her. Not that I ever have. But she seems like a woman someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Victor's cousin?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"She's in the Basement,\" Rachel says. \"I like her -- she doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
