__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's cousin?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Madeline Kidd. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know her very well, because she never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect her to take any interest in me. Why should she, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. She's probably in the Basement, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know him very well, because he never talks to me,\" she replies. \"Which is okay. I don't expect him to take any interest in me. Why should he, I'm just the only one who does any work around here, after all. He's probably in the Family Room, having a grand old time.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Victor's best friend?\" Rachel says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"He's in the Family Room,\" Rachel says. \"I like him -- he doesn't immediately blame me when things go wrong around here. As they inevitably do. And as everyone else inevitably does.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Rachel says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Basement. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Family Room,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Rachel says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Basement.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"He'll be in the Family Room,\" she says. \"You'll probably have a very nice conversation with him. Not that I ever have. But he seems like a man someone could have a nice conversation with. Someone other than me.\""));
