__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" she says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Victor, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Addison Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Robertson says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Robertson says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Master Bedroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Robertson says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" Robertson says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Master Bedroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Addison Franks, Detective,\" Robertson says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Master Bedroom, if you require more information than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Robertson says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Robertson says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Master Bedroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Robertson says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Master Bedroom at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" she says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" she says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Master Bedroom and ask her directly.\""));
