__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Genesis Ingram. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, Victor's bodyguard,\" Robertson says. \"Quite a polite and good-natured woman. She may even make something of herself one day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Genesis Ingram? Why yes,\" she replies. \"She's delightful -- wonderful sense of humor. What a shame she'll never amount to anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, I know her,\" Robertson says. \"Her name is Genesis Ingram. Charming woman. Utterly unsuited to the upper-class lifestyle, of course.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Victor's bodyguard,\" Robertson says. \"Yes, our interactions have been pleasant, though I have little reason to speak with her with any frequency.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=6", "\"The victim's bodyguard -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" she says. \"Genesis Ingram. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Victor's bodyguard,\" Robertson says. \"A perfectly charming woman, despite her upbringing.\""));
