__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Chuck Wilson?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Chuck Wilson, Detective,\" Robertson says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about him. He is in the Laundry Room, if you require more information than that.\""));
