__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>Robertson snorts derisively. \"Victor's cousin is utterly beneath my notice, Detective. I have nothing whatsoever to say about that woman.\""));
