__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" she says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Robertson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Robertson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Robertson says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Addison Franks's great fun!\" Chuck says. \"She's in the Master Bedroom right now. She'll probably share her chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a business partner, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That must be who's in the Foyer right now, Detective, \"Chuck says. \"I was trying to figure out who that was, we've never really been introduced.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Addison Franks. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Addison Franks's great fun!\" Chuck says. \"She's in the Master Bedroom right now. She'll probably share her chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
