__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Chuck says. \"She's in the Master Bedroom. I don't think she did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
