__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"They're in the Foyer, if I know who you mean, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"We've never really talked or anything.\""));
