__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" he says. \"That's Victor Sellers's business partner. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Chuck nods. \"That's Audrey Morton. She's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Genesis Ingram. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Shucks, Detective!\" Chuck says, \"I know a bunch of stuff about her! She's the victim's business partner, and she has a lot of gambling debts to some very dangerous people!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's bodyguard. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Genesis Ingram?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who that is!\" he says. \"That's Victor Sellers's business partner. She has a pretty good motive for the murder, what with the life insurance and all!\""));
