__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Steven Zamora. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He's the victim's neighbor,\" Chuck says. \"He is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie him to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Addison Franks?\" Chuck says. \"I'd be real surprised if she did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
