__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Chuck exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Basement and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's cousin. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, she's in the Basement -- you should check her out <i>very</i> carefully, Detective!\" Chuck says. \"I bet the FBI has a rap sheet on her a mile long! Maybe Interpol too!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's cousin. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Chuck says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Basement right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to his disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Chuck says. \"That's the victim's cousin. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Madeline Kidd. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Chuck exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Basement and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's the victim's cousin, Detective,\" Chuck says, nodding. \"I'm pretty sure she's hiding something, but I guess that doesn't necessarily make her the killer. Lots of people around here have stuff they wanna keep secret.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Chuck exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Basement and see for yourself!\""));
