__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Chuck says. \"He's in the Family Room. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Bar, if I know who you mean, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"We've never really talked or anything.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Barney Bryan's great fun!\" Chuck says. \"He's in the Family Room right now. He'll probably share his chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"They seem nice enough, but I've never really talked to them, Detective,\" Chuck says. \"I think they're in the Bar?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Barney Bryan?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Barney Bryan's great fun!\" Chuck says. \"He's in the Family Room right now. He'll probably share his chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
