__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Victor's dental hygienist, dude!\" she says. \"She's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a business partner,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Umm... oh, you mean Barney Bryan? I dunno, like, we don't hang out a lot, right, but he's pretty cool. Real casual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Addison Franks?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, man!\" Madeline says. \"She's cool, she's a real bro. She's, like, Victor's dental hygienist and stuff. We don't get to hang out much, but she's fun.\""));
