__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Genesis Ingram. she's all right. Can't tell you much about her, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Madeline Kidd. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Madeline Kidd? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Basement? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim had a cousin, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Victor's cousin? She's called Genesis Ingram. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey, cop -- Madeline Kidd is my friend, and I don't talk to cops about my friends. Haul your cop ass to the Basement and ask she yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>\"Madeline Kidd? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Basement? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Genesis Ingram. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"Madeline Kidd. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Barney scowls. \"What, now you're after Madeline Kidd? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Basement, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Genesis Ingram. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Madeline Kidd?\" you ask.<p>Barney scowls. \"What, now you're after Madeline Kidd? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Basement, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Do you know Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Genesis Ingram. she's all right. Can't tell you much about her, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Sellers's cousin?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Genesis Ingram. she's all right. Can't tell you much about her, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Barney says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Victor's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Barney says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Victor's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Barney says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Victor's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the dental hygienist. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Barney asks. \"Okay. It was Victor's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" He reaches into his jacket pocket, and pulls out his middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Barney says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Victor's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Family Room, where Stephen Walton's accountant, Leonard Alexander, is adding another butt to a rapidly-filling ashtray. <p>\"Few more things I need to ask you, if that's all right,\" you say. <p>\"Hey, no problem!\" Leonard says. \"Ask away, Detective, I'm an open book here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Back at the Living Room, Ed Barker, the victim's best friend, is still lifting weights. Which is not, to be honest, all that surprising. \"Do you do those posing competitions and so on?\" you ask. <p>\"Nope,\" Ed says, shaking his head as far as his neck will allow, which isn't much. \"Not healthy to compare yourself. Besides, these babies are just for me.\" He curls a massive bicep and kisses it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You return to the Basement, and find the victim's chauffeur, Clarence Mayer, still working feverishly on his poem about the murder. Perhaps he's trying to race you to the conclusion. \"Ah, good, you're just in time,\" he says. \"What do you think of this: 'life drains, falling, lost, blackened grains drain / 'twixt outstretched fingers grasping, gasping.'\"<p>\"I think you ought to have your poetic license revoked,\" you say. <p>\"Hmph! Well, I wouldn't expect a police detective to understand the emotional turmoil of violent death.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You return to the Laundry Room -- the victim's lawyer, Ella Maynard, is still sitting quietly and reading. She ignores you, though at least you get the sense that it's not out of dislike so much as absolute disinterest."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Dining Room, where Natalie Mercado, the victim's lover, is pacing around impatiently. \"Hey, cop!\" she says. \"Are we finished with this crap yet, or what?\"<p>\"Cool your jets, kid,\" you growl. \"We'll be done soon enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The victim's dental hygienist, Allison Cole, is pacing around the Hall Closet with her hands behind her back, apparently looking for some means of entertaining herself. Her eyes light up when she sees you enter. \"What-ho, Detective!\" she says with a grin. \"I was wondering when you'd be popping back around for more of the old Q and A!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "Inside the Billiard Room, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the dossier, this is Lauren Contreras, the victim's boss.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "When you return to the Sunroom, the victim's personal assistant, Gianna Barnett, is still grading papers with an unusual expression of mixed irritation, disgust, and amusement."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You walk into the Ballroom, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Maya Christensen, the victim's child.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Stephen Walton, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Ed Barker's great, just great,\" Leonard says. \"Go check out the Living Room, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Stephen's best friend,\" Leonard says. \"Not real well, but we've chatted. Charming, real charming type. Probably in the Laundry Room, if I hadda guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure!\" Leonard says. \"That man's a real peach. He's over in the Living Room -- tell him I said hi.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Walton's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure,\" Leonard says. \"Stephen's best friend is great. I don't know them much more than to say hello to, but I can tell they're a decent sort. Check in the Laundry Room, if you wanna chat.\""));
