__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur... Chauffeur...\" Leonard mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Maya Christensen! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot she's Stephen's chauffeur!\""));
