__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"D'you mean Maya Christensen?\" Leonard asks. \"She's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Maya Christensen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Clarence Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Clarence Mayer's great, just great,\" Leonard says. \"Go check out the Basement, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
