__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Ella Maynard. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>Leonard rolls his eyes. \"Pfft. Yeah, I know Ella Maynard. That's Stephen's child. I trust that woman about as far as I can throw her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Stephen's lawyer... Oh. You mean Ed Barker,\" Leonard says, shaking his head. \"Yeah, no. I don't need the stress, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>Leonard rolls his eyes. \"Pfft. Yeah, I know Ella Maynard. That's Stephen's child. I trust that woman about as far as I can throw her.\""));
