__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Stephen's child,\" he replies. \"Don't care much for her. She's a crook, if you ask me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Sheesh,\" Leonard grumbles. \"Yeah, I know Ed Barker. Know him like a kick in the teeth. Got about as much need for him, too.\""));
