__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure! Ella Maynard's a good friend. We play games all the time,\" he replies. <p>\"Games?\"<p>\"Yeah, she beats me at chess, and then I beat her at leg-wrestling. She's in the Laundry Room if you want to meet her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Stephen's lawyer? Oh, you mean Leonard Alexander,\" Ed says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked him to spot me on the benchpress once, but he couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Ed says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Laundry Room, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Leonard Alexander. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I like her,\" Ed says. \"Never complains when I accidentally break one of the flimsy little chairs they've got around here. She'll be in the Laundry Room, if you're looking for her.\""));
