__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Cole?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Allison Cole!\" Ed says. \"That's Stephen's boss. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Ed says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Ballroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=2", "\"Allison Cole. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Stephen's boss, I know her,\" Ed says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, I know who that is, but don't know much about 'em,\" Ed says. \"I think they'd be in the Ballroom at this time of day.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Do you know Lauren Contreras?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Ed snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Ed says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Lauren Contreras?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Lauren Contreras,\" Ed says. \"You'll find her in the Billiard Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Ed says. \"Leonard Alexander, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Contreras?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Ed snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Billiard Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
