__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>Ed rolls his eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Leonard Alexander. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Lauren Contreras?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Lauren Contreras,\" Ed says. \"You'll find her in the Billiard Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
