__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Gianna Barnett,\" Ed says. \"You'll find her in the Sunroom, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Ed says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Laundry Room right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Ed snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Sunroom, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Ed thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Laundry Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Gianna Barnett,\" Ed says. \"You'll find her in the Sunroom, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's personal assistant? you ask.<p>\"Forget that wimp,\" Ed sneers. \"I already did.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft. They'll be in the Laundry Room. That's all I know or care.\""));
