__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Stephen's boss, I know her,\" Ed says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know Walton's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Lauren Contreras. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Stephen's boss,\" Ed says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Lauren Contreras,\" Ed says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
