__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Stephen's boss, I know her,\" Ed says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Do you know someone named Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Stephen's boss,\" Ed says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Stephen's child? Oh, you mean Lauren Contreras,\" Ed says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's child? you ask.<p>\"Stephen's child? Oh, you mean Lauren Contreras,\" Ed says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=2", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Stephen's boss,\" Ed says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=2", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Stephen's child? Oh, you mean Lauren Contreras,\" Ed says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh ho!\" Ed exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Maya Christensen. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh ho!\" Ed exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Maya Christensen. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Ed says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Maya Christensen. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Ed says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Maya Christensen. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh ho!\" Ed exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Maya Christensen. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Ed says. I know who it was. It was Maya Christensen. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Family Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Walton's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Leonard Alexander? Bah,\" Clarence says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Clarence says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Leonard Alexander? Bah,\" Clarence says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Leonard Alexander. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Clarence says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Clarence sniffs. \"His name is Leonard Alexander, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Clarence says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Do you know Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Family Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Clarence sniffs. \"His name is Leonard Alexander, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Clarence snorts. \"You're referring to Leonard Alexander. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Leonard Alexander. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Clarence says. \"If it were up to him, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Clarence says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find him in the Family Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Clarence sniffs. \"His name is Leonard Alexander, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"He can be found in the Family Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Clarence snorts. \"You're referring to Leonard Alexander. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Clarence says. \"We get along quite well. He's Stephen's best friend, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Living Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Ed Barker. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Stephen's best friend. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Clarence says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the best friend,\" Clarence muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Living Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the best friend,\" Clarence muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Living Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Stephen's best friend. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Clarence says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Walton's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Clarence says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Clarence says. \"We get along quite well. He's Stephen's best friend, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
