__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Clarence says. \"We get along quite well. He's Stephen's best friend, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over his head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, I know of whom you speak,\" Clarence says. \"We don't interact much, as we've very little in common. But you can find them in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Stephen's best friend and I have a very cordial relationship,\" he says. \"He has essentially no understanding of the poetic form, poor soul, but he does the best he can.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Do you know Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Stephen's best friend. He's a perfectly affable man, Detective,\" Clarence says. \"We get along reasonably well, though he hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
