__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Clarence says. \"We get along quite well. She's Stephen's lawyer, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
