__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" he says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Laundry Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Stephen's lawyer. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Clarence says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Natalie Mercado?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Dining Room, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Clarence snorts. \"Their presence in the Dining Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Natalie Mercado?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Clarence says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Dining Room, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Clarence snorts. \"Their presence in the Dining Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Natalie Mercado?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Clarence says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Dining Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Clarence snorts. \"Their presence in the Dining Room is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
