__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Dining Room,\" Clarence says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
