__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Lauren Contreras?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Clarence says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Billiard Room, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=3", "\"Do you know Walton's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Billiard Room,\" Clarence says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
