__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Clarence asks. \"Oh -- you mean Stephen's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Clarence snorts. \"You're referring to Gianna Barnett. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Clarence asks. \"Oh -- you mean Stephen's personal assistant. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Gianna Barnett? Bah,\" Clarence says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Clarence says, rolling his eyes dramatically. \"The personal assistant. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Gianna Barnett? Bah,\" Clarence says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Stephen's personal assistant, and an absolute philistine,\" Clarence scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Gianna Barnett? Bah,\" Clarence says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
