__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Clarence sniffs. \"Her name is Gianna Barnett, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
