__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Clarence says, shaking his head. \"I refuse to speak to -- or of -- that savage. You'll find her in the Ballroom, if you wish to see what the modern educational system does to a person.\""));
