__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Ballroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Clarence snorts. \"Their presence in the Ballroom is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"She can be found in the Ballroom, Detective, and that is all I have to say about a person who thinks any poem longer than a limerick is 'boring as hell', endquote.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's child?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Ballroom,\" Clarence says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"No, Detective, I have no respect for such an unthinking degenerate,\" Clarence says. \"If it were up to her, there would be no art in this world but what might be found upon a television screen. You'll find her in the Ballroom, if you wish to behold such a monster for yourself.\""));
