__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Ballroom,\" Clarence says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
