__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, yeah. I think I saw them in the Family Room?\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, making a note of it. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah. S'alright, I guess? We don't really interact.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>\"Maya Christensen? She's alright, she's cool. I think she's over in the Ballroom? But that's all I'm gonna say to a cop.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a child,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Family Room. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Maya Christensen?\" you ask.<p>Natalie scowls. \"What, now you're after Maya Christensen? You think I'm gonna help you pin this on one of my friends, think again, cop! She's in the Ballroom, you can go talk to her yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's child?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, yeah. I think I saw them in the Family Room?\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say, making a note of it. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah. S'alright, I guess? We don't really interact.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" she sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" she sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Allison muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Stephen's accountant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind him in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Family Room, Detective,\" Allison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Allison says. \"He's Stephen's accountant, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Walton's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Family Room, Detective,\" Allison says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
