__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Detective,\" Allison says as sternly as she can muster, \"Stephen's accountant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Family Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Stephen's accountant?\" Allison says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
