__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Ella Maynard. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Allison says. \"Did you know she's Stephen's lawyer? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer, lawyer. Hmm,\" Allison ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Ella Maynard? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Stephen's lawyer. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Ella Maynard. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Allison says. \"Did you know she's Stephen's lawyer? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"That's Ella Maynard, isn't it?\" Allison asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Allison says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Stephen's lawyer, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know Walton's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Lawyer, lawyer. Hmm,\" Allison ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Ella Maynard? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Stephen's lawyer. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Ella Maynard?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Ella Maynard's a positive delight!\" Allison says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
