__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=6", "\"Do you know Walton's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Natalie Mercado, isn't it?\" Allison asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Natalie Mercado?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Allison says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Stephen's lover, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
