__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Gianna Barnett. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Allison says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Sunroom, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=6", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Personal assistant, personal assistant. Hmm,\" Allison ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Gianna Barnett? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Stephen's personal assistant. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Gianna Barnett. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Gianna Barnett,\" Allison says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Sunroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
