__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=6", "\"Gianna Barnett. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Gianna Barnett!\" Allison says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Sunroom.\""));
