__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know who I think did it?\" Allison says, looking surprised. \"Well, that's a rum go. I hadn't even considered the question. I suppose it must've been Gianna Barnett, though, mustn't it? Stands to reason.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well now, I'm not sure it would be right to be a squealer, Detective,\" Allison says. \"Not quite cricket, you know. ...Then again, neither is murder, what? Very well, you've forced my hand. It was Gianna Barnett.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who put paid to old Stephen? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Allison says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Gianna Barnett, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now, I'm not sure it would be right to be a squealer, Detective,\" Allison says. \"Not quite cricket, you know. ...Then again, neither is murder, what? Very well, you've forced my hand. It was Gianna Barnett.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who put paid to old Stephen? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Allison says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Gianna Barnett, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well now, I'm not sure it would be right to be a squealer, Detective,\" Allison says. \"Not quite cricket, you know. ...Then again, neither is murder, what? Very well, you've forced my hand. It was Gianna Barnett.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who put paid to old Stephen? Well, that's quite a question, isn't it Detective?\" Allison says. \"I mean, it could be bally anyone, and there's quite a quantity of people on this old ball of rock we call Earth.\"<p>\"...We're pretty sure it was someone in this house,\" you say.<p>\"Oh! Well, it was Gianna Barnett, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know who I think did it?\" Allison says, looking surprised. \"Well, that's a rum go. I hadn't even considered the question. I suppose it must've been Gianna Barnett, though, mustn't it? Stands to reason.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Detective! Leonard Alexander's great fun!\" Lauren says. \"He's in the Family Room right now. He'll probably share his chewing gum with you, if you ask!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Allison Cole?\" Lauren says. \"I'd be real surprised if she did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"I sure do!\" Lauren says. \"He's in the Family Room. I don't think he did it, but it's dangerous to make assumptions before you have all the facts. That's like the first rule of detectiveing!\""));
