__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Allison Cole?\" you ask.<p>\"She's one of my top suspects!\" Lauren exclaims.<p>\"Why's that?\" you ask. <p>\"Well jeez, Detective! Have you <i>met</i> her? She <i>super</i>-suspicious! Go to the Hall Closet and see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know Allison Cole?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about her yet, Detective,\" Lauren says, \"But you can tell just by looking at her that she has <i>tons</i> of underworld connections! She's in the Hall Closet right now, I could be the Bad Cop for you!\"<p>\"No thank you,\" you say, to her disappointment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Lauren says. \"They're in the Dining Room, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Lauren says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Dining Room right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Gianna Barnett?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Stephen Walton's best friend!\" Lauren says. \"She's really very nice, once you get to know her! Or once you follow her around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim had a personal assistant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Ed Barker. He's pretty funny,\" Lauren says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Gianna Barnett. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's the victim's best friend,\" Lauren says. \"She is pretty friendly. I haven't found anything to tie her to the scene of the crime yet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Ed Barker?\" Lauren says. \"I'd be real surprised if he did it, Detective! But I guess you have to cover all the bases in our line of work!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Gianna Barnett. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Stephen Walton's best friend!\" Lauren says. \"She's really very nice, once you get to know her! Or once you follow her around for a while, peeking out from behind lampposts and stuff.\""));
