__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Lauren exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Lauren pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Lauren pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Lauren says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Lauren exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Lauren says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Barnett says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Barnett says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Hall Closet, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Leonard Alexander. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Barnett says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Barnett says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Hall Closet, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Barnett says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Hall Closet, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Barnett says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Hall Closet, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Hall Closet, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Barnett says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Stephen Walton's chauffeur,\" Barnett says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"If you seek them out in the Hall Closet, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Barnett says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Ed Barker. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Living Room,\" Barnett says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Barnett says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Hall Closet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find him in the Living Room,\" Barnett says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that he has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Barnett says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Hall Closet is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Ed Barker?\" you ask.<p>\"You will find this man in the Living Room,\" Barnett says. \"Refusing to accept responsibility for his own actions, I do not doubt.\""));
