__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Barnett says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Hall Closet.\""));
