__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Barnett asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Lauren Contreras.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Leonard Alexander?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's cool,\" she replies. \"Like, maybe you wouldn't think it to meet him, but like deep down, you know? He's good people.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything <i>useful</i> about Leonard Alexander?\"<p>\"Oh, uhh... Well, he's Stephen's chauffeur, does that help?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Accountant...\" Maya muses, then her eyes light up. \"Oh, yeah, dude! I know who you mean. They're cool. Go check out the Hall Closet, you'll find 'em there.\""));
