__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Clarence Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" she says. \"Yeah man. That's Stephen's personal assistant. I've run into him a couplea times. He's a real bummer, though. Like, zero fun.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man,\" Maya says, shaping her head. \"I know enough to stay the hell out of the Hall Closet when they're there, which is like always, and that's all I need to know, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Clarence Mayer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh jeez, Clarence Mayer is a total downer,\" she replies. \"Like a primo buzzkill.\"<p>\"I need something more concrete than that.\"<p>\"Right, right. Umm... I think he's Stephen's personal assistant? Can't tell ya much more than that, man.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Stephen Walton's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" she replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Hall Closet and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
