__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know 'em. I mean, not really,\" she says. \"They're cool, but we're not like bros or anything. Check the Family Room, maybe?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Natalie Mercado?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, sure man,\" Maya says. \"She's a solid bro. She'll be in the Dining Room, that's where she hangs out. Tell her I said hey.\""));
