__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=9", "\"Do you know Natalie Mercado?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, sure man,\" Maya says. \"She's a solid bro. She'll be in the Dining Room, that's where she hangs out. Tell her I said hey.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Cole?\" you ask.<p>\"I met her once or twice,\" Maya says. \"She seemed like real bad news to me. She's in the Hall Closet if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You mean Ed Barker?\" Maya asks. \"Yeah I kinda know him, I guess. Like I know him well enough to say hey to. And then get the hell out of Dodge because dang, man, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Cole?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, yeah, I know her,\" Maya replies. \"But no. Not like <i>know</i>-know, y'know? We aren't, like, friends. She's pretty uncool, if you ask me. Real drag. She's probably in the Hall Closet, if you're looking for her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Oh, him, yeah. I know him, kinda,\" Maya says. \"His name's Ed Barker. I'm not real into him. He's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
