__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Lauren Contreras?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Stephen's dental hygienist, dude!\" she says. \"She's great. Funny as hell. But, like, deep, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Boss...\" Maya muses, then her eyes light up. \"Oh, yeah, dude! I know who you mean. They're cool. Go check out the Sunroom, you'll find 'em there.\""));
