__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Dang, dude, like, you're the detective, right? I dunno from this whole murder thing, I'm just mindin' my own.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Dining Room, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. According to the dossier, this is Grant Farmer, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Grant says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Clive Patel. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Study, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Leroy Pitts, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" he says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and his eyes widen when you show him your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" he pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Leroy pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Attic, you find a large and powerfully-muscled woman doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Samantha Boyle, the victim's ex-cousin.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" she replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Samantha says. I know who it was. It was Madison Santiago. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, nothin' against them, but we don't talk much,\" she replies. \"They aren't interested in bodybuilding, and I'm not interested in... whatever. Try the Study.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Family Room you find a young man deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping his pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. According to the dossier, this is Kelly Christian, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Kelly grumbles, \"it was Peter's business partner. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for business partner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Dining Room,\" Kelly says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Pantry, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Edgar Pearson, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask him. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Lily Nelson was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" he says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh boy!\" Edgar says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Faith Bishop for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Living Room, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Glenn Zamora, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Foyer, where a dark-haired young woman in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; she doesn't look up as you come in. \"You must be Lillian Aguilar, the victim's lover,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>She shakes her head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Hall Closet and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. \"You must be Hannah Johnson, the victim's ex-physician,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Good, good,\" she says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Hannah says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Guest Bedroom is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies her as Bailey Adkins, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Lily'd had a proper regimen like I told her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Beats me,\" she mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "When you enter the Servants' Quarters, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Marlon Hobbs, the victim's butler.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Lily?\" Marlon asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Alvin Cooley?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "As you enter the Smoking Lounge, a wild-eyed man accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. Your dossier identifies him as Dan Mosley, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Dan says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then he looks around and whispers, \"It was Edgar Pearson!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Nelson's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Edgar Pearson? Stay away from him!\" Dan says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Ballroom, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Addison Barber, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" she sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Game Room, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Stan Glass, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well,\" Stan says, \"if I tell you, what's in it for me?\"<p>\"Nothing.\"<p>\"Oh good, my standard compensation. Okay, it was Paul's business partner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Blackwell's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, he's great. Just great,\" Stan says. \"Everyone loves Timmy Crosby.\"<p>\"...I can't tell if you're being sarcastic.\"<p>\"Yeah, me neither,\" he sighs."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "The only person in the Kitchen is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Your dossier identifies him as Mickey Vasquez, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Blackwell may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"The child.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Paul Blackwell's child, Detective,\" Vasquez says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Addison Barber, Detective,\" Vasquez says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Boiler Room, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. According to the dossier, this is Nicky Salas, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Dwight Riddle? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Hall Closet, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. Your dossier identifies her as Melanie Noel, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>She shakes her head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Basement. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Billy Bob Franks, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well now!\" Billy Bob says, glancing around the room and over his shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Johnny Lowery*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a personal assistant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Dwight's personal assistant... Oh. You mean Nicky Salas,\" Billy Bob says, shaking his head. \"Yeah, no. I don't need the stress, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Guest Bedroom, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Alexis Bullock, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" she mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" she says, rolling her eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Ted Lowery. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Alexis says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Kitchen, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Your dossier identifies her as Samantha Hall, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Samantha says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Wine Cellar and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Your dossier identifies her as Sophia Thomas, the victim's butler.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Sophia looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Living Room, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. According to the dossier, this is Chloe Langley, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Chloe grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Beats me,\" she mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Basement, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the dossier, this is Victoria Webster, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Investigate the cousin,\" Victoria mutters quietly.<p>\"All right,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything more concrete?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Henderson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Ballroom.\"<p>\"Any opinion on them?\"<p>Shrug. \"Seems okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Laundry Room and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Ted Lowery, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Lowery says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Breakfast Nook and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Randy Hancock, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Randy says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "The only person in the Family Room is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Duncan Hays, the victim's lover.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"The housekeeper.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Holden Henderson's housekeeper, Detective,\" Hays says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Holden Henderson's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Hays says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Guest Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Game Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be John Rice, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"John says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Wallace's college roommate.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Wallace Ballard's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" John says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Game Room, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Wine Cellar and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. Your dossier identifies her as Bella Kim, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Kim says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be James Leach, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" he snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Ballroom, you encounter a young man wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of his pencil. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Joey Carney, the victim's lover.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Joey sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, well,\" Joey muses, \"I suppose it does make for a more satisfying conclusion to my poem if you actually apprehend the criminal. Very well, it was Evelyn Harper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Joey snorts. \"You're referring to Ava Calderon. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Lounge, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Ava Calderon, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was the chauffeur,\" Ava mutters from behind her book.<p>\"Do you have some kind of evidence for that?\" you ask.<p>No response."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Wallace Ballard's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>Ava grimaces and turns a page. \"Ugh.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything about them at all?\"<p>\"Name's Joey Carney.\"<p>\"...That's it, huh?\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The only person in the Servants' Quarters is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. According to the dossier, this is Rachel Morse, the victim's physician.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Rachel grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Rachel shakes her head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "As you enter the Sunroom, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young woman wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out her \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. According to the dossier, this is Evelyn Harper, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" she asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Heck if I know, dude,\" she says. \"Like, your guess is as good as mine, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "In the Attic you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Ralph Rollins, the victim's ex-physician.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" he mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You enter the Dining Room. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Your dossier identifies her as Sydney Monroe, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" she says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Wallace. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Sydney grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was James Leach. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure,\" Sydney says. \"Wallace's golf caddy is great. I don't know them much more than to say hello to, but I can tell they're a decent sort. Check in the Game Room, if you wanna chat.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Laundry Room you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Parker Simpson, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Simpson says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Toby Fisher.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Pantry, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Morgan Dodson, the victim's business partner.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "When you enter the Billiard Room, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. According to the dossier, this is Lillian Chang, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Oliver?\" Lillian asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Attic, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the dossier, this is Eddie Bray, the victim's butler.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Living Room, and discover an extremely muscular man lifting weights and glistening with sweat. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Andy Figueroa, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Oliver'd had a proper regimen like I told him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Andy shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Bar you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Merle Compton, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Oliver. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Merle says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Oliver's business partner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Nah, I got no use for them,\" Merle says. \"Nothin' but trouble. Probably hangin' around the Laundry Room, if you've got time to waste.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Servants' Quarters you meet a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Mariah Gordon, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" she says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to her feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Alyssa Thornton,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Alyssa?\" Mariah asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Alan Hopper?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Hall Closet, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the dossier, this is Saul Castillo, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Mariah Gordon. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Umm... oh, you mean Hannah Franklin? I dunno, like, we don't hang out a lot, right, but she's pretty cool. Real casual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Family Room, and find a woman dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at her feet. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Hannah Franklin, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Hannah says, her eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Alyssa's business partner killed her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"College roommate...\" Hannah mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Clyde Harrison. Sure, I know him. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but he says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You walk into the Living Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Julia Jensen, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to her. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Julia asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Billiard Room and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. According to the dossier, this is Ike Becker, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Alyssa Thornton's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Becker sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Hannah Franklin? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Becker sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Guest Bedroom. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Your dossier identifies her as Emily Swanson, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" she says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Ed. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Emily says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Ed's college roommate.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Ed's college roommate,\" Emily says. \"Not real well, but we've chatted. Charming, real charming type. Probably in the Laundry Room, if I hadda guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Master Bedroom and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the dossier, this is Claire Jordan, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want me to tell you who the killer is?\" Claire asks. \"Okay. It was Wilbur's physician.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence for that?\"<p>\"Yeah, sure. Right here in my pocket.\" She reaches into her jacket pocket, and pulls out her middle finger."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know much about 'em. Alright, I suppose. Go find out for yourself -- in the Family Room, I think.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Library, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. Your dossier identifies her as Audrey Collins, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know,\" Audrey says suspiciously. \"I still don't entirely trust you.\"<p>\"Look,\" you say, \"if I was working for them, then I'd already know who did it, so it wouldn't matter if you told me.\"<p>\"...I guess you have a point. All right, it was Wilbur's lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Audrey says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Library, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=2", "\"Do you know Cortez's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Madelyn Palmer is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Audrey says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "The only person in the Ballroom is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Madelyn Palmer, the victim's physician.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Bar, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Valeria Swanson, the victim's butler.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Family Room and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Peyton Adams, the victim's lover.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Abigail's lawyer, Detective,\" Peyton says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Abigail Humphrey's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Master Bedroom, Detective,\" Peyton says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Ballroom you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Dan Solomon, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Dining Room and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. \"You must be Alyssa Copeland, the victim's neighbor,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You expect me to do your work for you, Detective?\" Copeland sighs. \"Very well, if it will get me out of this miserable situation more quickly. It was Abigail's chauffeur -- no one else has as much to gain.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Humphrey's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Copeland sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Boiler Room you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Martin Juarez, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Abigail. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Martin says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Master Bedroom, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. \"You must be Grant Acevedo, the victim's sibling,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Study, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Ike Tillman, the victim's chauffeur.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Ike exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's lover, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I dunno much of anything about them, Detective,\" Ike says apologetically. \"I'm pretty sure they're in the Game Room right now, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You walk into the Game Room, and find a young man wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. He looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" he says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Roy Robinson, the victim's gardener.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Abigail Humphrey, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Heck if I know, dude,\" he says. \"Like, your guess is as good as mine, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "The only person in the Wine Cellar is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Gavin Richard, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Humphrey may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Roy Robinson, Detective,\" Richard says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Richard says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Bar, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Library, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking man dressed for a white-tie occasion. He looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what he sees. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Max Hines, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Zoe Peck's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" he exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Mitch Sims, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and he looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Zoe's child, Detective,\" Mitch says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Madeline Santana, isn't it?\" Mitch asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Pantry, and find a woman dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at her feet. According to the dossier, this is Leah Madden, the victim's child.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Zoe Peck? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Dining Room, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Madison McDonald, the victim's boss.<p>She looks up at you, and her eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" she says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Madison exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Attic is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. \"You must be Kayla Andrews, the victim's chauffeur,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Zoe'd had a proper regimen like I told her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Kayla shakes her head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Hall Closet and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. Your dossier identifies him as Steven Bruce, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Peck may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"The physician.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Zoe Peck's physician, Detective,\" Bruce says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Peck's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Max Hines, I presume,\" Bruce says. \"He is a petulant child, demanding candy from a universe that does not listen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Family Room, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Gustav Cruz, the victim's gardener.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask him. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Dan Bean was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" he says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh boy!\" Gustav says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Madeline Johnson for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Pantry and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Camila Hardy, the victim's lover.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Dan Bean's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Hardy says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Master Bedroom, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Madeline Johnson, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Guest Bedroom, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. \"You must be Kimberly Morrow, the victim's sibling,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Kimberly exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Wine Cellar and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Chloe Long, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Chloe sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Chloe says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Gustav Scott,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Bean's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Isabella Moss and I get along rather well,\" Chloe says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Living Room and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Oliver Leon, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Oliver Leon. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Oliver says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Bathroom you find a pale, drably-dressed woman slouched on a small chair. She looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. Your dossier identifies her as Ella Albert, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Dan Bean? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Boiler Room you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Isabella Moss, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Dan Bean's gardener,\" Moss says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Moss says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Guest Bedroom is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "In the Basement, you find a large and powerfully-muscled man doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. Your dossier identifies him as Gustav Scott, the victim's physician.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Gustav grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Gustav says. \"It was Dan's child.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" He flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Umm...\" Gustav thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Living Room if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Family Room, and find the victim's gardener, Gustav Cruz the Kid Detective, quickly brushing dirt off of his knees."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It's just gotta be Madeline Johnson, Detective,\" Gustav says excitedly. \"Means, motive, and opportunity -- just like the Junior Detective's Handbook says!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm. I know who that is, but I dunno much of anything about them. Sorry, Detective,\" Gustav says. \"They're in the Pantry, maybe you can investigate them there?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Living Room you find a young man deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping his pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Your dossier identifies him as Eddie Estes, the victim's boss.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Eddie sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Eddie says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" he sniffs. \"It was her personal assistant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Do you know Vasquez's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing good to say about that... person,\" Eddie snorts. \"Their presence in the Kitchen is lowering the average intelligence of the household by at least thirty points.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Kitchen, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the dossier, this is Serenity Nguyen, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>She shakes her head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Basement you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Alexandra Alston, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Vasquez may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Alston says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Breakfast Nook you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Freddy Roman, the victim's lover.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Sophia. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well Detective, you know what they always say,\" he says with a twinkle in his eye. \"The child did it!\"<p>\"...Is that what they always say?\"<p>\"Something like that, yeah. Pretty sure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"His name's Eddie Estes. I don't recommend you waste your time with him though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The only person in the Study is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Garrett Osborn, the victim's child.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"The boss.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Travis Maynard's boss, Detective,\" Osborn says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove he is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=1", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Andrea Short,\" Osborn says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "The only person in the Billiard Room is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Aaliyah Floyd, the victim's boss.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Aaliyah grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Travis?\" Aaliyah says. \"That's easy, it was his cousin.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Aaliyah flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>Aaliyah rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Garrett Osborn. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The only person in the Master Bedroom is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Mackenzie Burch, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Mackenzie grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Yeah, easy,\" Mackenzie says. \"It was Naomi's child.\"<p>\"Are you sure?\" you ask.<p>\"Hey buddy, these muscles don't lie.\" She flexes at you to demonstrate... something."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"The victim's child -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Naomi's child? Oh, you mean Alexa Duncan,\" Mackenzie says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Sunroom, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Alexa Duncan, the victim's child.<p>She looks up at you, and her eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" she says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Kitchen you meet a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. According to the dossier, this is Mackenzie Fry, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Mackenzie says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Grant's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the business partner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Mackenzie says. \"Calls himself 'Franklin Perry', but is that even his legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Franklin Perry' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Basement, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Arthur Weber, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing him your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Arthur exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Smoking Lounge, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Your dossier identifies him as Tucker Buck, the victim's butler.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" he says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and his eyes widen when you show him your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" he pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Tucker exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Study, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. According to the dossier, this is Taylor Blair, the victim's child.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who killed Grant, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "When you enter the Billiard Room, you encounter a young man wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of his pencil. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Franklin Perry, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Franklin says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Breakfast Nook you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Your dossier identifies him as Ferris Ortiz, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Ortiz says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Arthur Weber.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Lynch's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Ortiz says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Smoking Lounge is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Master Bedroom, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. According to the dossier, this is Doc Baker, the victim's lover.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the bodyguard,\" Doc mutters from behind his book.<p>\"Do you have some kind of evidence for that?\" you ask.<p>No response."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's golf caddy?\" you ask.<p>\"Only know them a little. They're in the Kitchen.\"<p>\"What do you think of them?\"<p>\"'S'alright.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you enter the Wine Cellar, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Harry Hewitt, the victim's butler.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Paige Howell,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who murdered Paige?\" Harry asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Roy Park?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Library, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Aaliyah Combs, the victim's ex-best friend.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Aaliyah shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Paige committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Study and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Madeline Pitts, the victim's physician,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Madeline says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Elizabeth McDowell, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Howell may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Paige Howell's ex-best friend,\" McDowell says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Harry Hewitt to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Laundry Room you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Terry Richards, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Terry says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Breakfast Nook you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Parker Briggs, the victim's bodyguard.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Parker looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Dining Room, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Alex Howe, the victim's boss.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Alyssa, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Bathroom, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. \"You must be Hailey Sawyer, the victim's business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the lawyer. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, umm... I think I know who you mean. In the Dining Room. Don't know 'em too well, but I guess they're okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Kitchen is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Your dossier identifies her as Ashley Ballard, the victim's ex-college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Langley may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Ballard says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Alyssa Langley's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was her bodyguard.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Maria Riddle, Ballard says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Master Bedroom, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Carl Tate, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Carl exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Attic, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. \"You must be Maria Riddle, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Investigate the best friend,\" Maria mutters quietly.<p>\"All right,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything more concrete?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Only know them a little. They're in the Laundry Room.\"<p>\"What do you think of them?\"<p>\"'S'alright.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Library, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Conway Kline, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Riff, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Lounge is a hugely-muscled man, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies him as Leonard Sears, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Leonard grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Riff?\" Leonard says. \"That's easy, it was his dental hygienist.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Leonard flexes his muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's dental hygienist -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's the jerk that keeps calling me a 'muscle-head' when they think I'm not listening,\" Leonard says. \"Little do they know, my ears are as strong as the rest of me! Heck, I can hear them in the Ballroom right now.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Pantry and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Alexa Sears, the victim's physician.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Sears says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Riff Carr's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Riff Carr's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Conway Kline to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Guest Bedroom, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Zoe Crane, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Zoe. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Ballroom you find a young man deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping his pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Curly Richards, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Curly says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "The only person in the Smoking Lounge is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Your dossier identifies him as Garrett Madden, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Wynn may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Barney Wynn's neighbor,\" Madden says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Madden says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Guest Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Servants' Quarters, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. \"You must be Jacky Beard, the victim's butler,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Jacky, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Dining Room, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Your dossier identifies him as Larry Flynn, the victim's gardener.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Larry exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's dental hygienist, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Servants' Quarters,\" Larry says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Foyer, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. Your dossier identifies her as Mariah Adkins, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Mariah. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Boiler Room and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. Your dossier identifies him as Dan Riley, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Bradley may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Eddie Bradley has true relevance, Detective,\" Riley says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Kitchen, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. According to the dossier, this is Alexis Little, the victim's physician.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Eddie Bradley was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Alexis exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Your dossier identifies her as Taylor Aguilar, the victim's gardener.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" she says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to her feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Eddie Bradley,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Taylor looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You walk into the Library, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Victoria Walker, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Victoria asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You walk into the Smoking Lounge and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Alex Watson, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" he says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Guest Bedroom you find a pale, drably-dressed woman slouched on a small chair. She looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Samantha Noble, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Samantha grumbles. \"It was Mariah Adkins. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Bradley's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur...\" Samantha mutters. \"...Oh, you mean Mariah Adkins. Sure, I know her. I mean, as well as I know anybody, which isn't very well, but she says hello to me sometimes, and that's more than I get from most people.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Breakfast Nook and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. Your dossier identifies him as Lonnie Shields, the victim's lover.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Claudius Holmes's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" he exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Master Bedroom you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Caroline Delaney, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Holmes may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Delaney says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Claudius Holmes's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his college roommate.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Lonnie Shields to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Sunroom, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Riff Schmidt, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The Sunroom is still silent but for the sound of turning pages as the victim's chauffeur, Riff Schmidt, sits and reads. \"Hey,\" you say. \"I've got some more questions for you.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm?\" comes the reply.<p>\"Eyes up here, please,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Sunroom, where Riff Schmidt (the victim's chauffeur) is still reading his book. \"Rest your eyes for a second,\" you say. \"I've got something to ask you.\" He looks up at you with a very faint sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>Riff tilts his head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Riff turns a page and goes back to his reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Sunroom -- the victim's chauffeur, Riff Schmidt, is still sitting quietly and reading. \"Hey,\" you say. \"I've got some more questions for you.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm?\" comes the reply.<p>\"Eyes up here, please,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The Sunroom is still silent but for the sound of turning pages as the victim's chauffeur, Riff Schmidt, sits and reads. \"Rest your eyes for a second,\" you say. \"I've got something to ask you.\" He looks up at you with a very faint sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Hmm.\" After a long pause, he mutters, \"Probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"Do you have any evidence to back that up?\"<p>He glances up at you, then turns a page and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Sunroom, where Riff Schmidt (the victim's chauffeur) is still reading his book. \"Hey,\" you say. \"I've got some more questions for you.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm?\" comes the reply.<p>\"Eyes up here, please,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>Riff tilts his head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Riff turns a page and goes back to his reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The Sunroom is still silent but for the sound of turning pages as the victim's chauffeur, Riff Schmidt, sits and reads. He ignores you, though at least you get the sense that it's not out of dislike so much as absolute disinterest."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Sunroom -- the victim's chauffeur, Riff Schmidt, is still sitting quietly and reading. He ignores you, though at least you get the sense that it's not out of dislike so much as absolute disinterest."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Riff tilts his head to the side in thought for a moment. \"...Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"Okay,\" you say. \"And why do you say that?\"<p>Riff turns a page and goes back to his reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Breakfast Nook, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Your dossier identifies her as Abigail Sawyer, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Lewis's ex-bodyguard, Detective,\" Abigail says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's chauffeur? you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur, chauffeur. Hmm,\" Abigail ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Riff Schmidt? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Lewis's chauffeur. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Gustav Logan.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p><p>\"Layla Warren. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>He turns a page and doesn't reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You return to the Breakfast Nook, and find Lewis's dental hygienist, Abigail Sawyer, snoozing on a couch with her straw boater over her face. You clear your throat loudly, and she pushes up the brim of the hat and blinks at you. \"What-ho, Detective!\" she says with a grin. \"I was wondering when you'd be popping back around for more of the old Q and A!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Lewis's ex-bodyguard, Detective,\" Abigail says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Riff Schmidt, isn't it?\" Abigail asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a dental hygienist,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Don't really know her. Name's Layla Warren.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about her?\"<p>\"She's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You return to the Breakfast Nook, and find Lewis's dental hygienist, Abigail Sawyer, snoozing on a couch with her straw boater over her face. You clear your throat loudly, and she pushes up the brim of the hat and blinks at you. \"Hallo hallo!\" she says, grinning. \"Back for round two, are you? I must say, this is exciting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Abigail says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lewis Suarez?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the ex-bodyguard, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur, chauffeur. Hmm,\" Abigail ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Riff Schmidt? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Lewis's chauffeur. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lewis Suarez's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't really know her. Name's Layla Warren.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about her?\"<p>\"She's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The victim's dental hygienist, Abigail Sawyer, is pacing around the Breakfast Nook with her hands behind her back, apparently looking for some means of entertaining herself. Her eyes light up when she sees you enter. \"Hallo hallo!\" she says, grinning. \"Back for round two, are you? I must say, this is exciting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Abigail says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Lewis Suarez?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the ex-bodyguard, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Riff Schmidt,\" Abigail says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Suarez's dental hygienist?\" you ask.<p><p>\"Layla Warren. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>He turns a page and doesn't reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The victim's dental hygienist, Abigail Sawyer, is pacing around the Breakfast Nook with her hands behind her back, apparently looking for some means of entertaining herself. Her eyes light up when she sees you enter. \"I say!\" she says. \"Back for more questions, are you?\"<p>\"Yes, I'm sorry to disturb you, but --\"<p>\"Oh, no apologies needed, my good Detective! I've never been what you might call 'murder-adjacent' before! It's bally exciting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Abigail says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Lewis's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the ex-bodyguard.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lewis Suarez's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Riff Schmidt, isn't it?\" Abigail asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Sunroom, where Riff Schmidt (the victim's chauffeur) is still reading his book. He ignores you, though at least you get the sense that it's not out of dislike so much as absolute disinterest."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't really know her. Name's Layla Warren.\"<p>\"Can you tell me anything at all about her?\"<p>\"She's awful.\"<p>\"...Anything else?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Chauffeur, chauffeur. Hmm,\" Abigail ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Riff Schmidt? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Lewis's chauffeur. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Master Bedroom, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Aldous McFadden, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Wine Cellar, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Rachel Morin, the victim's butler.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Rachel grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Rachel says. I know who it was. It was Aldous McFadden. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's neighbor? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Ava Bean. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Bar, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Charlotte Rose, the victim's accountant.<p>She looks up at you, and her eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" she says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Charlotte pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Sunroom, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking man dressed for a white-tie occasion. He looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what he sees. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Andy McIntyre, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Dennis Vang's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" McIntyre sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a butler.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim's neighbor -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know the person you mean,\" McIntyre says, \"but I've never really had occasion to speak with them. We travel in entirely different circles. Perhaps you should try the Lounge?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Hall Closet and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. Your dossier identifies her as Sophie McLeod, the victim's business partner.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Boiler Room you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Ava Bean, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Ava Bean. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Ava says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Lounge you meet a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. \"You must be Maya Sparks, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who murdered Dennis?\" Maya asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Abe Witt?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You walk into the Guest Bedroom, and find a young man wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. He looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" he says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Merle Martinez, the victim's ex-physician.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Dennis Vang, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, well, uhh...\" Merle hesitates. \"...Like I don't wanna be a narc or whatever, so I don't wanna name names, you know dude? But okay, I will say you should check out Dennis's dental hygienist. Like for real, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, jeez,\" Merle says, rolling his eyes. \"Him. Aldous McFadden. Phew, he's a real piece of work, dude. When he comes in the room, I'm, like, <i>gone</i>. Like 'No thank you,' right? Who needs that kind of drama?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Master Bedroom and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. Your dossier identifies her as Elizabeth Everett, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It was Charlie Cortez, Detective,\" Everett says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. Your dossier identifies her as Caroline Lucas, the victim's boss.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Elmer Booker's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Back in the Master Bedroom, you find Elizabeth Everett, the victim's accountant, still grading essays. It looks like she's going to need another red pen soon."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a boss, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Everett says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Servants' Quarters is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you enter the Study, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Jessica Jackson, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh, well,\" Jessica says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Chloe Sweet,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Sunroom, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Jessica Blanchard, the victim's cousin.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" she says, turning a page in her book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Study, where Jessica Jackson, the victim's bodyguard is struggling to compose her poetic masterpiece. Guess these artistic types get their inspiration from all sorts of places. \"Oh! Hello,\" she says. \"I was hoping you would come back, so I could ask you: Aubrey's last words -- how many were there?\"<p>\"How many? Well, I don't know that anyone but the murderer heard them, but according to the coroner's report it was a short sentence at the most. And probably just 'Ow'.\"<p>\"Not an entire sonnet? Well, that's a slight crimp in my plans.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim's cousin -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That barbarian is currently occupying the Guest Bedroom,\" Jessica says, \"which is why I'm not there myself. One might as well read one's poetry to a pickled eel.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Hall Closet. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Your dossier identifies him as Del Crawford, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Del says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Game Room, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Giles Castillo, the victim's boss.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>Giles looks around the room, and picks up a piece of paper and a pen. He writes the name \"Genesis Stone\", shows it to you, then stuffs it in his mouth and swallows it."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's bodyguard? you ask.<p>\"Elmer Medina? Stay away from him!\" Giles says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Guest Bedroom you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. Your dossier identifies him as Arthur Lowe, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Aubrey Rosa,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Arthur says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Aubrey's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The only person in the Bar is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Your dossier identifies her as Genesis Stone, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Rosa may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Jessica Blanchard, Detective,\" Stone says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Jessica Jackson to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Billiard Room and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Larry Snider, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Library, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the dossier, this is Brendan Collier, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Brendan. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Brendan says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Arianna Fitzgerald. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a chauffeur,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You mean Larry Snider? Yeah dude! He's a riot! He's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Attic, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Timmy Watkins, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Timmy. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Timmy says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Lonnie's bodyguard. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Lonnie O'Connor's bodyguard?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm, dunno much, dude,\" Timmy says. \"I guess look in the Guest Bedroom? That's where I'd look, if I was looking.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Foyer, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Mariah Sharp, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, fine, okay. You wanna know who did it? It was Eva Osborne. You happy now?\"<p>\"We'll see,\" you say, writing it down in your notebook."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Basement and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. Your dossier identifies her as Melanie Goodwin, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Gustav Acevedo. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Eustace Coffey's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Apart from the fact that they are in the Foyer,\" she says, \"I know nothing about them, and nor do I care to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Smoking Lounge, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Ava Riggs, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Get the hell outta here! Even if I <i>did</i> know, I still wouldn't tell a cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Bathroom you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Your dossier identifies her as Lily Thomas, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Lily says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Game Room, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Isaiah Kirkland, the victim's accountant.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Kitchen, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Ted West, the victim's gardener.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Ted pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Hall Closet you meet a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. \"You must be Samantha Harvey, the victim's personal assistant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" she says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to her feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Molly Herrera,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Molly's best friend, Detective,\" Samantha says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a golf caddy, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Samantha says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Smoking Lounge and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Boiler Room, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Carl Rich, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>He ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Basement is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. \"You must be Leo Blackburn, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Leonard may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Lucy Park, Detective,\" Blackburn says. \"Have you not witnessed for yourself the madness that gnaws at the core of their being, brought on by irrational fear of the unknown?\"<p>\"I guess not,\" you shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a child, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe you are speaking of Carl Rich, Detective,\" Blackburn says. \"I have nothing to recommend of such a cowardly, beady-eyed vole of a human being.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Game Room and find an annoyed-looking young woman slouched on a leather sofa with her motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. She gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Bailey Guerrero, the victim's ex-child.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, it was probably the cousin. That's what I figure.\"<p>\"Why do you say that?\" you ask.<p>\"Because I'm a friggin' psychic. Get bent!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Oh, you mean Emily Nicholson. she's all right. Can't tell you much about her, though.\"<p>\"Do you mean can't, or won't?\" you ask.<p>\"What I mean is: get bent, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Lounge, a woman in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair she's slouched in, and sighs. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Emily Nicholson, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Master Bedroom, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. Your dossier identifies him as Parker Sargent, the victim's physician.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Foyer. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Randy Palmer, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" he says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Dennis. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Randy says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "The only person in the Smoking Lounge is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Bella Rivers, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Rivers says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new woman to take her place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Dennis Burns's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his ex-accountant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Rivers says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Master Bedroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Servants' Quarters, and find a woman dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at her feet. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Naomi Combs, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Alexis, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Ballroom you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Nicky Wilson, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Hayden may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Wilson says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You walk into the Pantry, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" According to the dossier, this is Ashley Levine, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Ashley. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Family Room and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Hannah Kim, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" she says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Alexis. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Hannah says, glancing around the room and over her shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Payton Woodard*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Hayden's chauffeur?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" she replies. \"Her name's Naomi Combs. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Laundry Room you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Your dossier identifies her as Ashley Hartman, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Ashley Hartman. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Ashley says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Morgan like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Ballroom, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. Your dossier identifies him as Aldous Hess, the victim's lawyer.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Golly!\" Aldous exclaims, \"A real-life detective wants to know what I think?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"What've you got?\"<p>He flips open his notebook and quickly scans the pages. \"I think it's the victim's golf caddy, Detective! It's gotta be!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about Morgan Savage's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Sunroom,\" Aldous says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Dining Room you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. Your dossier identifies him as Cal Marks, the victim's personal assistant.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Cal looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Sunroom, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. \"You must be Kylie Andrews, the victim's business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Kylie grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, sorry,\" she says. \"No idea. I was blastin' my delts at the time, so I didn't notice anything unusual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Servants' Quarters, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. According to the dossier, this is Zoey Hurst, the victim's boss.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to her. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Zoey asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Game Room and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Amelia Britt, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Family Room, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Dale Workman, the victim's sibling.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Dale says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Ashley Hartman. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had a housekeeper, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>that</i> jerkoff. Go to the Sunroom and see for yourself why I wouldn't give a wet fart.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Attic and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. According to the dossier, this is Zoe Pace, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Savage may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Pace asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Cal Marks.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"If you seek them out in the Laundry Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Pace says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Dining Room you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the dossier, this is Garrett Faulkner, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although McCormick may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"We are all murderers, Detective,\" Faulkner says. \"Every decision we make, every event we experience, kills our past self and creates a new man to take his place.\"<p>\"...Okay, but I'm talking about Larry McCormick's murder specifically.\"<p>\"Ah. In that case, it was his accountant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Faulkner says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Ballroom, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Harry Serrano, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Harry. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Harry asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Larry's butler! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know 'em. I mean, not really,\" he says. \"They're cool, but we're not like bros or anything. Check the Dining Room, maybe?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Laundry Room, you find a large and powerfully-muscled man doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Aldous Pennington, the victim's boss.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" he replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>Aldous shakes his head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Boiler Room and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. Your dossier identifies her as Paige Fischer, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Good, good,\" she says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Paige says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "When you enter the Pantry, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Sarah Hines, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Sarah sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Sarah says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Billiard Room, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Your dossier identifies her as Zoe Rios, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Zoe says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Sophie's boss.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know him, that's Aldous Pennington. He's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Family Room, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Gabrielle Page, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't know who did it!\" Gabrielle says, really loudly. \"I don't know a thing! Why are you even asking me? Even if I did know, I certainly wouldn't tell you!\" And then she looks around and whispers, \"It was Clarence Stewart!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Servants' Quarters, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. According to the dossier, this is Dwight Puckett, the victim's cousin.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Larry Bryant, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Family Room, Gabrielle Page (the victim's personal assistant) hides behind the sofa. \"It's all right,\" you say. \"It's just me again. The detective.\"<p>\"Well, of course you'd say that!\" comes the response. \"How do I know you didn't just kill the detective and now you're wearing a detective skin to trick me?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Gabrielle says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Family Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "The only person in the Library is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Gianna Brady, the victim's ex-college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Brady says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Family Room, and the victom's personal assistant, Gabrielle Page, screams and dives behind a curtain. \"Will you just settle the hell down?\" you say. \"You aren't in any danger. There's cops all over this place.\"<p>\"Oh! Oh, that's supposed to make me feel <i>better?</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's ex-college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Gabrielle says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Family Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Lounge, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. \"You must be Arianna Jacobs, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Family Room, Gabrielle Page (the victim's personal assistant) hides behind the sofa. \"Will you just settle the hell down?\" you say. \"You aren't in any danger. There's cops all over this place.\"<p>\"Oh! Oh, that's supposed to make me feel <i>better?</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's child?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Basement, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Basement you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Edgar Bush, the victim's sibling.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" he mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Smoking Lounge, and encounter a young man -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Craig Marshall, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" he says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and his eyes widen when you show him your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" he pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Craig exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "When you enter the Game Room, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Your dossier identifies her as Arianna Herman, the victim's ex-housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well now, I'm not sure it would be right to be a squealer, Detective,\" Arianna says. \"Not quite cricket, you know. ...Then again, neither is murder, what? Very well, you've forced my hand. It was Gabrielle Page.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's personal assistant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Personal assistant, personal assistant. Hmm,\" Arianna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Gabrielle Page? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Larry's personal assistant. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Bathroom, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young woman wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out her \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. Your dossier identifies her as Gabrielle George, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Gabrielle. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Gabrielle asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Alex's sibling! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"Do you know Coffey's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Andy Joyner? Yeah dude! He's a riot! He's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Foyer, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Your dossier identifies her as Hailey Mason, the victim's sibling.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Alex Coffey was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh boy!\" Hailey says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Andy Joyner for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, yeah,\" Hailey nods. \"That's Gabrielle George. She's a real suspicious character, if you ask me! Keep your eyes peeled!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Wine Cellar, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Genesis Chen, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>She shakes her head slightly, but doesn't say anything."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Bar. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Bailey Byers, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Bailey Byers. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Bailey says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Rachel like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Guest Bedroom, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. \"You must be Rachel Mullins, the victim's best friend,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Rachel'd had a proper regimen like I told her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>Rachel shakes her head. \"No idea who it was. If they tried that on me, though, I'd tear them in half. Literally. I've been practicing on sides of beef.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Hall Closet, you encounter a young man wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of his pencil. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Floyd Ingram, the victim's boss.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Floyd says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Laundry Room and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. Your dossier identifies him as Dan Copeland, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Dan says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Rachel's best friend.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, you mean Rachel Mullins, right? I don't know anything about her except that she's a real ass and I don't want anything to do with her. Does that help?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Attic you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Ariana Madden, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you not already know, Detective?\" Madden asks. \"You need only ask yourself, who among these people is so ruled by fear that they would take the life of another in order to prolong their own existence, miserable though it may be?\" <p>\"...Just answer the question, please?\"<p>\"Rachel Mullins.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about Rachel Briggs's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Dining Room, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Madden says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Dining Room, and find a woman dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at her feet. \"You must be Caroline Cooper, the victim's child,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" she says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Rachel Briggs? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "As you enter the Foyer, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Charlie Alford, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Aw jeez, man. I can't be havin' people think I'm the sorta dude who talks to cops, you know? But, okay, it was Bailey Byers. Just, like, keep it on the down-low, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man,\" Charlie says, shaping his head. \"I know enough to stay the hell out of the Wine Cellar when they're there, which is like always, and that's all I need to know, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Dining Room, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Alexis Williams, the victim's cousin.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Floyd Collier, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Bathroom, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Ralph Anthony, the victim's gardener.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>He looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Alexis Williams.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Collier's cousin?\" you ask.<p>Ralph shrugs. \"Try the Dining Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Kitchen, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. \"You must be Glenn McMahon, the victim's physician,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gosh,\" Glenn says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Louis's college roommate killed him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Glenn says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Living Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Wine Cellar, you find a young woman in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick her foot to wake her up. \"Uh?\" she says. \"Wha? Oh.\" She stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Morgan Kaufman, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Morgan. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Bathroom and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. \"You must be Horace Carpenter, the victim's accountant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Giles Grant,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Giles?\" Horace asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Isaiah Burgess?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Breakfast Nook. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. According to the dossier, this is Elmer Mendez, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Elmer Mendez. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Elmer says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Willard Farmer. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a cousin,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Nah, I got no use for them,\" Elmer says. \"Nothin' but trouble. Probably hangin' around the Wine Cellar, if you've got time to waste.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Basement you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Your dossier identifies him as Ricky Mays, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Ricky says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Wilbur like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Ballroom, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Ella Knapp, the victim's personal assistant.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Wilbur?\" Ella asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Doc Ferguson?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Master Bedroom, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Paul Richardson, the victim's lover.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Guest Bedroom, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Makayla Alston, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Makayla says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Wilbur's lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Ricky Mays? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Makayla exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "In the Hall Closet, you find a large and powerfully-muscled man doing arm-curls with a set of huge barbells. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Niles Woodward, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Randy'd had a proper regimen like I told him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Niles says. I know who it was. It was Julia Robinson. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. According to the dossier, this is Dwight Daugherty, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Dwight says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Hall Closet, which is starting to smell noticeably of sweat from the workout the victim's personal assistant, Niles Woodward, is having. \"I've got to hand it to you,\" you say, \"all this working out you do is giving you real results.\"<p>\"Heh, yeah, I'd like to see a murderer try and get one over on me,\" he says. \"I'd crush his skull like a pumpkin! Wanna see me crush a pumpkin? I can do it with my armpit!\" <p>\"...Not just now, thanks.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a bodyguard, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Ariana Klein,\" Niles says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You walk into the Pantry, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Madeline Wong, the victim's boss.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Madeline. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Heck if I know, dude,\" she says. \"Like, your guess is as good as mine, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Master Bedroom and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. \"You must be Douglas Russell, the victim's housekeeper,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Randy?\" Douglas asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Leo Dejesus?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Foyer, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Sophia Hewitt, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Investigate the butler,\" Sophia mutters quietly.<p>\"All right,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything more concrete?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p><p>\"Madeline Wong. We don't talk.\"<p>\"Do you actually talk to anyone?\"<p>She turns a page and doesn't reply."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Kitchen, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Ariana Klein, the victim's lover.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Ariana asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You walk into the Dining Room and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Clancy McGuire, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Randy Russell's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "You enter the Game Room, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Willie Morin, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Willie says, his eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Randy's boss killed him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's personal assistant?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Willie says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Hall Closet.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Servants' Quarters, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. According to the dossier, this is Oliver Tanner, the victim's butler.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" he mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who killed Samantha Andrews? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Boiler Room is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies her as Gianna Blake, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Samantha'd had a proper regimen like I told her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Beats me,\" she mutters. \"If they try and pull that murder stuff on me, though, I'll tie 'em in a knot like a fireplace poker!\"<p>\"...You can do that?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah! Wanna see?\"<p>\"Yeah, kind of. But later.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Library, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. Your dossier identifies him as Steven Becker, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"If I knew that, I wouldn't be out of my mind with fear!\" Steven exclaims. \"It could be any of them! <i>Any of them!!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Lounge, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be John Martin, the victim's best friend.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "When you enter the Smoking Lounge, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Zoey Ortega, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Zoey says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was her housekeeper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had a butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, John Martin and I get along rather well,\" Zoey says. \"He never seems to have time to hear my poems, but he always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Laundry Room, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Franklin Baxter, the victim's child.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Basement and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. \"You must be Paul Graves, the victim's sibling,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I can only assume it was Samantha Andrews's golf caddy,\" Graves says. \"If you have witnessed for yourself the lizard-like quality of their eyes, Detective, you must undoubtedly have reached the same conclusion.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This woman you are speaking of, her name is Charlotte Burch,\" Graves says. \"My interactions with her have been unpleasant, without exception.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "When you enter the Hall Closet, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Charlotte Burch, the victim's personal assistant.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Charlotte says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Samantha's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Boiler Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Charlotte declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "Inside the Sunroom, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Your dossier identifies him as Parker Combs, the victim's golf caddy.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Golly! You really want to know what I think, Detective?\" Parker says, excitedly, and pulls out a notebook. \"Okay, so, first I measured some footprints out in the driveway, and...\" <p>\"Kid, we're short on time. Cut to the chase and tell me the details later, okay?\"<p>\"Oh, okay! It was Paul Graves!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about Samantha Andrews's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Servants' Quarters,\" Parker says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Study and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Mia Harrington, the victim's lover.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Foyer, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Giles Dodson, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Giles says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Todd Glenn. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Lover? Lover...\" Giles lights a cigarette and thinks for a moment. \"...Oh! You mean Jocelyn Sexton. Yeah, I don't give a crap about that woman.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Attic you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. According to the dossier, this is Sofia David, the victim's physician.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Sofia sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Sofia says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was her lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Payton Guy's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Paco Bush and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Sofia says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "The only person in the Bar is an older man in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Dennis Boone, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Payton Guy has true relevance, Detective,\" Boone says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Wine Cellar, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. According to the dossier, this is Jocelyn Sexton, the victim's best friend.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Payton Guy was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Jocelyn says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "When you enter the Dining Room, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. Your dossier identifies him as Todd Glenn, the victim's business partner.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Todd says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Payton's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "Inside the Bathroom, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the dossier, this is Aldous George, the victim's butler.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Aldous. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Aldous asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Payton's best friend! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Oh, her, yeah. I know her, kinda,\" Aldous says. \"Her name's Mia Harrington. I'm not real into her. She's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. According to the dossier, this is Naomi Hahn, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Naomi Hahn. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Naomi says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Library and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. \"You must be Autumn Dudley, the victim's lover,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Williams may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Dudley says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Ashley Hubbard.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a dental hygienist, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Dudley says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Servants' Quarters, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Pantry, you discover a young woman, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Jocelyn Faulkner, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Jocelyn pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Kitchen you find a young man deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping his pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Wade Campos, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Wade sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Wade says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Basement, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Craig Hopper, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, it's not enough that I have to do everything else around here, I might as well solve the murder for the detective too,\" Craig grumbles. \"It was Ralph Murphy. There. Happy?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"You'll find them in the Foyer, if you want to talk to them,\" Craig says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Sunroom, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Ralph Murphy, the victim's physician.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and he looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It's interesting you should ask me that, Detective, because I was just asking myself the very same,\" Ralph says. \"The identical, as it were.\"<p>\"...And?\"<p>\"Hmm?\"<p>\"Who killed Buck Lloyd?\"<p>\"Oh! It was the best friend, of course. Terribly sorry, I thought you already knew.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Jocelyn Faulkner,\" Ralph says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The only person in the Dining Room is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the dossier, this is Zoey Alston, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Barney Farmer has true relevance, Detective,\" Alston says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Pantry, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Clarence Adkins, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" he mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Kaitlyn Graves, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Kaitlyn Graves. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Kaitlyn says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Barney's accountant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Kaitlyn says. \"Try the Dining Room, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Basement you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the dossier, this is Riley Hardin, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Hardin says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Study you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. According to the dossier, this is Diego Lane, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Great, here we go,\" he says morosely. \"You'll probably put the blame for this on me, same as everyone always does when anything goes wrong around here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Julia Faulkner? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Attic, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Sophie Briggs, the victim's butler.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Sophie says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Guest Bedroom, where a dark-haired young man in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; he doesn't look up as you come in. According to the dossier, this is Leo McMillan, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Dining Room, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. \"You must be Curly Barber, the victim's gardener,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Curly says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Julia's chauffeur.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, you mean Ike Harvey, right? I don't know anything about him except that he's a real ass and I don't want anything to do with him. Does that help?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "In the Laundry Room you meet a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Abigail Mack, the victim's sibling.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Julia's best friend, Detective,\" Abigail says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Accountant, accountant. Hmm,\" Abigail ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Riley Hardin? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Julia's accountant. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Kitchen and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Jocelyn Hicks, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Alexis Avery's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy woman, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" she sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Guest Bedroom, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. \"You must be Dunstan Clark, the victim's ex-college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Alexis's ex-butler, Detective,\" Dunstan says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Bathroom with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Dunstan declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Foyer, and find a man dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at his feet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Kenny Mullen, the victim's ex-butler.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Alexis Avery? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Living Room, where a young man wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling his initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. He glances at you, finishes his task, and puts his penknife away. According to the dossier, this is Victor Larson, the victim's lover.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Victor says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Alexis's ex-butler.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>that</i> jerkoff. Go to the Game Room and see for yourself why I wouldn't give a wet fart.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "In the Boiler Room, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Clyde Snyder, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Library and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Hilary Sims, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Hilary Sims. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, well, I'm trusting you to keep my name out of this, Detective,\" Hilary says. \"My life wouldn't be worth a plugged nickel if the wrong people found out I told you this. But it was Dunstan Clark. I can't risk tellin' ya any more than that.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know them real well,\" Hilary says, \"but we run into each other from time to time, sure. They're alright. Check in the Kitchen.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Pantry, a distinctive smell assaults your sinuses. A young man wearing a tye-dyed t-shirt and a knitted beanie coughs in surprise, hurriedly stubs out his \"cigarette\" in a potted plant, and moves to open a window. Your dossier identifies him as Glenn Roman, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" he says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Glenn. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Laundry Room, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. According to the dossier, this is Riley Wiggins, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions about the murder,\" you say. <p>\"Real shame. Wouldn'ta happened if Alistair'd had a proper regimen like I told him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Riley says. I know who it was. It was Alex Larsen. And if I wasn't so busy with Arm Day, I'd wring that scrawny neck myself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had a chauffeur, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Glenn Roman. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Game Room, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Larry Walls, the victim's boss.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>He turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Breakfast Nook, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. \"You must be Grant Gray, the victim's business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to him. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Okay, I'll tell you, but I need police protection!\" Grant says. <p>\"You'll be fine,\" you say. \"Who was it?\"<p>Grant looks around, then whispers, \"It was Olivia's best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's boss -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Grant says, shaking his head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Breakfast Nook, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=2", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Makayla Schmidt is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Grant says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You walk into the Lounge and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be John Levine, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Levine smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Avery Clarke?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Benjamin's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I will not lower myself to that person's level by deigning to speak to them,\" Levine sniffs. \"If you wish to know about them, try the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Basement, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. According to the dossier, this is Emil Bartlett, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Look, cop -- I don't know who did it, and if I did, I still wouldn't tell you! Get out of my face, already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Foyer and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Makayla Schmidt, the victim's gardener.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Makayla says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Olivia's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Dining Room, you discover a young man, about 14 years old, give or take, who appears to be dusting a glass-topped coffee table for prints with a homemade fingerprinting kit. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Andre Woods, the victim's accountant.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask him. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Olivia Benjamin was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" he says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It's just gotta be Lillian Black, Detective,\" Andre says excitedly. \"Means, motive, and opportunity -- just like the Junior Detective's Handbook says!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's boss? you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Game Room,\" Andre says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Bathroom you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Aaliyah Wright, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" she says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Paco. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Nah, 'fraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Aaliyah says. \"I mean, I <i>know</i>, and I'll absolutely tell ya anything <i>else</i> ya wanna know, but my rep'll take a real dive if people think I'm a rat, you know what I'm sayin'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Lounge you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Lauren Scott, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Scott says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Attic and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the dossier, this is Sophie Clements, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and she looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Sophie looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You walk into the Breakfast Nook and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. \"You must be Frederick Leblanc, the victim's personal assistant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Paco Riddle's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, since you asked me, Detective,\" Leblanc sniffs, \"I would say it was undoubtedly that snivelling little upstart of a best friend.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Riddle's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" he sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Bathroom at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Pantry and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. \"You must be Stan Orr, the victim's golf caddy,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Orr says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Living Room and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. According to the dossier, this is Randy Clay, the victim's business partner.<p>\"God, finally,\" he growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I'll tell you this,\" Randy says, \"if I was you -- and I'm friggin' glad I'm not, hah -- but if I was you I'd look into Isabella's dental hygienist.\"<p>\"How about a name?\" you ask.<p>\"How about up yours, cop?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim's golf caddy -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>that</i> jerkoff. Go to the Pantry and see for yourself why I wouldn't give a wet fart.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Laundry Room and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. \"You must be Lucy Lara, the victim's lawyer,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Dawson may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Lara says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Smoking Lounge, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Madelyn Andrews, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" She slowly drags her eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You walk into the Sunroom, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Addison Tucker, the victim's personal assistant.<p>You show her your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Eva Dawson, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" she says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Dang, dude!\" Addison says, \"I wondered when you were finally gonna get around to asking that! Like, jeez, right? Listen, it was totes Eva's lover. Like, for real.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know they're a drag to be around, and that's about it, dude,\" she replies. \"I dunno, maybe like, check out the Bar and see for yourself? Hope you got a high tolerance for bummers though, dude.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Pantry. The man inside stands to greet you, but his gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Your dossier identifies him as Barney Salinas, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Barney says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Eva like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You walk into the Ballroom and meet a man dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. He looks down his nose regally at you. \"You must be Moe Riddle, the victim's bodyguard,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" he says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" he says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "In the Bathroom you find a pale, drably-dressed man slouched on a small chair. He looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Tucker Barton, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "In the Kitchen you meet a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. \"You must be Gabrielle Campos, the victim's accountant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" she says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to her feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Eva Dawson,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Gabrielle looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "The only person in the Bar is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Alexis Kidd, the victim's lover.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" she replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Alexis says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Addison Tucker. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Umm...\" Alexis thinks. \"Yeah, I know who you mean, but we don't talk. Look in the Sunroom if you have questions for them, I guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "You walk into the Wine Cellar, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Payton Guerra, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=9", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Madelyn Andrews!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=9", "\"The victim's lawyer -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Lucy Lara? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Payton exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Vincent Gay, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" he says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Olivia?\" Vincent asks. \"Why, I haven't the faintest idea. I was rather hoping you could tell me, or else I won't be able to give my poem a proper ending.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Billiard Room you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Your dossier identifies him as Mick Horton, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"Good, good,\" he says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Mick says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Olivia's college roommate.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Mick says. \"Try the Master Bedroom, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "In the Ballroom you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Riff Bean, the victim's ex-best friend.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Olivia?\" Riff asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Andre Sandoval?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You walk into the Smoking Lounge and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. \"You must be Faith Levine, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" she exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Library, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Your dossier identifies him as Bert Wheeler, the victim's child.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Gosh, Detective!\" Bert exclaims. \"I sure wish I knew! I've been looking all over for clues, but the bad guy really covered their tracks on this one!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "The only person in the Living Room is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Samantha Schultz, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Samantha grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Olivia?\" Samantha says. \"That's easy, it was her ex-best friend.\" <p>\"How do you know?\" you ask. <p>Samantha flexes her muscles at you in several bodybuilder poses. You aren't sure how that relates to the question."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Do you know Lawrence's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know who you mean,\" Samantha says. \"Not real well, but we make smalltalk from time to time. Which is the only kind of talk they could make, hah! They're in the Ballroom if you wanna see 'em.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "As you enter the Master Bedroom, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. Your dossier identifies her as Molly Cortez, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to her. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Molly says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Olivia's dental hygienist.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Lawrence's neighbor?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Molly says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Master Bedroom, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's dental hygienist? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Mick Horton? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Molly exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "A dark-haired young man is sitting in the Basement, quietly reading a large hardcover book. He doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Paco Yates, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Pantry and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Elizabeth Hayden, the victim's boss.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" she says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to her feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Todd Dorsey,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Todd's cousin, Detective,\" Elizabeth says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"That's Paco Yates, isn't it?\" Elizabeth asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you enter the Guest Bedroom, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Larry Simon, the victim's sibling.<p>He looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking his proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who did it, Detective? Well yes, that's the question, isn't it?\" Larry says. \"That's the query whizzing around everyone's racetrack today. Who put the nails in poor old Niles's coffin. Well, well. And might I add, well.\"<p>\"...You don't know, do you?\"<p>\"Oh, certainly. It was the lawyer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Lyons's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Alex Jones, isn't it?\" Larry asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Hall Closet and meet a man dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. \"You must be Mitch Kirby, the victim's lawyer,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Mitch Kirby. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Mitch says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Niles like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "Inside the Dining Room, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Tucker Sharpe, the victim's college roommate.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Niles Lyons, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, man, you got me. ...Ha ha, no wait, that sounded bad. I mean, like, you got me, not you got me, right? Like, I dunno who did it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Wine Cellar and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Amelia Spence, the victim's child.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Amelia sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Amelia says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was his gardener.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know Lyons's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Amelia sniffs. \"His name is Larry Simon, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Attic and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Isaiah Hoover, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" he  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>He glares at you for a second, then rolls his eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" he says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Ballroom you find a pale, drably-dressed woman slouched on a small chair. She looks up at you as you enter, and sighs pathetically. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Arianna Barnett, the victim's cousin.<p>\"It's just one more thing after another, isn't it?\" she mutters bitterly. \"It always rains, and it always pours.\"<p>\"Well, I can see <i>you're</i> going to be a real barrel of laughs,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well gosh,\" Arianna says, her eyes widening. \"Do you actually expect me to rat out one of my precious friends and/or colleagues?\"<p>\"...Are you joking?\"<p>\"Yes. Hilary's ex-accountant killed him.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Cunningham's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Isaiah Hoover,\" she replies. \"I had an entire conversation with him once. Not a long one. And I was doing most of the talking. But still, I guess that counts for a little something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Lounge, and encounter a young woman -- very young, barely a teenager -- who is creeping around in a half-crouch, inspecting the furniture with a large magnifying glass. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Makayla Fischer, the victim's butler.<p>\"What are you doing?\" you ask her. <p>\"Looking for clues! I'm pretty sure Makayla Walsh was murdered, and I'm going to track down who did it!\" <p>\"Well, you're right, it was a murder. I'm the detective in charge of the case.\" <p>\"Gosh!\"<p>\"Yeah,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I'm going to have to ask you to stay in this room while I'm investigating.\" <p>\"Aww, gee,\" she says, disappointed. \"Well, that's okay. I bet I can figure it out from here, if I put my mind to it!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh boy!\" Makayla says. \"You really want to know who I think did it?\" <p>\"Sure, kid,\" you say. \"Lay it on me.\" <p>\"It was Olivia Poole for sure, Detective! That's the only suspect that fits all the clues!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You walk into the Game Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. Your dossier identifies him as Patrick Patel, the victim's physician.<p>\"Help!\" he yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" he says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who did it?\" Patrick asks incredulously. \"Don't you get it? Don't you <i>see?</i> They <i>all</i> did it! They're all in on it together!\"<p>\"In my experience, that's pretty unlikely,\" you say."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You return to the Lounge just in time to see Makayla Fischer, the Kid Detective and the victim's butler, quickly shutting a window and adjusting her cardigan."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Uh-huh, that's Peter Weiss. He's pretty funny,\" Makayla says. \"Wait, do you think he did it? Should I be investigating him?\" <p>\"You should be sitting here quietly without investigate anything,\" you say sternly. <p>\"Aw, gee!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Family Room, where a bored and angry-looking young man in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing his cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Your dossier identifies him as Peter Weiss, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Bar, you find a young man in a tie-dye shirt and beanie, lying on the floor snoozing on some scavenged cushions. You kick his foot to wake him up. \"Uh?\" he says. \"Wha? Oh.\" He stands up, knuckling sleepy, bloodshot eyes. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Arthur Ingram, the victim's lawyer.<p>You show him your badge. \"I'm investigating the murder of Makayla Walsh, and I need to ask you some questions.<p>\"Sure, right on,\" he says. \"Ask away, man. Rock it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah,\" Arthur says, nodding. \"You wanna know who did it, dude? I know for sure who did it. It was Kaitlyn McKay. No question.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's Peter Weiss,\" Arthur says. \"He's cool. Plays a mean hackey-sack, you know? You wouldn't expect that, but like, wow.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Boiler Room and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the dossier, this is Patrick McDowell, the victim's boss.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, and he looks up at you, surprised. <p>\"Oh, I say! You must be with the police! Jolly good! Frightful business, just dreadful. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Patrick looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "As you enter the Smoking Lounge, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Kaitlyn McKay, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Arthur Ingram. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's butler? you ask.<p>\"I know her, yes,\" she says. \"Makayla Fischer. As pleasant a luncheon companion as I've had, at least from the lower strata of society.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Guest Bedroom, and discover an extremely muscular woman lifting weights and glistening with sweat. According to the dossier, this is Alyssa Boone, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" she replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Oh ho!\" Alyssa exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Saul Kelly. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "As you enter the Attic, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. According to the dossier, this is Sydney Byers, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Sydney says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Andre's accountant.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Sydney says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Guest Bedroom isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Living Room, which appears to be empty -- until a nervous face appears from behind the sofa. \"You must be Grace Walter, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Tell you who did it?\" she says. \"I don't trust you as far as I could throw a space-communications relay tower disguised as the Washington Monument! Why would I tell you?\"<p>\"Well, if you don't know, just say so,\" you shrug. <p>\"Of course I know! They don't get anything past me! It was Zoey Emerson!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Laundry Room you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Your dossier identifies her as Nevaeh Wells, the victim's boss.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Perkins may have escaped her duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"The butler.\"<p>\"What?\"<p>\"The killer was Mia Perkins's butler, Detective,\" Wells says. <p>\"Oh! I was expecting a wordier response.\"<p>\"I hope you will relish that feeling of surprise, for it is one of the few ways in which a person can prove she is alive.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Wells says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Servants' Quarters, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You knock on the Living Room door and open it slowly so as to not startle the victim's college roommate, Grace Walter. She's hiding underneath a table. \"It's all right,\" you say. \"It's just me again. The detective.\"<p>\"Well, of course you'd say that!\" comes the response. \"How do I know you didn't just kill the detective and now you're wearing a detective skin to trick me?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's boss?\" you ask.<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Grace says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Living Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a butler,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Grace says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Living Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "A dark-haired young woman is sitting in the Smoking Lounge, quietly reading a large hardcover book. She doesn't seem to be aware of your presence. \"You must be Hannah Wynn, the victim's business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Living Room, Grace Walter (the victim's college roommate) hides behind the sofa. \"It's all right,\" you say. \"It's just me again. The detective.\"<p>\"Well, of course you'd say that!\" comes the response. \"How do I know you didn't just kill the detective and now you're wearing a detective skin to trick me?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"No! Keep well away from that one!\" Grace exclaims. \"They'rein the Living Room, so stay out of there! Don't risk being subverted by that hypnotic gaze!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "You enter the Billiard Room and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Chuck Hayes, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Sorry to disturb you,\" you say, \"but I'm investigating Mia Perkins's death, and I need to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"I am an extremely busy man, Detective, and I have places to be this evening,\" he sniffs haughtily. <p>\"That's fine,\" you say. \"The sooner I get these questions answered, the sooner you can go.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I'm sure I have no idea,\" he says coldly. \"Perhaps you should figure it out, Detective, so that I needn't stand around this place answering your questions any longer!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Living Room, and the victom's college roommate, Grace Walter, screams and dives behind a curtain. \"It's all right,\" you say. \"It's just me again. The detective.\"<p>\"Well, of course you'd say that!\" comes the response. \"How do I know you didn't just kill the detective and now you're wearing a detective skin to trick me?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't even know who that is!\" Grace says. \"Oh, I know who they <i>claim</i> to be, but that person in the Pantry isn't who they say they are, you mark my words!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Sunroom, and find a woman dressed in a shapeless gray suit, slouched on a chair and staring at her feet. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Alexandra Rivera, the victim's lover.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" she mutters, holding up her wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "Inside the Pantry you find a woman pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, she turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Zoey Emerson, the victim's butler.<p>\"Good, good,\" she says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Zoey grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Grace Walter. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" she replies. \"Her name's Grace Walter. I don't recommend you waste your time with her though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Bathroom, where a dark-haired young woman in glasses is sitting, deeply focused on a large hardback book; she doesn't look up as you come in. \"You must be Claire Griffith, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. She silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" she replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Investigate the housekeeper,\" Claire mutters quietly.<p>\"All right,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything more concrete?\"<p>\"No.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's housekeeper?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Boiler Room.\"<p>\"Any opinion on them?\"<p>Shrug. \"Seems okay.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Bar and find a young man in a beret, pacing around and muttering to himself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. \"You must be Frederick Wyatt, the victim's ex-butler,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" he says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, I hate to give away the ending,\" Frederick says, \"but I'm having trouble with that part anyway. What's a good rhyme for 'Savannah Tucker'?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Master Bedroom and encounter a woman dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. She regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Sofia Greene, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" she says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Frederick Wyatt. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"The victim had an ex-butler, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I presume you are asking about Frederick Wyatt,\" Greene says. \"That loathsome little insect of a man. I have nothing to do with him, and nothing more to say.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Study. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. \"You must be Julia Tran, the victim's sibling,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Julia Tran. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Ahh, well now, I'm afraid I can't help ya there, Detective,\" Julia says. \"I was all the way on the other side of the house when it happened, and I didn't hear a thing. Sorry.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Attic, you encounter a young man wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of his pencil. According to the dossier, this is Diego Terry, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Diego sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Diego says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Elizabeth Espinoza,\" he says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"I'll have nothing to do with that savage in the Kitchen,\" Diego says. \"Not until they apologize for comparing my 'Opus XXVII' to Smash Mouth lyrics.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You walk into the Master Bedroom, and find a young man wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. He looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" he says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Your dossier identifies him as Rufus Rojas, the victim's chauffeur.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Heck if I know, dude,\" he says. \"Like, your guess is as good as mine, right?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Family Room you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Bert Holcomb, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Holcomb says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Library, where a young woman wearing a leather jacket and motorcycle boots is casually whittling her initials into the surface of a mahogany end-table. She glances at you, finishes her task, and puts her penknife away. According to the dossier, this is Naomi Valenzuela, the victim's dental hygienist.<p>\"God, finally,\" she growls. \"Hurry up and ask me some effin' questions so I can get out of this place!\"<p>\"You in a hurry or something?\" you ask, tapping your pencil on your notepad.<p>\"Look, cop, I got a life. I got stuff to be doing other than standing around this craphole.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, well... normally I wouldn't talk to a cop,\" she says, \"but I am sick to death of sitting around here. So I'll tell you: it was Kayla Hinton. Can I friggin' go now?\"<p>\"I'll let you know,\" you say.<p><i>\"Frig!\"</i> Naomi says, throwing her hands in the air exasperatedly. \"I'm gonna be stuck here all frickin' <i>night!</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Newton's sibling? She's called Julia Tran. She seems okay. That's all I know, though, so choke on it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Bar, and find a young man wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. He looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" he says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Charlie Kennedy, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>Charlie looks over his shoulder. \"Okay, well, you didn't hear this from me, right dude? But it was Todd Goff. Don't ask me how I know, but like, scout's honor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Foyer, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. \"You must be Ella Blake, the victim's accountant,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>She looks up at you, and her eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" she says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Jeez, Detective!\" Ella pouts. \"If you hadn't ordered me to stay in here, maybe I'd be able to tell you! How about I just follow you around, I promise I won't get in the way!\" <p>\"No,\" you say. \"Stay here.\"<p>\"Well, phooey! You're no fun at all!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you return to the Bar, you find Charlie Kennedy (the victim's bodyguard) snoozing on the floor. \"Wake up,\" you growl. \"Oh, hey man, he says. \"How's it goin'? How's the case? Find any, like, clues?\"<p>\"I need to ask you some more questions,\" you say.<p>\"Sure, sure. I'm just chillin'. What's up?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Alistair Roberson's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her, yeah. I know her, kinda,\" Charlie says. \"Her name's Ella Blake. I'm not real into her. She's a real buzzkill, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The only person in the Library is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Bella Moody, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Moody says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "The only person in the Game Room is a hugely-muscled man, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. Your dossier identifies him as Harry Moon, the victim's lover.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Harry grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Harry says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Layla Martin. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Do you know Valenzuela's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Harry says. \"Abe Mayo, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "When you enter the Breakfast Nook, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Taylor Sloan, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Taylor says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Pantry, you find a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. \"You must be Abe Mayo, the victim's cousin,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Todd Valenzuela,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Abe says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Todd's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Sunroom, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Layla Martin, the victim's butler.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" she sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "In the Basement, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Zoey Carr, the victim's ex-accountant.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>She looks up at you, and thinks for a second. \"Hmm...\"<p>\"Yes?\"<p>\"...probably Elmer Schroeder.\"<p>\"And why do you say that?\"<p>Shrug."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Have you met the victim's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"No.\"<p>\"Nothing at all?\"<p>\"Try the Library.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Wine Cellar, and find a young man wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. He looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" he says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Gavin McMahon, the victim's personal assistant.<p>\"So uh, what's up man?\" he asks. \"I mean, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Right on, right on. So what's the skinny?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Okay, sure, yeah. Shoot.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You wanna know who did it?\" Gavin asks. \"Okay well like, hold onto your hat dude -- it was Stephen's golf caddy! Like crazy, right? Like who would've guessed that? But it so totally was!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's golf caddy? you ask.<p>\"You mean Eva Phelps? Yeah dude! She's a riot! She's like, way cool. Real party animal, know what I mean?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "Inside the Servants' Quarters, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Your dossier identifies her as Eva Phelps, the victim's golf caddy.<p>She looks up at you, and her eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" she says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Boiler Room, and find a young woman wearing a tye-die shirt and a knitted beanie, lazily kicking a hackey-sack around. She looks over at you, surprised, and accidentally kicks the beanbag under an overstuffed chair. \"Aw dangit,\" she says, kneeling down to fish for it. \"I was totes on a roll.\" According to the dossier, this is Hailey Camacho, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Uh, hey,\" she says. \"Hi. Yeah. I'm Hailey. What's up, man? You solve this thing yet, or what?\"<p>\"I need to ask you a few questions,\" you say, flashing your badge.<p>\"Wow, okay. Heavy. But yeah, sure. Hit me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Sunroom, you meet a young man, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. Your dossier identifies him as Leo Blake, the victim's cousin.<p>He looks up at you, and his eyes widen with surprise. \"Ooh! You must be the police detective assigned to the case!\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, showing your badge.<p>\"Great! I'm gonna be a real big help, you'll see!\"<p>\"As long as you stay in here while doing it,\" you say. \"Sorry, but I can't have you running around during the investigation.\"<p>\"Aw, that's okay,\" he says. \"I'll just sneak out while you aren't watching, dodge the guards, and come back before you've realized I'm gone!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It's just gotta be Terry Andrews, Detective,\" Leo says excitedly. \"Means, motive, and opportunity -- just like the Junior Detective's Handbook says!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"I understand the victim had a housekeeper,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Gross. Yeah,\" Leo says. \"That's the victim's housekeeper. She creeps me out. There's something real fishy about her, Detective!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Servants' Quarters, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Terry Andrews, the victim's butler.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing him your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Terry shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Autumn committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you return to the Sunroom, Kid Detective Leo Blake, the victim's cousin, is sitting on a sofa twiddling his thumbs with a very innocent expression on his face."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=2", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"All I know is they're in the Servants' Quarters,\" Leo says. \"Sorry, Detective, I barely know them to say hi to.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Inside the Sunroom you find a gray-haired man reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. \"You must be Craig Arnold, the victim's neighbor,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"It is not difficult to see who in this house has the soul of a killer, Detective,\" Arnold says. \"The desperate eyes, the hunger, the growl of an animal. No human who would take a life can truly hide these things.\" <p>\"Great. Okay. So...?\"<p>\"Zane Cooper.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Bar, where a bored and angry-looking young woman in motorcycle boots and a leather jacket is stomping around and ashing her cigarette on the expensive-looking Turkish carpet. Your dossier identifies her as Natalie Clarke, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I need to ask you some questions about the murder,\" you say.<p>\"I didn't kill anybody, but if I have to hang around this dump any longer, I might,\" she snarls. \"Hurry up and ask me whatever you're gonna ask, so I can get out of here!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"What, now you want me to do your damn job for you?\" she sneers. \"You're the big-time detective, you figure it out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "When you return to the Sunroom, the victim's neighbor, Craig Arnold, is still grading papers with an unusual expression of mixed irritation, disgust, and amusement."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Arnold says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Ballroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "When you enter the Servants' Quarters, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. \"You must be Zoey Rivera, the victim's business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Zoey sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I think it was probably either a raven, or a metaphor for the tyranny of social expectations,\" Zoey says. <p>\"Well thanks,\" you say dryly. \"I'll be sure to put an APB out on both of those things.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Laundry Room, you find a young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, idly bouncing a tennis ball on a racket and whistling a jaunty little tune. \"You must be Mariah Molina, the victim's best friend,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>She looks up, and seems rather surprised. \"Hullo! Are you with the police?\" <p>\"That's right,\" you say, shaking her proffered hand. \"I'm the detective in charge of the case. I'll need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"Well! By all means, ask away, old chap!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Mariah looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "You enter the Wine Cellar. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Serenity Shepherd, the victim's accountant.<p>\"Boy, am I glad to see you!\" she says. \"I just can't believe someone would do this to dear old Harry. Listen, if there's anything I can do to help, anything at all, you just let me know.\"<p>\"Well,\" you say, \"I would like to ask you some questions.\"<p>\"Questions? Oh, er, right! Yeah, sure, ask away! Always happy to cooperate with the police, that's me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"All right, Detective, all right,\" Serenity grins. \"Ya dragged it out of me. The killer was Zoey Rivera. And I trust you'll remember how helpful I was to you, if we should ever cross paths again!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a neighbor,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who that is, Detective, but we don't talk much,\" Serenity says. \"Try the Sunroom, they're usually skulking around there.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You walk into the Game Room and meet a woman dressed for an extremely expensive white-tie affair. She looks down her nose regally at you. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Leah Combs, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Sorry to keep you waiting,\" you say, \"but I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Do you know who I am, Detective?\" she says with an icy stare. <p>\"Yes, and I'm sure you have more important things to do. As soon as you answer my questions, you can get on with whatever they are.\"<p>\"...Very well.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Combs says with a glare, \"if you cannot be bothered to do your own job, I most certainly am not going to do it for you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Living Room, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. Your dossier identifies her as Nevaeh McLeod, the victim's golf caddy.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>She ignores you and keeps reading."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Wine Cellar. The woman inside stands to greet you, but her gaze doesn't seem to want to meet your own, flickering around you like a rat sizing up a trap. According to the dossier, this is Gabrielle Kerr, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Good, good,\" she says. \"I'm glad you're here, Officer.\"<p>\"Detective.\"<p>\"Right! Right, of course, Detective, sorry. What a terrible thing that happened, just awful. But I'm sure you'll get to the bottom of it right away, yeah?\"<p>\"Hopefully, yes,\" you say. \"I'd like to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Sure, sure! Ask away, Detective, I've got nothin' to hide!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well gee, Detective,\" Gabrielle says, \"I hate to disappoint ya, but I haven't got a clue who could've done it. Far as I know, everyone in this house loved Nick like a brother. Or a sister, or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Study, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. According to the dossier, this is Sophia Taylor, the victim's housekeeper.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Sophia shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Nick committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "The only person in the Servants' Quarters is an older woman in a tweed suit, slashing at a stack of papers with a red pen. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Lucy Burnett, the victim's business partner.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police -- need to ask you a few questions. ...What are you doing?\"<p>\"Grading papers. Although Cox may have escaped his duties for the oblivion of death,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"the rest of us still have jobs that require our attention.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Nick Cox has true relevance, Detective,\" Burnett says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "In the Boiler Room you meet a young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, relaxing and leafing idly through a fashion magazine, apparently without a care in the world. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Vince Harding, the victim's butler.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Nick Cox,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was Nick's neighbor, Detective,\" Vince says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=6", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Vince says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Sophia Taylor, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Guest Bedroom and find a young woman in a beret, pacing around and muttering to herself while scribbling in a leather-bound notebook. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Jasmine McKnight, the victim's bodyguard.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask--\"<p>\"Ah! Good! A detective!\" she says. \"Please, I require your aid. I simply cannot, for the life of me, think of a decent rhyme for 'murder'.\" <p>\"'Heard her,'\" you reply. \"or 'hurt her'.\"<p>\"Ah! That'll do nicely. And now, <i>quid pro quo</i>: what can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Jasmine says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was his business partner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Jasmine sniffs. \"Her name is Leah Combs, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Pantry and encounter a well-to-do-looking young man dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. Your dossier identifies him as Joe Brady, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" he says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to his feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Davey Hebert,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was Davey's physician, Detective,\" Joe says. \"And that's the honest truth, not a fib to get out of an unpleasant betrothal arrangement, I assure you.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Joe says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Foyer, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "You enter the Foyer and find an older man in a tweed suit, muttering to himself over a stack of papers. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Roy Summers, the victim's neighbor.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, showing your badge. \"Sorry to interrupt your work, but I need to ask you a few questions.<p>\"Good. I am weary of the answers my students have given me,\" he says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so now it will be my turn to give the answers. I shall recognize this as a rare moment of justice in the universe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Summers says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "The only person in the Wine Cellar is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Victoria Dejesus, the victim's ex-gardener.<p>\"Is this your usual spot for training?\" you ask, looking around. \"Kind of an unusual choice.\"<p>\"Yeah, well,\" Victoria grunts, \"With all this stuff going on, I couldn't leave to go to my usual gym, right? Good thing I carry a set of weights around for emergencies.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Oh ho!\" Victoria exclaims. \"If you're asking me, then you must recognize my power!\"<p>\"I... what?\"<p>\"It was Andrea McClain. As plain as these sick pecs!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lawyer? you ask.<p>\"Yeah, his name's Roy Summers. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to himself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "In the Ballroom, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Jim Mayo, the victim's physician.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say, \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you some questions. ...Can you put the book down for a minute?\" He slowly drags his eyes away from the page and regard you impassively. \"Well, it's a start,\" you sigh."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"No idea,\" he says, turning a page in his book."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Bathroom, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking woman dressed for a white-tie occasion. She looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what she sees. Your dossier identifies her as Amelia Farrell, the victim's butler.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" she  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>She glares at you for a second, then rolls her eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Farrell sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Abigail Hansen? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of that person, but have never found it necessary to interact with them,\" she sniffs. \"I believe they're in the Pantry at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Lounge, you are greeted by an aristocratic-looking man dressed for a white-tie occasion. He looks you up and down, and doesn't appear to think much of what he sees. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Walter Hartman, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" he  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>He glares at you for a second, then rolls his eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You're asking <i>me</i>, Detective?\" he exclaims. \"If I knew that, this ridiculous little mishap would have been handled already!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "Inside the Billiard Room, you meet a young woman, maybe 13 or 14 years old, who is methodically tilting every book in a bookcase, as though trying to find the trigger for a secret door. According to the dossier, this is Lily O'Donnell, the victim's physician.<p>\"Looking for clues?\" you ask. <p>\"Yep!\" she says. \"I'm gonna bring that ol' murderer to justice! Say -- are you a real-life police detective?\"<p>\"That's me,\" you say, and her eyes widen when you show her your badge. \"Sorry to spoil your fun, but I need you to stay in here while I investigate.\"<p>\"Aw, gee willikers! Do I have to?\" she pouts."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Sorry, Detective,\" Lily says sadly. \"I haven't figured it out yet. This is bunches harder than when I solved the Mystery of Pirate Island!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "As you enter the Bar, a small nervous-looking woman spins around with a startled look. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Kaylee McMahon, the victim's child.<p>\"Help!\" she yells. \"They've come for me! It's the murderer!\"<p>\"Settle down,\" you say. \"I'm a detective with the police. I'm investigating the case.\"<p>\"Well, so you <i>say</i>,\" she says, glaring at you with suspicion."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It could be any of them!\" Kaylee shouts. \"Any of them, or none of them! It could be outside forces! Or maybe Kaylee committed suicide, don't you see! To put everyone off the scent!\"<p>\"Well, I've seen the pictures,\" you say, \"and I can pretty much confirm it wasn't a suicide.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "Inside the Guest Bedroom you find a young woman deep in thought, staring at the ceiling while tapping her pencil on the page of a leather-bound notebook. Your dossier identifies her as Aaliyah Maxwell, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well, in my poem I'm attributing the murder to a black shadow wrought from the ghosts of those murdered by capitalism,\" Aaliyah says. \"Does that help?\"<p>\"Not... particularly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "Inside the Bathroom you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. According to the dossier, this is Jack Stout, the victim's cousin.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Jack Stout. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Well I gotta say, Detective, I wasn't expecting such a direct line of questioning,\" Jack says. \"Tell ya what, I'll give ya a hint: check out Kaylee's physician.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Ah. Yeah. I know who you mean,\" he replies. \"His name's Walter Hartman. I don't recommend you waste your time with him though, Detective. That ain't gonna be a, whaddyacallit -- a profitable endeavor.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Attic and meet a woman dressed in cheap knockoff versions of the latest rich peoples' fashions. \"You must be Madelyn Castaneda, the victim's butler,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" she asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Madelyn Castaneda. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Well now!\" Madelyn says, glancing around the room and over her shoulder. \"Ain't every day a police detective asks my opinion on a thing like that! Sorry though, I just don't know what to tell ya. <i>*cough*Noah Wiley*cough*</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Hall Closet, you find a dark-haired young man sitting quietly, reading a book. He glances briefly at you over the top of his glasses as you enter, but says nothing. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Clarence Mccray, the victim's boss.<p>\"What are you reading?\" you ask, to break the silence. He silently gestures at the cover, which is jacketless and doesn't have the title printed on it. \"So... a book.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" he replies."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "As you enter the Attic, Madelyn Castaneda's demeanor instantly shifts from nail-biting anxiety to the coolest cucumber in the crop. \"Welcome back, Detective,\" says Zachary's butler. \"Just couldn't keep away from ol' Madelyn, eh? What can I do ya for?\" <p>\"Few more things I need to ask you, if that's all right,\" you say. <p>\"Hey, no problem!\" Madelyn says. \"Ask away, Detective, I'm an open book here.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a boss,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"D'you mean Claire Dickerson?\" Madelyn asks. \"She's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Claire Dickerson.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "You enter the Smoking Lounge and find an older woman in a tweed suit, muttering to herself over a stack of papers. \"You must be Riley Sloan, the victim's lover,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"This is not my field of knowledge or experience, Detective,\" Sloan says. \"Nor of interest. I will leave such matters to you and the other police.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "When you enter the Study, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. \"You must be Addison Bridges, the victim's business partner,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Addison sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well,\" Addison says, \"I mean, I haven't quite finished my poem yet, and I wouldn't like to spoil the dramatic reveal for you, but I could read you what I have so far and...\"<p>\"Just the name, please.\"<p>\"It was Noah Wiley,\" she says dourly."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's butler?\" you ask.<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Foyer at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Billiard Room, a small nervous-looking man spins around with a startled look. Your dossier identifies him as Noah Wiley, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Who are you?!\" he demands. \"Police,\" you reply. \"I need to ask you a few questions about--\"<p>\"And how do I know you're telling the truth? I should just take your word for it? You could be anybody!\"<p>With a sigh, you pull out your badge and show it to him. \"Happy?\"<p>\"And I'm supposed to just trust that that's real? Well... all right. For now. But I've got my eye on you!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=5", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"If I tell you who did it, they'll kill me for sure!\"Noah says. <p>\"You think they'll do that anyway, though,\" you say. \"If you tell me who it is, I can at least help avenge you.\"<p>\"Good point. Okay, it was Zachary's business partner.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim's butler -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Madelyn Castaneda is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Noah says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "You enter the Laundry Room and find an annoyed-looking young man slouched on a leather sofa with his motorcycle boots propped up on the expensive ebony coffee-table. He gives you a withering look and lights a cigarette. \"You must be Mick Allen, the victim's college roommate,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I've got some questions for you,\" you say.<p>\"Good! Great! Ask away!\" he mutters. \"Then maybe I can get out of this dive.\"<p>\"You got somewhere better to be?\"<p>\"If that's the kinda questions you're gonna ask, this is gonna be <i>real</i> fun,\" he says, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Cuttin' right to the chase, huh?\" Mick says. \"Well, since you ask so friggin' nice and all -- it was Archie Solomon. Whaddya think of that?\" <p>You write the name down without replying."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "When you enter the Servants' Quarters, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. Your dossier identifies her as Claire Cooper, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I need to ask you a few--\" <p>\"One moment, please. I am in the middle of my magnum opus! I just require a suitable rhyme for 'lethal'.\"<p>\"This can't wait, I'm afraid,\" you growl, showing your badge. <p>Claire sighs theatrically. \"Very well. Ask away, then.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=2", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Victor Hull's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his boss,\" she grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=2", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Audrey Bryan? Bah,\" Claire says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "Mick Allen (the victim's college roommate) scowls at you impatiently as you enter the Laundry Room. \"Oh goody, more questions,\" he mutters, rolling his eyes."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Victor Hull's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know her, that's Claire Cooper. She's pretty cool.\"<p>\"...And?\" you ask.<p>\"And that's all I'm gonna say to a cop, cop!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=1", "The only person in the Living Room is a hugely-muscled woman, currently working out with a set of oversized freeweights. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Trinity Hancock, the victim's accountant.<p>\"I'm going to need to ask you a few questions,\" you say. <p>\"Yeah, okay,\" she replies. \"S'alright if I keep lifting? It's arm day. Can't slack on arm day.\"<p>\"Err, no, go right ahead.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=2", "In the Master Bedroom, you find a dark-haired young woman sitting quietly, reading a book. She glances briefly at you over the top of her glasses as you enter, but says nothing. \"You must be Paige Dejesus, the victim's physician,\" you say, flipping to the relevant page in the dossier.<p>\"I'm from the police, and I'll need to ask you a few questions,\" you say.<p>\"Mm-hmm,\" comes the reply.<p>\"...You're the quiet type, I gather.\"<p>\"Mm-hmm.\"<p>\"Are all your answers going to be like this?\"<p>She turns the page without comment."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=3", "When you enter the Wine Cellar, you encounter a young woman wearing a beret and black turtleneck, chewing on the end of her pencil. According to the dossier, this is Allison Bowers, the victim's best friend.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm from the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\"<p>\"Hmm,\" she says. \"Questions, questions. ...No, no, that won't do at all.\"<p>\"I beg your pardon?\"<p>\"There's no good rhyme for 'questions', it simply won't fit.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=4", "As you enter the Lounge, a man in a drab gray suit looks up at you from the chair he's slouched in, and sighs. A quick flip through your suspect dossier reveals this to be Isaiah Benton, the victim's gardener.<p>\"Might as well get it over with and put the cuffs on me now,\" he mutters, holding up his wrists.<p>\"Is this a confession?\" you frown.<p>\"No. I didn't do anything. But I never do anything, and I get blamed for it anyway. It's just how it goes. I'm used to it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=5", "As you enter the Billiard Room, a wild-eyed woman accosts you, pointing with an outstretched and trembling finger. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Nevaeh Greer, the victim's lawyer.<p>\"Who are you?!\" she exclaims. \"Don't come any closer or I'll call the cops!\"<p>\"I <i>am</i> the cops,\" you say, showing her your badge.<p>\"Oh thank god! Thank god you're here! I'm going to be next, I just know it, you have to protect me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=6", "You enter the Servants' Quarters and encounter a man dressed in very expensive-looking formal attire. He regards you with a look of distaste and disdain. According to the dossier, this is Billy Bob Riddle, the victim's sibling.<p>\"Excuse me,\" you say. \"I'm with the police, and I need to ask you a few questions.\" <p>\"I am already late for the French Ambassador's gala,\" he  says coldly. \"I trust this will not take long?\" <p>\"Depends on how quickly you answer.\"<p>He glares at you for a second, then rolls his eyes. \"Oh, very well. Ask.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=7", "You enter the Boiler Room and encounter a well-to-do-looking young woman dressed in crisp tennis whites, lounging casually across an overstuffed chair and flipping playing cards into a straw boater -- or rather, attempting to, and largely missing. According to the notes the Officers Chaps gave you, this is Anna Byrd, the victim's business partner.<p>\"I'd love a spot of tea, if you've got one handy,\" she says, then looks up at you and practically jumps to her feet in surprise. \"Oh, I say! I do beg your pardon, that was dreadfully silly of me -- I thought you were the butler at first.\"<p>\"I'm a detective, investigating the murder of Woody Gross,\" you say. <p>\"Jolly good show! What a dreadful mess this has all been, what?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=8", "Inside the Bathroom you find a gray-haired woman reading through a stack of papers, scowling at them with faint disgust. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Taylor Jackson, the victim's college roommate.<p>\"I'm a police detective,\" you say, showing your badge, \"and I'll need to ask you some questions.\" <p>\"Very well. The foolishness of my students is threatening to overwhelm me,\" she says in a clipped Bavarian accent, \"and so perhaps it would be advantageous to take a break. What can I do for you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?visit=9", "Inside the Attic you find a man pacing around and smoking a cigarette. As you enter, he turns and shoots you that particular grin that people use when they're extremely nervous, but are trying to play it cool. Judging from the dossier the Officers Chaps gave you, this must be Martin Shaw, the victim's lover.<p>\"Hey, what took ya so long?\" he asks. \"Hah, nah, just kiddin' with ya. I know you boys have got a tough job, always had a deep respect for the boys in blue. Anything you wanna know, just ask me -- Martin Shaw. Nobody knows what's going down around this place like I do.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Paige Dejesus,\" Trinity says. \"You'll find her in the Boiler Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>Trinity rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Isaiah Benton. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Trinity snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Boiler Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Trinity says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Trinity says. \"Isaiah Benton, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Paige Dejesus. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Trinity snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>Trinity rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Isaiah Benton. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Paige Dejesus. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Trinity snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Boiler Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a physician,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Him?\" Trinity says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"I could break that punk in half with my pinky fingers,\" Trinity snorts. \"Heck, with my <i>eyelids!</i> She's in the Boiler Room, go see for yourself what a weakling she is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Trinity snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Trinity snorts. \"Yeah, I know her. If you wanna meet the world's biggest wimp, just go to the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>Trinity rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Isaiah Benton. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, yeah, I know Paige Dejesus,\" Trinity says. \"You'll find her in the Boiler Room, if a stiff breeze hasn't carried her away, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=1", "\"Do you know Gross's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Trinity says. \"Isaiah Benton, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Allison Bowers. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Woody's lawyer,\" Trinity says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Woody's best friend? Oh, you mean Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What do you know about Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Woody's lawyer,\" Trinity says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody's best friend? Oh, you mean Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"Yeah, I wouldn't say we're close, but we get along. I almost asked her to spot me on the benchpress once, but she couldn'ta handled the weight. Probably couldn't handle the weight of a large phone book, but not everybody has muscles as glorious as mine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, that's Woody's lawyer, I know her,\" Trinity says. \"We swap training tips all the time. Well, I tell her training tips and she listens politely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Sure, that's Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Allison Bowers!\" Trinity says. \"That's Woody's lawyer. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Woody's lawyer,\" Trinity says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Allison Bowers!\" Trinity says. \"That's Woody's lawyer. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=1", "\"The victim had a best friend, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, that's Anna Byrd,\" Trinity says. \"She's all right, for a woman with the muscles of a... I dunno, one of those bugs that look like sticks, or something.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=1", "\"What can you tell me about Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Woody's lawyer,\" Trinity says. \"We don't have much in common, but we get along pretty well. She's got a real good sense of humor, you know? Funny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Trinity grunts. \"That's Woody's lover -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>Trinity rolls her eyes. \"Yeah, I know who that is. His name's Billy Bob Riddle. Totally useless. Maybe if he had some muscle mass, he'd at least be useful as a barbell, hah!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"I've got no use for that scrawny runt of a lover,\" Trinity snorts. \"Well -- maybe I could use him as bicep floss! Heh!\"<p>\"You... floss your biceps?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Trinity says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Do you know Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Huh!\" Trinity grunts. \"That's Woody's lover -- a skinny little sneak. I trust him about as far as I can throw him... er... I guess that's pretty far actually.\" Her forehead creases as she considers this. \"As far as I could <i>not</i> throw him?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"The victim had a gardener, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, <i>him</i>,\" Trinity says. \"Billy Bob Riddle, I think his name is. Dunno what that scrawny little weasel could possibly be good for. I guess if you had some sand, you could kick it in his face.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=1", "\"Isaiah Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know that wimp. That's Woody's lover,\" Trinity says. \"Pathetic. All talk and no fight.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=1", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Him?\" Trinity says. \"Don't see what you'd be interested in him for. He's all words and hot air. No muscle, no backbone.\""));
