__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=1", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"'Course I know Anna Byrd!\" Trinity says. \"That's Woody's gardener. I challenged her to arm-wrestle once, and nearly threw her across the room, heh heh. Oh, don't give me that look, she was fine.\""));
