__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=1", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, her name's Allison Bowers. Seems a decent sort. Keeps to herself, doesn't bug me when I'm working out, you know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=1", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, I know who it was,\" Trinity says. \"Nothing gets past <i>these</i> muscles!\"<p>\"I... don't know what that means, but who?\" you ask. <p>\"Allison Bowers. Can you believe it? A skinny twig like that?\""));
