__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=3", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes, the accountant,\" Allison muses. \"Not a poetic bone in that entire body, of course. Such a pity. You might try the Living Room, if you've a need to speak with them.\""));
