__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Woody's physician. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Allison says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Paige Dejesus and I get along quite well. Just the other day she helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Allison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Allison says. \"We get along quite well. She's Woody's physician, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Paige Dejesus?\" Allison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. She doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate her whenever she's not late for one of her many dentist appointments.\""));
