__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Paige Dejesus and I get along rather well,\" Allison says. \"She never seems to have time to hear my poems, but she always seems so saddened by the fact, I can't help but forgive her.\""));
