__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Isaiah Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Allison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Woody's gardener. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Gross's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Allison sniffs. \"His name is Isaiah Benton, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Allison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Woody's gardener. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. He thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Allison sniffs. \"His name is Isaiah Benton, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Woody's gardener, and an absolute philistine,\" Allison scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"The victim's gardener -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmpf,\" Allison snorts. \"You're referring to Isaiah Benton. I'm afraid I don't associate with people whose idea of a dictionary has little pictures of superheroes providing examples for each definition.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Isaiah Benton? Bah,\" Allison says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"He's Woody's gardener, and an absolute philistine,\" Allison scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"He tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Allison sniffs. \"His name is Isaiah Benton, and he is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
