__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Isaiah Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Allison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The gardener. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Allison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The gardener. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, he walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Nevaeh Greer?\" you ask.<p>\"You're referring to Woody's lawyer. She's a perfectly affable woman, Detective,\" Allison says. \"We get along reasonably well, though she hasn't the artistic education of a raccoon.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=3", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I see so little of them,\" she says, \"that I would almost suspect they were avoiding me deliberately! But I believe you'll find them in the Billiard Room at the moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about Nevaeh Greer?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Allison says. \"We get along quite well. She's Woody's lawyer, you know. Very polite and appreciative of my work, though I fear most of it goes over her head.\""));
