__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Taylor Jackson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Allison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The college roommate. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Allison sniffs. \"Her name is Taylor Jackson, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Allison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Woody's college roommate. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Allison sniffs. \"Her name is Taylor Jackson, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of the person you describe,\" Allison sniffs. \"Her name is Taylor Jackson, and she is a boorish lout with the literary education of a ham sandwich.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Allison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The college roommate. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Taylor Jackson? Bah,\" Allison says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Allison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Woody's college roommate. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"She's Woody's college roommate, and an absolute philistine,\" Allison scowls. <p>\"Doesn't like your poetry, eh?\"<p>\"She tore up my favorite sonnet about mushrooms!\"<p>\"Well, everybody's a critic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=3", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Taylor Jackson? Bah,\" Allison says with a grimace. \"I might as well attempt to converse with the raccoon that knocks over the trash bins in the evening.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Taylor Jackson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Who?\" Allison asks. \"Oh -- you mean Woody's college roommate. No, I have no time for a person with such reprehensible ignorance of the fine arts. She thinks Baudelaire is a type of French wine.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=3", "\"Do you know Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah, yes,\" Allison says, rolling her eyes dramatically. \"The college roommate. No, that feeble-minded blowhard and I have little in common, Detective. Well, she walks upright, I suppose. Barely.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Allison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Attic -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Martin Shaw and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Allison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Allison says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Martin Shaw?\" Allison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Allison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Attic -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Martin Shaw and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Allison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Martin Shaw. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"We get along famously!\" Allison says. \"In fact, he once told me his favorite poem was one of mine.\"<p>\"Is it your shortest one?\"<p>\"Why yes, how did you know? It's called--\"<p>\"I'll have him tell me about it himself.\"<p>\"Very well! He's in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Do you know Gross's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Martin Shaw and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Allison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Martin Shaw is my biggest fan!\" Allison says. \"He is always asking me to read him my poems. I mean, I'm sure he would, if he wasn't always in such a rush, poor dear. You might find him in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Martin Shaw and I get along quite well. Just the other day he helped me think of a rhyme for 'ennui',\" Allison says. \"...Would you like to know what it was?\"<p>\"No, thank you.\"<p>\"It's very clever.\"<p>\"I'm sure it is.\""));
