__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Martin Shaw?\" Allison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=3", "\"What do you know about Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, yes indeed,\" Allison smiles. \"We're quite companionable. He's quite an attentive and astute listener. He's in the Attic -- I'm positive that if you ask him, he'll tell you all about how he loves my work.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=3", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Are you referring to Martin Shaw?\" Allison asks. \"Yes, I'd say we get along quite well. He doesn't know very much about poetry, I'm afraid, but I'm doing my best to educate him whenever he's not late for one of his many dentist appointments.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Allison says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was his lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Woody Gross's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his lover,\" she grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Woody Gross's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his lover,\" she grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Allison says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was his lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, obviously, it was karmic debt for decades of selfish corporatism,\" Allison says.<p>\"Do you have anything more concrete?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, well, if you want to be <i>bourgeois</i> about it,\" she sniffs. \"It was his lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Unfortunately,\" Allison grumbles, \"it was Woody's lover. I can't think of a single decent rhyme for lover.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=3", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"It was the grim spectre of guilt, which gripped Woody Gross's heart in the icy talons of--\"<p>\"No metaphors, please.\"<p>\"It was his lover,\" she grumbles."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Trinity Hancock is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Isaiah says. \"She's Woody's lawyer. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody's accountant?\" Isaiah says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Trinity Hancock is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Isaiah says. \"She's Woody's lawyer. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Isaiah says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Servants' Quarters. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Trinity Hancock is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Isaiah says. \"She's Woody's lawyer. She actually does what she's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Isaiah says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much about them,\" Isaiah says. \"They mostly avoid me. I mean, everyone does, but they're better at it than most. You might find them in the Servants' Quarters.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=4", "\"Trinity Hancock. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Woody's lawyer,\" Isaiah says. \"She's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
