__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Paige Dejesus,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Living Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Living Room,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Living Room. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"I know she's in the Living Room. And that she hates me. Fair's fair, I don't like her much either. Or myself, come to think of it. So we've got that much in common, at least.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know Gross's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Living Room,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Living Room. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=4", "\"The victim had a physician, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Living Room, if you want to talk to them,\" Isaiah says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
