__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, Billy Bob Riddle is actually a good person, at least compared to everyone else around here,\" Isaiah says. \"He's Woody's physician. He actually does what he's supposed to, instead of expecting me to do it. That's worth a lot in my book. Well, a little.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know Gross's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody's sibling?\" Isaiah says. \"We don't talk much. Well, we don't talk at all. But they've never said anything mean to me. Never said anything to me.\"<p>\"Are you certain this person actually exists?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, I've <i>seen</i> them, yeah. In the Billiard Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=4", "\"Do you know someone named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Woody's physician,\" Isaiah says. \"He's all right. Never inflicted actual physical harm on me.\"<p>\"Err... do the others?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, no. But they'd like to. I can tell.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=4", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have a single unkind word to say about that person,\" Isaiah says.<p>\"Do you have anything at all to say about them?\"<p>\"No. Well, they're probably in the Billiard Room. Does that count?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>Isaiah shudders. \"She's Woody's lawyer. She's horrible. At least she's horrible to me. Now that I think about it, in that respect she's no different from anyone else, really.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Martin Shaw. Totally useless. He just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Woody's lawyer,\" Isaiah replies. \"Not that you'd know it. I'm the one who does all the work around here. But do I get any thanks? No, of course not. Just the blame.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"...Oh. You're talking about Martin Shaw,\" Isaiah says. \"Well, if you're expecting me to say anything nice about him, I won't.\"<p>\"I wasn't.\""));
