__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Isaiah mutters. \"I don't know how Woody got stuck with a lawyer like her. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a gardener like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
