__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=4", "\"What do you know about Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Ugh,\" Isaiah mutters. \"I don't know how Woody got stuck with a lawyer like her. Of course, I don't know how he got stuck with a gardener like me, either. Unlucky, I suppose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=4", "\"Have you met the victim's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"The only business partner I'm aware of around here is Martin Shaw, and he isn't much of one if you ask me.\"<p>\"I don't think I will.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"What can you tell me about Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Taylor Jackson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"You'll find them in the Wine Cellar, if you want to talk to them,\" Isaiah says. \"Though why you would want to do that is beyond me. I'd rather throw myself out of a window. ...Actually, I might do that anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Taylor Jackson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know much,\" he replies. \"She avoids me like the plague. Like the world's most boring plague. 'World's Most Boring Plague,' I wouldn't be surprised if that was her nickname for me. She's probably in the Wine Cellar. That's where I'd be, if I was here and I wanted to avoid me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=4", "\"Do you know Gross's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"They're in the Wine Cellar,\" he mutters. \"Probably leaving cigarette butts everywhere. And who do you think will be expected to clean them up? You're a detective -- go ahead and guess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=4", "\"Taylor Jackson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, I know Taylor Jackson,\" he replies. \"I bet she'll tell you she doesn't know me, though. Probably considers me beneath her notice. Go on and ask her, you'll see. She's in the Wine Cellar.\""));
