__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=4", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Allison Bowers. Totally useless. She just sits around all day while everyone else does all the work. And by 'everyone else' I mean me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't know who killed Woody, but I do know they'd have saved me a lot of trouble if they'd killed me too. Guess they couldn't be bothered to waste the bullet or whatever.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Woody Gross? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who killed Woody Gross? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"Who killed Woody Gross? You're asking me? Why not ask me something I know the answer to, like who's supposed to clean the toilets around here. The answer to that is not, in fact, me, but guess what? I end up having to do it anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=4", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't have any idea,\" he says, \"but I guarantee if you ask anyone else, they'll all say it was me. That's how it goes around here. I do all the work, and do I get any of the credit? No, don't bother answering, it's a rhetorical question and the answer is perfectly obvious anyway.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Nevaeh says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Living Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I know who you mean,\" Nevaeh says, \"but I don't know them well. I see them around. No suspicious moves yet, but it's only a matter of time. You can find them in the Billiard Room, check them out for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Nevaeh says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Living Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Don't know them,\" Nevaeh says, shaking her head. \"I've seen them around, but we never talk. Can't risk my secrets getting out. They'll be in the Billiard Room, though. Maybe you'll see something I haven't.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"I think she's okay,\" Nevaeh says, glancing over her shoulder. \"At least, I've seen no overt indications that she's been sent to get me. You'd better go to the Living Room and check her out for yourself, though.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Gross's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"We haven't talked,\" she says. \"I can't risk talking to people I don't know and trust. They're in the Living Room, if you think you haven't got anything to lose.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"Do you know Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"No, she's fine, she's not dangerous,\" Nevaeh says. \"At least I don't think so. Not right now. Everyone's got their price, though. Everyone can be bought. She's in the Living Room, go check her out, see what you think. See if I'm right.\""));
