__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=5", "\"What can you tell me about Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Trinity Hancock? I think she's safe,\" Nevaeh says. \"Maybe. I'm not sure, though. I can't be certain. I can't ever be certain. Always gotta be watching. Gotta keep an eye on her in the Living Room.\""));
