__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"What, are you kidding me?\" Nevaeh exclaims. \"Woody's physician? She's one of the most suspicious of the bunch! I've seen the way she watches me!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=5", "\"Have you met the victim's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Paige Dejesus? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Nevaeh exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that woman is even a real human being!\""));
