__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Nevaeh says. \"She's Woody's college roommate. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
