__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's college roommate? you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Taylor Jackson?\" Nevaeh says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone named Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"You mean Woody's college roommate,\" she replies. \"She's okay, I think. If she's an agent, they haven't activated her yet. But if they do, I'll know.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Pfft, Taylor Jackson is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Nevaeh says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"I know her a little,\" Nevaeh says. \"She's Woody's college roommate. We don't talk much, but I'm pretty sure she's not part of The Conspiracy. She's just a dupe, like so many others.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, you mean Taylor Jackson?\" Nevaeh says. \"I'm not one hundred percent on her, but I think she might be okay. I'm keeping my eyes on her.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I've been watching her for unusual activity,\" Nevaeh says. \"Her name's Taylor Jackson. So far she seems to check out fine, but you can't be too careful these days.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=5", "\"Taylor Jackson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Woody's college roommate? Well, I don't trust her,\" she says, \"but I don't think she's actively dangerous. At least, I haven't seen anything to indicate it yet. But I'm watching.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=5", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Pfft, Taylor Jackson is just a dupe, a patsy!\" Nevaeh says. \"She doesn't know what's going on around here. Maybe that'll keep her safe, but I doubt it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay as far away from that man as I possibly can,\" Nevaeh says, \"and you will too, if you know what's good for you. Just keep out of the Attic!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's lover? you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Nevaeh says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Martin Shaw, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Nevaeh declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Attic if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Gross's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"No! No, never!\" Nevaeh says, alarmed. \"He's one of them! His name's Martin Shaw, he's always watching me! Watching and waiting!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't want anything to do with that tool of the Illuminati,\" Nevaeh declares. \"You can go talk to him in the Attic if you want, but you better wear something metallic on your head.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know Gross's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Martin Shaw? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Nevaeh exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"What do you know about Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Billiard Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Martin Shaw? Ha ha ha, are you kidding?\" Nevaeh exclaims. \"I'm not convinced that man is even a real human being!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=5", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"No way, I keep as far away from him as I possibly can,\" she says. \"I don't even go near the Billiard Room, because he has it all wired up with recording devices. He's in there now, probably copying the tapes! Go and see!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=5", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Martin Shaw? Stay away from him!\" Nevaeh says. \"I've seen his mail -- mission orders disguised as innocuous credit-card offers!\""));
