__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Allison Bowers. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"She and I do not interact in any significant way,\" he says, \"but she seems fairly respectable. If you wish to know more, I can only recommend you go to the Billiard Room and ask her directly.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"Do you know Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"No, I'm not familiar with that person,\" he says. \"I believe I've seen them in the mansion from time to time, however. Go look in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"What do you know about Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"I have nothing in particular to say about that woman, Detective,\" Riddle says. \"We have little occasion to interact. I believe she is in the Billiard Room at present.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=6", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"I don't really know who that is,\" Riddle says. \"I've seen them around, of course, but I certainly didn't take any notice. Perhaps they're in the Bathroom?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=6", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"I am familiar with Allison Bowers, Detective,\" Riddle says. \"Our relationship is perfectly cordial, though I don't have much else to say about her. She is in the Billiard Room, if you require more information than that.\""));
