__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=6", "\"Isaiah Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, Detective, that is Woody's business partner,\" Riddle says. \"A perfectly charming man, despite his upbringing.\""));
