__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Riddle sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Trinity Hancock? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Trinity Hancock. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Trinity Hancock. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Trinity Hancock. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"Naturally I know who it was,\" Riddle smirks. \"Who in this house is hungrier for elevation from their miserable station than Trinity Hancock?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I believe the answer is quite obvious, Detective,\" Riddle sneers. \"Who could it possibly have been except Trinity Hancock? A prime specimen of the criminal underclass.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=6", "\"Who do you think the killer is?\" you ask.<p>\"You wish to hear my opinion?\" he says. \"Well, that's very astute of you, Detective. In my view, it must have been Trinity Hancock. I've never encountered a more obvious criminal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Anna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Woody's accountant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Living Room, Detective,\" Anna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Living Room, Detective,\" Anna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Woody's accountant?\" Anna says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim had an accountant, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Anna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Woody's accountant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Living Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Do you know Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Woody's accountant?\" Anna says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Woody's accountant?\" Anna says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Living Room, Detective,\" Anna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Anna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Woody's accountant? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's accountant? you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Anna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Woody's accountant is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Living Room. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Woody's accountant?\" Anna says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=7", "\"The victim's accountant -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Living Room with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Anna declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Great Scott, do you mean Old Woody's physician?\" Anna says. \"Well, here's what I have to say about that particular bounder, Detective: Hmph! And furthermore, tut!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, her,\" Anna says with a slight grimace. \"That little blighter goes by the name Paige Dejesus, Detective. Nasty piece of work. Face like a horse. And I shall leave the question of which bit of the horse to your own deductive prowess.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Hmm,\" Anna muses. \"Hmm and also hmm. Oh, steady on, do you mean Old Woody's physician? Hah! No, Detective -- you'd need to pay me a fair penny just to stand behind her in a queue!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that's a rotten one there, Detective,\" Anna says. \"Calls herself 'Paige Dejesus', but is that even her legitimate moniker? ... ...Well, yes, probably. Can't quite imagine someone calling themselves 'Paige Dejesus' by choice, can you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Gross's physician?\" you ask.<p>\"Do you mean Paige Dejesus, Detective?\" Anna asks. \"Well! I'm not one to tell tales out of school, but well. Hmph! Yes. Tch! With perhaps a Hoh! and Tsk! for good measure.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=7", "\"Do you know Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, that scallywag,\" Anna says. \"She's Woody's physician, you know -- and a boor, and a bore, and a bounder to boot!\""));
