__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Allison Bowers's a positive delight!\" Anna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Anna says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Wine Cellar? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Allison Bowers's a positive delight!\" Anna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Anna says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Wine Cellar, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Allison Bowers. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Anna says. \"Did you know she's Woody's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Allison Bowers. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Anna says. \"Did you know she's Woody's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
