__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Allison Bowers's a positive delight!\" Anna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Anna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Wine Cellar and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely woman, Allison Bowers. Always stands her round, wouldn't say a word against her,\" Anna says. \"Did you know she's Woody's best friend? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
