__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Allison Bowers. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes, Allison Bowers's a positive delight!\" Anna says. \"Why, I could tell you some real stories, Detective!\"<p>\"That won't be necessary,\" you say. <p>\"Just as well. I'd forgotten you were a policeman for a moment.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Why yes, we get along splendidly,\" Anna says. \"If we're thinking of the same person, that is. With the um? In the Wine Cellar? Is that the one?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Anna says. \"Marvelous woman, just brilliant. She's Woody's best friend, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at her! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=7", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Anna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Wine Cellar and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Isaiah Benton,\" Anna says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Lounge, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Isaiah Benton, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Isaiah Benton,\" Anna says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Lounge, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Isaiah Benton, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Isaiah Benton!\" Anna says. \"He's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. He's in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's gardener?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Isaiah Benton, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know him well, Detective, but he seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Anna says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Lounge, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better man with whom to share a pint than Isaiah Benton,\" Anna says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see him in the Lounge, tell him I said that, he likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a gardener,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Isaiah Benton,\" Anna says. \"Can't say I know him very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Anna says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Lounge, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=4&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's gardener? you ask.<p>\"Gardener, gardener. Hmm,\" Anna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Isaiah Benton? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about him being Woody's gardener. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Isaiah Benton?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Anna says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, he and I! If you see him in the Lounge, give him a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
