__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Anna says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Servants' Quarters, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Lovely man, Billy Bob Riddle. Always stands his round, wouldn't say a word against him,\" Anna says. \"Did you know he's Woody's sibling? I was flabbergasted when I found out!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yes! Yes, quite well,\" Anna says. \"What was the name... hmm... Began with an S, I believe. Or an R? ...No, it's no good, I'm afraid, old chap. You'll have to go to the Servants' Quarters and ask for yourself.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Anna says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Servants' Quarters, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly!\" Anna says. \"Marvelous man, just brilliant. He's Woody's sibling, did you know that? Wouldn't think it to look at him! But it's like the Greeks said, you know, Detective.\"<p>\"...What did they say?\"<p>\"Hmm? Oh, I don't speak a word of Greek. Something about columns, I expect.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=7", "\"The victim had a sibling, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh certainly, certainly,\" Anna says. \"Indubitably, even, if I'm correct in assuming that to be a word. Spends a lot of time in the Servants' Quarters, don't you know. Yes yes, we're quite close.\"<p>\"Do you know their name?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Taylor Jackson!\" Anna says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim had a college roommate, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Taylor Jackson, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Anna says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Bathroom, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Taylor Jackson,\" Anna says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Taylor Jackson. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Taylor Jackson!\" Anna says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Taylor Jackson, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Certainly I know Taylor Jackson!\" Anna says. \"She's the feline's nightclothes, I don't mind telling you. A pollen purveyor's leg-hinges! A... Well, I can't think of another one. She's in the Bathroom.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"The victim's college roommate -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate, college roommate. Hmm,\" Anna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Taylor Jackson? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Woody's college roommate. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"That's Taylor Jackson, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh, we go way back, Detective,\" Anna says. \"All the way back! Practically <i>antediluvian</i>, she and I! If you see her in the Bathroom, give her a 'What-ho!' from me, won't you?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know Gross's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"College roommate, college roommate. Hmm,\" Anna ponders. \"No, sorry Detective, I don't know who that is, dash it all. ...Oh! Unless you mean Taylor Jackson? Now that you mention it, I do seem to remember something about her being Woody's college roommate. Well there you go! That must be it.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Taylor Jackson,\" Anna says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Bathroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"I understand the victim had a college roommate,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"That's Taylor Jackson, isn't it?\" Anna asks. \"Don't know her well, Detective, but she seems quite respectable. Stable sort, plenty of atoms up in the old thinkpiece.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=8&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Taylor Jackson?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective, you won't find a better woman with whom to share a pint than Taylor Jackson,\" Anna says. \"Well, two pints. One for each of you. Hah! Drinking the same pint, that'd be ridiculous! When you see her in the Bathroom, tell her I said that, she likes a good laugh.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=8&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's college roommate?\" you ask.<p>\"Unless I'm well off the mark, you're referring to Taylor Jackson,\" Anna says. \"Can't say I know her very well, I regret to inform. Seems nice enough.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"What do you know about Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Anna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Attic, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Attic, Detective,\" Anna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Martin Shaw is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Anna says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Attic, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim's lover -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Attic with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Anna declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Martin Shaw. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Anna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Attic is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Well, there's nothing like a good friend, Detective,\" Anna says, \"and that creature currently residing within the Attic is nothing like a good friend!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"The victim had a lover, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Anna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Woody's lover is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Attic. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"I'm afraid I could no more stand to be in the Attic with that person than a snowman could stand to vacation within a fizzing volcano, Detective,\" Anna declares."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"I stay bloody well away from that character, Detective,\" Anna says, \"if you'll excuse the 'bloody'. Could set your hat alight with a glare, he could. He's in the Attic, go see for yourself!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know Gross's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Attic, Detective,\" Anna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=9&visit=7", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Martin Shaw?\" you ask.<p>\"Martin Shaw is less a person, and more a sort of angry vole,\" Anna says. \"That twitching nose, those beady little eyes... Go have a look in the Attic, Detective -- you'll find the resemblance positively uncanny!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"Detective,\" Anna says as sternly as she can muster, \"Woody's lover is the very reason I'm in here and not in the Attic. Absolutely frightful individual.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=9&visit=7", "\"Have you met the victim's lover?\" you ask.<p>\"As concerns the individual currently occupying the Attic, Detective,\" Anna says, \"allow me to say one word: <i>balderdash.</i>\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Haven't the foggiest, Detective,\" Anna says. \"Not the slightest idea. Not a tiddle, nor a jot. I could no more tell you the name of Woody's murderer than I could tell you the--\" <p>\"I get it,\" you grumble."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Woody?\" Anna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Ted Lindsey?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Anna looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Help me out here,\" you say. \"You know all the people in this house. Who's the most likely killer?\"<p>\"Who murdered Woody?\" Anna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Gunther Battle?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"Who murdered Woody?\" Anna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Emil Mayer?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Woody?\" Anna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Barney Waters?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"You want to know... who do I...?\" Anna looks flummoxed. \"Sorry, old bean. I can certainly understand why you'd ascribe me a certain Sherlockian intelligence, but I haven't the first clue of who might have done that deed.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=7", "\"Do you have any thoughts on who did it?\" you ask.<p>\"Who murdered Woody?\" Anna asks. \"Hmm. Well now. Was it Peter Duran?\"<p>You flip through your dossier. \"Who the devil's that?\"<p>\"Made it up. Sorry, it was a shot in the dark.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Woody Gross's gardener, I believe,\" Jackson says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Gross's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know Gross's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Jackson says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Attic.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Woody Gross's gardener, I believe,\" Jackson says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Jackson says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Attic.\""));
