__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's accountant?\" you ask.<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Attic is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Trinity Hancock. What can you tell me about her?\" you ask.<p>\"This is the name of Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"If such a title continues to have any significance after this day's events. The woman herself is of no consequence to me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=1&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had an accountant,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Attic is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=1&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Trinity Hancock?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
