__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=2&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about Paige Dejesus?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Woody Gross's sibling, I believe,\" Jackson says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=2&visit=8", "\"The victim's physician -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Boiler Room.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a woman named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Living Room,\" Jackson says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Yes, that is Anna Byrd, Jackson says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Living Room,\" Jackson says. \"We are cordial with one another, but speak little. It is refreshing to know someone who does not insist on small talk at every encounter.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Anna Byrd, Jackson says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jackson says. \"Presently, she is in the Living Room. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's best friend? you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Anna Byrd to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"What do you know about Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"I know of whom you speak,\" Jackson says. \"Presently, she is in the Living Room. Her outlook on life is, in many ways, quite refreshing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Anna Byrd to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know Gross's best friend?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, that is Anna Byrd, Jackson says. \"A fine woman, quite fearless and comfortable with the unknown. I regard these as remarkable qualities.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=3&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Allison Bowers?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes,\" Jackson says. \"You will find her in the Living Room, Detective. We have participated in friendly debate on occasion. Her views regarding the human condition are unorthodox, but intriguing.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a best friend,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"This person's name is Anna Byrd, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"I have found her to be quite companionable, and thoughtful in her opinions.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=3&visit=8", "\"The victim's best friend -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"Yes, I consider Anna Byrd to be a friend, Detective. In as much as any two humans, with our limited understanding of the universe filtered by our barely-evolved brains, can be said to truly be friends.\""));
