__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=4&visit=8", "\"Isaiah Benton. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"He is in the Servants' Quarters at the moment,\" Jackson says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for him where I have not.\""));
