__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nevaeh Greer?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic at the moment,\" Jackson says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have spoken with them on rare occasion, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"It was not worth my time. But the Wine Cellar is where you can find them.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Nevaeh Greer?\" you ask.<p>\"She is in the Attic at the moment,\" Jackson says. \"Perhaps you will discover a use for her where I have not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"The victim had a lawyer, do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Nevaeh Greer?\" you ask.<p>\"Mmm. You will find her in the Attic,\" Jackson says. \"I must warn you, Detective, that she has little regard for the truth.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"I understand the victim had a lawyer,\" you say. \"Can you tell me anything about them?\"<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Jackson says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
