__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=5&visit=8", "\"Do you know Gross's lawyer?\" you ask.<p>\"Each of us has a limited amount of time on this Earth, Detective,\" Jackson says, \"and I have resolved not to spend mine upon such a person. But, you must judge for yourself. You will find them in the Wine Cellar.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Gross's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Master Bedroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"We have had many interesting conversations; he is an excellent thinker. Our topics of interest are largely dissimilar, but one must expose oneself to new things, or else stagnate and die.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's sibling? you ask.<p>\"If you seek them out in the Master Bedroom, I believe you will find them to be quite reasonable, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"That is the impression I have, though we have not conversed at any length.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yes. Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"An excellent mind. Very imaginative. Imagination is very important, Detective, for it is one of the few advantages than a human has over an animal.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"What can you tell me about the deceased's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"A well-mannered individual,\" Jackson says. \"Regrettably, I can tell you no more, as we have had no opportunity for conversation. They are in the Master Bedroom, I believe.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Billy Bob Riddle. What can you tell me about him?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=8", "\"The victim's sibling -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"I regret that I have had little interaction with this person,\" Jackson says. \"I simply have not had the time. Perhaps, Detective, when you find them in the Master Bedroom, you might send my regards.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=8", "\"Do you know Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"This is Woody Gross's gardener,\" Jackson says. \"He is very brave, and fearlessness is the primary requirement for a human being to control his own destiny.\""));
