__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Do you know someone named Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"You are speaking of Woody Gross's accountant,\" Jackson says, \"and I wish that you would not.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=8", "\"Can you tell me anything about Woody Gross's business partner?\" you ask.<p>\"I have had very little interaction with this person, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"This is by choice, as I am certain that they have nothing to offer me. Perhaps it will be a different matter for you, in which case you can find them in the Lounge.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=8", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"You are referring to Woody Gross's accountant, I believe,\" Jackson says. \"A woman of small mind, with no dreams or imagination. She might as well be an iguana.\""));
