__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Who do you think is the most likely to be the killer?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Woody Gross has true relevance, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"Does anyone else here seem particularly suspicious to you?\" you ask.<p>\"I do not feel that the question of who murdered Woody Gross has true relevance, Detective,\" Jackson says. \"All people die. It is only a matter of when.\"<p>\"And how,\" you mutter."));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=killer&visit=8", "\"If you had to guess,\" you ask, \"who would you say did it?\"<p>\"I respect that the matter is of interest to you, Detective,\" Jackson says, \"because it is only through the interest of people such as yourself that our society can withstand the forces of chaos for the brief time that we inhabit this universe. However, I do not share your interest.\""));
