__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Billy Bob Riddle's great, just great,\" Martin says. \"Go check out the Bathroom, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
