__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with someone named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure!\" Martin says. \"That man's a real peach. He's over in the Bathroom -- tell him I said hi.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know Gross's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"Sibling... Sibling...\" Martin mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Isaiah Benton! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot he's Woody's sibling!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Are you familiar with a man named Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh yeah, me and Billy Bob Riddle, we get along great!\" Martin says. \"Two peas in a pod, that's us. He'll be in the Bathroom, tell him I sent ya.\""));
