__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=6&visit=9", "\"Have you met the victim's sibling?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Isaiah Benton?\" Martin asks. \"He's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Isaiah Benton.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=6&visit=9", "\"Do you know someone by the name of Billy Bob Riddle?\" you ask.<p>\"Ah yeah, Billy Bob Riddle's great, just great,\" Martin says. \"Go check out the Bathroom, that's where he is. See for yourself how great he is.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What can you tell me about Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Yeah, that's Woody's lawyer,\" Martin says. \"She's good people. Dependable, you know?\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"The victim's business partner -- do you know them?\" you ask.<p>\"D'you mean Nevaeh Greer?\" Martin asks. \"She's great, a real riot. You need someone to watch your back, that's who you need, is Nevaeh Greer.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"Do you know Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Martin says. \"Ever since she first became Woody's lawyer. Practically inseparable, her and me.\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=rel&w=7&visit=9", "\"Can you tell me anything about the victim's business partner? you ask.<p>\"Business partner... Business partner...\" Martin mutters. \"...Oh! You mean Nevaeh Greer! Heck, we're such good pals I practically forgot she's Woody's business partner!\""));
__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Sure, sure, we get along great,\" Martin says. \"Ever since she first became Woody's lawyer. Practically inseparable, her and me.\""));
