__core_text_test_data.listAppend(listMake("wham.php?ask=7&visit=9", "\"What do you know about Anna Byrd?\" you ask.<p>\"Oh sure, Woody's lawyer, I know her pretty well,\" he says. \"He's a real straight-shooter. Real trustworthy.\""));
